&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your role and responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the firm and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. The tax and legal experts at KPMG &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato &lt;/strong&gt;provide assistance in all the key tax and corporate law areas, offering innovative, integrated services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In particular, by joining the &lt;strong&gt;Deal Advisory M&amp;amp;A Tax Team &lt;/strong&gt;of our Milan office, you will help support clients in addressing challenges related to key areas of taxation. You will operate in a constantly evolving scenario, where national and international regulations intertwine with market and public opinion expectations on crucial topics such as ethics, transparency, and corporate governance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tax due diligence reviews of extraordinary transactions (mergers, demergers, acquisitions, contributions, etc);&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Corporate restructuring;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Analyses of the treatment of extraordinary transactions according to national accounting standards (OIC) and international ones (IAS/IFRS);&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;National and International tax opinions;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Applications for tax rulings;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Preparation of corporate income tax returns (Modello Unico and Modello IRAP).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You will be involved in &lt;strong&gt;national&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;international projects&lt;/strong&gt;, working alongside highly qualified professionals and acquiring top-level skills through interaction with the brightest minds in the field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Economics&lt;/strong&gt; (LM-77 or LM-56)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;with a final grade of at least 100/110;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The intention to pursue the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;professional practice&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;as a&lt;strong&gt; C&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;hartered Accountant&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;A good knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt;, especially Excel and PowerPoint;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Excellent &lt;strong&gt;interpersonal&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;– Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/em&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-CN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Torino-Deal-Advisory-M&amp;A-Tax-Consultant-Torino/1350418557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1350418557</guid><g:id>1350418557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Torino, IT</g:location></item><item><title>M&amp;A Legal Consultant - Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Are you looking for meaningful and impactful work?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to support clients, society, and your colleagues in addressing and solving today’s most pressing and complex challenges. The professionals at &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; operate across all major areas of taxation and corporate law, providing integrated and innovative services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;For the &lt;strong&gt;M&amp;amp;A Legal&lt;/strong&gt; team in the &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt; office, we are looking for a professional within the team who will be responsible for activities related to extraordinary corporate transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, will be in charge of:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Legal due diligence activities;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Drafting of contracts related to the completion of acquisition transactions (company and share package acquisitions) and assistance in the various negotiation phases;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Legal assistance in extraordinary transactions and preparation of corporate documentation (mergers, demergers, contributions, corporate reorganizations, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Preparation of opinions and notes on corporate and commercial matters;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Doctrinal and case law research activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;1-2 years experience in a leading firms or Legal consulting;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in Law with a grade higher than 105/110;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the English language;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the Office package;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Excellent interpersonal and team working skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Flexibility and dynamism.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working With Us Also Means&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ongoing professional development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A clearly defined career growth path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;stimulating and dynamic&lt;/strong&gt; setting that promotes creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training and development programs&lt;/strong&gt; to stay up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and a focus on innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;– Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-CN1  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-M&amp;A-Legal-Consultant-Milano/1332442357/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1332442357</guid><g:id>1332442357</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Legal</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant IT Strategy | CIO Advisory (Bologna, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Gli esperti di &lt;strong&gt;Nolan Norton&lt;/strong&gt;, società di IT Strategy del Network KPMG, aiutano le organizzazioni ad affrontare le sfide di trasformazione digitale e ad implementare architetture IT. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del Team CIO Advisory di Bologna, esperto di architetture e soluzioni di data management che supporta i CIO nell&apos;evoluzione digitale del loro percorso, nel loro journey verso il cloud, dalla strategia all&apos;esecuzione e dalla visione al valore reale. Entrerai a far parte di un ambiente dinamico e stimolante, per clienti di alto livello altamente visibili nei mercati dei servizi finanziari, dell&apos;energia, del settore pubblico e dei consumatori e industriali.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di su tecnologie innovative su progetti sfidanti ed entusiasmanti, supportando i nostri clienti principalmente sulle seguenti tematiche:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: aiutiamo i nostri clienti a sviluppare strategie tecnologiche e modelli operativi tecnologici innovativi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: consentiamo ai clienti di utilizzare soluzioni all&apos;avanguardia per applicazioni, infrastrutture e TLC;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management&lt;/strong&gt;: aiutiamo i nostri clienti nell’identificazione delle migliori soluzioni di gestione del dato e progettazione di architetture di Data Management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;: assistiamo i nostri clienti a identificare, definire le priorità, progettare e indirizzare meglio gli investimenti tecnologici;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: gestiamo la governance e svolgiamo attività di supporto tecnico durante la selezione delle varie opzioni e dei fornitori nell&apos;intero ciclo dei servizi ICT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance and Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: ci occupiamo della corretta struttura e dimensionamento delle risorse ICT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost right-sizing&lt;/strong&gt;: valutiamo e suggeriamo opzioni per indirizzare meglio la spesa e le risorse ICT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Laurea Magistrale in Ingegneria Gestionale,Informatica, Elettronica, delle Telecomunicazioni, Fisica, Matematica;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza della lingua inglese, idealmente approfondita attraverso un&apos;esperienza formativa/lavorativa all&apos;estero.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Opportunità di stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1000€ per stage extracurriculare&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nolan Norton Spa garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. Experts from Nolan Norton, an IT Strategy company within the KPMG Network, help organizations face digital transformation challenges and implement IT architectures. Specifically, you will join the CIO Advisory Team, experts in data management architectures and solutions that support CIOs in their digital evolution journey, from strategy to execution and from vision to real value. You will be part of a dynamic and stimulating environment, working with high-level clients highly visible in the financial services, energy, public sector, and consumer and industrial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will work on innovative technologies on challenging and exciting projects, supporting our clients mainly on the following topics:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: We help our clients develop innovative technology strategies and operating models;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: We enable clients to use cutting-edge solutions for applications, infrastructure, and TLC;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management&lt;/strong&gt;: We help our clients identify the best data management solutions and design data management architectures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;: We assist our clients in identifying, prioritizing, designing, and better directing technology investments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: We manage governance and provide technical support during the selection of various options and suppliers throughout the ICT services cycle;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance and Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: We take care of the proper structure and sizing of ICT resources;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost Right-Sizing&lt;/strong&gt;: We evaluate and suggest options to better direct ICT spending and resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in Management Engineering, Computer Engineering, Electronic Engineering, Telecommunications Engineering, Physics, Mathematics;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of the English language, ideally deepened through educational/work experience abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, fair work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that encourages creativity and teamwork;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid work mode to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay always updated;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset and innovative projects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Paid internship opportunity offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are the Values of KPMG that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Within our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan - you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are carrying out on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues. Join us! Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to the KPMG privacy policy. Nolan Norton Spa guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-SD1&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Bologna-Junior-Consultant-IT-Strategy-CIO-Advisory/1366113357/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366113357</guid><g:id>1366113357</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Bologna, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Consultant - Tech Risk | Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Nel rispetto dei valori di integrità e qualità,&lt;strong&gt; KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance &lt;/strong&gt;offre un portafoglio di servizi integrato in costante evoluzione, con insight che consentono alle aziende di rispondere ai fabbisogni informativi del mercato e degli investitori. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk&lt;/strong&gt;, linea di servizi di KPMG che ha anticipato e seguito nel tempo le richieste del mercato relative alle tematiche di Information Risk Management e Sicurezza Informatica, sviluppando costantemente le competenze e capacità di analisi a protezione del patrimonio informativo aziendale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Comprendere il contesto tecnologico e di business dei clienti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Mappare i processi business ed IT, identificandone i rischi e definendo il giusto approccio per mitigarli &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Analizzare le nuove tecnologie e capirne i rischi specifici&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Identificare i dati chiave e definire i controlli per renderli affidabili e sicuri&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;I professionisti appartenenti al team CTR di KPMG supportano le organizzazioni in tutte le fasi necessarie a garantire la sicurezza delle loro informazioni e delle loro strategie di business. Possiamo affiancare i nostri clienti per migliorare la crescita e creare valore. Possiamo aiutarli a fare i giusti investimenti nel momento giusto, a considerare le implicazioni più ampie della digital disruption, ad integrare tecnologie innovative nelle infrastrutture esistenti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei un laureando/neolaureato magistrale in Ingegneria Gestionale, Management dell’innovazione, Management ecc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Passione per le nuove tecnologie e la loro declinazione nei contesti aziendali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Competenze nella comprensione e analisi dei processi aziendali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Capacità di analisi dei dati e di sintesi nella presentazione dei risultati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Interesse per l&apos;ambito dei Sistemi Informativi aziendali, intesi quale strumento abilitante per l&apos;efficace erogazione dei processi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Predisposizione per la risoluzione di problemi complessi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Proattività, flessibilità e capacità di adattamento a contesti eterogenei e sfidanti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una buona padronanza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a viaggiare sul territorio nazionale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; internazionale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ / L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso compresa tra € 28.000 e € 31.500, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:windowtext&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. In keeping with the values of integrity and quality&lt;strong&gt;, KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offers an integrated and constantly evolving portfolio of services, with insights that allow companies to respond to the informational/reporting needs of the market and investors. The &lt;strong&gt;Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk&lt;/strong&gt; team handles the KPMG line of services that pre-empted and continues to meet market demand for information risk management and cybersecurity services, continually developing the analytical skills and expertise to protect company information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;understanding clients’ technological and business context;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;mapping business and IT processes, identifying their risks and developing the right approach to mitigate them; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;analysing new technologies and understanding their specific risks;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;identifying key data and defining controls to guarantee they are reliable and secure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;The members of KPMG’s CTR team support organisations across all phases of the process to ensure the security of their information and business strategies. We help our clients drive growth and generate value.  We can help them make the right investments at the right time, consider the broader implications of the digital disruption and build breakthrough innovations into their legacy infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;or will soon have a master’s degree in management engineering, innovation management, management, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;a passion for new technologies and their application in corporate settings;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;expertise in understanding and analysing company processes;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;an ability to analyse and summarise data when reporting findings;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;an interest in corporate IT systems as enablers for the effective performance of processes; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;an aptitude for complex problem solving;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;proactiveness, flexibility and an ability to adapt to different challenging situations;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of English, preferably with study/work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;availability to travel within Italy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;A challenging and &lt;strong&gt;dynamic environment&lt;/strong&gt; that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay up-to-date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; and innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship with a monthly allowance of €800 / This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary  ranging from €28,000 to €31,500. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the KPMG values that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality Within our Impact Plan - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:windowtext&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Consultant-Tech-Risk-Milano/1365915957/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365915957</guid><g:id>1365915957</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Auditor (Categorie Protette) - Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;KPMG is where Auditors become AI enthusiasts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Nel rispetto dei valori di integrità e qualità, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offre un portafoglio di servizi integrato in costante evoluzione, con insight che consentono alle aziende di rispondere ai fabbisogni informativi del mercato e degli investitori.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt;, ti interfaccerai con clienti leader a livello nazionale e internazionale e potrai contribuire all’integrità e alla trasparenza dei mercati finanziari, garantendo l’indipendenza e la riservatezza fondamentale al loro corretto andamento. Grazie all’&lt;strong&gt;innovazione&lt;/strong&gt;, svolgerai un audit conforme e attento ai &lt;strong&gt;temi ESG&lt;/strong&gt;, sempre più &lt;strong&gt;digitalizzato&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;integrato&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;automatizzato&lt;/strong&gt;, basato sull&apos;&lt;strong&gt;Intelligenza Artificiale &lt;/strong&gt;e sui &lt;strong&gt;Big Data&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello pecifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mappare i &lt;strong&gt;principali cicli aziendali &lt;/strong&gt;dei clienti attraverso colloqui con il personale amministrativo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verificare l’adeguatezza dei controlli interni delle imprese &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analizzare e verificare le diverse &lt;strong&gt;aree di bilancio&lt;/strong&gt; delle aziende clienti, predisposte in accordo ai principi contabili nazionali (OIC) o internazionali (IAS - IFRS) in base a quanto definito dai principi di revisione applicabili&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applicare la metodologia di revisione aziendale con il supporto di &lt;strong&gt;tecnologie di analisi dati avanzate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sarai coinvolto/a in progetti che ti permetteranno di esplorare &lt;strong&gt;diverse realtà aziendali&lt;/strong&gt; (industriali o finanziarie) a 360°, intessere relazioni con i &lt;strong&gt;referenti delle società clienti&lt;/strong&gt; ed entrare a far parte di &lt;strong&gt;team strutturati&lt;/strong&gt; che ti supporteranno nella tua &lt;strong&gt;crescita professionale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai o stai per conseguire una &lt;strong&gt;Laurea &lt;/strong&gt;in &lt;strong&gt;Economia/Finanza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai una buona conoscenza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai voglia di &lt;strong&gt;imparare&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;mettere in pratica&lt;/strong&gt; ciò che hai studiato&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sei un &lt;strong&gt;team player&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai voglia di &lt;strong&gt;migliorare &lt;/strong&gt;le tue&lt;strong&gt; capacità relazionali &lt;/strong&gt;e&lt;strong&gt; comunicative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Iscrizione alle liste Categorie Protette Art.1 lg. 68/99&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il nostro ambiente di lavoro è progettato per essere inclusivo e accessibile a tutti. Siamo orgogliosi di offrire una struttura &lt;strong&gt;priva di barriere architettoniche&lt;/strong&gt;, per garantire che tutte le persone, indipendentemente dalle loro abilità fisiche, possano lavorare in un ambiente confortevole e sicuro. Le caratteristiche del nostro ufficio includono:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rampe di accesso&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ascensori accessibili&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bagni accessibili&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Postazioni di lavoro ergonomiche&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ci impegniamo a fornire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo e ad accogliere richieste specifiche di adattamento per soddisfare le esigenze individuali dei nostri dipendenti.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Troverai inoltre:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un percorso che ti aiuterà a &lt;strong&gt;riconoscere&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;sviluppare&lt;/strong&gt; le &lt;strong&gt;competenze&lt;/strong&gt; ed aree di miglioramento&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e programmi di sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL di ingresso compresa tra € 25.500 e € 28.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG is where Auditors become AI enthusiasts&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. In line with the values of integrity and quality, KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance offers an integrated and constantly evolving portfolio of services, providing insights that enable companies to meet the informational needs of the market and investors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join the &lt;strong&gt;Audit Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will collaborate with leading national and international clients and contribute to the integrity and transparency of financial markets, ensuring the confidentiality essential to their proper functioning. Thanks to &lt;strong&gt;innovation&lt;/strong&gt;, you will create an audit that is compliant and attentive to &lt;strong&gt;ESG issues&lt;/strong&gt;, increasingly &lt;strong&gt;digitalized&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;integrated&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;automated&lt;/strong&gt;, based on &lt;strong&gt;Artificial Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Big Data&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mapping of &lt;strong&gt;key business cycles&lt;/strong&gt; of clients through interviews with administrative staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assessing the adequacy of internal controls within companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzing and verifying various areas of &lt;strong&gt;client companies&apos; financial statements&lt;/strong&gt;, prepared in accordance with national accounting standards (OIC) or international standards (IAS - IFRS) as defined by applicable auditing principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing the audit methodology with the support of &lt;strong&gt;advanced data analysis technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be involved in projects that will allow you to explore &lt;strong&gt;various business environments&lt;/strong&gt; (industrial or financial) comprehensively, build relationships with &lt;strong&gt;client company representatives&lt;/strong&gt;, and become part of &lt;strong&gt;structured teams&lt;/strong&gt; that will support your &lt;strong&gt;professional growth&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have or are about to obtain a &lt;strong&gt;degree&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Economics/Finance&lt;/strong&gt; (priority will be given to Master&apos;s degree students or graduates)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;eager to learn and apply&lt;/strong&gt; what you have studied&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a &lt;strong&gt;team player&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;keen to improve&lt;/strong&gt; your &lt;strong&gt;interpersonal and communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Registration in the Protected Categories Lists Art.1 Law 68/99.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work environment is designed to be inclusive and accessible to everyone. We are proud to offer a &lt;strong&gt;barrier-free facility&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure that all individuals, regardless of their physical abilities, can work in a comfortable and safe environment. Our office features include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access ramps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accessible elevators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accessible restrooms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ergonomic workstations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to providing an inclusive work environment and accommodating specific adaptation requests to meet the individual needs of our employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also find:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A path that will help you &lt;strong&gt;identify &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;develop&lt;/strong&gt; your &lt;strong&gt;skills &lt;/strong&gt;and areas for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary ranging from €25,500 to €28,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-GF1 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Auditor-%28Categorie-Protette%29-Milano/1355336657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1355336657</guid><g:id>1355336657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Audit</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Supply Chain Planning Strategic Junior Consultant (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your role and responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitalization, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will support projects focused on transforming end-to-end planning processes, including Demand Planning, Supply Planning, Factory Scheduling, and S&amp;amp;OP/IBP. You will gain hands-on experience by working alongside experienced professionals, contributing to the adoption of modern planning solutions, best practices, and innovative technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Supporting demand and supply planning activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;, including data collection, baseline forecast preparation, and the maintenance of planning parameters and calendars.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Contributing to the &lt;strong&gt;definition, monitoring, and reporting&lt;/strong&gt; of key performance indicators (KPIs), such as forecast accuracy, forecast bias, service level, and inventory turns, through reports and dashboards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Collaborating on data quality improvement initiatives by maintaining master data, validating key attributes and lead times, identifying anomalies, and working with the team to implement corrective actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Preparing analyses and presentation materials for &lt;strong&gt;S&amp;amp;OP meetings and workshops&lt;/strong&gt;, as well as documenting meeting minutes and tracking action items.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Assisting in the implementation and enhancement of &lt;strong&gt;APS/IBP platforms&lt;/strong&gt; by supporting data mapping, user acceptance testing (UAT), documentation, and the creation of user guides.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Automating repetitive tasks using tools such as Excel and Power BI, while maintaining and improving templates, reports, and shared libraries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Working effectively with cross-functional teams, including Sales, Operations, Finance, and IT, to ensure clear communication and successful collaboration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Learning and applying forecasting methodologies appropriate to the business context, including statistical and machine learning techniques, under the guidance of senior team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;Master&apos;s degree in Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; (preferably Mechanical or Electronic Engineering) or another &lt;strong&gt;STEM&lt;/strong&gt; discipline, achieved with excellent academic results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Up to one year of experience, including internships, in planning or operations within industries such as Consumer Goods, Food &amp;amp; Beverage, Pharmaceuticals, Chemicals, or Automotive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A basic understanding of statistical forecasting methods and their appropriate applications, with a strong willingness to develop expertise in advanced forecasting techniques and machine learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Excel, including pivot tables, formulas, and charts; familiarity with Power Query is a plus. Initial experience with Power BI or similar business intelligence tools is also desirable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, attention to detail, a structured approach to work, and a proactive attitude toward learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An excellent knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 36.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MC2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Supply-Chain-Planning-Strategic-Junior-Consultant/1368642957/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368642957</guid><g:id>1368642957</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Supply Chain &amp; Industry 4.0 (Bologna, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain &amp;amp; Industry 4.0&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Bologna&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be engaged in projects for large Italian and international customers for the implementation of applications in Industry 4.0 - Smart Manufacturing - Supply Chain &amp;amp; Operations. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analyzing and defining the new functional requirements of Supply Chain and Operational Planning processes, implementing innovative Performance Management solutions;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Designing IT solutions to support Lean Manufacturing processes and assisting in the implementation phase of Low Code technologies;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Monitoring performance pre- and post-transformation intervention;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Creating functional analysis documents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A master&apos;s degree with high marks in &lt;strong&gt;Industrial &lt;/strong&gt;or &lt;strong&gt;Management Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably supported by study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;MS Office&lt;/strong&gt; applications;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Good knowledge of programming and writing queries in &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 36.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MC2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Bologna-Junior-Consultant-Supply-Chain-&amp;-Industry-4_0/1368640557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368640557</guid><g:id>1368640557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Bologna, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Consultant - Cyber Security | Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella &lt;strong&gt;digitalizzazione&lt;/strong&gt; dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk&lt;/strong&gt;, linea di servizi di KPMG che ha anticipato e seguito nel tempo le richieste del mercato relative alle tematiche di Information Risk Management e Sicurezza Informatica, sviluppando costantemente le competenze e capacità di analisi a protezione del patrimonio informativo aziendale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Comprendere il contesto tecnologico e di business dei clienti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Analizzare e proteggere il patrimonio informativo aziendale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Garantire la sicurezza delle informazioni e delle strategie di business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Integrare tecnologie innovative nelle infrastrutture esistenti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I professionisti appartenenti al team IRM di KPMG supportano le organizzazioni in tutte le fasi necessarie a garantire la sicurezza delle loro informazioni e delle loro strategie di business. Possiamo affiancare i nostri clienti per migliorare la crescita e creare valore. Possiamo aiutarli a fare i giusti investimenti nel momento giusto, a considerare le implicazioni più ampie della digital disruption, ad integrare tecnologie innovative nelle infrastrutture esistenti.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei un laureando/neolaureato magistrale in Cybersecurity, Informatica, Ingegneria informatica, Crime&amp;amp;Security Analysis, Cybersecurity Risk Strategy and Governance ecc;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai passione per le nuove tecnologie e la loro declinazione nei contesti aziendali;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai capacità di analisi dei dati e di sintesi nella presentazione dei risultati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Conosci i principali standard o practice di riferimento (ISO 27001, COBIT ecc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai interesse per l&apos;ambito dei Sistemi Informativi aziendali, intesi quale strumento abilitante per l&apos;efficace erogazione dei processi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai predisposizioni per la risoluzione di problemi complessi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei proattivo, flessibile e capace di adattarti a contesti eterogenei e sfidanti;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una buona padronanza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a viaggiare sul territorio nazionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ / L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso compresa tra € 28.000 e € 31.500, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and &lt;strong&gt;digitalisation&lt;/strong&gt;, risk analysis and management, and support in corporate finance transactions.  The &lt;strong&gt;Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk &lt;/strong&gt;team handles the KPMG line of services that pre-empted and continues to meet market demand for information risk management and cybersecurity services, continually developing the analytical skills and expertise to protect company information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;understanding clients’ technological and business context;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;analysing and protecting their information assets;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ensuring information and business strategies are secure;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;integrating innovative technologies into existing infrastructures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The members of KPMG’s CTR team support organisations across all phases of the process to ensure the security of their information and business strategies. We help our clients drive growth and generate value.  We can help them make the right investments at the right time, consider the broader implications of the digital disruption and build breakthrough innovations into their legacy infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;or will soon have a master’s degree in cybersecurity, computer science or computer engineering, Crime&amp;amp;Security Analysis, Cybersecurity Risk Strategy and Governance etc;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a passion for new technologies and their application in corporate settings;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an ability to analyse and summarise data when reporting findings;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;knowledge of the main applicable standards or practices (ISO 27001, COBIT, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an interest in corporate IT systems as enablers for the effective performance of processes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an aptitude for complex problem solving;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a proactive, flexible approach and the ability to adapt to varied, challenging situations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of English, preferably with study/work experience abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;availability to travel within Italy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay up-to-date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship with a monthly allowance of €800 / This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary  ranging from €28,000 to €31,500. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Consultant-Cyber-Security-Milano/1366117557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366117557</guid><g:id>1366117557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Risk Analytics Junior Consultant | Milan 1 (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Risk Analytics Junior Consultant | Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 12.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transac&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;tions. When you join the Risk Analytics team in Milan, you are going to work on financial projects using tech solutions and AI support for top-tier clients in different sectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Risk Analysis &amp;amp; Application Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Build and maintain high-performance applications and microservices that underpin data analytics platforms; develop robust APIs and integration layers to seamlessly connect various internal and external data sources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Financial Data Engineering &amp;amp; Control:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Design, implement, and optimize financial data ingestion and transformation pipelines to process high-volume datasets from diverse energy systems and sensors; ensure data quality and integrity through testing, validation and monitoring processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Financial Analytics, Reporting &amp;amp; Visualization:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Collaborate with data scientists to integrate machine learning algorithms and predictive modeling into live production environments; create interactive dashboards and reporting tools that transform raw data into actionable insights for technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;System Optimization &amp;amp; Scalability:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Enhance system performance through code optimization, cost optimization, robust testing, and effective resource management; implement scalable solutions that support growing data demands and evolving business needs in the client domain.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Agile Collaboration:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Participate in agile development practices, including sprint planning, code reviews, and continuous integration, to ensure efficient delivery of features and improvements; work closely with cross-disciplinary teams, including business analysts, data engineers, and product managers, to align technological advancements with strategic objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a style=&quot;background-color:white&quot; name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Master’s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering or a related field;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Motivation to build a career in the Risk sector&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt; with a focus on financial services industry;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Some knowledge in software engineering with a strong understanding of full-stack development;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Proficiency in modern programming languages (e.g., Python, Java, Javascript or similar) and experience working with data processing frameworks;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Some knowledge with API development, cloud platforms, and containerization technologies;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Familiarity with data visualization tools and basic statistical modeling techniques;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills and the ability to communicate technical concepts clearly to diverse audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 36.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Immediate exposure to live data challenges, where you can apply your skills to solve authentic business problems and see the impact of your work in real time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Join a collaborative, agile team that values creativity, technical excellence, and practical problem solving, facilitating rapid prototyping and successful project deployments (from PoCs to MVPs).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Opportunities to acquire leading certifications (Azure, Google Cloud, AWS, Databricks) and engag&lt;/span&gt;e in challenging projects that accelerate your technical and professional learning curve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;Tailored compensation packages and benefits designed to support both your personal and professional success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the KPMG values that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network complies with the standards of the ISO 30415 requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125, relating to gender equality”. Within our Impact Plan - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-FN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Risk-Analytics-Junior-Consultant-Milan-1/1370780657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1370780657</guid><g:id>1370780657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Supply Chain &amp; Digital Procurement (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain &amp;amp; Operations Team&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will have the opportunity to be part of the biggest revolution taking place by rethinking customer operating models from a digital perspective. You will work closely with market-leading companies on innovation topics and support our clients throughout their digital transformation journey. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Rethink the operating models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; of key business functions (with a specific focus on the Extended Supply Chain) by redesigning processes, revising the organizational structure and evaluating new technologies to support the Business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Assess the &lt;strong&gt;impacts and expected benefits of initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; identified through business cases and monitor pre- and post-transformation performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Lead and coordinate complex &lt;strong&gt;Business and Digital Transformation programs &lt;/strong&gt;with Program, Project &amp;amp; Change Management initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Target Operating Model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; Design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Management Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Organizational and teamwork skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; with attention to detail, including the ability to prioritize and manage various complex tasks and activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;MS Office&lt;/strong&gt; package&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MC2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Consultant-Supply-Chain-&amp;-Digital-Procurement/1366723357/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366723357</guid><g:id>1366723357</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Healthcare Consultant | Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;h3&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza a organizzazioni pubbliche e private per accompagnarle nei percorsi di trasformazione dei modelli di business, miglioramento e digitalizzazione dei processi, analisi e gestione dei rischi, nonché nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribuisci alla digitalizzazione del Servizio Sanitario Nazionale (SSN)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Healthcare di KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;, avrai l’opportunità di contribuire all’&lt;strong&gt;innovazione dei servizi&lt;/strong&gt; sanitari in Italia. Nei prossimi anni saremo impegnati nell’estensione dell’utilizzo degli strumenti digitali e delle trasformazioni che essi possono generare nelle strutture sanitarie e nella vita di oltre 60 milioni di persone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particolare, supporterai gli enti del SSN nelle attività di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;definizione delle strategie e valutazione dei relativi impatti sanitari, economici, finanziari e organizzativi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;elaborazione delle strategie di trasformazione digitale e progettazione della relativa esperienza utente e paziente;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;valorizzazione delle tecnologie digitali per ripensare in modo innovativo servizi, processi e modelli operativi delle amministrazioni pubbliche e delle organizzazioni sanitarie;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;monitoraggio dello stato di avanzamento e dell’evoluzione dei servizi, dei sistemi e delle attività operative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sei pronto a contribuire al cambiamento del nostro Paese?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La pandemia ha evidenziato ancora di più il ruolo strategico della sanità, un settore fondamentale non solo per la tutela della salute e della sicurezza dei cittadini, ma anche per la crescita e la resilienza economica del Paese.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di vivere il cambiamento in prima persona, lavorando a stretto contatto con professionisti del settore sanitario, dirigenti e manager del Servizio Sanitario Nazionale. Entrerai a far parte di un team giovane e dinamico, composto da professionisti che ogni giorno promuovono il cambiamento e l’innovazione, supportandoti nella tua crescita professionale attraverso formazione continua e affiancamento costante.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Siamo alla ricerca di professionisti per la nostra sede di &lt;strong&gt;Milano&lt;/strong&gt;, motivati a contribuire allo sviluppo del Paese. Cerchiamo persone empatiche, orientate al lavoro di squadra, al raggiungimento degli obiettivi e dotate di solide capacità di problem solving, entusiasmo e forte motivazione professionale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il candidato ideale possiede:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;una laurea magistrale, conseguita con ottimi risultati, in discipline ingegneristiche (Ingegneria Biomedica, Ingegneria Gestionale), economiche (Economia Aziendale, Economia Sanitaria) o farmaceutiche (Chimica e Tecnologie Farmaceutiche, Biotecnologie Farmaceutiche);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;attitudine all’analisi quantitativa e padronanza degli strumenti di analisi dei dati (utilizzo avanzato di Excel, gestione di database, ecc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente maturata anche attraverso esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all’estero;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Microsoft Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo ed equo, che rispetta, valorizza e promuove la diversità.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto dinamico e sfidante, che incoraggia creatività, innovazione e lavoro di squadra.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibride a supporto dell’equilibrio tra vita professionale e personale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Percorsi strutturati di formazione e sviluppo per una crescita continua.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un mindset internazionale e la possibilità di lavorare su progetti innovativi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative dedicate al benessere psicofisico delle persone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; -  &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;  - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitization, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help digitalise the national health system (NHS)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working with KPMG’s Healthcare team, you will have the opportunity to contribute to the innovation of healthcare services in Italy. &lt;strong&gt;Over the next few years, we will be working to expand the use of digital tools and the changes&lt;/strong&gt; they can bring to healthcare facilities and the lives of more than 60 million people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our team, you will assist NHS bodies: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;outline the strategy and related healthcare, economic, financial and organisational impacts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;prepare the digital strategy and related user and patient experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;leverage digital technologies to rethink, in an innovative way, service provided, processes and operating models of public and healthcare institutions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;monitor the status and evolution of services, operating management and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you ready to change the future of our country?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The pandemic shed additional light on the strategic importance of healthcare as a crucial sector not only for the health and safety of all citizens but for the country’s economic security as well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With KPMG, you will see first hand where change happens, &lt;strong&gt;working closely with healthcare professionals and NHS officials and managers.&lt;/strong&gt; You will join a &lt;strong&gt;team of young colleagues and professionals &lt;/strong&gt;who work tirelessly day in and day out to promote and champion change, colleagues who will help you to grow and act as a point of reference and help plan your ongoing training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are recruiting professionals for our office in&lt;strong&gt; Milan &lt;/strong&gt;who want to be part of setting the path for our country. Candidates must be empathetic and team players. They must be highly goal-oriented and have strong problem-solving abilities and they must be enthusiastic and strongly career-oriented.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate has:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a master’s degree in engineering subjects (biomedical/engineering management), business (business/healthcare economics) or pharmaceutical subjects (chemistry and pharmaceutical technologies/pharmaceutical biotechnologies) with excellent results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an aptitude for quantitative approaches and a mastery of data analysis tools (advanced use of Excel, database management, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you&apos;ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages creativity and teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International mindset and innovative projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt; This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better - Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individuality, continuous deepening, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s Values that give rise to an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, which allows our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network has obtained ISO 30415 certification, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125, which certifies gender equality. Within our Impact Plan - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarized all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”) as amended. For more information, please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CA1&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Healthcare-Consultant-Milano/1368650857/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368650857</guid><g:id>1368650857</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Software Engineer - Digital Assurance Team (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Junior Software Engineer – Digital Assurance Team&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Il Digital Assurance Team è un team all’avanguardia di KPMG in cui diverse competenze collaborano per dare forma alla digitalizzazione del futuro dei servizi di assurance e revisione contabile. I nostri servizi sono sviluppati da professionisti appassionati che vogliono offrire valore in un nuovo contesto in cui integrare la comprensione delle tematiche contabili e normative con le più recenti soluzioni tecnologiche.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Starting date: Ottobre 2026&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tipologia di inserimento: Apprendistato &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Fondamenti di Programmazione: scriverai e analizzerai &lt;strong&gt;codici&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Manipolazione e Visualizzazione dei Dati: userai tool di &lt;strong&gt;data management e visualization&lt;/strong&gt; per pulire, trasformare e visualizzare i dati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Framework Web e Markup: creerai splendide interfacce utilizzando &lt;strong&gt;HTML, CSS&lt;/strong&gt; e framework &lt;strong&gt;JavaScript&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Database: gestirai grandi quantità di &lt;strong&gt;dati&lt;/strong&gt;, sia NoSQL che relazionali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai una laurea&lt;strong&gt; STEM&lt;/strong&gt; e ti riconosci in questa descrizione, potresti essere la risorsa che stiamo cercando! Get candidate (🎓=True, attitude=True)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai interesse in linguaggi di programmazione come &lt;strong&gt;Python, R e SQL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza con tool di manipolazione dati come &lt;strong&gt;IDEA, KNIME, PBI&lt;/strong&gt; (Power Query, Power Pivot), Qlik e abilità nell&apos;utilizzo di strumenti di visualizzazione dei dati come &lt;strong&gt;PowerBI&lt;/strong&gt;, Qlik e &lt;strong&gt;Tableau&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza con i framework &lt;strong&gt;Javascript&lt;/strong&gt; come &lt;strong&gt;React o AngularJS&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;{console.log(&quot;Qua facciamo un salto quantico&quot;)}&lt;/strong&gt; e linguaggi di markup come &lt;strong&gt;HTML e CSS&lt;/strong&gt; non possono essere &lt;strong&gt;“404 Not Found” nel tuo repertorio; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sai come fare fit, train e test sui modelli di &lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning&lt;/strong&gt; rimanendo lontano dall&apos;overfitting? Cerchiamo un candidato che, come un buon modello di Machine Learning, sia in grado di imparare dagli errori e di evolversi. &lt;strong&gt;while 1 &amp;lt; 2: learn(); exit()&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL di ingresso compresa tra € 25.500 e € 28.500, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Junior Software Engineer - Digital Assurance Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Digital Assurance Team&lt;/strong&gt; is KPMG’s innovative team which brings together different skill sets to shape the digitalization of the future for assurance and audit services. KPMG’s cutting-edge Digital assurance team brings together different skill sets to shape the digitalisation of the future for assurance and audit services. Our services are developed by professionals who are passionate about what they do and who want to bring value to a new context where an understanding of accounting and regulatory issues dovetails with the most recent technological solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Starting date: October 2026&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Type of contract: Apprenticeship&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming&lt;/strong&gt; fundamentals: you will write and analyse &lt;strong&gt;code&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Data manipulation and visualisation: you will use &lt;strong&gt;data management&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;visualisation tools&lt;/strong&gt; to clean, transform and visualise data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Web framework and markup: you will develop outstanding interfaces using &lt;strong&gt;HTML, CSS&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;JavaScript&lt;/strong&gt; framework&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Databases: you will handle large amounts of data, both NoSQL and relational&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have a &lt;strong&gt;STEM&lt;/strong&gt; degree and you see yourself in this description, you might be the candidate we are looking for! Get candidate (🎓=True, attitude=True)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have an interest in programming languages such as &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;R&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have experience with data manipulation tools like &lt;strong&gt;IDEA&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;KNIME&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;PBI&lt;/strong&gt; (Power Query, Power Pivot), Qlik and skills in using data visualization tools like &lt;strong&gt;PowerBI&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;strong&gt; Qlik&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Tableau&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have experience with &lt;strong&gt;JavaScript&lt;/strong&gt; frameworks like &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;AngularJS&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;{console.log(&quot;Here we make a quantum leap&quot;)} &lt;/strong&gt;and markup languages like &lt;strong&gt;HTML&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;CSS&lt;/strong&gt; cannot be &lt;strong&gt;“404 Not Found” in your repertoire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You know how to fit, train, and test &lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning&lt;/strong&gt; models while avoiding overfitting? We are looking for a candidate who, like a good Machine Learning model, can learn from mistakes and evolve. &lt;strong&gt;while 1 &amp;lt; 2: learn(); exit()&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive &lt;/strong&gt;and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages, and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training &lt;/strong&gt;and development programs to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International&lt;/strong&gt; mindset and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and &lt;strong&gt;mental well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;S&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;tandard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary ranging from €25,500 to €28,500. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;  &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, integrity: these are the &lt;strong&gt;values of KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to &lt;strong&gt;express their full potential.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which attests to the compliance of our Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; certification, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance &lt;strong&gt;(ESG)&lt;/strong&gt; issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:6.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-TB1&lt;br&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Software-Engineer-Digital-Assurance-Team/1368819257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368819257</guid><g:id>1368819257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Audit</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Digital Finance Transformation (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Digital Finance Transformation&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will collaborate with experienced colleagues who specialize in functional consultancy on Corporate Performance Management systems, supporting our clients in the analysis, review, and design of processes that support the CFO and subsequent implementation of technological platforms. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Redefining the &lt;strong&gt;EPM strategy&lt;/strong&gt; for leading Italian and international companies, supporting the CFO in redesigning the performance model;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Designing and implementing IT solutions to &lt;strong&gt;support finance and business processes&lt;/strong&gt;, working with top players in the EPM tool market (Board, Oracle, SAP, Tagetik);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analyzing and defining new functional requirements for Statutory &lt;strong&gt;and Managerial Consolidation, Budgeting, Forecasting, Long-Term Planning, Sales and Operational Planning, Product Costing&lt;/strong&gt;, and implementing innovative &lt;strong&gt;Performance Management&lt;/strong&gt; solutions;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Assessing the impacts and benefits expected from &lt;strong&gt;automation&lt;/strong&gt; through business cases;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Monitoring &lt;strong&gt;pre- and post-transformation&lt;/strong&gt; performance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Defining the organizational structure, competencies, required resources, training plan, operating logic, and timelines for the realization of &lt;strong&gt;Finance 4.0&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Economics/Management&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Management Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; with excellent grades; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an excellent knowledge of English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;experience with modules of Board, Tagetik CPM, SAP BPC, or Oracle Hyperion solutions will be considered a plus;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color:blue;text-decoration:underline&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;#LI-MS2&lt;/div&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Consultant-Digital-Finance-Transformation/1367356957/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367356957</guid><g:id>1367356957</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant - SAP Ariba (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare clienti, organizzazioni e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere sfide complesse e attuali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory supporta le imprese nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, oltre che nell&apos;analisi e gestione dei rischi e nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del Team Enterprise Platform sarai coinvolta/o in progetti di implementazione ed evoluzione SAP con focus su &lt;strong&gt;SAP Ariba&lt;/strong&gt; per clienti della Pubblica Amministrazione, contribuendo ai processi end-to-end di procurement nel rispetto della normativa sui contratti pubblici.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Analisi dei requisiti e traduzione in soluzioni SAP Ariba, guidando sessioni di design con i referenti Procurement e Ufficio Gare del cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Configurazione dei moduli &lt;strong&gt;Ariba Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt; (eventi RFx, aste), garantendo tracciabilità e trasparenza dei processi di gara&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Configurazione dei moduli &lt;strong&gt;SAP Ariba Contracts&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;SLP&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;Supplier Risk&lt;/strong&gt;, gestendo la creazione di workspace contrattuali, i processi di qualifica e onboarding fornitori tramite Ariba Network, e implementando logiche di valutazione del rischio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Configurazione dei moduli &lt;strong&gt;Ariba Buying&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Guided Buying&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;Catalog Management&lt;/strong&gt;, inclusa la gestione dei flussi di requisition, approvazione, cataloghi (CIF) e il ciclo di vita degli ordini d&apos;acquisto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Disegno e implementazione delle &lt;strong&gt;integrazioni&lt;/strong&gt; tra SAP Ariba e SAP S/4HANA/ECC nei flussi Procure-to-Pay (tramite Cloud Integration Gateway) e verso soluzioni custom basate su SAP BTP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supporto a &lt;strong&gt;testing&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;formazione utenti&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;change management&lt;/strong&gt;, e redazione della documentazione funzionale di progetto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Lavorerai a stretto contatto con clienti del settore pubblico, in contesti di Pubblica Amministrazione centrale e locale, enti regolatori, sanità, istruzione e società a partecipazione pubblica, collaborando con team multidisciplinari.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai maturato esperienza consolidata su progetti di implementazione SAP Ariba, con almeno un ciclo completo o roll-out, e forte competenza sui moduli &lt;strong&gt;Contracts&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;SLP&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;Supplier Risk&lt;/strong&gt;; sai inoltre gestire in autonomia la configurazione dei moduli &lt;strong&gt;Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Buying&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;Guided Buying&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai familiarità con la gestione dei cataloghi (CIF), i flussi di approvazione e l&apos;onboarding fornitori su Ariba Network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei in grado di condurre in autonomia workshop di analisi e gestire l&apos;interfaccia diretta con il cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi competenze tecniche sulle &lt;strong&gt;integrazioni&lt;/strong&gt;: hai familiarità con le integrazioni tra Ariba e SAP S/4HANA/ECC (via CIG) e possiedi le basi per supportare interfacciamenti verso piattaforme custom come SAP BTP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Costituisce un plus la conoscenza della &lt;strong&gt;normativa sui contratti pubblici (D.Lgs. 36/2023)&lt;/strong&gt; e delle piattaforme di e-procurement pubblico (es. CONSIP, MEPA)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona padronanza della lingua inglese e attitudine al lavoro in team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a trasferte in Italia e all&apos;estero in base alle esigenze progettuali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo e orientato alla valorizzazione delle diversità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto dinamico che incentiva collaborazione e lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibrida per favorire l&apos;equilibrio vita-lavoro&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di formazione e sviluppo strutturati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative dedicate al benessere psicofisico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all&apos;esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto dell&apos;individualità, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità sono i Valori di KPMG, alla base di un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e conoscenza.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie al nostro impegno per un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il Network è conforme agli standard ISO 30415 e UNI PdR 125. Nel nostro Impact Plan sono raccolte azioni concrete sui temi ambientali, sociali e di governance ESG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 GDPR e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Looking for work that is genuinely meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you&apos;ll have the chance to help clients, organisations and colleagues tackle and solve today&apos;s most complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory supports businesses in transforming their operating models, improving and digitalising processes, and managing risk and extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;As part of the Enterprise Platform Team, you will work on SAP implementation and evolution projects with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;SAP Ariba&lt;/strong&gt; for Public Administration clients, contributing to end-to-end procurement processes in compliance with public procurement regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be responsible for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Requirements analysis and translation into SAP Ariba solutions, leading design sessions with the client&apos;s Procurement and Tender Office stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Configuring the &lt;strong&gt;Ariba Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt; modules (RFx events, auctions), ensuring traceability and transparency of tender processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Configuring the &lt;strong&gt;SAP Ariba Contracts&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;SLP&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Supplier Risk&lt;/strong&gt; modules, managing the creation of contract workspaces, qualification processes and supplier onboarding via Ariba Network, and implementing risk assessment logic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Configuring the &lt;strong&gt;Ariba Buying&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Guided Buying&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Catalog Management&lt;/strong&gt; modules, including requisition and approval flows, catalogues (CIF) and the purchase order lifecycle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Designing and implementing &lt;strong&gt;integrations&lt;/strong&gt; between SAP Ariba and SAP S/4HANA/ECC in Procure-to-Pay flows (via Cloud Integration Gateway) and towards custom solutions built on SAP BTP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supporting &lt;strong&gt;testing&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;user training&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;change management&lt;/strong&gt;, and drafting project functional documentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You will work closely with public sector clients, including central and local Public Administration, regulatory bodies, healthcare, education and publicly-owned companies, collaborating with multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your skills and qualities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have solid experience on SAP Ariba implementation projects, including at least one full implementation or roll-out cycle, and strong expertise in the &lt;strong&gt;Contracts&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;SLP&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Supplier Risk&lt;/strong&gt; modules; you are also able to independently manage configuration of the &lt;strong&gt;Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Buying&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Guided Buying&lt;/strong&gt; modules&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are familiar with catalogue management (CIF), approval workflows and supplier onboarding on Ariba Network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You can independently lead analysis workshops and manage direct client interaction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have technical expertise in &lt;strong&gt;integrations&lt;/strong&gt;: you are familiar with Ariba–SAP S/4HANA/ECC integrations (via CIG) and have a foundational understanding of interfacing with custom platforms such as SAP BTP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;public procurement regulations (Italian Legislative Decree 36/2023)&lt;/strong&gt; and public e-procurement platforms (e.g. CONSIP, MEPA) is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good command of English and a collaborative, team-oriented mindset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are available to travel in Italy and abroad based on project needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What you&apos;ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An inclusive work environment that values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A dynamic setting that encourages collaboration and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A hybrid working model that supports work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Structured training and development programmes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives dedicated to physical and mental wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with an indicative starting gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position, determined on the basis of objective criteria with specific reference to the candidate&apos;s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are also based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity are KPMG&apos;s Values, underpinning an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to an inclusive workplace, our Network complies with the ISO 30415 and UNI PdR 125 standards. Our Impact Plan brings together our concrete actions on environmental, social and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (GDPR) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please consult KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Senior-Consultant-SAP-Ariba/1368278657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368278657</guid><g:id>1368278657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant Governance, Risk and Compliance - Financial Services (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Junior Consultant Governance, Risk and Compliance - Financial Services&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di &lt;strong&gt;Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt; di &lt;strong&gt;Milano &lt;/strong&gt;potrai aiutare le aziende a trasformare i &lt;strong&gt;rischi in opportunità&lt;/strong&gt; per migliorare la loro organizzazione e l’evoluzione dei loro sistemi di governance, ottenendo un vantaggio competitivo e offrendo soluzioni integrate e approcci innovativi per la gestione strategica del rischio. La tua esperienza troverà la giusta valorizzazione e ti consentirà di diventare il punto di riferimento per importanti clienti, supportati nel miglioramento dell’efficacia e dell’efficienza dei processi e delle organizzazioni, creando un elevato valore aggiunto e incrementando l’impatto dei servizi erogati.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Sviluppo e applicazione di modelli per la valutazione del rischio di non conformità (&lt;strong&gt;Compliance Risk Assessmen&lt;/strong&gt;t);&lt;br&gt;• Sviluppo e applicazione di modelli per la valutazione del &lt;strong&gt;rischio di coinvolgimento in attività di riciclaggio&lt;/strong&gt; e finanziamento del terrorismo (Money Laundering Risk Assessment);&lt;br&gt;• Studio della &lt;strong&gt;normativa&lt;/strong&gt; relativa al &lt;strong&gt;settore bancario&lt;/strong&gt; e sue applicazioni ed implicazioni sui processi e le procedure;&lt;br&gt;• Sviluppo e applicazione di &lt;strong&gt;modelli di controllo&lt;/strong&gt; a distanza funzionali alla rilevazione di &lt;strong&gt;potenziali anomalie comportamentali e frodi &lt;/strong&gt;(interne ed esterne)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;strong&gt;Internal Audit.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su &lt;strong&gt;progetti nazionali &lt;/strong&gt;e&lt;strong&gt; internazionali&lt;/strong&gt; al fianco di professioniste e professionisti altamente qualificati e lavorerai a stretto contatto con i nostri clienti del settore dei &lt;strong&gt;Financial Services&lt;/strong&gt;, tra cui banche, assicurazioni e società di investimento.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Esperienza di &lt;strong&gt;0 - 1 anno&lt;/strong&gt; presso aziende (compagnie assicurative, banche, asset management) o presso società di consulenza;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laurea magistrale o Master in&lt;strong&gt; Economia o Finanza&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interesse per i &lt;strong&gt;Financial Services&lt;/strong&gt; (settore bancario, assicurativo, asset &amp;amp; wealth management) e buona conoscenza del framework normativo del settore finanziario;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, meglio se avvalorata da un’esperienza di studio e/o lavoro all’estero.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a id=&quot;menur96q&quot; title=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join the Governance, Risk, Compliance and Sustainability Services team, you will help companies transform risks into opportunities for the improvement of their organisation and evolution of their governance systems to gain a competitive edge and offer integrated solutions and innovative approaches for strategic risk management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory’s Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt; team supports companies in the definition of governance and organisational structures to face the challenges of digital transformation through processes for the management of risks and opportunities. If you are passionate about governance and internal control and risk management systems applied to the financial reporting sector, with an interest in consulting, join our &lt;strong&gt;Milan &lt;/strong&gt;team serving clients in the&lt;strong&gt; Financial sector.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• developing and applying compliance &lt;strong&gt;risk assessment models&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;br&gt;• developing and applying money laundering and terrorism financing risk assessment models; • studying &lt;strong&gt;banking sector legislation &lt;/strong&gt;and its applications and implications on processes and procedures; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• developing and applying remote control models for the recognition of potential irregular conduct and fraud (internal and external);&lt;br&gt;•&lt;strong&gt; internal audits&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• a degree in &lt;strong&gt;business and management&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;br&gt;• excellent knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;financial intermediaries&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;br&gt;• interest in &lt;strong&gt;banking/insurance legislation&lt;/strong&gt;; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• interest in compliance and internal audit;&lt;br&gt;• excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;br&gt;• excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MM3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Consultant-Governance%2C-Risk-and-Compliance-Financial-Services/1367787257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367787257</guid><g:id>1367787257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Consultant - Cyber Security | Torino (Torino, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella &lt;strong&gt;digitalizzazione&lt;/strong&gt; dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk&lt;/strong&gt;, linea di servizi di KPMG che ha anticipato e seguito nel tempo le richieste del mercato relative alle tematiche di Information Risk Management e Sicurezza Informatica, sviluppando costantemente le competenze e capacità di analisi a protezione del patrimonio informativo aziendale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Comprendere il contesto tecnologico e di business dei clienti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Analizzare e proteggere il patrimonio informativo aziendale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Garantire la sicurezza delle informazioni e delle strategie di business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Integrare tecnologie innovative nelle infrastrutture esistenti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I professionisti appartenenti al team IRM di KPMG supportano le organizzazioni in tutte le fasi necessarie a garantire la sicurezza delle loro informazioni e delle loro strategie di business. Possiamo affiancare i nostri clienti per migliorare la crescita e creare valore. Possiamo aiutarli a fare i giusti investimenti nel momento giusto, a considerare le implicazioni più ampie della digital disruption, ad integrare tecnologie innovative nelle infrastrutture esistenti.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei un laureando/neolaureato magistrale in Cybersecurity, Informatica, Ingegneria informatica, Crime&amp;amp;Security Analysis, Cybersecurity Risk Strategy and Governance ecc;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai passione per le nuove tecnologie e la loro declinazione nei contesti aziendali;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai capacità di analisi dei dati e di sintesi nella presentazione dei risultati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Conosci i principali standard o practice di riferimento (ISO 27001, COBIT ecc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai interesse per l&apos;ambito dei Sistemi Informativi aziendali, intesi quale strumento abilitante per l&apos;efficace erogazione dei processi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai predisposizioni per la risoluzione di problemi complessi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei proattivo, flessibile e capace di adattarti a contesti eterogenei e sfidanti;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una buona padronanza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a viaggiare sul territorio nazionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ / L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso&lt;/span&gt; compresa tra € 28.000 e € 31.500, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and &lt;strong&gt;digitalisation&lt;/strong&gt;, risk analysis and management, and support in corporate finance transactions.  The &lt;strong&gt;Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk &lt;/strong&gt;team handles the KPMG line of services that pre-empted and continues to meet market demand for information risk management and cybersecurity services, continually developing the analytical skills and expertise to protect company information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;understanding clients’ technological and business context;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;analysing and protecting their information assets;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ensuring information and business strategies are secure;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;integrating innovative technologies into existing infrastructures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The members of KPMG’s CTR team support organisations across all phases of the process to ensure the security of their information and business strategies. We help our clients drive growth and generate value.  We can help them make the right investments at the right time, consider the broader implications of the digital disruption and build breakthrough innovations into their legacy infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;or will soon have a master’s degree in cybersecurity, computer science or computer engineering, Crime&amp;amp;Security Analysis, Cybersecurity Risk Strategy and Governance etc;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a passion for new technologies and their application in corporate settings;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an ability to analyse and summarise data when reporting findings;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;knowledge of the main applicable standards or practices (ISO 27001, COBIT, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an interest in corporate IT systems as enablers for the effective performance of processes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an aptitude for complex problem solving;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a proactive, flexible approach and the ability to adapt to varied, challenging situations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of English, preferably with study/work experience abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;availability to travel within Italy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay up-to-date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship with a monthly allowance of €800 / This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary&lt;/span&gt;  ranging from €28,000 to €31,500. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Torino-Consultant-Cyber-Security-Torino/1366290157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366290157</guid><g:id>1366290157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Torino, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Digital Finance Transformation (Bologna, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Digital Finance Transformation Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Bologna &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;Florence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;, you will interact with top-tier professionals and clients, laying the foundations for your career in a collaborative and stimulating environment focused on individual growth and open to dialogue.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will work with expert colleagues that provide functional advice on corporate performance management systems, assisting clients in the analysis, review and design of processes supporting the CFO and the subsequent development of technological platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Redefining &lt;strong&gt;EPM strategies&lt;/strong&gt; for leading Italian and international companies&lt;strong&gt;, assisting the CFO redesign the performance model&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Designing and configuring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt; solutions to support finance and business processes and implementing them in consultation with the top EPM tool providers on the market;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Analysing and defining the new functional requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt; of budgeting, forecasting, long-term planning, sales and operational planning and product costing processes and implementing innovative performance management solutions;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Assessing the expected impacts and benefits of automation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt; using business cases;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Monitoring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt; pre- and post-transformation performance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Defining the organisational structure, the skills, the number of personnel required, the training plan, the operating framework and the timeframes needed for the &lt;strong&gt;realisation of Finance 4.0&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Management&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Economics,&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Management Engineering, &lt;/strong&gt;or similar &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of the following topics: &lt;strong&gt;Control Models, Budgeting and Forecasting, Consolidated Financial Statements, Financial Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Organizational and teamwork skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; with attention to detail, including the ability to prioritize and manage various complex tasks and activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;MS Office&lt;/strong&gt; package&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color:#0563c1;text-decoration:underline&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MS2&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Bologna-Junior-Consultant-Digital-Finance-Transformation/1367349557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367349557</guid><g:id>1367349557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Bologna, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Experienced Accountant | Verona (Verona, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced Accountant &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;| Verona&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Fides Servizi di Amministrazione&lt;/strong&gt; provides professional services for &lt;strong&gt;administrative, accounting and tax processes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Fides has &lt;strong&gt;over 300 professionals across six locations&lt;/strong&gt; and continues to grow. As the Italian company of the KPMG Network providing professional services for administrative, accounting and tax processes, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Fides, Accounting&lt;/strong&gt; division, supports leading Italian and international companies with administration, finance and control. It plays a key role in identifying potential opportunities, redesigning reporting models and harmonising management accounting processes. At KPMG, we aim to invest in young people to equip them with the solid skills they need to become trusted, reliable professionals. By joining one of KPMG’s Accounting teams, you will work closely with leading companies, assisting them with an integrated compliance approach to administrative activities to translate the various legislative, regulatory and procedural requirements into accounting and tax processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;In a context of profound digital transformation of accounting and administrative services, the Accounting team is increasingly involved in the evolution of operational processes, with the aim of improving efficiency, data quality and reliability, also through the growing use of digital tools and automated solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;We are recruiting &lt;strong&gt;Accounting Consultants&lt;/strong&gt; for our &lt;strong&gt;Verona office&lt;/strong&gt; to carry out &lt;strong&gt;administrative/accounting activities&lt;/strong&gt; for our clients. Successful candidates will be involved in the following activities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ordinary and cost accounting&lt;/strong&gt; applying the &lt;strong&gt;Italian financial reporting standards&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;IFRS&lt;/strong&gt;, outsourced activities and accounting and administrative assistance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;fulfilling clients’ &lt;strong&gt;tax requirements&lt;/strong&gt;, preparing the main types of&lt;strong&gt; tax returns and forms&lt;/strong&gt;, calculating taxes and analysing tax and statutory compliance ;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;administrative and business process re-engineering/improvement;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;project/programme management for the design and implementation of IT and management systems;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;identifying and defining the requirements and the design of complex functional specifications;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;designing &lt;strong&gt;financial reporting models&lt;/strong&gt; and tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate must have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;a master&apos;s degree in &lt;strong&gt;business subjects&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;at least &lt;strong&gt;two/three years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience in the Administration, finance and control area;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Italian financial reporting standards&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;IFRS&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of general ledger and cost accounting methods and techniques;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt; (particularly Excel, PowerPoint, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;excellent &lt;strong&gt;interpersonal and team working skills&lt;/strong&gt; and a flexible and dynamic approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;equitable &lt;/strong&gt;work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;challenging and dynamic environment&lt;/strong&gt; that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a &lt;strong&gt;healthy work-life balance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International&lt;/strong&gt; mindset and &lt;strong&gt;innovative &lt;/strong&gt;projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical &lt;strong&gt;well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €25,500 to €31,500 for the Staff Accountant position and from €31,500 to €42,000 for the Senior Acountant position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. Please see KPMG’s privacy policy for further information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Fides servizi di Amministrazione S.p.A.guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-SC1&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Verona-Experienced-Accountant-Verona/1333140257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1333140257</guid><g:id>1333140257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>FIDES</g:job_function><g:location>Verona, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Financial Services (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Financial Services Team&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt;, you will work closely with &lt;strong&gt;Banking &amp;amp; Insurance&lt;/strong&gt; sector on topics such as: business process reengineering to increase the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;economic-financial and physical-operational performance and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;digital transformation. This specialization offers the opportunity to work on nationally and internationally significant projects within the Financial Sector industry, participating in key initiatives of change and improvement in the realm of business processes efficiency and digitization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Definition of &lt;strong&gt;strategic development and growth opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; in the banking and insurance sector&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Development of &lt;strong&gt;industrial and business plans&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Feasibility studies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; for the start-up of new businesses and innovative products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Management of complex &lt;strong&gt;strategic reorganization transactions&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;business integration deals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Definition and implementation of &lt;strong&gt;business strategy&lt;/strong&gt; of major financial institutions (e.g., reorganization of distribution networks, marketing plans, pricing models, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Market, benchmarking and expected evolution analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; of major sectors/business segments in the financial market&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Definition of &lt;strong&gt;operating models&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;performance improvement programs&lt;/strong&gt; including the use of &lt;strong&gt;innovative technological solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Management Engineering, Finance, Management &lt;/strong&gt;or related field, with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;financial services&lt;/strong&gt; industry &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Organizational and teamwork skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; with attention to detail, including the ability to prioritize and manage various complex tasks and activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;MS Office&lt;/strong&gt; package&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color:blue;text-decoration:underline&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span title=&quot;Hashtag Job Posting: #LI-MM3&quot;&gt;#LI-MM3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Junior-Consultant-Financial-Services/1367348457/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367348457</guid><g:id>1367348457</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant - SAP PP (Padova, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare clienti, società, colleghe e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory affianca le imprese nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, supportando i clienti anche nell&apos;analisi e gestione dei rischi e nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria. Entrando a far parte del Team Enterprise Platforms, lavorerai su progetti di implementazione ed evoluzione &lt;strong&gt;SAP&lt;/strong&gt; con focus su &lt;strong&gt;SAP PP&lt;/strong&gt;, contribuendo ai processi di pianificazione e gestione della produzione end-to-end (&lt;strong&gt;Plan-to-Produce&lt;/strong&gt;) su &lt;strong&gt;SAP ECC&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;SAP S/4HANA&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Analisi dei requisiti produttivi e traduzione in soluzioni &lt;strong&gt;SAP PP&lt;/strong&gt;, guidando autonomamente sessioni di design con gli stakeholder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fit-to-Standard&lt;/strong&gt;/&lt;strong&gt;Blueprint&lt;/strong&gt; e disegno dei processi &lt;strong&gt;to-be&lt;/strong&gt; con referenti di Production, Supply Chain Planning e Operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Configurazione &lt;strong&gt;PP&lt;/strong&gt;: strutture organizzative, tipi ordine, &lt;strong&gt;distinte base&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;BOM&lt;/strong&gt;), &lt;strong&gt;cicli di lavoro&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;routing&lt;/strong&gt;) e &lt;strong&gt;centri di lavoro&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MRP&lt;/strong&gt;: configurazione parametri di pianificazione, classi MRP, &lt;strong&gt;lot sizing&lt;/strong&gt; e gestione eccezioni&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Gestione del ciclo di vita degli &lt;strong&gt;ordini di produzione&lt;/strong&gt; (rilascio, conferma, &lt;strong&gt;goods movements&lt;/strong&gt;, chiusura) e &lt;strong&gt;process orders&lt;/strong&gt; in ambito &lt;strong&gt;PP-PI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Integrazioni con &lt;strong&gt;MM&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;CO-PC&lt;/strong&gt; (product costing e scostamenti) ed &lt;strong&gt;EWM&lt;/strong&gt;/&lt;strong&gt;WM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Redazione di documentazione funzionale (&lt;strong&gt;Blueprint&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Functional Design&lt;/strong&gt;, specifiche sviluppi, manuali utente)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su progetti nazionali e internazionali, lavorando a stretto contatto con clienti e team multidisciplinari, in particolare su contesti&lt;strong&gt; Industrial &amp;amp; Manufacturing &lt;/strong&gt;(es. Automotive, Industrial Manufacturing, Food &amp;amp; Drink, Consumer Products, Pharmaceutical &amp;amp; Life Sciences).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai &lt;strong&gt;3–5 anni di esperienza&lt;/strong&gt; su progetti &lt;strong&gt;SAP PP&lt;/strong&gt;, maturata su almeno un progetto di implementazione o migrazione &lt;strong&gt;S/4HANA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai competenze solide di configurazione &lt;strong&gt;PP&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;BOM&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;routing&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;work centers&lt;/strong&gt;) e padronanza dei processi &lt;strong&gt;Plan-to-Produce&lt;/strong&gt; in scenari &lt;strong&gt;Make-to-Stock&lt;/strong&gt; e/o &lt;strong&gt;Make-to-Order&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Sai configurare e analizzare i risultati &lt;strong&gt;MRP&lt;/strong&gt;, interpretare le eccezioni e supportare i planner del cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza su documentazione funzionale, &lt;strong&gt;SIT&lt;/strong&gt;/&lt;strong&gt;UAT&lt;/strong&gt; e gestione requisiti in autonomia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai familiarità con le integrazioni &lt;strong&gt;PP–MM&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;PP–CO-PC&lt;/strong&gt; e, preferibilmente, &lt;strong&gt;PP–EWM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Costituisce un plus la conoscenza di &lt;strong&gt;PP-PI&lt;/strong&gt; per contesti farmaceutici, chimici o food &amp;amp; beverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Buona conoscenza dell&apos;&lt;strong&gt;inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, attitudine al lavoro in team e disponibilità a &lt;strong&gt;trasferte&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, colleagues and peers tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory supports companies in transforming their business model, improving and digitalising their processes, while also helping clients analyse and manage risks and navigate extraordinary finance transactions. By joining the Enterprise Platforms Team, you will work on SAP implementation and evolution projects with a focus on SAP PP, contributing to end-to-end production planning and management processes (Plan-to-Produce) on SAP ECC and SAP S/4HANA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be responsible for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Analysing production requirements and translating them into SAP PP solutions, independently leading design sessions with stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Fit-to-Standard/Blueprint and to-be process design with Production, Supply Chain Planning and Operations stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;PP configuration: organisational structures, order types, Bills of Materials (BOM), routings and work centres&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;MRP: configuration of planning parameters, MRP classes, lot sizing and exception management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Managing the production order lifecycle (release, confirmation, goods movements, technical completion) and process orders in PP-PI environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Integrations with MM, CO-PC (product costing and variance analysis) and EWM/WM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Functional documentation (Blueprint, Functional Design, development and integration specifications, user manuals)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You will be involved in national and international projects, working closely with clients and multidisciplinary teams, particularly in Industrial &amp;amp; Manufacturing contexts (e.g. Automotive, Industrial Manufacturing, Food &amp;amp; Drink, Consumer Products, Pharmaceutical &amp;amp; Life Sciences).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your skills and background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;This opportunity is the right fit for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;3–5 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; on SAP PP projects, gained on at least one S/4HANA implementation or migration project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You have solid PP configuration skills (BOM, routing, work centres) and a strong command of Plan-to-Produce processes in Make-to-Stock and/or Make-to-Order scenarios&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You can configure and analyse MRP results, interpret exceptions and support the client&apos;s planning team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You have experience in functional documentation, SIT/UAT and requirements management, working independently&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You are familiar with PP–MM, PP–CO-PC integrations and, preferably, PP–EWM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Knowledge of PP-PI in pharmaceutical, chemical or food &amp;amp; beverage environments is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Good command of English, team-oriented mindset and willingness to travel as required by project needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you will find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An inclusive and equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that fosters creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hybrid working model to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programmes to keep you always up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;International mindset and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate&apos;s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s Values, which create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Through our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network complies with the requirements of ISO 30415 (Diversity and Inclusion Management System) and UNI PdR 125 (gender equality). Within our Impact Plan — Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) — you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Personal data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of EU Regulation No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation — &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-EB1 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Padova-Senior-Consultant-SAP-PP/1366886157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366886157</guid><g:id>1366886157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Padova, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Analyst AMS SAP FI-CO (Napoli, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Open Platform&lt;/strong&gt; è il nostro nuovo Hub innovativo con sede a Napoli, creato per sviluppare modelli di servizio e soluzioni ad alto contenuto tecnologico per le imprese e la Pubblica Amministrazione. Le aree di intervento includono Cyber Security, Program Management su grandi cantieri di trasformazione del settore pubblico, Application Maintenance e Managed Services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team AMS SAP&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai impegnata/o nella gestione dei processi aziendali relativi al modulo &lt;strong&gt;SAP FI-CO&lt;/strong&gt;, con un focus su &lt;strong&gt;manutenzione, ottimizzazione e personalizzazione&lt;/strong&gt; delle piattaforme SAP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Analizzare i processi aziendali relativi all&apos;area &lt;strong&gt;amministrazione, finanza e controllo&lt;/strong&gt;, identificando in autonomia opportunità di miglioramento e definendo le priorità di intervento in collaborazione con il management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Progettare e implementare soluzioni SAP FI/CO personalizzate&lt;/strong&gt; per ottimizzare i processi di contabilità generale, contabilità fornitori e clienti, cespiti, controlling e reporting gestionale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Presidiare la &lt;strong&gt;manutenzione correttiva ed evolutiva&lt;/strong&gt; dei moduli SAP FI/CO, garantendo la corretta integrazione con gli altri moduli SAP (es. MM, SD, PP)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Affiancare e supportare le &lt;strong&gt;risorse junior&lt;/strong&gt; del team, favorendone la crescita professionale attraverso formazione on the job e condivisione delle best practice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Lavorerai a stretto contatto con clienti del &lt;strong&gt;settore pubblico&lt;/strong&gt;, in contesti di &lt;strong&gt;Pubblica Amministrazione centrale e locale, enti regolatori, sanità, istruzione e società a partecipazione pubblica&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai maturato &lt;strong&gt;esperienza consolidata in ambito SAP&lt;/strong&gt;, con un focus sul modulo &lt;strong&gt;SAP FI-CO&lt;/strong&gt;, e conosci le principali dinamiche di integrazione con gli altri moduli SAP (MM, SD, PP)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai gestito in autonomia l&apos;&lt;strong&gt;intero ciclo di vita di richieste e progetti AMS&lt;/strong&gt;, dalla presa in carico fino alla chiusura, monitorando SLA e qualità degli output anche su casistiche complesse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei in grado di &lt;strong&gt;identificare e risolvere in autonomia problematiche tecniche e funzionali&lt;/strong&gt; all&apos;interno del modulo SAP FI-CO, applicando metodologie di troubleshooting strutturate e supportando il team nella gestione delle criticità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei abituata/o a lavorare in &lt;strong&gt;ambienti strutturati&lt;/strong&gt;, dimostrando &lt;strong&gt;autonomia operativa&lt;/strong&gt; e capacità di interfacciarti direttamente con gli stakeholder di business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG Open Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo, equo&lt;/strong&gt; e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;stimolante e dinamico&lt;/strong&gt; che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt;, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo avanzati&lt;/strong&gt; per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Mindset &lt;strong&gt;internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un&apos;organizzazione che si impegna per generare un &lt;strong&gt;impatto sociale e sul territorio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 24.500 e € 31.500 per la qualifica di Junior Analyst/Analyst, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all&apos;esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all&apos;impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; (Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l&apos;Inclusione) e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; (parità di genere). All&apos;interno del nostro Impact Plan – bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Open Platform S.r.l SB garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that truly matters and makes an impact? At &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues face and solve today&apos;s most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Open Platform&lt;/strong&gt; is our new innovation Hub based in Naples, created to develop service models and high-tech solutions for businesses and Public Administration. Areas of focus include &lt;strong&gt;Cyber Security&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Program Management&lt;/strong&gt; for large-scale public sector transformation initiatives, &lt;strong&gt;Application Maintenance&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Managed Services&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Joining the &lt;strong&gt;AMS SAP Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be involved in managing business processes related to the &lt;strong&gt;SAP FI-CO&lt;/strong&gt; module, with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;maintenance, optimisation, and customisation&lt;/strong&gt; of SAP platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Analyse business processes related to the &lt;strong&gt;administration, finance, and controlling&lt;/strong&gt; area, independently identifying improvement opportunities and defining priorities for intervention in collaboration with management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and implement customised SAP FI/CO solutions&lt;/strong&gt; to optimise general ledger, accounts payable and receivable, asset accounting, controlling, and management reporting processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Oversee the &lt;strong&gt;corrective and evolutionary maintenance&lt;/strong&gt; of SAP FI/CO modules, ensuring proper integration with other SAP modules (e.g. MM, SD, PP)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Mentor and support &lt;strong&gt;junior team members&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering their professional growth through on-the-job training and the sharing of best practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You will work closely with &lt;strong&gt;public sector&lt;/strong&gt; clients, in contexts including &lt;strong&gt;central and local Public Administration, regulatory bodies, healthcare, education, and publicly-owned companies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Qualities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is right for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;solid experience in SAP&lt;/strong&gt;, with a focus on the &lt;strong&gt;SAP FI-CO&lt;/strong&gt; module, and understand the main integration dynamics with other SAP modules (MM, SD, PP)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have independently managed the &lt;strong&gt;full lifecycle of AMS requests and projects&lt;/strong&gt;, from intake through to closure, monitoring SLAs and output quality even on complex cases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are able to &lt;strong&gt;independently identify and resolve technical and functional issues&lt;/strong&gt; within the SAP FI-CO module, applying structured troubleshooting methodologies and supporting the team in managing critical issues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are used to working in &lt;strong&gt;structured environments&lt;/strong&gt;, demonstrating &lt;strong&gt;operational autonomy&lt;/strong&gt; and the ability to interface directly with business stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You Will Find at KPMG Open Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;stimulating and dynamic&lt;/strong&gt; setting that fosters creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;hybrid working&lt;/strong&gt; model to support a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training and development&lt;/strong&gt; programmes to keep you always up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;physical and mental wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An organisation committed to generating &lt;strong&gt;social and local impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Employment terms under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with an indicative gross annual salary between €24,500 and €31,500 for the Junior Analyst/Analyst qualification, determined on the basis of objective criteria with specific reference to the candidate&apos;s skills and experience against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Our Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity: these are the Values of KPMG, which give life to an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to reach their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Through our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network complies with the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; standard (Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Management System) and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; (Gender Equality). Within our Impact Plan – bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG, you will find a full overview of the concrete actions we are taking on &lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt; (Environmental, Social, and Governance) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with EU Regulation No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Open Platform S.r.l SB is an equal opportunities employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-EB1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Napoli-Analyst-AMS-SAP-FI-CO/1368519057/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368519057</guid><g:id>1368519057</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Napoli, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Business Transformation (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Business Trasformation&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be placed in a fast-growing team full of talent, which is characterized by the quality and impact of its transformative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;You will be involved in major discontinuity projects for major national and international clients, in direct contact with the top management of leading companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Rethinking the &lt;strong&gt;operating models&lt;/strong&gt; of key business functions (Finance, HR, Procurement, Supply Chain) through &lt;strong&gt;organizational and operational levers&lt;/strong&gt;. The goal is to implement models that can &lt;strong&gt;improve business performanc&lt;/strong&gt;e in alignment with business strategies;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Supporting &lt;strong&gt;organizational redesign and process re-engineering initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; through change management pathways, providing levers to address change and unlocking its full potential to be an integral part of the business transformation;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Evaluating &lt;strong&gt;the impacts and expected benefits of implemented initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, monitoring pre- and post-transformative performance, and initiating targeted plans to close identified gaps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Management, Business Administration&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Management Engineering;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:#3c3c3c;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Organizational and teamwork skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; with attention to detail, including the ability to prioritize and manage various complex tasks and activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:#3c3c3c;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;MS Office&lt;/strong&gt; package&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:#3c3c3c;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An excellent knowledge of&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0.0cm&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MS2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Consultant-Business-Transformation/1367356557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367356557</guid><g:id>1367356557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Meet&amp;Cheers Fides - Servizi di Accounting (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG &lt;/strong&gt;ti invita a partecipare a&lt;strong&gt; Meet&amp;amp;Cheers Fides&lt;/strong&gt;, un evento pensato per studenti e studentesse triennali, magistrali e neolaureati/e con una passione per il mondo Accounting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;📅 &lt;strong&gt;Quando:&lt;/strong&gt; martedì 13 ottobre 2026 | 17.00 – 19.00&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;📍 &lt;strong&gt;Dove:&lt;/strong&gt; Ufficio KPMG Milano – Via Melchiorre Gioia 20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;🍽 &lt;strong&gt;Aperitivo di networking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;L’evento&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Un’esperienza di networking informale, durante la quale avrai l’opportunità di confrontarti con i nostri Professional, conoscere il loro percorso di carriera e approfondire la loro esperienza nel team Fides di KPMG. Sarà inoltre un’occasione per scoprire più da vicino progetti e opportunità professionali negli ambiti &lt;strong&gt;amministrativo-contabili delle nostre aziende clienti.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;✨ &lt;strong&gt;Perché partecipare?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Ti confronterai con i nostri professionisti&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Scoprirai da vicino il mondo Fides&lt;br&gt;Approfondirai i principali ambiti di attività del team Accounting&lt;br&gt;Vivrai un momento di networking e condivisione in un contesto informale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;📌 &lt;strong&gt;Requisiti&lt;/strong&gt;:L’evento è dedicato a neolaureati/e e studenti e studentesse universitarie con background Economico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;👉 Candidati ora! Posti limitati!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG, con oltre 276.000 professionisti in 138 paesi, è leader globale nei servizi di revisione, consulenza e amministrazione. In Italia, il team di oltre 7.000 professionisti in 25 sedi, si distingue per valori come trasparenza, inclusione e innovazione, promuovendo un ambiente che valorizza il potenziale di ciascuno.&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG. KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Meet&amp;Cheers-Fides-Servizi-di-Accounting/1370942657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1370942657</guid><g:id>1370942657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>FIDES</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>CRM Junior Tech Consultant (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Digital Customer Team&lt;/strong&gt; as a &lt;strong&gt;CRM Junior Tech Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;, you will have the opportunity to be part of the biggest revolution taking place by rethinking customer models from a digital perspective. You will work closely with market-leading companies on innovation topics and support our clients throughout their digital transformation journey. You will have the opportunity to work with new technologies, such as: &lt;strong&gt;Generative AI, CRM design and development, Marketing Automation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Project and develop customized configurations on the &lt;strong&gt;biggest CRM suites&lt;/strong&gt;, tailored to the client’s needs, working with the low-code/no-code configuration and the most famous programming languages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Collaborate to define &lt;strong&gt;new functional requirements for the suite&lt;/strong&gt;, bringing an effective competitive advantage for the clients&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Follow the &lt;strong&gt;deployment of new releases&lt;/strong&gt;, support the phases of testing and debugging, monitor pre- and post-transformation performance, and produce documentation about the improvements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A Master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Computer Science &lt;/strong&gt;or related courses (Physics, etc..)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of one or more &lt;strong&gt;programming languages&lt;/strong&gt; (Java, Python, C, C++, ecc…)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;SQL language for relational databases&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Organizational and teamwork skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; with attention to detail, including the ability to prioritize and manage various complex tasks and activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;MS Office&lt;/strong&gt; package&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Familiarity with GenAI (topics definition, training engines) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MC2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-CRM-Junior-Tech-Consultant/1367487957/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367487957</guid><g:id>1367487957</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Digital Finance Transformation (Padova, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Digital Finance Transformation&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Padua&lt;/strong&gt;, you will also have the opportunity to work with highly skilled professionals and clients from various industries, building the foundation for your professional career in a collaborative and stimulating environment that values individual growth and encourages open discussions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will collaborate with experienced colleagues specializing in functional consulting and you will assist our clients in analyzing, reviewing, and designing processes to support the CFO in decision making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analysis of different industries&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; in order have a deep knowledge of the business requirements in terms of business processes, business models, market analysis, IT landscape. We collaborate both with industrial companies and services companies, some of the businesses involved are industrial manufacturing, fashion, pharma &amp;amp; chemical, utilities, food retail, …&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Direct support to CFO and the financial department&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: redesign of processes and procedures and IT Tools enhancement, related to the following topics:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Planning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: define planning process and key roles for budget, forecasts, business plans, …;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: define reporting models (managerial P&amp;amp;L, industrial controlling reporting, production analysis, industrial variances, …) through financial and business KPIs definition, report layout build up on BI tools and data modeling;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Product costing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: define main cost elements in line with industrial process and the rule for their attribution to the products;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Closing and consolidation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: define closing and consolidation logics and timeline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Designing and configuring solutions to support finance and implementing them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; both with internal skills (ex: Microsoft PBI, Board, Knime, Alteryx, ...) or in collaboration with external parties where needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Support Italian and international leading companies in various &lt;strong&gt;transformation projects playing the role of the project manager&lt;/strong&gt; as key link among actor involved in the project (business functions, system integrators, investment funds, other consulting companies …). This includes the definition of goals and the project timeline, the management of project summaries and updates meetings and problem-solving sessions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Support the financial department in the digital transformation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; defining the organizational structure, the skills, the number of personnel required, the training plan, the operating framework and the timeframes needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Business administration &lt;/strong&gt;or&lt;strong&gt; Management engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, with excellent results;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;English and Italian&lt;/strong&gt; language, preferably supported by study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt; suite;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of the following topics: &lt;strong&gt;Controlling Models, Budget &amp;amp; Forecast, Consolidated Financial Statements&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;(Statutory and Managerial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Experience with Microsoft Power BI, Board and general knowledge of main &lt;strong&gt;ERP&lt;/strong&gt; functionalities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;will be considered a plus. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color:blue;text-decoration:underline&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MS2&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Padova-Junior-Consultant-Digital-Finance-Transformation/1367350057/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367350057</guid><g:id>1367350057</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Padova, IT</g:location></item><item><title>IT Business Analyst SAP (Intern) (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Enterprise Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai inserita/o in un percorso di crescita nell&apos;ambito &lt;strong&gt;SAP Business Technology Platform (BTP)&lt;/strong&gt;: affiancherai colleghe e colleghi più esperti nello sviluppo di applicazioni e soluzioni digitali per i nostri clienti, imparando passo dopo passo gli strumenti e le tecnologie SAP più moderne.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Scrivere codice per &lt;strong&gt;applicazioni cloud-native&lt;/strong&gt; utilizzando il modello di sviluppo SAP CAP (Cloud Application Programming), il framework che permette di costruire app moderne su SAP BTP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Realizzare &lt;strong&gt;interfacce utente&lt;/strong&gt; con SAP Fiori/UI5, le schermate con cui gli utenti finali interagiranno con le applicazioni&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Costruire &lt;strong&gt;estensioni&lt;/strong&gt; che aggiungono nuove funzionalità ai sistemi SAP esistenti dei clienti, senza modificarne il codice core&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Configurare &lt;strong&gt;integrazioni tra sistemi&lt;/strong&gt; tramite SAP Integration Suite, ad esempio collegando SAP con altri applicativi aziendali tramite API&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Scrivere e far eseguire &lt;strong&gt;test funzionali&lt;/strong&gt; sul codice sviluppato, per verificare che tutto funzioni come previsto prima del rilascio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Documentare il lavoro svolto e affiancare il team nella fase di &lt;strong&gt;messa in produzione&lt;/strong&gt; della soluzione presso il cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai un &lt;strong&gt;percorso accademico&lt;/strong&gt; in discipline STEM, Ingegneria Informatica o Informatica&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai &lt;strong&gt;motivazione&lt;/strong&gt; a intraprendere un percorso di consulenza sui processi aziendali e sui sistemi informativi, anche senza esperienza pregressa su SAP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai un&apos;&lt;strong&gt;ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, meglio se avvalorata da un&apos;esperienza di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai un&apos;&lt;strong&gt;ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Office&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona padronanza della lingua inglese e attitudine al lavoro in team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a trasferte in Italia e all&apos;estero in base alle esigenze progettuali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibrida, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di formazione e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul benessere psicofisico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;L&apos;opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all&apos;impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l&apos;Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I dati richiesti verranno trattati nell&apos;assoluto rispetto delle disposizioni contenute nel Regolamento Europeo 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot; o &quot;Normativa Privacy&quot;) e sue successive modificazioni ed integrazioni.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to do a job that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues face and solve the most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to businesses to assist them in transforming their business models, improving and digitalizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, as well as supporting extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;By joining the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platform Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be onboarded onto a growth path within &lt;strong&gt;SAP Business Technology Platform (BTP)&lt;/strong&gt;: you will work alongside more experienced colleagues on the development of applications and digital solutions for our clients, learning step by step the most modern SAP tools and technologies. Our Team was awarded the SAP Gold Quality Award for Business Transformation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Write code for &lt;strong&gt;cloud-native applications&lt;/strong&gt; using the SAP CAP (Cloud Application Programming) development model, the framework used to build modern apps on SAP BTP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Build &lt;strong&gt;user interfaces&lt;/strong&gt; with SAP Fiori/UI5, the screens end users will interact with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Build &lt;strong&gt;extensions&lt;/strong&gt; that add new functionality to clients&apos; existing SAP systems, without modifying their core code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Configure &lt;strong&gt;system integrations&lt;/strong&gt; using SAP Integration Suite, for example connecting SAP with other business applications via APIs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Write and run &lt;strong&gt;functional tests&lt;/strong&gt; on the code developed, to check everything works as expected before release&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Document the work carried out and support the team during the &lt;strong&gt;go-live&lt;/strong&gt; phase at the client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is right for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have an &lt;strong&gt;academic background&lt;/strong&gt; in STEM disciplines, Computer Engineering or Computer Science&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have the &lt;strong&gt;motivation&lt;/strong&gt; to build a consulting career on business processes and information systems, even without prior experience in SAP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have an &lt;strong&gt;excellent command of English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally supported by study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;excellent knowledge of the Office suite&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good command of English and a team-oriented attitude&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are available for business travel in Italy and abroad based on project needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us – What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that promotes creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid working options to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate&apos;s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In compliance with applicable law, we do not collect or use information about salaries received in current or previous employment relationships. Our selection processes are also based on objective and gender neutral criteria.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community commitment, and integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s values, which create an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network complies with the standards of the ISO 30415 requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125, relating to gender equality. In our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) you can find all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The requested data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of the European Regulation 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – &quot;GDPR&quot; or &quot;Privacy Regulation&quot;) and its subsequent amendments and integrations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-IT-Business-Analyst-SAP-%28Intern%29/1356974757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1356974757</guid><g:id>1356974757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Financial Services (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Financial Services Team&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will work closely with &lt;strong&gt;Banking &amp;amp; Insurance&lt;/strong&gt; sector on topics such as: business process reengineering to increase the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;economic-financial and physical-operational performance and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;digital transformation. This specialization offers the opportunity to work on nationally and internationally significant projects within the Financial Sector industry, participating in key initiatives of change and improvement in the realm of business processes efficiency and digitization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Definition of &lt;strong&gt;strategic development and growth opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; in the banking and insurance sector&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Development of &lt;strong&gt;industrial and business plans&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Feasibility studies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; for the start-up of new businesses and innovative products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Management of complex &lt;strong&gt;strategic reorganization transactions&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;business integration deals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Definition and implementation of &lt;strong&gt;business strategy&lt;/strong&gt; of major financial institutions (e.g., reorganization of distribution networks, marketing plans, pricing models, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Market, benchmarking and expected evolution analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; of major sectors/business segments in the financial market&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Definition of &lt;strong&gt;operating models&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;performance improvement programs&lt;/strong&gt; including the use of &lt;strong&gt;innovative technological solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Management Engineering, Finance, Management &lt;/strong&gt;or related field, with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;financial services&lt;/strong&gt; industry &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Organizational and teamwork skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; with attention to detail, including the ability to prioritize and manage various complex tasks and activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;MS Office&lt;/strong&gt; package&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color:blue;text-decoration:underline&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent:-0.5pt&quot;&gt;#LI-MM3&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Consultant-Financial-Services/1367349157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367349157</guid><g:id>1367349157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Tax Incentives Consultant | Firenze (Firenze, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. I professionisti dello &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato &lt;/strong&gt;di KPMG intervengono in tutte le principali aree della fiscalità e del diritto societario offrendo servizi integrati e innovativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;team Tax Incentives&lt;/strong&gt; di Firenze, contribuirai a supportare i clienti nell&apos;affrontare le sfide legate alle principali aree della fiscalità. Opererai in uno scenario in continua evoluzione, dove normative nazionali e internazionali si intrecciano con le aspettative del mercato e dell’opinione pubblica su temi cruciali come l’etica, la trasparenza e la corporate governance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di supportare le aziende nell&apos;identificazione e nell&apos;ottenimento dei &lt;strong&gt;Crediti d&apos;Imposta&lt;/strong&gt; previsti dalla normativa quali, ad esempio:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;i crediti d’imposta per investimenti in ricerca, sviluppo e innovazione, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;transizione 4.0, transizione 5.0,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;nuovo regime Patent Box. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza professionale di &lt;strong&gt;almeno 1 anno&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;presso primari studi nazionali o internazionali e/o società di consulenza;&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hai una laurea magistrale in &lt;strong&gt;Economia&lt;/strong&gt; (LM 77 o LM 56) o Giurisprudenza con votazione almeno pari a 100/110&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hai l’abilitazione alla professione di &lt;strong&gt;Dottore Commercialista/Avvocato&lt;/strong&gt; o la volontà di intraprendere la &lt;strong&gt;pratica professionale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hai una buona padronanza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Buona conoscenza di Office, in particolare Excel e Power Point&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ottime capacità relazionali e di team working&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere.  All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;–&lt;em&gt; Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you’ll have the opportunity to help your firm, clients and colleagues address and resolve some of today’s most topical and complex issues. Our &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Tax &amp;amp; Legal&lt;/strong&gt; professionals work at the forefront of tax and corporate law, delivering integrated and innovative services across all key areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As part of our &lt;strong&gt;Tax Specialties &lt;/strong&gt;team in Florence,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;you’ll help clients navigate the tax system. You’ll be working in a constantly evolving environment, where national and international regulations intersect with market expectations as well as public opinion on crucial topics such as ethics, transparency and corporate governance. Specifically, you’ll assist businesses in identifying and obtaining &lt;strong&gt;tax relief&lt;/strong&gt; such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:8.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;tax credits for investments in research, development and innovation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;the transition 4.0 and transition 5.0 tax credits;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;the new Patent Box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Qualifications, Skills and Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:8.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;at least one year’s&lt;/strong&gt; experience at a leading national or international practice and/or advisory firm; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;a master&apos;s degree in &lt;strong&gt;economics&lt;/strong&gt; (LM-77 or LM-56) or &lt;strong&gt;law&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;with a final mark of at least 100/110;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;qualified as an &lt;strong&gt;accountant&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;lawyer&lt;/strong&gt; or wish to begin your &lt;strong&gt;qualifying work experience&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;a good command of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably with experience studying and/or working abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of Microsoft Office, especially Excel and PowerPoint;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:8.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that fosters &lt;strong&gt;creativity &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;teamworking&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to support continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international outlook&lt;/strong&gt; and a focus on &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individual, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values &lt;/strong&gt;that foster an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge, so that our people can &lt;strong&gt;express their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;. KPMG supports all its people in reaching their full potential, whatever their identity or background. Fully committed to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, we are &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 compliant &lt;/strong&gt;(ISO 30415:2021 &lt;em&gt;–&lt;/em&gt; Human Resources Management &lt;em&gt;–&lt;/em&gt; Diversity and Inclusion). KPMG in Italy is also &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125 &lt;/strong&gt;compliant (UNI/PdR 125:2022 – measures to ensure gender equality in audit and assurance services). You can find a summary of all our &lt;strong&gt;concrete&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;ESG &lt;/strong&gt;(environmental, social, and governance) &lt;strong&gt;actions&lt;/strong&gt; in our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG in Italy is an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – “GDPR”) as subsequently amended. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy notice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-AL1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Firenze-Tax-Incentives-Consultant-Firenze/1365618657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365618657</guid><g:id>1365618657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Firenze, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Deal Advisory - Restructuring&amp;Turnaround Senior Consultant | Firenze (Firenze, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Restructuring&amp;amp;Turnaround Consultant | Florence&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi intraprendere una professione davvero significativa e di impatto? In &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare clienti, azienda e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione dei modelli di business, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e gestione dei rischi e nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Il team &lt;strong&gt;Restructuring&lt;/strong&gt; assiste i clienti nei processi di ristrutturazione del debito e di rilancio industriale, offrendo consulenza finanziaria e supporto nella predisposizione di business plan finalizzati alla stabilizzazione dell&apos;azienda e all&apos;avvio di un cambiamento sostenibile.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;I consulenti del team sono coinvolti in attività di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;ristrutturazione del debito;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;operazioni di fusione e acquisizione (M&amp;amp;A) su aziende in difficoltà (&lt;em&gt;distressed M&amp;amp;A&lt;/em&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;consulenza agli istituti finanziari (&lt;em&gt;lender advisory&lt;/em&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;rivolte a multinazionali, imprese familiari, fondi di private equity e istituzioni finanziarie.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte di un team riconosciuto per la qualità e la rilevanza dei progetti realizzati, avrai l&apos;opportunità di lavorare con importanti clienti italiani e internazionali. Nel 2022, per la terza volta in quattro anni, il team ha ricevuto il &lt;strong&gt;Finance Community Award&lt;/strong&gt; come &lt;strong&gt;&quot;Restructuring Team of the Year&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, a conferma dell&apos;eccellenza professionale e del valore dei progetti seguiti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando nel team di &lt;strong&gt;Firenze&lt;/strong&gt;, in un ambiente dinamico e stimolante, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;analizzare le performance finanziarie delle aziende target per valutarne l&apos;effettiva situazione economico-finanziaria;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;sviluppare modelli finanziari (&lt;em&gt;financial modelling&lt;/em&gt;) e business plan;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;effettuare revisioni indipendenti dei business plan (&lt;em&gt;Independent Business Review&lt;/em&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;svolgere attività di due diligence commerciale e operativa;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;partecipare alle negoziazioni con i principali stakeholder, in particolare istituti finanziari e investitori;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;supportare operazioni di acquisizione e fusione di aziende in crisi (&lt;em&gt;distressed M&amp;amp;A&lt;/em&gt;), insieme a partner industriali, fondi di investimento e altri operatori;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;supportare attività di gestione della liquidità (&lt;em&gt;cash management&lt;/em&gt;) e progetti di turnaround aziendale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;analizzare interventi di riduzione dei costi e miglioramento organizzativo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è ideale se possiedi:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2-4 anni di esperienza&lt;/strong&gt; in ambito restructuring, gestione delle crisi d&apos;impresa e/o corporate finance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;una &lt;strong&gt;laurea magistrale&lt;/strong&gt; in discipline economiche con specializzazione in finanza o amministrazione, finanza e controllo (AFC), oppure in ingegneria gestionale con indirizzo finanziario;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;un&apos;ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente accompagnata da esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;un&apos;ottima conoscenza del pacchetto &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo ed equo&lt;/strong&gt;, che rispetta, valorizza e promuove la diversità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;dinamico e stimolante&lt;/strong&gt;, che incoraggia creatività e lavoro di squadra.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt;, per favorire un sano equilibrio tra vita privata e professionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi avanzati di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt;, per mantenere competenze sempre aggiornate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente internazionale e la possibilità di lavorare su &lt;strong&gt;progetti innovativi&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere mentale e fisico&lt;/strong&gt; delle persone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità sono i valori di &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;. Questi principi contribuiscono a creare un ambiente che favorisce la condivisione di idee e conoscenze, permettendo ai professionisti di esprimere al meglio il proprio potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo &lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 &lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125 &lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Attraverso il proprio &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt;, KPMG riassume le azioni concrete intraprese sui temi ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati personali saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (GDPR) e delle successive modifiche. Per maggiori informazioni è possibile consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. promuove le pari opportunità ed è un datore di lavoro che valorizza l&apos;inclusione e la diversità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Restructuring services&lt;/strong&gt; team assists clients in debt and industrial restructuring with financial advisory and/or support services to help them prepare business plans that stabilise the business and usher in sustainable change. Our consultants are involved in debt restructuring, distressed M&amp;amp;As and lender advisory activities for multinationals, family-run enterprises, private equity funds and financial institutions. As a member of this team, known for the quality and scope of its projects, your talent will be put to full use, enabling you to work with leading Italian and international clients: in 2022, for the third time in four years, our team received the Finance Community Award for Italian “Restructuring Team of the Year” in recognition of its professional excellence and the type of projects implemented.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join our team in &lt;strong&gt;Florence, &lt;/strong&gt;a dynamic and stimulating environment where&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; you will be tasked with: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;analysing the financial performance of target companies to identify the actual financial situation of an enterprise;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;financial modelling and business planning;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;independent business reviews of business plans;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;commercial and operational due diligence;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;negotiation with the main stakeholders (mainly financial institutions and investors);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;distressed M&amp;amp;As (with industrial partners, investment funds, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;cash management and turnarounds;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;cost cutting analysis and organizational improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;2/4 years of experience in restructuring, company crisis and/or corporate finance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;specialist degree in business with a focus on finance/AFC and/or engineering management (for finance);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;equitable &lt;/strong&gt;work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;challenging and dynamic environment&lt;/strong&gt; that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a &lt;strong&gt;healthy work-life balance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internationa&lt;/strong&gt;l mindset and &lt;strong&gt;innovative &lt;/strong&gt;projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical &lt;strong&gt;well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a style=&quot;text-decoration:underline;color:black&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-AA2&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Firenze-Deal-Advisory-Restructuring&amp;Turnaround-Senior-Consultant-Firenze/1353106457/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1353106457</guid><g:id>1353106457</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Deal Advisory</g:job_function><g:location>Firenze, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant Monitoring Public - Fondi Strutturali Roma (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Junior Consultant Monitoring Public – Fondi Strutturali &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entrando a far parte del Team&lt;strong&gt; Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance &lt;/strong&gt;di &lt;strong&gt;Roma, &lt;/strong&gt;dedicato esclusivamente ai servizi per le amministrazioni pubbliche che supporta i propri clienti nel miglioramento dell’efficacia e dell’efficienza di processi e organizzazioni di innovazione digitale, indirizzando l’incremento delle &lt;em&gt;performance&lt;/em&gt; economico-finanziarie. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;attività di assistenza tecnica ai Programmi cofinanziati FESR/FSE per le amministrazioni centrali e/o regionali;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;definizione di modelli e sistemi per supportare la governance e la sana gestione finanziaria delle risorse del bilancio UE;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;progetti e studi internazionali per la Commissione Europea.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizzazione contabile e sistemi di controllo interno&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ricerchiamo professionisti che abbiano una conoscenza di base su temi di politica e normativa comunitaria, assistenza tecnica ad Amministrazioni Pubbliche centrali e/o regionali nella programmazione, gestione, monitoraggio, controllo e rendicontazione dei Programmi cofinanziati con fondi Strutturali FESR/FSE.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;laurea magistrale o triennale (preferibilmente in materie economiche o indirizzo politico);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;interesse a lavorare su tematiche pubbliche o fondi nazionali e strutturali;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;buona conoscenza del funzionamento della PA e dei modelli di sistemi di gestione e controllo dei programmi UE (AdG, AdC e AdA);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Office e, quale titolo preferenziale, di strumenti e tool di data visualization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ / L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Junior Consultant Monitoring Public - Fondi strutturali&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to do work that’s truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you’ll have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues face and solve today’s most complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to businesses, assisting them in transforming business models, improving and digitizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, and supporting extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By Joining our &lt;strong&gt;Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance Team in Rome,&lt;/strong&gt; dedicated exclusively to services for public administrations, you’ll support our clients in enhancing the effectiveness and efficiency of processes and organizations, ultimately aiming to increase economic and financial performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particular, your role will involve:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing technical assistance for ERDF/ESF co-financed programs for central and/or regional administrations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing models and systems to support governance and sound financial management of EU budget resources;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engaging in international projects and studies for the European Commission;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on accounting organization and internal control systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking professionals with a foundational knowledge of community policy and regulations, experience in providing technical assistance to central and/or regional public administrations in programming, managing, monitoring, controlling, and reporting on programs co-financed by ERDF/ESF structural funds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s or master’s degree &lt;strong&gt;(preferably in economics or political science);&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in public sector topics or national and structural funds;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of public administration operations and management and control systems for EU programs (AdG, AdC, and AdA);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English proficiency;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Microsoft Office, with data visualization tools as a preferred qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive and equitable  work environment that respects, encourages, and &lt;strong&gt;values diversity;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic and stimulating environment that promotes &lt;strong&gt;creativity and teamwork;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work options, promoting a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to stay up-to-date;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An international mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship with a monthly allowance of €800 / This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community involvement, and integrity: these are KPMG’s core values, creating an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to reach their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks to our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network has obtained the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, confirming compliance with the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125 certification&lt;/strong&gt; for gender equality. Within our Impact Plan - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you’ll find an overview of our concrete actions on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, consult KPMG&apos;s privacy notice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is committed to equal opportunity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-VE1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Junior-Consultant-Monitoring-Public-Fondi-Strutturali-Roma/1368688757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368688757</guid><g:id>1368688757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant - Governance, Risk &amp; Compliance - Industrial Market (Torino, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell’analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;br&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team &lt;strong&gt;Governance, Risk and Compliance &lt;/strong&gt;di &lt;strong&gt;Torino&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai impegnata/o nella gestione dei processi di cambiamento aziendali; in particolare, insieme a colleghe e colleghi esperti, analizzerai i requisiti strategici utili a implementare le migliori soluzioni presenti sul mercato.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controllo interno e valutazione del &lt;strong&gt;rischio&lt;/strong&gt; nel settore industriale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Esecuzione di incarichi di conformità al Decreto Legislativo n&lt;strong&gt;. 231, SOX, 262 e anti-corruzione&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conformità integrata;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit interno&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valutazione e progettazione di &lt;strong&gt;sistemi di controllo interno&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Studio della legislazione del settore industriale e delle sue applicazioni e implicazioni su processi e procedure;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sviluppo di &lt;strong&gt;modelli di governance&lt;/strong&gt; e organizzativi a supporto del processo di trasformazione aziendale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;- Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai una laurea magistrale in economia e management, amministrazione aziendale e amministrazione, finanza e controllo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai interesse a lavorare su temi di rischio e governance aziendale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai un’ottima conoscenza dell’inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all’estero;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai un’ottima conoscenza di Microsoft Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. When you join the&lt;strong&gt; Governance, Risk and Compliance team,&lt;/strong&gt; you will help companies transform risks into opportunities for the improvement of their organisation and evolution of their governance systems to gain a competitive edge and offer integrated solutions and innovative approaches for strategic risk management.&lt;br&gt;As a member of our team, your experience will be put to full use, enabling you to become the point person for top-tier national and international clients. We are recruiting a junior consultant for the&lt;strong&gt; Turin &lt;/strong&gt;office to work on the following projects:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal control &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;risk assessment &lt;/strong&gt;in the industrial sector;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance of Legislative decree no.&lt;strong&gt; 231, SOX, 262&lt;/strong&gt; and anti-bribery compliance engagements;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrated &lt;strong&gt;compliance&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal auditing&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluating and designing &lt;strong&gt;internal control systems&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Studying &lt;strong&gt;industrial sector legislation&lt;/strong&gt; and its applications and implications on processes and procedures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development of &lt;strong&gt;governance &lt;/strong&gt;and organizational models to support the corporate transformation process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a &lt;strong&gt;master’s degree in business and management&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;business administration&lt;/strong&gt; and administration, &lt;strong&gt;finance and controlling&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are interested in working on &lt;strong&gt;corporate governance&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In today’s increasingly complex and interconnected world, clients need to transform and adapt ever more rapidly. The successful candidate will be highly goal-driven and have an aptitude for problem solving, along with strong communication and interpersonal skills, a client focus, enthusiasm and strong career-orientation and a natural ability to work in a team and drive innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are offering a unique experience in which you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a professional network, liaising with the first line of top Italian companies;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a dynamic environment with a career fast-track;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop your knowledge with training;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on innovative and cutting-edge projects and topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At KPMG Advisory, we focus on the main drivers of change: strategies, corporate finance, organisational processes and models, technological platforms, risk management and organisational change. You will have access to global opportunities and the possibility of gaining skills and expertise that will help you reach your goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity. These are the KPMG values that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential.&lt;br&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our Impact Plan - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;  - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-MM3 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Torino-Junior-Consultant-Governance%2C-Risk-&amp;-Compliance-Industrial-Market/1366393757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366393757</guid><g:id>1366393757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Torino, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Accountant | Verona (Verona, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Junior Accountant | Verona&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Fides Servizi di Amministrazione&lt;/strong&gt; offre servizi professionali nei &lt;strong&gt;processi amministrativi, contabili e fiscali&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Fides conta oltre &lt;strong&gt;300 professionisti in sei sedi&lt;/strong&gt; ed è in continua crescita. In quanto società italiana del Network KPMG che fornisce servizi professionali per processi amministrativi, contabili e fiscali, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Fides, settore Accounting&lt;/strong&gt;, supporta le principali aziende italiane e internazionali in amministrazione, finanza e fiscalità.&lt;br&gt;Svolge un ruolo chiave nell&apos;identificare potenziali opportunità e armonizzare i processi di contabilità, facilitati da una profonda trasformazione digitale, accelerata ulteriormente dall’introduzione di tecnologie di intelligenza artificiale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;In KPMG Fides, puntiamo a investire nei giovani talenti per sviluppare in loro delle solide competenze, necessarie a diventare professionisti affidabili e di fiducia. Entrando a far parte di uno dei team Accounting di KPMG, lavorerai a stretto contatto con aziende leader, assistendole in un approccio integrato alla compliance amministrativa, traducendo i vari requisiti legislativi, normativi e procedurali in processi contabili e fiscali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Per la &lt;strong&gt;sede di Verona &lt;/strong&gt;siamo alla ricerca di &lt;strong&gt;risorse junior&lt;/strong&gt; da coinvolgere in &lt;strong&gt;attività amministrativo-contabili&lt;/strong&gt; a supporto delle aziende clienti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, il/la candidato/a sarà coinvolto/a nelle seguenti attività:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;gestione della &lt;strong&gt;contabilità ordinaria&lt;/strong&gt; e rappresentazione dei risultati economico-finanziari;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;supporto operativo nella &lt;strong&gt;redazione del bilancio d’esercizio&lt;/strong&gt; e dei principali adempimenti fiscali;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;verifica della &lt;strong&gt;compliance civilistica e fiscale&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;analisi e gestione dei &lt;strong&gt;processi amministrativi, contabili e fiscali&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Il candidato ideale possiede:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;laurea in discipline economiche&lt;/strong&gt; (conseguita o in fase di conseguimento);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;preferibile esperienza in ambito contabile e nella redazione del bilancio&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;preferibile esperienza nell’utilizzo di software contabili;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;conoscenza dei &lt;strong&gt;principi contabili italiani&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;buona conoscenza del pacchetto &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office &lt;/strong&gt;(in particolare Excel, PowerPoint, ecc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;buona conoscenza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ottime capacità relazionali, approccio analitico e problem solving&lt;/strong&gt;, capacità di adattamento e spirito di innovazione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Il tuo futuro con noi – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;un&lt;strong&gt; ambiente di lavoro inclusivo &lt;/strong&gt;ed &lt;strong&gt;equo&lt;/strong&gt;, che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza la diversità;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;un contesto &lt;strong&gt;stimolante e dinamico&lt;/strong&gt; che favorisce creatività e lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;modalità di lavoro ibride&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita professionale e personale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;programmi avanzati di formazione e sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt; per mantenere competenze sempre aggiornate;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;mentalità internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e progetti innovativi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere mentale e fisico&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 1000€  o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 24.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità: sono i &lt;strong&gt;valori KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che creano un ambiente favorevole alla condivisione di idee e conoscenze, permettendo ai nostri professionisti di esprimere appieno il proprio potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;In linea con il nostro impegno per un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il Network KPMG è conforme ai requisiti della &lt;strong&gt;norma ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; sul sistema di gestione della Diversità e Inclusione e alla &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; in materia di parità di genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Fides servizi di Amministrazione S.p.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;A. garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Junior Accountant | Verona&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Fides Servizi di Amministrazione&lt;/strong&gt; provides professional services in &lt;strong&gt;administrative, accounting, and tax processes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Fides has &lt;strong&gt;over 300 professionals across six offices &lt;/strong&gt;and is in continuous growth. As the Italian company within the KPMG Network that delivers professional services for administrative, accounting, and tax processes, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Fides,&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Accounting&lt;/strong&gt; division, supports leading Italian and international companies in administration, finance, and taxation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;We play a key role in identifying potential opportunities and harmonizing accounting processes, supported by a significant digital transformation, further accelerated by the introduction of artificial intelligence technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;At KPMG Fides, we invest in young talent to help them develop strong skills needed to become reliable and trusted professionals. By joining one of KPMG’s Accounting teams, you will work closely with leading companies, assisting them with an integrated approach to administrative compliance, translating various legislative, regulatory, and procedural requirements into accounting and tax processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;For our &lt;strong&gt;Verona &lt;/strong&gt;office, we are looking for &lt;strong&gt;junior Staff members&lt;/strong&gt; to be involved in &lt;strong&gt;administrative and accounting activities&lt;/strong&gt; supporting client companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, the candidate will be involved in the following activities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;managing &lt;strong&gt;general accounting&lt;/strong&gt; and preparing economic and financial reports;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;providing operational support in the &lt;strong&gt;preparation of annual financial statements&lt;/strong&gt; and key tax filings;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;verifying &lt;strong&gt;civil and tax compliance&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;analyzing and managing &lt;strong&gt;administrative, accounting, and tax processes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate must have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;a &lt;strong&gt;degree in business subjects&lt;/strong&gt; (graduate or nearing completion);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;preferable experience in accounting and financial statement preparation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;preferable experience using accounting software;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Italian financial reporting standards&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;good knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt; (particularly Excel, PowerPoint, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;a good knowledge of English&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;excellent interpersonal skills, analytical mindset, and problem‑solving abilities&lt;/strong&gt;, adaptability, and innovation spirit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;equitable &lt;/strong&gt;work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;challenging and dynamic environment&lt;/strong&gt; that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a &lt;strong&gt;healthy work-life balance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International&lt;/strong&gt; mindset and &lt;strong&gt;innovative &lt;/strong&gt;projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical &lt;strong&gt;well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either an &lt;span&gt;internship opportunity with a monthly allowance of €1000&lt;/span&gt; or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €24,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join us!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Fides Servizi di Amministrazione S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-SC1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Verona-Junior-Accountant-Verona/1361859157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1361859157</guid><g:id>1361859157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>FIDES</g:job_function><g:location>Verona, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant/ Assistant Manager Cyber Security - Rome (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk a Roma lavorerai con i nostri esperti di ICT security per aiutare i clienti ad affrontare i rischi informatici che minacciano il loro business. Collaborerai su progetti rilevanti per le aziende leader di mercato.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analizzare &lt;strong&gt;la sicurezza delle informazioni&lt;/strong&gt; (politiche, modelli organizzativi, ecc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestire &lt;strong&gt;la continuità operativa&lt;/strong&gt; e disaster recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestire gli accessi (IAM e IAG)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestire la privacy &lt;strong&gt;IT Compliance&lt;/strong&gt; (ad es., protezione dei dati, decreto legislativo n. 231, crimine informatico e regolamenti della Banca d&apos;Italia)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analizzare dei &lt;strong&gt;dati di sicurezza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Re-ingegnerizzare&lt;/strong&gt; i processi aziendali&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Applicare i &lt;strong&gt;principali standard&lt;/strong&gt; (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, ecc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Utilizzare strategie di sicurezza e valutazione dei rischi&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestione del rischio e controllo nel campo IT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Valutazione della cybersecurity e delle &lt;strong&gt;vulnerabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ethical hacking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolto in progetti sia nazionali che internazionali, collaborando con professionisti altamente qualificati, e lavorerai a stretto contatto con i nostri clienti del settore Financial Services, tra cui banche, assicurazioni e società di investimento, contribuendo alla gestione di rischi IT, governance, audit, privacy e sicurezza informatica.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai maturato oltre 2 anni di esperienza in società di consulenza operanti in ambito cybersecurity, audit IT e compliance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai una laurea in ingegneria informatica, ingegneria gestionale o in informatica e tecnologie dell&apos;informazione;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai una consolidata esperienza nel modulo SAP FI maturata lavorando su progetti;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai un&apos;ottima padronanza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conosci i principali standard applicabili (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, ecc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 38.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 48.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto delle individualità, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità: questi sono i valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e alla crescita personale e professionale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere. Scopri tutte le nostre azioni concrete nel nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com), che descrive le nostre iniziative su temi ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity to build a better future is right in front of you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to businesses to support them in transforming their business models, improving and digitizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, as well as assisting in extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, by joining the Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk Team in Rome, you will work alongside our ICT security experts to help clients address the cybersecurity risks threatening their business. You will collaborate on significant projects for leading market companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In particular, you will be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analyzing information security governance (policies, organizational models, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Managing business continuity and disaster recovery;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Managing identity access (IAM and IAG);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ensuring IT compliance in privacy matters (e.g., data protection, Legislative Decree No. 231, cybercrime, and Bank of Italy regulations);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analyzing security data;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Re-engineering business processes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Applying the main standards (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Utilizing security strategies and conducting risk assessments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Managing risk and control in the IT field;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conducting cybersecurity and vulnerability assessments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Practicing ethical hacking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will be involved in both national and international projects, collaborating with highly qualified professionals and working closely with our clients in the financial services sector, including banks, insurance companies, and investment firms, contributing to the management of IT risks, governance, audit, privacy, and cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have 2+ of experience in consulting firms operating in the fields of cybersecurity, IT audit, and compliance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You hold a degree in computer engineering, management engineering, or information technology;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You possess solid experience in the SAP FI module gained through project work;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have excellent proficiency in English, preferably supported by study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You are familiar with the main applicable standards (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that fosters creativity and teamwork;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid working modes to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay up-to-date;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €38,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €48,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s values that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and personal and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.” Discover all our concrete actions in our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com), which outlines our initiatives on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:6.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-AA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;Default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#005786&quot;&gt;www.kpmg.it &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;to learn more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Senior-Consultant-Assistant-Manager-Cyber-Security-Rome/806779702/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">806779702</guid><g:id>806779702</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Cloud &amp; Data Architect | CIO Advisory (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Gli esperti di &lt;strong&gt;Nolan Norton&lt;/strong&gt;, società di IT Strategy del Network KPMG, aiutano le organizzazioni ad affrontare le sfide di trasformazione digitale e ad implementare architetture IT. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del Team CIO Advisory di Roma, esperto di architetture e soluzioni di data management che supporta i CIO nell&apos;evoluzione digitale del loro percorso, nel loro journey verso il cloud, dalla strategia all&apos;esecuzione e dalla visione al valore reale. Entrerai a far parte di un ambiente dinamico e stimolante, per clienti di alto livello altamente visibili nei mercati dei servizi finanziari, dell&apos;energia, del settore pubblico e dei consumatori e industriali.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di su tecnologie innovative su progetti sfidanti ed entusiasmanti, supportando i nostri clienti principalmente sulle seguenti tematiche:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: aiutiamo i nostri clienti a sviluppare strategie tecnologiche e modelli operativi innovativi, con un focus sull’evoluzione cloud-native e data-driven dei sistemi informativi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Data Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: progettiamo architetture ibride e multi-cloud scalabili, sicure ed efficienti, integrate con moderne piattaforme dati per l’abilitazione di analytics ed AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management &amp;amp; Modernization&lt;/strong&gt;: supportiamo la progettazione e realizzazione di data platform moderne (Data Lake, DWH, Data Mesh), curando ingestion, orchestrazione, catalogazione, qualità e governance del dato;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;: affianchiamo i clienti nella pianificazione di roadmap tecnologiche, nel budgeting di iniziative cloud e data e nell’ottimizzazione della spesa ICT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: accompagniamo le organizzazioni nella selezione di partner tecnologici e nella definizione di modelli di erogazione e gestione dei servizi in ambienti cloud/data-centric;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance &amp;amp; Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: disegniamo modelli di governance, ruoli, responsabilità e framework organizzativi per garantire un&apos;efficace gestione delle iniziative cloud e dati;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost Right-Sizing &amp;amp; FinOps&lt;/strong&gt;: analizziamo le architetture esistenti per ottimizzare le risorse, razionalizzare le piattaforme, e introdurre pratiche di FinOps per una gestione intelligente dei costi cloud e data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Laurea Magistrale in Ingegneria Informatica, Ingegneria Elettronica, Ingegneria delle Telecomunicazioni, Fisica, Matematica o hai maturato esperienze equivalenti;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Almeno 2 anni di esperienza di progettazione di architetture IT ibride (cloud e on-premise) in contesti applicativi eterogenei;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Esperienza nella progettazione di architetture dati;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Competenze sull’integrazione applicativa ed API management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza dei tools di CI/CD e della metodologia DevOps;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza delle principali tecnologie in ambito Observability, Automation, Infrastructure as Code, Container e Orchestration(Docker, Kubernetes);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Esperienza nella progettazione e realizzazione di soluzioni Serverless e architetture event-driven;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Competenze di Networking e sicurezza in ambienti cloud;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza approfondita di almeno uno dei principali public cloud provider (AWS, MS Azure, GCP, OCI, IBM Cloud);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza della lingua inglese, idealmente approfondita attraverso un&apos;esperienza formativa/lavorativa all&apos;estero. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Viene considerato un requisito preferenziale il possesso di una o più delle seguenti certificazioni:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Google Cloud Certified Professional Cloud Architect;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;AWS Certified Solutions Architect Associate (o Professional);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Microsoft Certified: Azure Solutions Architect Expert;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Google Professional Data Engineer;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Snowflake Architect Certification;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;RedHat Certified Architect (RHCA);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Certified Kubernetes Application Developer (CKAD);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;TOGAF 9.1 (o superiore).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant  Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nolan Norton Spa garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. Experts from Nolan Norton, an IT Strategy company within the KPMG Network, help organizations face digital transformation challenges and implement IT architectures. Specifically, you will join the CIO Advisory Team in Rome, experts in data management architectures and solutions that support CIOs in their digital evolution journey, from strategy to execution and from vision to real value. You will be part of a dynamic and stimulating environment, working with high-level clients highly visible in the financial services, energy, public sector, and consumer and industrial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will work on innovative technologies on challenging and exciting projects, supporting our clients mainly on the following topics:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: We help our clients develop innovative technology strategies and operating models, focusing on the cloud-native and data-driven evolution of information systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Data Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: We design scalable, secure, and efficient hybrid and multi-cloud architectures, integrated with modern data platforms for enabling analytics and AI;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management &amp;amp; Modernization&lt;/strong&gt;: We support the design and implementation of modern data platforms (Data Lake, DWH, Data Mesh), taking care of ingestion, orchestration, cataloging, data quality, and governance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;: We assist clients in planning technology roadmaps, budgeting cloud and data initiatives, and optimizing ICT spending;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: We accompany organizations in selecting technology partners and defining service delivery and management models in cloud/data-centric environments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance &amp;amp; Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: We design governance models, roles, responsibilities, and organizational frameworks to ensure effective management of cloud and data initiatives;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost Right-Sizing &amp;amp; FinOps&lt;/strong&gt;: We analyze existing architectures to optimize resources, rationalize platforms, and introduce FinOps practices for intelligent management of cloud and data costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in Computer Engineering, Electronic Engineering, Telecommunications Engineering, Physics, Mathematics, or equivalent experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;At least 3-4 years of experience in designing hybrid IT architectures (cloud and on-premise) in heterogeneous application contexts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Experience in designing data architectures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Skills in application integration and API management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of CI/CD tools and DevOps methodology;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of key technologies in Observability, Automation, Infrastructure as Code, Container, and Orchestration (Docker, Kubernetes);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Experience in designing and implementing Serverless solutions and event-driven architectures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Networking and security skills in cloud environments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In-depth knowledge of at least one of the major public cloud providers (AWS, MS Azure, GCP, OCI, IBM Cloud);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of the English language, ideally deepened through educational/work experience abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possession of one or more of the following certifications is considered a preferential requirement:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Google Cloud Certified Professional Cloud Architect;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;AWS Certified Solutions Architect Associate (or Professional);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Microsoft Certified: Azure Solutions Architect Expert;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Google Professional Data Engineer;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Snowflake Architect Certification;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;RedHat Certified Architect (RHCA);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Certified Kubernetes Application Developer (CKAD);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;TOGAF 9.1 (or higher).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, fair work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that encourages creativity and teamwork;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid work mode to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay always updated;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset and innovative projects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are the Values of KPMG that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Within our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan - you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are carrying out on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues. Join us! Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to the KPMG privacy policy. Nolan Norton Spa guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-DM1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Cloud-&amp;-Data-Architect-CIO-Advisory/1332242257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1332242257</guid><g:id>1332242257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Tech Consultant | Supply Chain &amp; Operations (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your role and responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitalization, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be involved within multifunctional teams working at customer sites to implement digital transformation projects for Supply Chain, Manufacturing Execution, Performance Management processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Design, implementation and testing of Digital Platforms to support Supply Chain processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Assess the impacts and expected benefits of initiatives identified through business cases and monitor pre- and post-transformation performance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Lead and coordinate complex Business and Digital Transformation programs with Program, Project &amp;amp; Change Management initiatives;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A master’s degree in Engineering&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;(preferably mechanical or electronic) or &lt;strong&gt;Computer Science&lt;/strong&gt;, earned with excellent grades;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Manufacturing and Supply Chain fields&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced skills in programming languages or logic (SQL, Javascript);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the MS Office package.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An excellent knowledge of English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Basic knowledge of Microsoft Azure platform is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 36.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MC2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Tech-Consultant-Supply-Chain-&amp;-Operations/1368642557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368642557</guid><g:id>1368642557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Strategy &amp; Value Chain Transformation (Bologna, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Value Chain Transformation&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Bologna&lt;/strong&gt;, you will have the opportunity to be part of the biggest revolution taking place by rethinking customer operating models from a digital perspective. You will work closely with market-leading companies on innovation topics and support our clients throughout their digital transformation journey.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Rethink the operating models of key business functions (with a specific focus on the Extended Supply Chain) by redesigning processes, revising the organizational structure and evaluating new technologies to support the Business;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Assess the impacts and expected benefits of initiatives identified through business cases and monitor pre- and post-transformation performance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Lead and coordinate complex Business and Digital Transformation programs with Program, Project &amp;amp; Change Management initiatives;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Target Operating Model Design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Management Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Organizational and teamwork skills with attention to detail, including the ability to prioritize and manage various complex tasks and activities; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the MS Office package&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MC2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Bologna-Junior-Consultant-Strategy-&amp;-Value-Chain-Transformation/1368642257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368642257</guid><g:id>1368642257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Bologna, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Governance &amp; Innovation Junior Consultant (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Innovation Junior Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;, you will join our&lt;strong&gt; Operations team&lt;/strong&gt; with the mission of leading complex digital transformation programs and ensuring effective governance on innovation-driven projects. You will support our clients in activities with a focus on innovation challenges, leveraging your &lt;strong&gt;management and technical skills&lt;/strong&gt;. Directly interacting with our customers, you will lead &lt;strong&gt;digital transformation&lt;/strong&gt; decisions with a strong eye on &lt;strong&gt;both business and technology&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will help our customers to drive the change with specific tasks:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Governance models to support &lt;strong&gt;innovation and digital initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; in line with leading practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Provide support for complex innovation initiatives across digital and application domains&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Deﬁne, establish, and evolve models for the governance of complex, multi-stakeholder project portfolios&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Develop methodologies for monitoring, reporting, and controlling project performance, ensuring alignment with KPIs, milestones, and budgets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Drive the deﬁnition and continuous &lt;strong&gt;improvement of digital processes&lt;/strong&gt;, translating business requirements into actionable solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Coordinate multidisciplinary teams and engage with senior internal and external stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Contribute to the growth of the practice through knowledge sharing, mentoring, and thought leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:underline&quot;&gt;Computer Science, Engineering, or other STEM disciplines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Effective knowledge of digital transformation projects with proven &lt;strong&gt;management and technical skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills in both Italian and English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MC2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Governance-&amp;-Innovation-Junior-Consultant/1368644157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368644157</guid><g:id>1368644157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior ServiceNow Developer - Implementation (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Enterprise Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai inserita/o in un percorso di crescita nell&apos;ambito &lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt;: ti occuperai di progettare, sviluppare e implementare soluzioni personalizzate su questa piattaforma per i nostri clienti, affiancando colleghe e colleghi più esperti in ogni fase del progetto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Partecipare, insieme al team funzionale, alla &lt;strong&gt;raccolta dei requisiti&lt;/strong&gt; del cliente e alla loro traduzione in &lt;strong&gt;workflow e regole di automazione&lt;/strong&gt; da costruire sulla piattaforma&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Configurare e personalizzare i &lt;strong&gt;moduli ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt;, definendo campi, form e regole di business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Costruire &lt;strong&gt;flussi automatizzati&lt;/strong&gt; con Flow Designer, lo strumento visuale di ServiceNow per collegare tra loro le diverse fasi di un processo senza scrivere codice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Effettuare i &lt;strong&gt;test interni&lt;/strong&gt; delle configurazioni sviluppate, verificando che i flussi funzionino correttamente prima di consegnarli al cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribuire alla &lt;strong&gt;migrazione dei dati&lt;/strong&gt; dai vecchi sistemi del cliente all&apos;interno di ServiceNow &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supportare il cliente nella fase di &lt;strong&gt;rilascio&lt;/strong&gt; della soluzione e nel periodo immediatamente successivo (&lt;strong&gt;Hypercare&lt;/strong&gt;), monitorando che tutto funzioni e risolvendo eventuali criticità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una &lt;strong&gt;formazione accademica&lt;/strong&gt; in Ingegneria Informatica o Informatica&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai &lt;strong&gt;motivazione&lt;/strong&gt; a svolgere attività di consulenza sui processi aziendali e sui sistemi informativi, anche senza esperienza pregressa su ServiceNow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai un&apos;&lt;strong&gt;ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, preferibilmente supportata da esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai un&apos;&lt;strong&gt;ottima conoscenza di JavaScript e Excel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona padronanza della lingua inglese e attitudine al lavoro in team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a trasferte in Italia e all&apos;estero in base alle esigenze progettuali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibrida, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di formazione e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul benessere psicofisico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;L&apos;opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all&apos;impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l&apos;Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I dati richiesti verranno trattati nell&apos;assoluto rispetto delle disposizioni contenute nel Regolamento Europeo 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot; o &quot;Normativa Privacy&quot;) e sue successive modificazioni ed integrazioni.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to do a job that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues face and solve the most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to businesses to assist them in transforming their business models, improving and digitalizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, as well as supporting extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;By joining the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platform Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be onboarded onto a growth path within &lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt;: you will design, develop and implement customised solutions on this platform for our clients, working alongside more experienced colleagues at every stage of the project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Take part, together with the functional team, in &lt;strong&gt;gathering the client&apos;s requirements&lt;/strong&gt; and translating them into &lt;strong&gt;workflows and automation rules&lt;/strong&gt; to be built on the platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Configure and customise &lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow modules&lt;/strong&gt; (for example Incident, Problem and Change Management, or custom applications), defining fields, forms and business rules&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Write simple &lt;strong&gt;JavaScript scripts&lt;/strong&gt; (ServiceNow&apos;s native scripting language, called GlideScript) to automate steps that would otherwise require manual work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Build &lt;strong&gt;automated flows&lt;/strong&gt; using Flow Designer, ServiceNow&apos;s visual tool for connecting the different steps of a process without writing code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Carry out &lt;strong&gt;internal testing&lt;/strong&gt; of the configurations developed, checking that flows work correctly before handing them over to the client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribute to &lt;strong&gt;data migration&lt;/strong&gt; from the client&apos;s old systems into ServiceNow (for example populating the CMDB, the repository that maps all of a company&apos;s IT assets)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Support the client during the &lt;strong&gt;release&lt;/strong&gt; phase and in the period immediately following it (&lt;strong&gt;Hypercare&lt;/strong&gt;), monitoring that everything works and resolving any issues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is right for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have an &lt;strong&gt;academic background&lt;/strong&gt; in Computer Engineering or Computer Science&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have the &lt;strong&gt;motivation&lt;/strong&gt; to engage in consulting activities related to business processes and information systems, even without prior experience in ServiceNow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have an &lt;strong&gt;excellent command of English&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably supported by study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;excellent knowledge of the Office suite&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good command of English and a team-oriented attitude&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are available for business travel in Italy and abroad based on project needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us – What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that promotes creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid working options to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate&apos;s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In compliance with applicable law, we do not collect or use information about salaries received in current or previous employment relationships. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community commitment, and integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s values, which create an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network complies with the standards of the ISO 30415 requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125, relating to gender equality. In our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) you can find all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The requested data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of the European Regulation 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – &quot;GDPR&quot; or &quot;Privacy Regulation&quot;) and its subsequent amendments and integrations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-ServiceNow-Developer-Implementation/1365974157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365974157</guid><g:id>1365974157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant (Stage) - Enterprise Business Intelligence (Bologna, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div id=&quot;tor__flistingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__flistingLayout_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché nel supporto alle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Enterprise Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai coinvolta/o in progetti di &lt;strong&gt;Business Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt; per clienti enterprise, supportando il team nella progettazione e realizzazione di reportistica e dashboard direzionali sia su tecnologie SAP sia su piattaforme di Reporting e Dashboarding enterprise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Collaborare alla &lt;strong&gt;progettazione, sviluppo e manutenzione&lt;/strong&gt; di reportistica direzionale e dashboard per il monitoraggio dei KPI aziendali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Verificare &lt;strong&gt;qualità, coerenza e affidabilità dei dati&lt;/strong&gt; utilizzati nei processi di reporting e analisi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Supportare le attività di &lt;strong&gt;test, validazione e rilascio&lt;/strong&gt; delle soluzioni implementate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai &lt;strong&gt;interesse verso il mondo della Business Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;, del reporting aziendale e della valorizzazione del dato&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai &lt;strong&gt;conoscenze base di SQL&lt;/strong&gt; e dei principali concetti relativi ai database relazionali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai &lt;strong&gt;buona conoscenza di Microsoft Excel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai attitudine analitica e voglia di imparare&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona padronanza della lingua inglese e attitudine al lavoro in team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a trasferte in Italia e all&apos;estero in base alle esigenze progettuali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibrida, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di formazione e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul benessere psicofisico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;L&apos;opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie all&apos;impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l&apos;Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, communities, and colleagues tackle and solve today&apos;s most important and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory provides consulting services to companies, supporting them in transforming their business models, improving and digitalizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, and assisting with extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;By joining the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platform Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be involved in &lt;strong&gt;Business Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt; projects for enterprise clients, supporting the team in the design and delivery of management reporting and dashboards, both on SAP technologies and on enterprise Reporting and Dashboarding platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Collaborate in the &lt;strong&gt;design, development and maintenance&lt;/strong&gt; of management reports and dashboards for monitoring business KPIs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Verify the &lt;strong&gt;quality, consistency and reliability of data&lt;/strong&gt; used in reporting and analysis processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Support &lt;strong&gt;testing, validation and release&lt;/strong&gt; activities for the solutions implemented&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;interest in Business Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;, corporate reporting and data enhancement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic knowledge of SQL&lt;/strong&gt; and the main concepts related to relational databases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good knowledge of Microsoft Excel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An analytical mindset and willingness to learn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A good command of the English language&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Availability for business travel in Italy and abroad based on project needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us – What You&apos;ll Find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An inclusive and fair work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that fosters creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hybrid working arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to help you stay up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate&apos;s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In compliance with applicable law, we do not collect or use information about salaries received in current or previous employment relationships. Our selection processes are also based on objective and gender neutral criteria.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity: these are the Values of KPMG, which create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to fully express their potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network complies with the requirements of ISO 30415 for Diversity and Inclusion Management Systems and UNI/PdR 125 relating to gender equality. Within our Impact Plan, you can find a summary of all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to the KPMG Privacy Policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Bologna-Junior-Consultant-%28Stage%29-Enterprise-Business-Intelligence/1361993957/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1361993957</guid><g:id>1361993957</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Bologna, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant Oracle EPM (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare clienti, società, colleghe e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory affianca le imprese nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, supportando i clienti nell&apos;analisi e gestione dei rischi e nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Enterprise Platforms&lt;/strong&gt;, lavorerai su progetti di implementazione ed evoluzione di soluzioni &lt;strong&gt;Oracle EPM Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;, contribuendo in autonomia alla digitalizzazione dei processi di pianificazione, budgeting, forecasting e financial close per clienti in ambito pubblico e privato, e fungendo da punto di riferimento funzionale per il team di progetto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Guidare le sessioni di &lt;strong&gt;analisi dei requisiti&lt;/strong&gt; con gli stakeholder (Finance, Program Management, Controllo di Gestione), traducendo le esigenze di business in soluzioni applicative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Curare il disegno dei &lt;strong&gt;processi to-be&lt;/strong&gt; in ambito pianificazione e budgeting, proponendo soluzioni innovative e best practice di settore&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Gestire in autonomia le attività di &lt;strong&gt;configurazione funzionale&lt;/strong&gt; di Oracle EPM Cloud (&lt;strong&gt;Planning/PBCS&lt;/strong&gt;), anche nelle componenti più complesse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Definire &lt;strong&gt;modelli di pianificazione integrata&lt;/strong&gt; (economico, patrimoniale, flussi di cassa), assicurandone la coerenza con i processi del cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Coordinarsi con i team tecnici nelle attività di &lt;strong&gt;integrazione e migrazione dei dati&lt;/strong&gt;, presidiando la qualità del prodotto finale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Curare la redazione e revisione della &lt;strong&gt;documentazione funzionale&lt;/strong&gt; (Blueprint, Functional Design, manuali utente)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Presidiare le fasi di &lt;strong&gt;test SIT/UAT&lt;/strong&gt;, gestendo in autonomia le anomalie e le relative priorità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Guidare gli utenti nelle fasi di &lt;strong&gt;go-live&lt;/strong&gt; e supporto operativo, garantendo continuità al cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribuire alla &lt;strong&gt;formazione e al knowledge transfer&lt;/strong&gt;, supportando la crescita delle risorse più junior del team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai maturato un solido percorso su progetti Oracle EPM in ambito &lt;strong&gt;Finance/Controllo di Gestione&lt;/strong&gt;, con esposizione diretta al cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Conosci in modo approfondito i processi di pianificazione, budgeting e controllo, e sai proporre soluzioni funzionali coerenti con le esigenze di business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai già seguito in autonomia almeno un &lt;strong&gt;ciclo completo di implementazione&lt;/strong&gt; su soluzioni Oracle EPM Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai forte attitudine all&apos;analisi, capacità di &lt;strong&gt;problem solving&lt;/strong&gt; e proattività nella gestione delle criticità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sai lavorare in team, coordinare risorse junior e interagire con &lt;strong&gt;stakeholder&lt;/strong&gt; di diverso livello, incluso il management del cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai buona conoscenza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt; e sei disponibile a trasferte nazionali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo ed equo, che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibrida&lt;/strong&gt;, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt; avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all&apos;esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all&apos;impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; (Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l&apos;Inclusione) e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; (parità di genere). All&apos;interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (GDPR) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, our firm, and your colleagues face and solve today&apos;s most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory supports companies in the transformation of their business models, in the improvement and digitalization of their processes, and assists clients in risk analysis and management and in extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;By joining the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platforms Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will work on implementation and evolution projects for &lt;strong&gt;Oracle EPM Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; solutions, contributing autonomously to the digitalization of planning, budgeting, forecasting, and financial close processes for public and private sector clients, acting as a functional point of reference for the project team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;requirement analysis&lt;/strong&gt; sessions with stakeholders (Finance, Program Management, Controlling), translating business needs into application solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Own the design of &lt;strong&gt;to-be processes&lt;/strong&gt; in planning and budgeting, proposing innovative solutions and industry best practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Independently manage &lt;strong&gt;functional configuration&lt;/strong&gt; activities for Oracle EPM Cloud (&lt;strong&gt;Planning/PBCS&lt;/strong&gt;), including its more complex components&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Define &lt;strong&gt;integrated planning models&lt;/strong&gt; (P&amp;amp;L, balance sheet, cash flow), ensuring consistency with client processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Coordinate with technical teams on &lt;strong&gt;data integration and migration&lt;/strong&gt;, overseeing the quality of the final deliverable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Own the drafting and review of &lt;strong&gt;functional documentation&lt;/strong&gt; (Blueprint, Functional Design, user manuals)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Oversee &lt;strong&gt;SIT/UAT testing&lt;/strong&gt; phases, independently managing issues and their prioritization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Guide users through &lt;strong&gt;go-live&lt;/strong&gt; and operational support, ensuring continuity for the client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribute to &lt;strong&gt;training and knowledge transfer&lt;/strong&gt;, supporting the growth of more junior team members&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and qualities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have built a solid track record on Oracle EPM projects in &lt;strong&gt;Finance/Controlling&lt;/strong&gt;, with direct client exposure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have an in-depth understanding of planning, budgeting, and control processes, and can propose functional solutions aligned with business needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have already independently followed at least one full &lt;strong&gt;implementation cycle&lt;/strong&gt; on Oracle EPM Cloud solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have strong analytical skills, &lt;strong&gt;problem-solving&lt;/strong&gt; ability, and proactiveness in managing critical issues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You can work in a team, coordinate junior resources, and interact with &lt;strong&gt;stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt; at different levels, including client management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good command of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; and are available for domestic travel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you will find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An inclusive and fair work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that fosters &lt;strong&gt;creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid working&lt;/strong&gt; arrangements, to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training and development&lt;/strong&gt; programs to stay continuously up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;psychophysical wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector (CCNL Commercio), with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate&apos;s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our values and our commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network complies with the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; standard (Diversity and Inclusion Management System) and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; (gender equality). Our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; summarizes all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (GDPR) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please consult KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-EB1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Senior-Consultant-Oracle-EPM/1359540157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1359540157</guid><g:id>1359540157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Consultant - Categorie protette (Napoli, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Open Platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; è il nostro nuovo centro innovativo a &lt;strong&gt;Napoli&lt;/strong&gt;. Lavoriamo su progetti tecnologici per aiutare aziende e Pubblica Amministrazione a migliorare i loro servizi. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, potresti essere coinvolto/a in una delle seguenti attività progettuali:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Cyber Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: erogazione di servizi avanzati per la protezione dei dati e la sicurezza delle infrastrutture IT, con focus su prevenzione e gestione delle minacce informatiche, risposta agli incidenti e supporto alla resilienza digitale delle organizzazioni.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Program Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: gestione di progetti complessi di cambiamento e innovazione nella Pubblica Amministrazione, garantendo il corretto avanzamento delle attività e il rispetto di tempi, costi e qualità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Application Maintenance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: supporto al mantenimento, all’aggiornamento e all’ottimizzazione di software aziendali, con particolare riferimento all’applicativo SAP, assicurandone l’efficienza e la continuità operativa.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Controlli di primo livello&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; e gestione delle istruttorie per l’accesso ai Programmi UE e a quelli finanziati con fondi nazionali per la coesione, oltre ad attività di assistenza tecnica a favore delle Autorità di Gestione (AdG), delle Autorità di Certificazione (AdC) e degli Organismi Intermedi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Corporate Intelligence e Forensic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: svolgimento di attività di integrity due diligence e analisi reputazionale su terze parti, per l’identificazione di potenziali rischi regolatori e reputazionali. Inclusa anche l’attività di asset tracing e di analisi dell’origine del patrimonio, con focus su individui ad alto profilo patrimoniale, in contesti di recupero crediti o verifiche AML.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Fiscalità e adempimenti tributari&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: raccolta, analisi e gestione dei dati necessari alla compilazione della dichiarazione dei redditi (Modello 730 e Modello PF), comprensiva di calcoli e predisposizione della relativa modulistica fiscale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Transfer Pricing e analisi di mercato&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: supporto alla definizione di progetti di transfer pricing relativi a beni e servizi, attraverso attività di benchmarking e analisi finanziarie. Le attività includono l’utilizzo di banche dati pubbliche (AIDA, TPCatalyst), l’analisi dei bilanci aziendali e il calcolo di indicatori economico-finanziari.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As you Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai conseguito un diploma di scuola secondaria di secondo livello o hai una laurea di primo o secondo livello in discipline economiche, giuridiche, ingegneristiche e/o umanistiche&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Dimestichezza con strumenti informatici di base;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Capacità di lavoro in team;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai buona conoscenza della lingua inglese.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sei iscritto alle liste Categorie Protette Art.1 / 18 lg. 68/99&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità - Il nostro ambiente di lavoro è progettato per essere inclusivo e accessibile a tutti. Siamo orgogliosi di offrire una struttura priva di barriere architettoniche, per garantire che tutte le persone, indipendentemente dalle loro abilità fisiche, possano lavorare in un ambiente confortevole e sicuro. Le caratteristiche del nostro ufficio includono:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;                - Rampe di accesso&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;                - Ascensori accessibili&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;                - Bagni accessibili&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;                - Postazioni di lavoro ergonomiche&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Ci impegniamo inoltre a fornire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo e ad accogliere richieste specifiche di adattamento per soddisfare le esigenze individuali dei nostri dipendenti. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 60.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol&quot;&gt;·&lt;span style=&quot;font:7.0pt &amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;&quot;&gt;       &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 60.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol&quot;&gt;·&lt;span style=&quot;font:7.0pt &amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;&quot;&gt;       &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibrida, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 60.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol&quot;&gt;·&lt;span style=&quot;font:7.0pt &amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;&quot;&gt;       &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di formazione sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 60.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol&quot;&gt;·&lt;span style=&quot;font:7.0pt &amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;&quot;&gt;       &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale e progettualità innovative;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 60.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol&quot;&gt;·&lt;span style=&quot;font:7.0pt &amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;&quot;&gt;       &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul benessere psicofisico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio al IV, III o al II livello ; la retribuzione sarà definita e commisurata in relazione a criteri oggettivi quali competenze, esperienza effettiva maturata e aderenza ai requisiti richiesti per la posizione.In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/span&gt; All’interno del nostro Impact Plan - bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:7.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:6.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Open Platform S.r.l. SB garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:6.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Are you looking for a job that truly has meaning and impact? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to support clients, society, and your colleagues in addressing and solving today’s most relevant and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Open Platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; is our new innovation hub based in Naples. We work on technology-driven projects that help businesses and public sector entities improve their services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you may be involved in one of the following project activities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Cyber Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: delivering advanced services for data protection and IT infrastructure security, with a focus on threat prevention and management, incident response, and supporting the digital resilience of organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Program Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: managing complex transformation and innovation projects in the Public Sector, ensuring that all activities are carried out effectively and within time, budget, and quality constraints.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Application Maintenance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: supporting the upkeep, upgrade, and optimization of enterprise software, particularly SAP, ensuring efficiency and business continuity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;First-level Controls and Case Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; for access to EU Programs and national cohesion fund initiatives, along with technical assistance to Managing Authorities (MA), Certifying Authorities (CA), and Intermediate Bodies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Corporate Intelligence and Forensics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: conducting integrity due diligence and reputational assessments of third parties to identify potential regulatory and reputational risks. Activities also include asset tracing and source of wealth analysis of high-net-worth individuals in the context of credit recovery or AML reviews.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Tax and Compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: gathering, analyzing, and processing data for personal income tax filing (Form 730 and Individual Tax Return), including related tax calculations and form preparation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Transfer Pricing and Market Analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;: supporting transfer pricing projects related to goods and services, through benchmarking and financial analysis using public databases (AIDA, TPCatalyst), financial statements, and calculation of economic-financial indicators.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;You hold a secondary school diploma or a bachelor’s/master’s degree in economics, law, engineering, and/or humanities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;You are confident using basic IT tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;You are a team player&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good command of the English language&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You are enrolled under the Protected Categories (Law 68/99 – Art. 1 or Art. 18)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;An inclusive, fair, and respectful work environment that embraces and values diversity. Our workplace is designed to be accessible to everyone. We’re proud to offer a barrier-free structure, ensuring all individuals can work in a safe and comfortable environment, regardless of physical ability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Our offices include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Accessible ramps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Accessible elevators&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Accessible restrooms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Ergonomic workstations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;We are also committed to meeting individual needs through specific accommodations to ensure full participation and inclusion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;You will also find:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;A dynamic and stimulating work environment that fosters creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;A hybrid working model that supports work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative project opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, level IV, III or II. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills, relevant experience and fulfilment of the requirements of the position.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s core values. They foster an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to reach their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in accorda  with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG’s Privacy Policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Open Platform S.r.l. SB is committed to equal opportunity employment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:6.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-AA2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:6.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Napoli-Consultant-Categorie-protette/821504102/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">821504102</guid><g:id>821504102</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Napoli, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Consultant Financial Risk - Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Consultant – Financial Risk| &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Milano&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;When you join &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;the Financial Risk team in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt; Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;, &lt;/em&gt;you are going to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;work on &lt;strong&gt;Financial Risk projects &lt;/strong&gt;for top-tier clients in the Financial Services sector. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;supporting clients in defining and delivering business transformation initiatives, contributing to the redesign of operating models, processes, governance frameworks and organizational structures across different business functions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;performing quantitative and qualitative analyses to identify business needs, operational inefficiencies and improvement opportunities, translating insights into pragmatic and value-driven recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;contributing to the design and implementation of strategic, organizational and operational transformation programs, supporting clients throughout the entire project lifecycle, from assessment to execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;preparing executive-level presentations, business cases, project documentation and Steering Committee materials, ensuring high-quality deliverables and clear communication of key finding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;supporting project governance and project management activities, including planning, progress monitoring, risk and issue management, stakeholder coordination and reporting to senior management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;have at least 2 years of experience in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;banks, credit institutions or in primary consultancy companies on business transformation, operational excellence, project management, process improvement or organizational change projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;have a Master&apos;s degree in Economics, Finance, Business Administration, Management Engineering or related disciplines;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;have strong analytical and problem-solving capabilities, with a hands-on and pragmatic approach to tackling complex issues, synthesizing information, structuring solutions, and developing practical, actionable recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;have excellent communication and presentation skills, with the ability to prepare client-ready deliverables and effectively interact with stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;have an excellent knowledge of the English language, preferably backed up by experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;have an excellent knowledge of the office package, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;knowledge of programming languages for database analysis will be considered a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive and equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; mindset and innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €30,000 to €33,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:windowtext&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-FN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Consultant-Financial-Risk-Milano/1366116557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366116557</guid><g:id>1366116557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Application &amp; IT Support Specialist - Area Payroll (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Business Services&lt;/strong&gt; offre servizi interni all’organizzazione, supportando tutte le linee di servizio e coadiuvando i professionisti nella gestione delle attività quotidiane. In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di&lt;strong&gt; Information Technology Services &lt;/strong&gt;del nostro dipartimento di IT interno di Milano, contribuirai all’innovazione e all’evoluzione digitale dei processi HR/Payroll dei nostri clienti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Analisi tecnico-funzionale, sviluppo e customizzazione di sistemi informativi HR (amministrazione del personale, presenze, budgeting, contabilità);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Progettazione e implementazione di integrazioni tra sistemi client e piattaforme interne;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Sviluppo di reportistica avanzata e personalizzata;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Supporto alla definizione e presentazione di soluzioni tecnologiche ai clienti;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Consulenza sui processi HR in ottica di miglioramento ed evoluzione digitale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Installazione, configurazione e gestione operativa dei sistemi:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Troubleshooting e gestione delle anomalie, in coordinamento con fornitori esterni;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Supporto tecnico/applicativo a utenti interni e clienti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi una Laurea o hai un background in ambito IT, Ingegneristico, Informatico o in discipline affini;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai maturato esperienza su sistemi gestionali o soluzioni HR/Paroll;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai competenze base di analisi tecnico-funzionale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai familiarità con integrazione di sistemi e gestione dati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una buona conoscenza degli strumenti informatici e applicativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Soft skills (nice to have)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Attitudine al problem solving e approccio proattivo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Capacità di lavorare in team e interfacciarsi con stakeholder diversi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Buone doti comunicative, anche verso clienti non tecnici;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Orientamento al risultato e al miglioramento continuo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Interesse per l’innovazione e le tecnologie digitali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio al III° livello; la retribuzione sarà definita e commisurata in relazione a criteri oggettivi quali competenze, esperienza effettiva maturata e aderenza ai requisiti richiesti per la posizione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Business Services S.r.l. garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-RR1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Application-&amp;-IT-Support-Specialist-Area-Payroll/1365989157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365989157</guid><g:id>1365989157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Information Technology Services</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Tax Consultant | Padova (Padova, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;–&lt;em&gt; Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you’ll have the opportunity to help your firm, clients and colleagues address and resolve some of today’s most topical and complex issues. Our &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Tax &amp;amp; Legal&lt;/strong&gt; professionals work at the forefront of tax and corporate law, delivering integrated and innovative services across all key areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As part of our &lt;strong&gt;Tax Consulting &lt;/strong&gt;team in Padova,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;you’ll help clients navigate the tax system. You’ll be working in a constantly evolving environment, where national and international regulations intersect with market expectations as well as public opinion on crucial topics such as ethics, transparency and corporate governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:8.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Analysis of routine direct and indirect tax matters (tax advice).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Calculation of corporate income taxes (IRES and IRAP) and preparation of annual income tax returns (tax compliance).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;VAT and withholding tax reporting (tax compliance).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Analysis of tax risks and implementation of appropriate systems to monitor and measure them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Assistance in dealings with the Italian Revenue Agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You’ll be involved in &lt;strong&gt;national and international projects&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;working alongside highly qualified professionals and acquiring top-level skills through interaction with the brightest minds in the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Qualifications, Skills and Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:8.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;a master&apos;s degree in &lt;strong&gt;economics &lt;/strong&gt;(LM-77 or LM-56), with a final mark of at least 100/110;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;qualified as a &lt;strong&gt;chartered accountant &lt;/strong&gt;or wish to begin your &lt;strong&gt;qualifying work experience&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;a good command of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably with experience studying and/or working abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of Microsoft Office, especially Excel and PowerPoint;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:8.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that fosters &lt;strong&gt;creativity &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;teamworking&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to support continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international outlook&lt;/strong&gt; and a focus on &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individual, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values &lt;/strong&gt;that foster an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge. KPMG supports all its people in reaching their full potential, whatever their identity or background. Fully committed to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, we are &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 compliant &lt;/strong&gt;(ISO 30415:2021 – Human Resources Management – Diversity and Inclusion). KPMG in Italy is also &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125 &lt;/strong&gt;compliant (UNI/PdR 125:2022 – measures to ensure gender equality in audit and assurance services). You can find a summary of all our &lt;strong&gt;concrete&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;ESG &lt;/strong&gt;(environmental, social, and governance) &lt;strong&gt;actions&lt;/strong&gt; in our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG in Italy is an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – “GDPR”) as subsequently amended. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy notice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-LA &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Padova-Tax-Consultant-Padova/1365688957/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365688957</guid><g:id>1365688957</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Padova, IT</g:location></item><item><title>IT Strategy Senior Consultant | CIM | Bologna (Bologna, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Gli esperti di &lt;strong&gt;Nolan Norton&lt;/strong&gt;, società di IT Strategy del Network KPMG, aiutano le organizzazioni ad affrontare le sfide di trasformazione digitale e ad implementare architetture IT. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del Team CIO Advisory di Bologna, esperto di architetture e soluzioni di data management che supporta i CIO nell&apos;evoluzione digitale del loro percorso, nel loro journey verso il cloud, dalla strategia all&apos;esecuzione e dalla visione al valore reale. Entrerai a far parte di un ambiente dinamico e stimolante, per clienti di alto livello altamente visibili nei mercati dei servizi finanziari, dell&apos;energia, del settore pubblico e dei consumatori e industriali.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di su tecnologie innovative su progetti sfidanti ed entusiasmanti, supportando i nostri clienti principalmente sulle seguenti tematiche:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: aiutiamo i nostri clienti a sviluppare strategie tecnologiche e modelli operativi tecnologici innovativi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: consentiamo ai clienti di utilizzare soluzioni all&apos;avanguardia per applicazioni, infrastrutture e TLC;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management&lt;/strong&gt;: aiutiamo i nostri clienti nell’identificazione delle migliori soluzioni di gestione del dato e progettazione di architetture di Data Management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;: assistiamo i nostri clienti a identificare, definire le priorità, progettare e indirizzare meglio gli investimenti tecnologici;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: gestiamo la governance e svolgiamo attività di supporto tecnico durante la selezione delle varie opzioni e dei fornitori nell&apos;intero ciclo dei servizi ICT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance and Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: ci occupiamo della corretta struttura e dimensionamento delle risorse ICT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost right-sizing&lt;/strong&gt;: valutiamo e suggeriamo opzioni per indirizzare meglio la spesa e le risorse ICT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Laurea in discipline tecnico-scientifiche;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;almeno 2 anni di esperienza in società di consulenza o grandi aziende internazionali del settore ICT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Buona padronanza della lingua inglese, scritta e parlata (Livello minimo B2);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ottime capacità comunicative (scritte e orali)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Rappresentano un plus:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Esperienza nel disegno dei processi IT sulla base delle best practice di mercato&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza dei principali tool utilizzati in ambito IT Governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Eventuali certificazioni (Prince, ITIL v4, Togaf v9, Scrum o certificazioni AWS/Ms Azure/Google/Professional Cloud Service Manager) &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant  Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nolan Norton Spa garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. The experts at &lt;strong&gt;Nolan Norton&lt;/strong&gt;, an IT Strategy firm in the KPMG Network, help organizations address digital transformation challenges and implement IT architectures. Specifically, you will join the Bologna-based CIO Advisory Team, experts in data management architectures and solutions who support CIOs in their digital evolution on their journey to the cloud, from strategy to execution and from vision to real value. You will join a dynamic and challenging environment for highly visible high-level clients in the financial services, energy, public sector, and consumer and industrial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will work on innovative technologies on challenging and exciting projects, supporting our clients primarily on the following topics:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: we help our clients develop innovative technology strategies and technology operating models;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: we enable clients to use state-of-the-art solutions for applications, infrastructure and TLC;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management&lt;/strong&gt;: we help our clients in identifying the best data management solutions and designing Data Management architectures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;: we assist our clients in identifying, prioritizing, planning and better targeting technology investments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: we manage governance and perform technical support activities during the selection of various options and suppliers throughout the ICT services cycle;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance and Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: we deal with the proper structure and sizing of ICT resources;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost right-sizing&lt;/strong&gt;: we evaluate and suggest options to better target ICT spending and resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bachelor&apos;s degree in technical/scientific disciplines;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;At least 1/2 years of experience in consulting firms or large international ICT companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Good command of the English language, written and spoken (Minimum level B2);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills (written and oral).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Represent a plus:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Experience in IT process design based on market best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of the main tools used in IT Governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Any certifications (Prince, ITIL v4, Togaf v9, Scrum or AWS/Ms Azure/Google/Professional Cloud Service Manager certifications)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you&apos;ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt;, equitable &lt;strong&gt;work&lt;/strong&gt; environment that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to stay current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better - Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individuality, continuous deepening, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are the &lt;strong&gt;Values of KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; that give rise to an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, which allows our professionals to &lt;strong&gt;express their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Within our &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Impact&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarized all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”) as amended.&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;For more information, please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nolan Norton Spa guarantees equal opportunities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-DM1&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Bologna-IT-Strategy-Senior-Consultant-CIM-Bologna/823582102/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">823582102</guid><g:id>823582102</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Bologna, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant - SAP Concur (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza per affiancare le organizzazioni nella trasformazione dei processi, nella digitalizzazione e nell’adozione di soluzioni SAP a supporto del cambiamento.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del Team &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platforms&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai coinvolta/o in progetti di implementazione e ottimizzazione di &lt;strong&gt;SAP Concur&lt;/strong&gt;, con focus sui processi di &lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Expense Management&lt;/strong&gt; e sulla digitalizzazione delle note spese e delle trasferte aziendali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Condurre workshop con &lt;strong&gt;stakeholder Business e IT &lt;/strong&gt;per tradurre le esigenze di Travel &amp;amp; Expense Management in requisiti funzionali concreti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribuire al &lt;strong&gt;disegno della soluzione to-be&lt;/strong&gt; su SAP Concur, occupandoti di attività di configurazione e customizing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Garantire, in collaborazione con team funzionali e tecnici, la corretta integrazione tra &lt;strong&gt;Concur&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;SAP ERP/S4HANA&lt;/strong&gt; e le altre piattaforme aziendali coinvolte.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Curare la &lt;strong&gt;documentazione funzionale&lt;/strong&gt; e seguire le fasi di &lt;strong&gt;test&lt;/strong&gt;, go-live e hypercare, garantendo continuità anche nel post rilascio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Affiancare gli utenti finali nelle fasi di &lt;strong&gt;adozione della soluzione.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Lavorerai a stretto contatto con clienti del &lt;strong&gt;Settore Pubblico&lt;/strong&gt;, partecipando a progettualità innovative in contesti di Pubblica Amministrazione centrale e locale, sanità, istruzione ed enti a partecipazione pubblica.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai maturato esperienza su &lt;strong&gt;progetti SAP Concur &lt;/strong&gt;e sei a tuo agio nel gestire in autonomia le fasi di analisi, configurazione e rilascio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza in attività di&lt;strong&gt; analisi requisiti&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;configurazione&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;testing&lt;/strong&gt; e supporto al go-live.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona conoscenza dei processi&lt;strong&gt; Travel &amp;amp; Expense.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai familiarità con integrazioni verso sistemi SAP ERP o &lt;strong&gt;SAP S/4HANA.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona padronanza della lingua &lt;strong&gt;inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a &lt;strong&gt;viaggiare &lt;/strong&gt;sia a livello nazionale che internazionale per supportare i clienti nelle varie fasi progettuali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 36.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;equo &lt;/strong&gt;e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;stimolante &lt;/strong&gt;e &lt;strong&gt;dinamico &lt;/strong&gt;che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt;, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;e &lt;strong&gt;sviluppo &lt;/strong&gt;avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Mindset &lt;strong&gt;internazionale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;e progettualità &lt;strong&gt;innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 36.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly &lt;strong&gt;meaningful&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;impactful&lt;/strong&gt;? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, communities, colleagues, and organizations address and solve today’s most complex challenges. KPMG Advisory provides consulting services to support organizations in &lt;strong&gt;process transformation&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;digitalization&lt;/strong&gt;, and the adoption of &lt;strong&gt;SAP solutions&lt;/strong&gt; to drive change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;By joining the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platforms&lt;/strong&gt; team, you will be involved in &lt;strong&gt;SAP Concur&lt;/strong&gt; implementation and optimization projects, with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Expense Management&lt;/strong&gt; processes and the digitalization of expense reports and business travel management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be responsible for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Gathering and analyzing business requirements through workshops and collaboration with Business and IT stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supporting the design of the &lt;strong&gt;to-be solution&lt;/strong&gt; and performing &lt;strong&gt;SAP Concur configuration/customization&lt;/strong&gt; activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Collaborating with functional and technical teams to ensure proper &lt;strong&gt;integration&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;SAP ERP/S/4HANA&lt;/strong&gt; systems and other enterprise platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Preparing &lt;strong&gt;functional documentation&lt;/strong&gt; and supporting &lt;strong&gt;testing&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;go-live&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;hypercare&lt;/strong&gt; activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supporting end users during project delivery and release phases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You will work closely with &lt;strong&gt;Public Sector&lt;/strong&gt; clients, contributing to innovative projects within central and local government, healthcare, education, and publicly owned organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your skills and characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have&lt;strong&gt; experience&lt;/strong&gt; working on &lt;strong&gt;SAP Concur&lt;/strong&gt; projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have experience in &lt;strong&gt;requirements gathering&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;configuration&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;testing&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;go-live support&lt;/strong&gt; activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a solid understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Expense&lt;/strong&gt; processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are familiar with integrations involving &lt;strong&gt;SAP ERP&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;SAP S/4HANA&lt;/strong&gt; systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You possess strong interpersonal skills and a good command of the &lt;strong&gt;English language&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What you will find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and collaborative work environment that values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A dynamic and stimulating context that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt; designed to support work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training and development&lt;/strong&gt; programs to help you continuously grow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An international mindset and involvement in innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on employees’ physical and mental well-being.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate&apos;s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity: these are KPMG’s Values, shaping an environment that promotes the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to fully express their potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network complies with ISO 30415 standards for Diversity and Inclusion Management Systems and UNI PdR 125 standards relating to gender equality. Within our Impact Plan, you can find an overview of all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – “GDPR”) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#&lt;/strong&gt;LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Senior-Consultant-SAP-Concur/1360917357/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1360917357</guid><g:id>1360917357</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Enterprise &amp; IT Architect | CIO Advisory (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Gli esperti di &lt;strong&gt;Nolan Norton&lt;/strong&gt;, società di IT Strategy del Network KPMG, aiutano le organizzazioni ad affrontare le sfide di trasformazione digitale e ad implementare architetture IT. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del Team CIO Advisory di Roma, esperto di architetture e soluzioni di data management che supporta i CIO nell&apos;evoluzione digitale del loro percorso, nel loro journey verso il cloud, dalla strategia all&apos;esecuzione e dalla visione al valore reale. Entrerai a far parte di un ambiente dinamico e stimolante, per clienti di alto livello altamente visibili nei mercati dei servizi finanziari, dell&apos;energia, del settore pubblico e dei consumatori e industriali.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di tecnologie innovative su progetti sfidanti ed entusiasmanti, supportando i nostri clienti principalmente sulle seguenti tematiche:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Progettazione di architetture IT ibride (cloud e on-prem), scalabili e sicure, in contesti applicativi complessi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Supporto ai CIO nella definizione di roadmap tecnologiche, capability model e valutazioni di impatto su processi e organizzazione;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Governo dei portafogli applicativi, definizione di standard architetturali e revisione di ecosistemi IT complessi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analisi e valutazione di scenari &quot;make or buy&quot;, piani di sourcing strategico e change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Disegno di soluzioni di integrazione applicativa, API management e modernizzazione applicativa (microservizi, container, DevOps);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Supporto alla selezione di soluzioni tecnologiche in ambito cloud, infrastrutture, automazione e observability;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modellazione tecnica e logica di architetture con strumenti standard di mercato;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Collaborazione con team di sviluppo, operations e sicurezza nella realizzazione end-to-end delle soluzioni.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Laurea Magistrale in Ingegneria Informatica, Ingegneria Elettronica, Ingegneria delle Telecomunicazioni, Fisica, Matematica o hai maturato esperienze equivalenti;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Almeno 3-4 anni di esperienza di progettazione di architetture IT ibride (cloud e on-premise) in contesti applicativi eterogenei;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ottima capacità di analisi, modellazione e comunicazione verso stakeholder tecnici e di business;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza di strumenti di modellazione tecnica (UML, ArchiMate, o simili);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Familiarità con framework architetturali (TOGAF, Zachman) e strumenti di EA (Archi, LeanIX);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Competenze sull’integrazione applicativa ed API management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza dei tools di CI/CD e della metodologia DevOps;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza delle principali tecnologie in ambito Observability, Automation, Infrastructure as Code, Container e Orchestration(Docker, Kubernetes);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Esperienza nella progettazione e realizzazione di soluzioni Serverless e architetture event-driven;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Competenze di Networking e sicurezza in ambienti cloud;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza approfondita di almeno uno dei principali public cloud provider (AWS, MS Azure, GCP, OCI, IBM Cloud);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza della lingua inglese, idealmente approfondita attraverso un&apos;esperienza formativa/lavorativa all&apos;estero. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Viene considerato un requisito preferenziale il possesso di una o più delle seguenti certificazioni:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Google Cloud Certified Professional Cloud Architect;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;AWS Certified Solutions Architect Associate (o Professional);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Microsoft Certified: Azure Solutions Architect Expert;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;RedHat Certified Architect (RHCA);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Certified Kubernetes Application Developer (CKAD);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ITIL 4, COBIT, SAFe Architect;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Certificazioni in ambito EA tooling (ArchiMate)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;TOGAF 9.1 (o superiore).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant  Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nolan Norton Spa garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. Experts from Nolan Norton, an IT Strategy company within the KPMG Network, help organizations face digital transformation challenges and implement IT architectures. Specifically, you will join the CIO Advisory Team in Rome, experts in data management architectures and solutions that support CIOs in their digital evolution journey, from strategy to execution and from vision to real value. You will be part of a dynamic and stimulating environment, working with high-level clients highly visible in the financial services, energy, public sector, and consumer and industrial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will work on innovative technologies on challenging and exciting projects, supporting our clients mainly on the following topics:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design of hybrid IT architectures&lt;/strong&gt; (cloud and on-prem), scalable and secure, in complex application contexts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support to CIOs&lt;/strong&gt; in defining technology roadmaps, capability models, and impact assessments on processes and organization;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance of application portfolios&lt;/strong&gt;, definition of architectural standards, and review of complex IT ecosystems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analysis and evaluation of &quot;make or buy&quot; scenarios&lt;/strong&gt;, strategic sourcing plans, and change management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design of application integration solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, API management, and application modernization (microservices, containers, DevOps);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support in selecting technology solutions&lt;/strong&gt; in cloud, infrastructure, automation, and observability;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical and logical modeling of architectures&lt;/strong&gt; with standard market tools;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration with development, operations, and security teams&lt;/strong&gt; in the end-to-end realization of solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in Computer Engineering, Electronic Engineering, Telecommunications Engineering, Physics, Mathematics, or equivalent experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;At least 3-4 years of experience in designing hybrid IT architectures (cloud and on-premise) in heterogeneous application contexts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent analytical, modeling, and communication skills towards technical and business stakeholders;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of technical modeling tools (UML, ArchiMate, or similar);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Familiarity with architectural frameworks (TOGAF, Zachman) and EA tools (Archi, LeanIX);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Skills in application integration and API management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of CI/CD tools and DevOps methodology;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of key technologies in Observability, Automation, Infrastructure as Code, Container, and Orchestration (Docker, Kubernetes);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Experience in designing and implementing Serverless solutions and event-driven architectures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Networking and security skills in cloud environments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In-depth knowledge of at least one of the major public cloud providers (AWS, MS Azure, GCP, OCI, IBM Cloud);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of the English language, ideally deepened through educational/work experience abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possession of one or more of the following certifications is considered a preferential requirement:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Google Cloud Certified Professional Cloud Architect;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;AWS Certified Solutions Architect Associate (or Professional);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Microsoft Certified: Azure Solutions Architect Expert;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;RedHat Certified Architect (RHCA);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Certified Kubernetes Application Developer (CKAD);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ITIL 4, COBIT, SAFe Architect;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Certifications in EA tooling (ArchiMate);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;TOGAF 9.1 (or higher).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, fair work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that encourages creativity and teamwork;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid work mode to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay always updated;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset and innovative projects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are the Values of KPMG that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Within our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan - you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are carrying out on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to the KPMG privacy policy. Nolan Norton Spa guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-DM1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Enterprise-&amp;-IT-Architect-CIO-Advisory/805768902/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">805768902</guid><g:id>805768902</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Internship - IT Governance and Software Asset Management (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Internship - IT Governance and Software Asset Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; offers consulting services to companies to support them in transforming their business model, improving and digitizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, and providing support in extraordinary finance oper&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;ations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Times New Roman&amp;#39;, serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Asset management is becoming crucial in ICT governance, especially with the growing complexity of cloud-based architectures and new licensing models. In this context, Software Asset Management plays a key role not only in controlling costs and ensuring compliance, but also as part of the broader intellectual property framework, helping organizations manage rights, obligations, and value associated with digital assets. It also requires strong contractual analysis capabilities to interpret licensing terms, optimize usage, and mitigate risks. We support our clients with specialised services to improve software license and overall asset management strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;We are looking for a junior resource interested in ICT governance, specifically in Software Asset Management and IT Intellectual Property.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Monitor and analyze software usage across its lifecycle to improve efficiency, optimize costs and reduce risks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Support software license and asset management activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribute to technical, architectural, and contractual analyses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Perform basic contract analysis related to licensing terms and conditions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Support the definition and improvement of asset management processes and controls within IT systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Support clients in the evaluation, selection, and management of SAM tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Use data analysis and tools to support control processes in IT systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Degree in computer engineering, engineering management, business subjects with a focus on the computer sciences, or similar;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;interest in software license management aspects or similar topics in the area of IT governance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 36.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive, fair work&lt;/strong&gt; environment that respects, encourages, and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity and teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid work mode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to stay up-to-date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Paid internship opportunity offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are the &lt;strong&gt;Values of KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to &lt;strong&gt;express their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;. As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-FN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Internship-IT-Governance-and-Software-Asset-Management/1364536757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1364536757</guid><g:id>1364536757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant/Assistant Manager Governance, Risk &amp; Compliance - Consumer&amp;Industrial Market (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultant/Assistant Manager Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance - Consumer &amp;amp; Industrial Market - Milano&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it&lt;br&gt;In KPMG, you’ll feel closer to your full potential&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell’analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria. In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt; di &lt;strong&gt;Milano&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai impegnata/o nella gestione dei processi di cambiamento aziendali; in particolare, insieme a colleghe e colleghi esperti, analizzerai i requisiti strategici utili a implementare le migliori soluzioni per la gestione della sostenibilità presenti sul mercato.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sviluppo di &lt;strong&gt;framework di Governance&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Evoluzione dei modelli di&lt;strong&gt; Enterprise Risk Management&lt;/strong&gt; e dei &lt;strong&gt;Compliance Program &lt;/strong&gt;aziendalii;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Disegno e implementazione delle componenti del sistema di controllo interno attraverso l’analisi dei processi, l’identificazione di rischi e controlli e favorendo il raccordo degli stessi nel più ampio sistema di controllo interno e&lt;strong&gt; gestione dei rischi integrato&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai maturato un&apos;esperienza di &lt;strong&gt;almeno 3 ann&lt;/strong&gt;i in ruoli analoghi o come Revisore Contabile presso società di consulenza/Big 4 o dipartimenti di internal audit di società industriali;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai una laurea magistrale in Economia e Management, Business Administration e Amministrazione, Finanza e Controllo, Ingegneria gestionale ed eventuale Master in Accounting, Auditing &amp;amp; Control;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai un’ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese, meglio se avvalorata da un’esperienza di studio e/o lavoro all’estero;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai interesse per aziende legate al mercato Consumer &amp;amp; Industrial.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a style=&quot;color:blue;text-decoration:underline&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border-bottom:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:0.0cm 0.0cm 1.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding:0.0cm;border:medium none currentcolor&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you looking for a role that is truly meaningful and impactful?&lt;/strong&gt; At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues address and overcome some of the most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory provides consulting services to organizations, supporting them in transforming their business models, improving and digitalizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, as well as assisting with extraordinary finance and transaction activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;By joining the &lt;strong&gt;Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance Team&lt;/strong&gt; in Milan, you will be involved in managing business transformation processes. Working alongside experienced professionals, you will analyze strategic requirements and contribute to the implementation of leading sustainability management solutions available on the market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Developing &lt;strong&gt;Governance frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;;Enhancing &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Risk Management (ERM) models&lt;/strong&gt; and corporate &lt;strong&gt;Compliance Programs&lt;/strong&gt;;Designing and implementing &lt;strong&gt;Internal Control System (ICS)&lt;/strong&gt; components through process analysis, risk and control identification, and facilitating their integration within the broader &lt;strong&gt;integrated Internal Control and Risk Management System (ICRMS)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;At least &lt;strong&gt;3 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in similar roles or as an &lt;strong&gt;External Auditor&lt;/strong&gt; within consulting firms/Big Four organizations, or in the &lt;strong&gt;Internal Audit&lt;/strong&gt; departments of industrial companies;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;Master’s degree&lt;/strong&gt; in Economics and Management, Business Administration, Administration, Finance &amp;amp; Control, Management Engineering, or a related field; an additional &lt;strong&gt;Master’s degree in Accounting, Auditing &amp;amp; Control&lt;/strong&gt; would be considered an advantage;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;excellent command of English&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably strengthened by a study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An interest in companies operating in the &lt;strong&gt;Consumer &amp;amp; Industrial&lt;/strong&gt; sectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You are a problem solver and never lose sight of your goals. You have strong interpersonal skills and are a team player. Your motivation and enthusiasm inspire confidence and empower change. You enjoy taking on challenges and are comfortable in fast-changing situations where your leadership abilities make the difference.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity. These are the KPMG values that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential. As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy. KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0px&quot;&gt;#LI-AV1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0px&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-ConsultantAssistant-Manager-Governance%2C-Risk-&amp;-Compliance-Consumer&amp;Industrial-Market/1329302157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1329302157</guid><g:id>1329302157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Deal Strategy Senior Consultant | Padova (Padova, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:24.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Deal Strategy Senior Consultant | Padova&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Deal Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; team provides support in &lt;strong&gt;M&amp;amp;As&lt;/strong&gt;, from the pre-deal evaluation to the post-deal integration or separation with focus on the definition and quantification of all value creation levers. As a member of this team, you will work in close contact with lenders, shareholders and managers at all levels, helping to support clients in corporate finance transactions using digital tools and technology in your day-to-day work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Join our teams in &lt;strong&gt;Padua&lt;/strong&gt; where you will gain experience supporting shareholders and management of client companies in solving complex business challenges, from the definition of strategy to the execution of value creation initiatives, with focus on the Pre-Deal Business/Operational Due Diligence, Business Planning and Post-Deal Integration phases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;•    Business &amp;amp; Strategic Planning: You’ll work alongside C-level executives to assess the business in a short time framework and define/ quantify improvement actions to present to investors and stakeholders;&lt;br&gt;•    Business &amp;amp; Commercial Due Diligence: You’ll analyze business dynamics, market, and competition for potential targets, working with private equity funds and other buyers;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;•    Identification and review of synergies both in a pre and post deal phase. Support in the implementation of tracking models of the synergies identified in the &quot;execution&quot; phase;&lt;br&gt;•    Synergy assessment and execution: You will analyze all potential synergies both in a pre and post deal phase,  supporting end to end the client from the quantification phase to the implementation/ tracking of the identified synergies;&lt;br&gt;•    Integration &amp;amp; Separation Management Office: You will define and drive Day 1 Readiness plan, D100 Integration plan, definition of Target Operating Model, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;At least 2/3 years of experience from either a strategy consulting firm or the strategy or business development function of an industrial, consumer or retail company with activity focus on revenue growth initiatives definition and management;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;A master&apos;s degree in business subjects and, preferably, additional post-graduate courses in data science, business analytics and digital innovation;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;A keen interest in pre and post M&amp;amp;A deal activities;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;An analytical approach and ability to interpret data and KPIs;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in Italian &amp;amp; English;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of Excel and PowerPoint;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Knowledge of data and analytics tools (e.g., Power, BI and Qlik) is preferred;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Flexible to travel for work in Italy and abroad.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;equitable &lt;/strong&gt;work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;challenging and dynamic environment&lt;/strong&gt; that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a &lt;strong&gt;healthy work-life balance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;I&lt;strong&gt;nternational &lt;/strong&gt;mindset and &lt;strong&gt;innovative &lt;/strong&gt;projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical &lt;strong&gt;well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network has obtained ISO 30415 certification, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a style=&quot;text-decoration:underline;color:black&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-AV2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Padova-Deal-Strategy-Senior-Consultant-Padova/1356016157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1356016157</guid><g:id>1356016157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Deal Advisory</g:job_function><g:location>Padova, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant Governance, Risk &amp; Compliance - Financial Services (Verona, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Junior Consultant Governance, Risk and Compliance - Financial Services&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di &lt;strong&gt;Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt; di &lt;strong&gt;Verona&lt;/strong&gt; potrai aiutare le aziende a trasformare i &lt;strong&gt;rischi in opportunità&lt;/strong&gt; per migliorare la loro organizzazione e l’evoluzione dei loro sistemi di governance, ottenendo un vantaggio competitivo e offrendo soluzioni integrate e approcci innovativi per la gestione strategica del rischio. La tua esperienza troverà la giusta valorizzazione e ti consentirà di diventare il punto di riferimento per importanti clienti, supportati nel miglioramento dell’efficacia e dell’efficienza dei processi e delle organizzazioni, creando un elevato valore aggiunto e incrementando l’impatto dei servizi erogati.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evoluzione della &lt;strong&gt;governance interna e del sistema di controllo interno&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Corporate governance&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;regulatory framework&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sistemi di controllo interno e relativa evoluzione attraverso nuove tecnologie;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strumenti di &lt;strong&gt;Data Analysis &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt; a supporto delle &lt;strong&gt;funzioni di controllo&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su &lt;strong&gt;progetti nazionali &lt;/strong&gt;e&lt;strong&gt; internazionali&lt;/strong&gt; al fianco di professioniste e professionisti altamente qualificati e lavorerai a stretto contatto con i nostri clienti del settore dei &lt;strong&gt;Financial Services&lt;/strong&gt;, tra cui banche, assicurazioni e società di investimento.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Esperienza di &lt;strong&gt;0 - 1 anno&lt;/strong&gt; presso aziende (compagnie assicurative, banche, asset management) o presso società di consulenza;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laurea magistrale o Master in&lt;strong&gt; Economia, Ingegneria Gestionale o Finanza&lt;/strong&gt; con ottima votazione;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interesse per i &lt;strong&gt;Financial Services&lt;/strong&gt; (settore bancario, assicurativo, asset &amp;amp; wealth management) e buona conoscenza del framework normativo del settore finanziario;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, meglio se avvalorata da un’esperienza di studio e/o lavoro all’estero;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a title=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join the Governance, Risk, Compliance and Sustainability Services team, you will help companies transform risks into opportunities for the improvement of their organisation and evolution of their governance systems to gain a competitive edge and offer integrated solutions and innovative approaches for strategic risk management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;KPMG Advisory’s Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance team supports companies in the definition of governance and organisational structures to face the challenges of digital transformation through processes for the management of risks and opportunities. If you are passionate about governance and internal control and risk management systems applied to the financial reporting sector, with an interest in consulting, join our &lt;strong&gt;Verona &lt;/strong&gt;team serving clients in the&lt;strong&gt; Financial sector.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Evolution of &lt;strong&gt;internal governance&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;internal control system&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Corporate governance&lt;/strong&gt; and regulatory framework;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Internal control systems and their evolution through new technologies;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analysis &amp;amp; Governance &lt;/strong&gt;tools supporting control functions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;you have &lt;strong&gt;0–1 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in companies (insurance companies, banks, or asset management firms) or in &lt;strong&gt;consulting firms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you have a master&apos;s degree or other post-graduate degree in&lt;strong&gt; business, engineering management or finance&lt;/strong&gt; with excellent results (preference for studies related to sustainability matters);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you have an interest in financial services (banking, insurance and asset and wealth management) and a good knowledge of the finance sector&apos;s regulatory framework;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you have excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__flistingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__flistingLayout_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AV1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Verona-Junior-Consultant-Governance%2C-Risk-&amp;-Compliance-Financial-Services/1366393457/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366393457</guid><g:id>1366393457</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Verona, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior / AM IT Audit Torino (Torino, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance &lt;/strong&gt;offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di Cyber &amp;amp; Tech Risk a Torino, lavorerai con i nostri esperti di ICT security per aiutare i clienti ad affrontare i rischi informatici che minacciano il loro business. Collaborerai su progetti rilevanti per le aziende leader di mercato.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analizzare i rischi e i controlli (rischio IT);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Comprendere le metodologie interne e le normative adottate dai clienti;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Valutare degli impatti delle caratteristiche specifiche del business del cliente sui sistemi IT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analizzare la parametrizzazione, configurazione e processi SAP (per i processi contabili e logistici);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Approfondire la sicurezza negli ambienti SAP ECC / SAP HANA;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Utilizzare le funzionalità di accesso ai dati (tabelle e report) e relative analisi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Apprendere gli strumenti di elaborazione dei dati come QlikView, IDEA e MS Access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolto su progetti sia nazionali che internazionali, collaborando con professionisti altamente qualificati, e lavorerai a stretto contatto con i nostri clienti, contribuendo alla gestione di rischi IT, governance, audit, privacy e sicurezza informatica.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai maturato oltre 2 anni di esperienza in società di consulenza operanti in ambito cybersecurity, audit IT e compliance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai una laurea in ingegneria informatica, ingegneria gestionale o in informatica e tecnologie dell&apos;informazione;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai un&apos;ottima padronanza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conosci i principali standard applicabili (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, ecc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza nella strategia e nella valutazione del rischio informatico;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai conoscenza della governance dei sistemi IT e di business continuity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile per effettuare trasferte a livello nazionale e internazionale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 38.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 48.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto delle individualità, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità: questi sono &lt;strong&gt;i valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;. Favoriamo un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e alla crescita personale e professionale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità. I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (GDPR).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offers consulting services to businesses, supporting them in transforming their business models, improving and digitizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, and executing extraordinary financial operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;By joining the Cyber &amp;amp; Tech Risk Team in Turin, you will work with our ICT security experts to help clients face cyber risks that threaten their business. You will collaborate on key projects for market-leading companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be involved in:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyzing risks&lt;/strong&gt; and controls (IT risk);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Understanding the &lt;strong&gt;internal methodologies&lt;/strong&gt; and regulations adopted by clients;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Assessing the &lt;strong&gt;impact of clients&apos; specific business&lt;/strong&gt; characteristics on IT systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyzing the configuration&lt;/strong&gt;, setup, and processes of SAP (for accounting and logistics processes);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Deepening your &lt;strong&gt;knowledge of security&lt;/strong&gt; in SAP ECC / SAP HANA environments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Utilizing &lt;strong&gt;data access functionalities&lt;/strong&gt; (tables and reports) and conducting related analyses;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Learning to &lt;strong&gt;use data processing&lt;/strong&gt; tools such as QlikView, IDEA, and MS Access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will be involved in both national and international projects, working alongside highly qualified professionals, and collaborating closely with our clients to contribute to IT risk management, governance, audit, privacy, and cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Qualities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have 2+ &lt;strong&gt; years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in consulting firms operating in cybersecurity, IT audit, and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You hold a degree in Computer Engineering, Management Engineering, or Computer Science and Information Technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have an excellent command of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You are familiar with the &lt;strong&gt;main applicable standards&lt;/strong&gt; (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have experience in &lt;strong&gt;cybersecurity strategy&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;risk assessment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have knowledge of IT systems governance and &lt;strong&gt;business continuity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You are available for national and international travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, &lt;strong&gt;equitable work&lt;/strong&gt; environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and &lt;strong&gt;dynamic context&lt;/strong&gt; that fosters creativity and teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;hybrid working&lt;/strong&gt; model to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to stay up-to-date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and innovative projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and &lt;strong&gt;mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €38,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €48,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity: these are KPMG’s values. We promote an environment open to the exchange of ideas and personal and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities. Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (GDPR).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-AA1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-AA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Torino-Senior-AM-IT-Audit-Torino/808335302/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">808335302</guid><g:id>808335302</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Torino, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Office Assistant - Napoli (Napoli, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt;Office Assistant | Napoli&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Open Platform – aprirsi al mondo dalla tua città&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Open Platform&lt;/strong&gt; è il nostro nuovo Hub innovativo in forte espansione con sede a &lt;strong&gt;Napoli&lt;/strong&gt;, creato per supportare le imprese e la Pubblica Amministrazione nell’esecuzione di progetti di trasformazione, spesso ad alto contenuto tecnologico. Le aree di intervento includono: Cyber Security, Program Management su grandi cantieri di trasformazione del settore Pubblico, sviluppo e manutenzione di applicativi aziendali e Managed Services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team Infrastructure, sarai responsabile di fornire i più alti standard di assistenza diretta e di supporto alla Leadership e ai componenti del Management Group. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Corrispondenza telefonica e via mail;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestione agenda e interfaccia costante con tutti i livelli organizzativi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestione dei rapporti istituzionali esterni;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Redazione di documenti, presentazioni, reportistica con archiviazione dei documenti interni;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Attività amministrative e di compliance legate alla contrattualistica;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Organizzazione e pianificazione di meeting interni e con i clienti, con relativo supporto logistico e gestione dell’allestimento delle sale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Organizzazione di viaggi e trasferte;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Supporto ai processi di onboarding e offboarding del personale, inclusa la consegna e la restituzione degli asset aziendali;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestione del processo di controllo qualità, in conformità con le linee guida stabilite da KPMG.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai conseguito una Laurea Triennale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ha maturato un&apos;ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Office, in particolare di Excel e Power Point;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona padronanza della lingua inglese (livello B1/B2);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai ottime doti comunicative scritte e orali.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio IV° livello; la retribuzione sarà definita e commisurata in relazione a criteri oggettivi quali competenze, esperienza effettiva maturata e aderenza ai requisiti richiesti per la posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Open Platform srl garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt;Office Assistant | Naples&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Open Platform – Open Yourself to the World from Your City&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Are you looking for a meaningful role where you can make a real impact? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, communities, and colleagues address and overcome some of today’s most complex challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Open Platform&lt;/strong&gt; is our rapidly growing and innovative Hub based in Naples, created to support businesses and Public Sector organizations in delivering transformation projects, often with a strong technology focus. Our areas of expertise include Cyber Security, Program Management for large-scale Public Sector transformation initiatives, application development and maintenance, and Managed Services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As part of the Infrastructure Team, you will be responsible for providing high-level executive support and assistance to Leadership and members of the Management Group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Management of telephone and email correspondence;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Calendar management and continuous liaison with stakeholders at all organizational levels;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Management of relationships with external institutions and key stakeholders;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Preparation of documents, presentations and reports, as well as maintenance of internal filing systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Administrative and compliance activities related to contract management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Organization and coordination of internal and client meetings, including logistical support and meeting room preparation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Organization of business travel and travel arrangements;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Support for employee onboarding and offboarding processes, including the allocation and collection of company assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Management of quality control processes in compliance with KPMG guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Qualifications&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is ideal for you if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hold a Bachelor’s degree;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Have a strong knowledge of the Microsoft Office Suite, particularly Excel and PowerPoint;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Have a good command of English (B1/B2 level);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possess excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us – What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive and equitable workplace that respects, encourages, and values diversity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A dynamic and stimulating environment that promotes creativity and teamwork;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid working arrangements designed to support a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced learning and development programs to help you continuously grow and stay up to date;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An international mindset and the opportunity to work on innovative projects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on employees&apos; wellbeing and mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, level IV. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills, relevant experience and fulfilment of the requirements of the position. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity: these are the values that shape KPMG’s culture and create an environment where ideas and knowledge are openly shared, enabling our professionals to reach their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Through our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network has achieved ISO 30415 certification for Diversity and Inclusion Management Systems and UNI/PdR 125 certification for Gender Equality. Learn more about our ESG commitments and initiatives through our Impact Plan: &lt;strong&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join Us!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (General Data Protection Regulation – GDPR) and subsequent amendments. For additional information, please refer to KPMG’s Privacy Notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Open Platform S.r.l. is an Equal Opportunity Employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:150%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-RR1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Napoli-Office-Assistant-Napoli/1368789257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368789257</guid><g:id>1368789257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Infrastructure</g:job_function><g:location>Napoli, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior M&amp;A Tax Consultant - Bologna (Bologna, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;With its highly qualified tax and legal experts, &lt;b&gt;KPMG Studio Associato&lt;/b&gt; provides assistance in all the key tax and corporate law areas, offering innovative, integrated services. Its work teams specialise in both professional field and client sector.&lt;br&gt;
With over &lt;b&gt;500 professionals&lt;/b&gt; at &lt;b&gt;12 offices&lt;/b&gt; in Italy&apos;s largest cities, the KPMG network&apos;s Tax and legal unit is one of the top professional partnerships in the country.&lt;br&gt;
  &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We are recruiting a professional to join our &lt;b&gt;M&amp;amp;A Tax Team&lt;/b&gt; in &lt;b&gt;Bologna&lt;/b&gt;, who will be involved in: &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Tax due diligence reviews of extraordinary transactions (mergers, demergers, acquisitions, contributions, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Corporate restructuring;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Analyses of the treatment of extraordinary transactions according to national accounting standards (OIC) and international ones (IAS/IFRS);&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;National and international tax opinions;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Applications for tax rulings;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Preparation of corporate income tax returns (&lt;em&gt;Modello Unico&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Modello IRAP&lt;/em&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;em&gt;Requirements&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To be our ideal candidate, you must:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Up to 2 years of professional experience at International Law Firms (Big Four or Advisory Firms);&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Master’s Degree in Economics or Law, with a final grade of more than 100/110;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of the English language;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of the Office suite.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and team-working skills;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Good organizational skills, initiative, and problem-solving ability;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and dynamism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Desired Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Master&apos;s degree in Tax Law.&lt;br&gt;
	 &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;br&gt;
Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. Please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy for further information at this link: https://home.kpmg/it/it/home/misc/privacy.html&lt;br&gt;
 &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer. &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0px&quot;&gt;#LI-LB1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%&quot;&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
		&lt;tr&gt;
		&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Bologna-Junior-M&amp;A-Tax-Consultant-Bologna/1365689257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365689257</guid><g:id>1365689257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Bologna, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Deal Advisory Transaction Services Senior Consultant | Roma (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Advisory Transaction Services Senior Consultant | Roma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi intraprendere una professione davvero significativa e di impatto? In &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare clienti, azienda e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Nel rispetto dei valori di integrità e qualità, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offre un portafoglio integrato e in continua evoluzione di servizi, fornendo analisi e approfondimenti che consentono alle aziende di rispondere alle esigenze informative e di rendicontazione del mercato e degli investitori. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Il team &lt;strong&gt;Transaction Services&lt;/strong&gt; fa parte della divisione &lt;strong&gt;Deal Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; e supporta i clienti in tutte le fasi delle operazioni di fusione e acquisizione (M&amp;amp;A), dalla valutazione preliminare dell&apos;operazione fino all&apos;integrazione o alla separazione successiva alla chiusura del deal. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;I professionisti del team assistono fondi di &lt;strong&gt;private equity&lt;/strong&gt; e clienti corporate nell&apos;identificazione dei rischi e delle opportunità legati ad acquisizioni, cessioni e joint venture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del team, lavorerai a stretto contatto con investitori, azionisti e manager di ogni livello. Supporterai i clienti nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria, utilizzando strumenti di &lt;strong&gt;data analytics&lt;/strong&gt;, tecnologie innovative e soluzioni di &lt;strong&gt;intelligenza artificiale&lt;/strong&gt; nelle attività quotidiane.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Entrando nel team di &lt;strong&gt;Roma&lt;/strong&gt;, diventerai un elemento chiave nella creazione di valore nelle operazioni di M&amp;amp;A. In un ambiente dinamico e stimolante, contribuirai a progetti di &lt;strong&gt;financial due diligence&lt;/strong&gt;, supportando fondi di private equity e aziende italiane e internazionali nelle loro decisioni di investimento.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è ideale se possiedi:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;una &lt;strong&gt;laurea magistrale&lt;/strong&gt; in discipline economiche, con specializzazione in contabilità, controllo di gestione e finanza;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3-6 anni di esperienza&lt;/strong&gt; in Transaction Services, Corporate Finance, Revisione Contabile (Audit) o ambiti affini;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;solide competenze contabili e conoscenza dei principi di bilancio &lt;strong&gt;Italian GAAP&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;IFRS&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;capacità di analizzare i bilanci d&apos;esercizio e una solida preparazione in ambito matematico, finanziario e contabile;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;ottime capacità di problem solving e un forte approccio analitico;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;una buona conoscenza della lingua inglese.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo ed equo&lt;/strong&gt;, che rispetta, valorizza e promuove la diversità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;dinamico e stimolante&lt;/strong&gt;, che incoraggia la creatività e il lavoro di squadra.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt;, per favorire un sano equilibrio tra vita privata e professionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi avanzati di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo professionale&lt;/strong&gt;, per mantenere competenze sempre aggiornate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente internazionale e la possibilità di lavorare su &lt;strong&gt;progetti innovativi&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere mentale e fisico&lt;/strong&gt; delle persone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 30.000 e € 43.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità sono i valori di &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;. Questi principi creano un ambiente che favorisce la condivisione di idee e conoscenze, consentendo ai professionisti di esprimere appieno il proprio potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A conferma dell&apos;impegno per un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il Network KPMG ha ottenuto la certificazione &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione della Diversità e Inclusione, e la certificazione &lt;strong&gt;UNI/PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Attraverso il proprio &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt;, KPMG presenta le azioni concrete intraprese sui temi ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati personali saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto del &lt;strong&gt;Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (GDPR)&lt;/strong&gt; e delle successive modifiche. Per maggiori informazioni è possibile consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. promuove le pari opportunità ed è un datore di lavoro che garantisce pari opportunità di accesso e crescita professionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. In keeping with the values of integrity and quality, KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance offers an integrated and constantly evolving portfolio of services, with insights that allow companies to respond to the informational/reporting needs of the market and investors.The &lt;strong&gt;Transaction Services&lt;/strong&gt; team is part of &lt;strong&gt;Deal Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;, providing support in M&amp;amp;As, from the pre-deal evaluation to the post-deal integration or separation.Our Transaction Services professionals assist private equity and corporate clients in identifying the risks and opportunities of their acquisitions, divestments and joint ventures.When you join our team, you will be working closely with financial backers, shareholders and managers at all levels. You will assist clients in corporate finance transactions, availing of data analytics tools and using technology and AI in your day-to-day activities.Join our team in &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt; and become a key player in delivering value on M&amp;amp;A transactions. In a dynamic and stimulating environment, you will contribute to &lt;strong&gt;financial due diligence&lt;/strong&gt; projects, supporting Italian and International private equity and corporates in their investment decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a master’s degree in business subjects (with a focus on accounting, management control and finance);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;3-6 years of experience in transaction services, corporate finance, audit or similar;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;accounting skills and knowledge of the financial reporting standards (Italian GAAP and IFRS);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;an ability to analyse financial statements and solid mathematical, financial and accounting expertise;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;problem solving and an analytical mindset;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of English;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt;, equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €30,000 to €43,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; -  &lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:underline&quot;&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-AA2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Deal-Advisory-Transaction-Services-Senior-Consultant-Roma/1365769457/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365769457</guid><g:id>1365769457</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Deal advisory</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Accountant - Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Junior Accountant | Milano&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Fides Servizi di Amministrazione&lt;/strong&gt; offre servizi professionali nei &lt;strong&gt;processi amministrativi, contabili e fiscali&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Fides conta oltre &lt;strong&gt;300 professionisti in sei sedi&lt;/strong&gt; ed è in continua crescita. In quanto società italiana del Network KPMG che fornisce servizi professionali per processi amministrativi, contabili e fiscali, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Fides, settore Accounting&lt;/strong&gt;, supporta le principali aziende italiane e internazionali in amministrazione, finanza e fiscalità.&lt;br&gt;Svolge un ruolo chiave nell&apos;identificare potenziali opportunità e armonizzare i processi di contabilità, facilitati da una profonda trasformazione digitale, accelerata ulteriormente dall’introduzione di tecnologie di intelligenza artificiale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;In KPMG Fides, puntiamo a investire nei giovani talenti per sviluppare in loro delle solide competenze, necessarie a diventare professionisti affidabili e di fiducia. Entrando a far parte di uno dei team Accounting di KPMG, lavorerai a stretto contatto con aziende leader, assistendole in un approccio integrato alla compliance amministrativa, traducendo i vari requisiti legislativi, normativi e procedurali in processi contabili e fiscali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Per la &lt;strong&gt;sede di Milano&lt;/strong&gt; siamo alla ricerca di &lt;strong&gt;risorse junior&lt;/strong&gt; da coinvolgere in &lt;strong&gt;attività amministrativo-contabili&lt;/strong&gt; a supporto delle aziende clienti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, il/la candidato/a sarà coinvolto/a nelle seguenti attività:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;gestione della &lt;strong&gt;contabilità ordinaria&lt;/strong&gt; e rappresentazione dei risultati economico-finanziari;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;supporto operativo nella &lt;strong&gt;redazione del bilancio d’esercizio&lt;/strong&gt; e dei principali adempimenti fiscali;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;verifica della &lt;strong&gt;compliance civilistica e fiscale&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;analisi e gestione dei &lt;strong&gt;processi amministrativi, contabili e fiscali&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Il candidato ideale possiede:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;laurea in discipline economiche&lt;/strong&gt; (conseguita o in fase di conseguimento);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;preferibile esperienza in ambito contabile e nella redazione del bilancio&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;preferibile esperienza nell’utilizzo di software contabili;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;conoscenza dei &lt;strong&gt;principi contabili italiani&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;buona conoscenza del pacchetto &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office &lt;/strong&gt;(in particolare Excel, PowerPoint, ecc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;buona conoscenza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ottime capacità relazionali, approccio analitico e problem solving&lt;/strong&gt;, capacità di adattamento e spirito di innovazione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Il tuo futuro con noi – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;un&lt;strong&gt; ambiente di lavoro inclusivo &lt;/strong&gt;ed &lt;strong&gt;equo&lt;/strong&gt;, che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza la diversità;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;un contesto &lt;strong&gt;stimolante e dinamico&lt;/strong&gt; che favorisce creatività e lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;modalità di lavoro ibride&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita professionale e personale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;programmi avanzati di formazione e sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt; per mantenere competenze sempre aggiornate;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;mentalità internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e progetti innovativi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere mentale e fisico&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 1000€  o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 24.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità: sono i &lt;strong&gt;valori KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che creano un ambiente favorevole alla condivisione di idee e conoscenze, permettendo ai nostri professionisti di esprimere appieno il proprio potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;In linea con il nostro impegno per un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il Network KPMG è conforme ai requisiti della &lt;strong&gt;norma ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; sul sistema di gestione della Diversità e Inclusione e alla &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; in materia di parità di genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Fides servizi di Amministrazione S.p.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;A. garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Junior Accountant | Milano&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Fides Servizi di Amministrazione&lt;/strong&gt; provides professional services in &lt;strong&gt;administrative, accounting, and tax processes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Fides has &lt;strong&gt;over 300 professionals across six offices &lt;/strong&gt;and is in continuous growth. As the Italian company within the KPMG Network that delivers professional services for administrative, accounting, and tax processes, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Fides,&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Accounting&lt;/strong&gt; division, supports leading Italian and international companies in administration, finance, and taxation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;We play a key role in identifying potential opportunities and harmonizing accounting processes, supported by a significant digital transformation, further accelerated by the introduction of artificial intelligence technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;At KPMG Fides, we invest in young talent to help them develop strong skills needed to become reliable and trusted professionals. By joining one of KPMG’s Accounting teams, you will work closely with leading companies, assisting them with an integrated approach to administrative compliance, translating various legislative, regulatory, and procedural requirements into accounting and tax processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;For our &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt; office, we are looking for &lt;strong&gt;junior Staff members&lt;/strong&gt; to be involved in &lt;strong&gt;administrative and accounting activities&lt;/strong&gt; supporting client companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, the candidate will be involved in the following activities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;managing &lt;strong&gt;general accounting&lt;/strong&gt; and preparing economic and financial reports;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;providing operational support in the &lt;strong&gt;preparation of annual financial statements&lt;/strong&gt; and key tax filings;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;verifying &lt;strong&gt;civil and tax compliance&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;analyzing and managing &lt;strong&gt;administrative, accounting, and tax processes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate must have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;a &lt;strong&gt;degree in business subjects&lt;/strong&gt; (graduate or nearing completion);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;preferable experience in accounting and financial statement preparation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;preferable experience using accounting software;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Italian financial reporting standards&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;good knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt; (particularly Excel, PowerPoint, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;a good knowledge of English&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;excellent interpersonal skills, analytical mindset, and problem‑solving abilities&lt;/strong&gt;, adaptability, and innovation spirit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;equitable &lt;/strong&gt;work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;challenging and dynamic environment&lt;/strong&gt; that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a &lt;strong&gt;healthy work-life balance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International&lt;/strong&gt; mindset and &lt;strong&gt;innovative &lt;/strong&gt;projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical &lt;strong&gt;well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either an &lt;span&gt;internship opportunity with a monthly allowance of €1000&lt;/span&gt; or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €24,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join us!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. Please see KPMG’s privacy policy for further information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Fides servizi di Amministrazione S.p.A.guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-SC1&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Accountant-Milano/1362786157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1362786157</guid><g:id>1362786157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>FIDES</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Internship Financial Risk | Verona (Verona, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Internship Financial Risk | Verona&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;When you join &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;the Financial Risk team in Verona&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;, &lt;/em&gt;you are going to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;work on projects in the field of Risk Management, with a focus both on regulatory and organizational aspects of competence and on the development and validation of modeling for top-tier clients in the Financial Services sector. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Credit and Market Risk;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Operational Risk;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Liquidity and Interest Rate Risk;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Insurance Risk;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Regulatory and ESG Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 17.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;have a specialist degree (graduate or nearing completion) in finance or quantitative field (statistics, mathematics);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;have excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;have an excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;knowledge of programming software and languages (Python, SAS, R, Matlab and Stata).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Paid internship opportunity offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-FN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Verona-Internship-Financial-Risk-Verona/1366312057/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366312057</guid><g:id>1366312057</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Verona, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant (Stage) - Digitalizzazione processi commerciali (Firenze, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Enterprise Platforms&lt;/strong&gt;, lavorerai su progetti di&lt;strong&gt; trasformazione digitale&lt;/strong&gt; in ambito Commercial Excellence, supportando i clienti nella progettazione e implementazione di soluzioni digitali per la gestione integrata dei processi commerciali. La posizione è basata presso la nostra sede di &lt;strong&gt;Firenze&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Partecipare a incontri con il cliente per &lt;strong&gt;mappare &lt;/strong&gt;come oggi gestisce prezzi, sconti e promozioni&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tradurre le esigenze&lt;/strong&gt; raccolte in documenti operativi come gap analysis e specifiche funzionali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Contribuire alla &lt;strong&gt;configurazione di piattaforme&lt;/strong&gt; come SAP, Akeron e Price Fx, impostando ad esempio le regole di calcolo prezzo, i flussi di approvazione degli sconti o le logiche di budget delle promozioni commerciali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Prendere parte ai &lt;strong&gt;test funzionali&lt;/strong&gt;, verificando concretamente che il sistema calcoli prezzi, sconti e commissioni nel modo corretto rispetto a quanto richiesto dal cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Affiancare il team nella fase di &lt;strong&gt;go-live&lt;/strong&gt; e nella preparazione di &lt;strong&gt;materiali di formazione&lt;/strong&gt; (manuali, guide operative) per gli utenti finali, come i team Sales o Trade Marketing del cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su progetti &lt;strong&gt;nazionali&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;internazionali&lt;/strong&gt;, collaborando con professionisti altamente qualificati e lavorando a stretto contatto con i nostri clienti del Consumer and Industrial Market, inclusi i settori Retail, Food &amp;amp; Drink, Consumer Products, Industrial and Manufacturing e Automotive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Hai conseguito una laurea triennale o magistrale, preferibilmente in &lt;strong&gt;Ingegneria Gestionale &lt;/strong&gt;o discipline affini&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Non è richiesta esperienza pregressa su SAP, Akeron o Price Fx: la formazione su questi strumenti avviene on the job, conta soprattutto la &lt;strong&gt;curiosità verso il funzionamento dei processi aziendali&lt;/strong&gt; e la voglia di imparare strumenti digitali complessi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Hai&lt;strong&gt; interesse per i sistemi informativi aziendali &lt;/strong&gt;e per le piattaforme digitali a supporto dei processi di business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Ti appassiona capire come le aziende gestiscono e ottimizzano i &lt;strong&gt;processi commerciali&lt;/strong&gt; attraverso&lt;strong&gt; strumenti digitali&lt;/strong&gt;, in particolare in ambiti come pricing, promozioni, gestione degli sconti e sistemi di incentivazione della forza vendita&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Hai una buona padronanza della lingua &lt;strong&gt;inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;stimolante e dinamico&lt;/strong&gt; che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt;, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt; avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Mindset &lt;strong&gt;internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere&lt;/strong&gt; psicofisico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;L&apos;opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto dell&apos;individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;. Creiamo un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee, dove i professionisti possono esprimere tutto il loro potenziale. Grazie all&apos;impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l&apos;Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. Nel nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; – Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) – trovi tutte le iniziative concrete che portiamo avanti su tematiche &lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt; (ambientali, sociali e di governance).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi! I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (GDPR). Per ulteriori informazioni, consulta l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A.&lt;/strong&gt; garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Looking for a job that&apos;s genuinely meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you&apos;ll have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues tackle and solve some of today&apos;s most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory provides consulting services to businesses, supporting them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitalization, risk analysis and management, as well as in extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;By joining the Enterprise Platforms Team, you will work on digital transformation projects in the Commercial Excellence space, supporting clients in the design and implementation of digital solutions for the integrated management of commercial processes. The position is based at our Florence office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be involved in:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Taking part in client meetings to map out how pricing, discounts, and promotions are currently managed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Translating the requirements gathered into operational documents such as gap analyses and functional specifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Contributing to the configuration of platforms such as SAP, Akeron, and Price Fx, for example by setting up price calculation rules, discount approval workflows, or trade promotion budget logic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Taking part in functional testing, concretely verifying that the system correctly calculates prices, discounts, and commissions according to the requirements defined&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Supporting the team during go-live and helping prepare training materials (manuals, user guides) for end users, such as the client&apos;s Sales or Trade Marketing teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;You will be involved in national and international projects, collaborating with highly skilled professionals and working closely with our Consumer and Industrial Market clients, including the Retail, Food &amp;amp; Drink, Consumer Products, Industrial and Manufacturing, and Automotive sectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Qualities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;This opportunity is right for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;You hold a Bachelor&apos;s or Master&apos;s degree, preferably in Management Engineering or a related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;No prior experience with SAP, Akeron, or Price Fx is required: training on these tools happens on the job, what matters most is curiosity about how business processes work and a willingness to learn complex digital tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;You have an interest in enterprise information systems and digital platforms supporting business processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;You&apos;re curious about how companies manage and optimize commercial processes through digital tools, particularly in areas such as pricing, promotions, discount management, and sales incentive systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;You&apos;re motivated to work in consulting, supporting companies in analyzing and improving processes and implementing software solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;You enjoy working on structured problems, analyzing data, and translating business needs into application solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;You have a good command of English, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You&apos;ll Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;An inclusive, fair work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that fosters creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;A hybrid work model, to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay continuously up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative project work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate&apos;s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In compliance with applicable law, we do not collect or use information about salaries received in current or previous employment relationships. Our selection processes are also based on objective and gender neutral criteria.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;T&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ogether for Better – Our Values and Our Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s Values. We create an environment open to the exchange of ideas, where professionals can express their full potential. Through our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network complies with ISO 30415 standards on Diversity and Inclusion Management Systems, and UNI PdR 125 on gender equality. In our Impact Plan – Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) – you can find all the concrete initiatives we carry out on ESG (environmental, social, and governance) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Join us! Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (GDPR). For more information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Firenze-Junior-Consultant-%28Stage%29-Digitalizzazione-processi-commerciali/1365722657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365722657</guid><g:id>1365722657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Firenze, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Deal Advisory M&amp;A Tax Consultant | Roma/Napoli (Napoli, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;− &lt;em&gt;Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Deal Advisory M&amp;amp;A Tax is a leading service line within KPMG in Italy. We serve the M&amp;amp;A tax market, assisting private capital houses and acquisitive corporates in their transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;As part of the team, you’ll provide support in a dynamic environment, enhancing your tax knowledge and analytical skills. You’ll be encouraged to think proactively and adopt a practical, transaction-oriented approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Your tasks will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;tax structuring of M&amp;amp;A deals and tax due diligence assignments;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;tax incentives and grants;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;routine tax advisory services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You’ll be involved in &lt;strong&gt;domestic &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;international projects&lt;/strong&gt;, working alongside highly qualified professionals and acquiring top-level skills, through interaction with the brightest minds in the field and clients who have exacting standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Profile&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;          &lt;em&gt;Education and Qualifications&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;gained a master’s degree in economics (LM-77 or LM-56) or law (LMG-01), with a final mark of at least 105/110;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;qualified (or are in the process of qualifying) as a chartered accountant (&lt;em&gt;dottore commercialista&lt;/em&gt;) and/or lawyer (&lt;em&gt;avvocato&lt;/em&gt;); &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience, Skills and Competencies&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;at least 3 years’ experience as a junior or senior tax specialist within a Big Four or top-tier advisory firm;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;the ability to work effectively in a dynamic and fast-paced environment, with a proactive and flexible approach;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;good analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to develop initial views on technical matters and seek guidance when needed;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;strong organizational and time-management skills, with the ability to multitask and meet deadlines;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a team-oriented mindset, and a willingness to collaborate and support colleagues across different projects;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;in the case of more experienced candidates, the ability to support and coach junior team members, contributing to their development and ensuring high-quality deliverables;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;an excellent command of English;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of Microsoft Office, especially Excel and PowerPoint.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Rome or Naples&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us − What You’ll Find at KPMG &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that fosters&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to support continuous learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An&lt;strong&gt; international outlook&lt;/strong&gt; and a focus on &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individual, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that foster an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge. KPMG supports all its people in reaching their full potential, whatever their identity or background. Fully committed to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, we are &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 compliant&lt;/strong&gt; (ISO 30415:2021 – Human Resources Management – Diversity and Inclusion). KPMG in Italy is also &lt;strong&gt;UNI/PdR 125 &lt;/strong&gt;compliant (UNI/PdR 125:2022 – measures to ensure gender equality in audit and assurance services). You can find a summary of all our concrete ESG (environmental, social, and governance) actions in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot;&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG in Italy is an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – &quot;GDPR&quot;) as subsequently amended. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy notice. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-CN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Napoli-Senior-Deal-Advisory-M&amp;A-Tax-Consultant-RomaNapoli/1354914757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1354914757</guid><g:id>1354914757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Napoli, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant, Assistant Manager - Monitoring Public, Assistenza Tecnica Fondi Strutturali (Palermo, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultant, Assistant Manager Monitoring Public – Assistenza Tecnica Fondi strutturali&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entrando a far parte dei nostri Team&lt;strong&gt; Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance &lt;/strong&gt;di&lt;strong&gt; Palermo &lt;/strong&gt;dedicato esclusivamente ai servizi per le amministrazioni pubbliche che supporta i propri clienti nel miglioramento dell’efficacia e dell’efficienza di processi e organizzazioni di innovazione digitale, indirizzando l’incremento delle &lt;em&gt;performance&lt;/em&gt; economico-finanziarie. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;attività di assistenza tecnica ai Programmi cofinanziati FESR/FSE per le amministrazioni centrali e/o regionali;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;definizione di modelli e sistemi per supportare la governance e la sana gestione finanziaria delle risorse del bilancio UE;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;progetti e studi internazionali per la Commissione Europea.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizzazione contabile e sistemi di controllo interno&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gestione e valutazioni team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ricerchiamo professionisti che abbiano una conoscenza di base su temi di politica e normativa comunitaria, assistenza tecnica ad Amministrazioni Pubbliche centrali e/o regionali nella programmazione, gestione, monitoraggio, controllo e rendicontazione dei Programmi cofinanziati con fondi Strutturali FESR/FSE.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Esperienza pregressa di 3 o 6 anni, in attività di assistenza tecnica&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;laurea magistrale (preferibilmente in materie economiche o indirizzo politico);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;interesse a lavorare su fondi nazionali e strutturali tematiche pubbliche.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;buona conoscenza del funzionamento della PA e dei modelli di sistemi di gestione e controllo dei programmi UE (AdG, AdC e AdA);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Office e, quale titolo preferenziale, di strumenti e tool di data visualization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La conoscenza pregressa di PowerBI verrà considerata come titolo preferenziale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultant, Assistant Manager Monitoring Public - Assistenza Tecnica Fondi strutturali&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to do work that’s truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you’ll have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues face and solve today’s most complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to businesses, assisting them in transforming business models, improving and digitizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, and supporting extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By Joining our &lt;strong&gt;Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance Teams in Palermo&lt;/strong&gt;, dedicated exclusively to services for public administrations, you’ll support our clients in enhancing the effectiveness and efficiency of processes and organizations, ultimately aiming to increase economic and financial performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particular, your role will involve:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing technical assistance for ERDF/ESF co-financed programs for central and/or regional administrations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing models and systems to support governance and sound financial management of EU budget resources;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engaging in international projects and studies for the European Commission;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on accounting organization and internal control systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking professionals with a foundational knowledge of community policy and regulations, experience in providing technical assistance to central and/or regional public administrations in programming, managing, monitoring, controlling, and reporting on programs co-financed by ERDF/ESF structural funds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3 to 6 years of previous experience&lt;/strong&gt; in technical assistance activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master’s degree&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably in Economics, Political Science, or related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in working on &lt;strong&gt;national and European Structural Funds&lt;/strong&gt; and public sector-related topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Public Administration (PA)&lt;/strong&gt; operations and of the &lt;strong&gt;management and control systems for EU-funded programmes&lt;/strong&gt;, including Managing Authorities (MA), Certifying Authorities (CA), and Audit Authorities (AA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent command of the &lt;strong&gt;English language&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office Suite&lt;/strong&gt; and, as a preferred qualification, familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;data visualization tools and platforms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience with &lt;strong&gt;Power BI&lt;/strong&gt; will be considered an asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive and equitable  work environment that respects, encourages, and &lt;strong&gt;values diversity;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic and stimulating environment that promotes &lt;strong&gt;creativity and teamwork;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work options, promoting a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to stay up-to-date;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An international mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultan position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community involvement, and integrity: these are KPMG’s core values, creating an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to reach their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks to our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network has obtained the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, confirming compliance with the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125 certification&lt;/strong&gt; for gender equality. Within our Impact Plan - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you’ll find an overview of our concrete actions on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, consult KPMG&apos;s privacy notice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is committed to equal opportunity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-VE1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Palermo-Senior-Consultant%2C-Assistant-Manager-Monitoring-Public%2C-Assistenza-Tecnica-Fondi-Strutturali/1366037457/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366037457</guid><g:id>1366037457</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Palermo, IT</g:location></item><item><title>IT Accounting (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Junior IT Application Accouting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Business Services&lt;/strong&gt; offre servizi interni all’organizzazione, supportando tutte le linee di servizio e coadiuvando i professionisti nella gestione delle attività quotidiane. In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di&lt;strong&gt; Accounting &amp;amp; Tax Application &lt;/strong&gt;del nostro dipartimento di IT interno di Milano, potrai occuparti dell’implementazione e del supporto su soluzioni IT per i servizi contabili e fiscali rivolti ai clienti.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Installazione e configurazione dei software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analisi funzionale, customizzazione e gestione di moderni applicativi in ambito contabile e fiscale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assistenza telefonica rivolta all’utente interno ed al Cliente;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporto tecnico/applicativo al team di lavoro&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risoluzione di anomalie e rilevazione dei malfunzionamenti;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contatti con i fornitori&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Semplici attività formative;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gestione di attività di testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sei un giovane brillante con 1 o 2 anni di esperienza nel ruolo e sei fortemente motivato a gestire e risolvere problematiche informatiche,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sei in possesso di un diploma in “Amministrazione, Finanza e Marketing” e/o di una laurea in materie scientifiche/tecnologiche;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai buona conoscenza dei Tools di Microsoft Office ed in particolare di Access, della programmazione VB e del linguaggio XML;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai buona conoscenza dei sistemi Windows, familiarità con il linguaggio SQL e i database relazionali;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possiedi una buona capacità di utilizzo di procedure informatiche per l’amministrazione e la gestione dei processi aziendali;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai capacità relazionali e comunicative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio III° livello; la retribuzione sarà definita e commisurata in relazione a criteri oggettivi quali competenze, esperienza effettiva maturata e aderenza ai requisiti richiesti per la posizione. In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Business Services S.r.l. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful?&lt;br&gt;At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to address and solve some of the most current and complex challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;KPMG Business Services provides internal services to the organization, supporting all service lines and assisting professionals in managing daily operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, by joining the &lt;strong&gt;Accounting &amp;amp; Tax Application Team&lt;/strong&gt; within our &lt;strong&gt;Internal IT Department in Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be involved in the &lt;strong&gt;implementation and support of IT solutions&lt;/strong&gt; for accounting and tax services aimed at clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Installing and configuring software;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Performing functional analysis, customization, and management of modern accounting and tax applications;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Providing telephone assistance to internal users and clients;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Offering technical and application support to the working team;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Troubleshooting issues and identifying malfunctions;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Managing contacts with suppliers;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Carrying out basic training activities;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Overseeing testing activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Qualities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity is ideal for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a bright young professional with 1–2 years of experience in a similar role and are highly motivated to manage and solve IT-related issues;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You hold a diploma in &lt;em&gt;Administration, Finance and Marketing&lt;/em&gt; and/or a degree in scientific or technological disciplines;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have a good command of Microsoft Office tools, particularly Access, as well as VB programming and XML language;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have a good knowledge of Windows systems, familiarity with SQL language and relational databases;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are skilled in using IT procedures for business administration and process management;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You possess strong interpersonal and communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An inclusive and equitable work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that fosters creativity and teamwork;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A hybrid work model to promote a healthy work–life balance;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay continuously updated;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, level III. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills, relevant experience and fulfilment of the requirements of the position. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity — these are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an open environment for sharing ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to fully express their potential. As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; – &lt;a href=&quot;https://bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/a&gt; – you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are taking in relation to environmental, social, and governance (ESG) matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your personal data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – “GDPR”) and subsequent amendments.&lt;br&gt;For further details, please refer to KPMG’s privacy notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Business Services S.r.l. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-AM1&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-IT-Accounting/1365975257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365975257</guid><g:id>1365975257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Information Technology Services</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>SENIOR AUDITOR - BOLZANO (Bolzano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Senior Auditor - Bolzano&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Nel rispetto dei valori di integrità e qualità, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offre un portafoglio di servizi integrato in costante evoluzione, con insight che consentono alle aziende di rispondere ai fabbisogni informativi del mercato e degli investitori. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Team Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; ti interfaccerai con clienti leader a livello nazionale e internazionale e potrai contribuire all’integrità e alla trasparenza dei mercati finanziari, garantendo l’indipendenza e la riservatezza fondamentale al loro corretto andamento. Grazie all’&lt;strong&gt;innovazione&lt;/strong&gt;, svolgerai un &lt;em&gt;audit&lt;/em&gt; conforme e attento ai &lt;strong&gt;temi ESG&lt;/strong&gt;, sempre più &lt;strong&gt;digitalizzato&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;integrato&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;automatizzato&lt;/strong&gt;, basato sull&apos;&lt;strong&gt;Intelligenza Artificiale &lt;/strong&gt;e sui &lt;strong&gt;Big Data&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolto/a in progetti che ti permetteranno di esplorare &lt;strong&gt;diverse realtà aziendali&lt;/strong&gt; (industriali o finanziarie) a 360°, intessere relazioni con i &lt;strong&gt;referenti delle società clienti&lt;/strong&gt; ed entrare a far parte di &lt;strong&gt;team strutturati&lt;/strong&gt; che ti supporteranno nella tua &lt;strong&gt;crescita professionale&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Hai conseguito una &lt;strong&gt;Laurea Magistrale&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Economia&lt;/strong&gt;/&lt;strong&gt;Finanza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Hai maturato &lt;strong&gt;2-3 anni di esperienza&lt;/strong&gt;, preferibilmente in società di &lt;strong&gt;Revisione contabile&lt;/strong&gt; o di Consulenza&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Hai acquisito una conoscenza dei &lt;strong&gt;Principi Contabili Italiani&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;IAS/IFRS, &lt;/strong&gt;oltre che dei principi di consolidamento e dei processi amministrativo contabili che sottendono alla predisposizione dell’&lt;strong&gt;informativa finanziaria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Hai interesse a lavorare su tematiche in ambito amministrazione, pianificazione e controllo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Hai un’ottima conoscenza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, preferibilmente avvalorata da esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero e un’ottima conoscenza del &lt;strong&gt;pacchetto Office.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; internazionale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL di ingresso compresa tra € 30.000 e € 37.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;----------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Senior Auditor - Bolzano&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. In line with the values of integrity and quality, KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance offers an integrated and constantly evolving portfolio of services, with insights that enable companies to meet the informational needs of the market and investors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;When you join &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;the &lt;strong&gt;Audit Team&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;background-color:#fafafa&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;you will collaborate with leading national and international clients and contribute to the integrity and transparency of financial markets, ensuring the confidentiality essential to their proper functioning. Thanks to &lt;strong&gt;innovation&lt;/strong&gt;, you will create an audit that is compliant and attentive to &lt;strong&gt;ESG issues&lt;/strong&gt;, increasingly &lt;strong&gt;digitalized&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;integrated&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;automated&lt;/strong&gt;, based on &lt;strong&gt;Artificial Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Big Data&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You have obtained a &lt;strong&gt;master’s degree in economics/finance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;2-3 years of experience,&lt;/strong&gt; preferably in auditing or consulting firms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You have acquired knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Italian Accounting Principles and IAS/IFRS&lt;/strong&gt;, as well as consolidation principles and administrative accounting processes underlying financial reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You are interested in working on &lt;strong&gt;administration, planning, and control topics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You have excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; language, preferably supported by study and/or work experiences abroad, and excellent knowledge of the Office suite.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive, fair work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages, and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity and teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; work mode to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training and development&lt;/strong&gt; programs to stay up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental &lt;strong&gt;well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €30,000 to €37,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&apos;s Values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to express their full &lt;strong&gt;potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. In our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG - you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;KPMG&apos;s privacy policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-SZ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Bolzano-SENIOR-AUDITOR-BOLZANO/1366453557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366453557</guid><g:id>1366453557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Audit</g:job_function><g:location>Bolzano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Digital Finance Transformation (Torino, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Digital Finance Transformation&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Turin&lt;/strong&gt;, you will interact with top-tier professionals and clients, laying the foundations for your career in a collaborative and stimulating environment focused on individual growth and open to dialogue.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will work with expert colleagues that provide functional advice on corporate performance management systems, assisting clients in the analysis, review and design of processes supporting the CFO and the subsequent development of technological platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;redefining &lt;strong&gt;enterprise performance management strategies&lt;/strong&gt; for leading Italian and international companies, assisting the CFO redesign the performance model;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;analysing and defining the new functional requirements of &lt;strong&gt;budgeting, forecasting, long-term planning, sales and operational planning and product costing processes&lt;/strong&gt; and implementing innovative performance management solutions;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;designing IT solutions for finance and business processes&lt;/strong&gt; and providing support in the implementation stage, in consultation with the top EPM tool providers on the market (Oracle, Tagetik, Board and OneStream);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;monitoring &lt;strong&gt;pre- and post-transformation performance&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;generation of functional analysis documents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;master&apos;s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Business Administration or Management Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, with excellent results;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; language, preferably supported by studies and/or work experience abroad, and proficiency in the &lt;strong&gt;MS Office&lt;/strong&gt; suite;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;knowledge of the following topics: &lt;strong&gt;Control Models, Budgeting and Forecasting, Consolidated Financial Statements, Financial Planning&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;experience with modules of solutions such as Board, Tagetik CPM, SAP BPC, or Oracle Hyperion will be considered a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a style=&quot;color:blue;text-decoration:underline&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MS2&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Torino-Junior-Consultant-Digital-Finance-Transformation/1367355157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367355157</guid><g:id>1367355157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Torino, IT</g:location></item><item><title>KPMG Open Platform | Risk - Security Senior Analyst - Napoli (Napoli, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Open Platform&lt;/strong&gt; è il nostro nuovo Hub innovativo con sede a &lt;strong&gt;Napoli &lt;/strong&gt;creato per sviluppare modelli di servizio e soluzioni ad alto contenuto tecnologico per le imprese e la Pubblica Amministrazione. Le aree di intervento includono Cyber Security, Program Management su grandi cantieri di trasformazione del settore Pubblico, Application Maintenance e Managed Services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Team Cyber &amp;amp; Tech Risk&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, avrai il compito di supportare le imprese nella gestione dei rischi cyber a cui sono soggette, unendo le proprie conoscenze e la propria passione per la tecnologia con le competenze sul mondo aziendale che caratterizzano tutti i professionisti di KPMG.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;L’ambito dei servizi KPMG offerti dal team Cyber Security copre tutte le esigenze più attuali delle organizzazioni, a partire dall’indirizzo della sicurezza delle informazioni, la gestione e valutazione del rischio, la definizione di requisiti e la valutazione di conformità a normative e standard di settore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Supervisionare e guidare il team di cyber security, fornendo supporto, mentoring e valutazioni delle prestazioni&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Collaborare con team internazionali ed interfunzionali per valutare i rischi ed implementare controlli efficaci&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Utilizzare metodologie di raccolta, analisi e diffusione delle informazioni sulle minacce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Identificare, monitorare e valutare le TTP attraverso l&apos;analisi di fonti aperte e proprietarie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Utilizzare strumenti e tecniche per la modellazione delle minacce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Produrre report chiari e dettagliati basati sui dati di intelligence sulle minacce per i 3 livelli CTI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Soluzioni di cybersecurity e mitigazione del rischio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Utilizzare lo standard STIX/TAXII per la scambio di informazioni sulle minacce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Avrai l’opportunità di crescere professionalmente e affrontare sfide stimolanti, partecipando a progetti che mirano ad aiutare i prestigiosi clienti del nostro network a gestire le sfide più complesse legate a momenti di discontinuità e trasformazione, contribuendo al loro successo.&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You  Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai conoscenza approfondita di linguaggi di programmazione e strumenti correlati (Python, C/C++, Bash)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi certificazioni riconosciute nel campo della sicurezza informatica come Certified Information Systems Security Professional (CISSP), Certified Information Security Manager (CISM) o equivalenti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai maturato 3-5 anni di esperienza.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi conoscenza approfondita del Mitre/Attack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi conoscenza approfondita di sicurezza di rete, cloud e applicazioni&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza con strumenti di sicurezza (ad esempio, SIEM, IDS/IPS, EDR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza nella gestione di incidenti di sicurezza e nella risoluzione di problemi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi ottime capacità di comunicazione, in grado di trasmettere informazioni tecniche in modo chiaro e comprensibile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai capacità di lavorare in gruppo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi flessibilità e capacità di adattarsi a un ambiente di lavoro dinamico.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai un orientamento alla risoluzione dei problemi con una mentalità analitica.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi un atteggiamento proattivo nell&apos;apprendimento continuo e nello sviluppo delle competenze.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG Open Platform&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un’organizzazione che si impegna per generare un &lt;strong&gt;impatto sociale&lt;/strong&gt; e sul &lt;strong&gt;territorio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 36.000 per la qualifica di Senior Analyst e tra € 36.000 e € 42.000 per la qualifica di Supervisor Analyst, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti&lt;strong&gt; ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Open Platform | Risk - Security Senior Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Open Platform is our new innovation hub based in Naples, created with a view to developing high-tech service models and solutions for businesses and the public administration. The consultancy areas include cyber security, program management on large transformation projects in the public sector, application maintenance and managed services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Members of the Cyber &amp;amp; Tech Risk team are responsible for supporting companies in the management of the cyber risks to which they are exposed, combining their knowledge and passion for technology with the business expertise of all KPMG professionals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG’s cyber security services cover all the most topical needs of organisations, from cybersecurity and risk management and assessment, to the definition of requirements for and the assessment of compliance with sector legislation and standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;supervising and leading the cyber security team, supporting and mentoring team members and reviewing their performance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;collaborating with international and interfunctional teams to assess risks and implement effective controls;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;applying methodologies for the collection, analysis and dissemination of information on cyber threats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;identifying, monitoring and assessing TTPs through the analysis of open and proprietary sources;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;using threat modelling tools and techniques;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;producing clear and detailed reports based on threat intelligence data for the three CTI levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;cybersecurity and risk mitigation solutions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;using the STIX/TAXII standard to share information on threats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will have the opportunity to grow professionally and take on stimulating challenges, participating in projects that aim to help our network’s most prestigious clients manage the most complex challenges related to instances of discontinuity and transformation, thus contributing to their success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;in-depth knowledge of programming languages and related tools (Python, C/C++, Bash);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;recognised IT security certifications such as Certified Information Systems Security Professional (CISSP), Certified Information Security Manager (CISM) or equivalent certificates;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;three to five years of experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;in-depth knowledge of Mitre/Attack;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;in-depth knowledge of network, cloud and application security;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;experience with security tools (e.g. SIEM, IDS/IPS, EDR);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;experience in security incident management and troubleshooting;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;excellent communication skills and the ability to convey technical information in a clear and comprehensible manner;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;the ability to work in a team;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;flexibility and the ability to adapt to a dynamic working environment;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a problem-solving mindset and analytical approach;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a proactive attitude for continuous learning and skill development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG Open Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive and equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programmes to stay up-to-date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset and innovative projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An organisation that strives to make a social and local impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €36,000 for the Senior Analyst position and from €36,000 to €42,000 for the Supervisor Analyst position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better - Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the KPMG values that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our network complies with the standards of ISO 30415 certification, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125 relating to gender equality. Our concrete actions on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues are summarized in our Impact Plan - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-AA1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Napoli-KPMG-Open-Platform-Risk-Security-Senior-Analyst-Napoli/808859402/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">808859402</guid><g:id>808859402</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Napoli, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Consultant - Tech Risk | Padova (Padova, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Nel rispetto dei valori di integrità e qualità,&lt;strong&gt; KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance &lt;/strong&gt;offre un portafoglio di servizi integrato in costante evoluzione, con insight che consentono alle aziende di rispondere ai fabbisogni informativi del mercato e degli investitori. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk&lt;/strong&gt;, linea di servizi di KPMG che ha anticipato e seguito nel tempo le richieste del mercato relative alle tematiche di Information Risk Management e Sicurezza Informatica, sviluppando costantemente le competenze e capacità di analisi a protezione del patrimonio informativo aziendale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Comprendere il contesto tecnologico e di business dei clienti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Mappare i processi business ed IT, identificandone i rischi e definendo il giusto approccio per mitigarli &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Analizzare le nuove tecnologie e capirne i rischi specifici&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Identificare i dati chiave e definire i controlli per renderli affidabili e sicuri&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;I professionisti appartenenti al team CTR di KPMG supportano le organizzazioni in tutte le fasi necessarie a garantire la sicurezza delle loro informazioni e delle loro strategie di business. Possiamo affiancare i nostri clienti per migliorare la crescita e creare valore. Possiamo aiutarli a fare i giusti investimenti nel momento giusto, a considerare le implicazioni più ampie della digital disruption, ad integrare tecnologie innovative nelle infrastrutture esistenti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Sei un laureando/neolaureato magistrale in Ingegneria Gestionale, Management dell’innovazione, Management ecc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Passione per le nuove tecnologie e la loro declinazione nei contesti aziendali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Competenze nella comprensione e analisi dei processi aziendali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Capacità di analisi dei dati e di sintesi nella presentazione dei risultati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Interesse per l&apos;ambito dei Sistemi Informativi aziendali, intesi quale strumento abilitante per l&apos;efficace erogazione dei processi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Predisposizione per la risoluzione di problemi complessi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Proattività, flessibilità e capacità di adattamento a contesti eterogenei e sfidanti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Hai una buona padronanza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a viaggiare sul territorio nazionale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; internazionale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ / L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso compresa tra € 28.000 e € 31.500, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. In keeping with the values of integrity and quality&lt;strong&gt;, KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offers an integrated and constantly evolving portfolio of services, with insights that allow companies to respond to the informational/reporting needs of the market and investors. The &lt;strong&gt;Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk&lt;/strong&gt; team handles the KPMG line of services that pre-empted and continues to meet market demand for information risk management and cybersecurity services, continually developing the analytical skills and expertise to protect company information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;understanding clients’ technological and business context;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;mapping business and IT processes, identifying their risks and developing the right approach to mitigate them; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;analysing new technologies and understanding their specific risks;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;identifying key data and defining controls to guarantee they are reliable and secure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;The members of KPMG’s CTR team support organisations across all phases of the process to ensure the security of their information and business strategies. We help our clients drive growth and generate value.  We can help them make the right investments at the right time, consider the broader implications of the digital disruption and build breakthrough innovations into their legacy infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;or will soon have a master’s degree in management engineering, innovation management, management, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;a passion for new technologies and their application in corporate settings;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;expertise in understanding and analysing company processes;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;an ability to analyse and summarise data when reporting findings;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;an interest in corporate IT systems as enablers for the effective performance of processes; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;an aptitude for complex problem solving;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;proactiveness, flexibility and an ability to adapt to different challenging situations;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of English, preferably with study/work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;availability to travel within Italy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;A challenging and &lt;strong&gt;dynamic environment&lt;/strong&gt; that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay up-to-date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; and innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship with a monthly allowance of €800 / This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary  ranging from €28,000 to €31,500. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the KPMG values that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality Within our Impact Plan - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Padova-Consultant-Tech-Risk-Padova/1357997157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1357997157</guid><g:id>1357997157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Padova, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Business Transformation (Torino, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Business Trasformation&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Turin&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be placed in a fast-growing team full of talent, which is characterized by the quality and impact of its transformative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will be involved in major discontinuity projects for major national and international clients, in direct contact with the top management of leading companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Rethinking the &lt;strong&gt;operating models&lt;/strong&gt; of key business functions (Finance, HR, Procurement, Supply Chain) through &lt;strong&gt;organizational and operational levers&lt;/strong&gt;. The goal is to implement models that can &lt;strong&gt;improve business performanc&lt;/strong&gt;e in alignment with business strategies;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Supporting &lt;strong&gt;organizational redesign and process re-engineering initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; through change management pathways, providing levers to address change and unlocking its full potential to be an integral part of the business transformation;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Evaluating &lt;strong&gt;the impacts and expected benefits of implemented initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, monitoring pre- and post-transformative performance, and initiating targeted plans to close identified gaps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Management, Business Administration&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Management Engineering;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An excellent knowledge of English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color:blue;text-decoration:underline&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#&lt;strong&gt;LI-MM3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Torino-Junior-Consultant-Business-Transformation/1367485557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367485557</guid><g:id>1367485557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Torino, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant Business Transformation (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Business Transformation&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be placed in a fast-growing team full of talent, which is characterized by the quality and impact of its transformative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You will be involved in major discontinuity projects for major national and international clients, in direct contact with the top management of leading companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Rethinking the &lt;strong&gt;operating models&lt;/strong&gt; of key business functions (Finance, HR, Procurement, Supply Chain) through &lt;strong&gt;organizational and operational levers&lt;/strong&gt;. The goal is to implement models that can &lt;strong&gt;improve business performanc&lt;/strong&gt;e in alignment with business strategies;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Supporting &lt;strong&gt;organizational redesign and process re-engineering initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; through change management pathways, providing levers to address change and unlocking its full potential to be an integral part of the business transformation;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Evaluating &lt;strong&gt;the impacts and expected benefits of implemented initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, monitoring pre- and post-transformative performance, and initiating targeted plans to close identified gaps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Management, Business Administration&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Management Engineering;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2 to 3 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in business transformation, process optimization or organizational redesign projects, ideally within a consulting environment;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;leadership abilities in coordinating teams and in client management; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;an excellent knowldege of English,&lt;/strong&gt; ideally with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-LZ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-Consultant-Business-Transformation/825100902/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">825100902</guid><g:id>825100902</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Facility Coordinator (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi un lavoro significativo, che possa fare la differenza? In KPMG potrai avere l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, colleghe e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere sfide complesse. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Business Services offre servizi interni all’organizzazione del network italiano KPMG, supportando le diverse società e coadiuvando i professionisti nella gestione delle proprie attività  In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team Facility management, come Facility Coordinator presso la nostra sede di Roma, a riporto della leadership dell’ufficio e in coordinamento con il Facility Manager di network, sarai responsabile di fornire i più alti standard di assistenza diretta e di supporto alla Leadership e ai componenti del Management Group. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Coordinare le attività di gestione operativa delle strutture aziendali, assicurando che gli edifici, le attrezzature e i servizi siano efficienti, sicuri e allineati con gli obiettivi del Network - inclusi la manutenzione ordinaria e straordinaria, la gestione dei contratti di fornitori esterni e la supervisione della sicurezza fisica degli edifici.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Guidare il team di Facility Management (sedi RM e NA) garantendo un&apos;efficace collaborazione e formazione continua.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sviluppare e monitorare il budget operativo, assicurando il rispetto dei costi. Pianificare gli interventi di manutenzione ordinaria e straordinaria delle strutture al fine di garantirne la completa fruibilità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Pianificare e gestire progetti di ristrutturazione, riqualificazione, space management, monitorando tempi e costi per garantire il completamento entro i parametri concordati.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestire lo space management con pianificazione, allocazione e corretto utilizzo degli spazi, facendo leva sulle piattaforme di riferimento.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Selezionare, negoziare e monitorare in collaborazione con il Procurement department, i fornitori esterni per i servizi di manutenzione, pulizia, sicurezza e altri servizi al building e alle persone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Garantire che le attività di competenza siano conformi a leggi, normative di sicurezza e politiche aziendali. Gestire gli audit sulla security e relative alle certificazioni.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Implementare pratiche di sostenibilità all&apos;interno della gestione delle strutture, con specifico focus su risparmio energetico, efficienza dei consumi, gestione dei rifiuti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Collaborare con altri dipartimenti aziendali per supportare le loro esigenze logistiche e infrastrutturali, inclusi IT, HR e Operation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As you Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai almeno 5-7 anni di esperienza nel settore della gestione delle strutture, con una comprovata esperienza in un ruolo di coordinamento.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai una laurea in Ingegneria, Architettura, Management delle strutture o equivalente.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai conoscenza approfondita dei sistemi di gestione degli edifici (es. HVAC, impianti elettrici, security, ecc), delle normative locali e nazionali e dei principi di sostenibilità ambientale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza nella gestione di budget, nella pianificazione di progetti e nella supervisione di team multidisciplinari.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai doti di comunicazione e capacità di lavorare in modo collaborativo con le diverse funzioni aziendali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai conoscenza di software di gestione delle strutture (es. CAFM, CMMS, CAD) e di Microsoft Office Suite.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai una buona conoscenza della lingua inglese.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di formazione e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale e progettualità innovative;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul benessere psicofisico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio I° livello; la retribuzione sarà definita e commisurata in relazione a criteri oggettivi quali competenze, esperienza effettiva maturata e aderenza ai requisiti richiesti per la posizione. In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le certificazioni ISO 30415, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro Impact Plan - bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Business services S.r.l. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Business Services provides internal services to the organization, supporting all service lines and assisting professionals in managing daily activities. Specifically, by joining the Facility Management Team as a Facility Coordinator, reporting to office leadership and in coordination with the network&apos;s Facility Manager, you will be responsible for providing the highest standards of direct assistance and support to the Leadership and the Management Group members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be responsible for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Coordinating all operational management activities of corporate facilities, ensuring that buildings, equipment, and services are efficient, safe, and aligned with Network goals—including ordinary and extraordinary maintenance, managing external supplier contracts, and supervising the physical security of buildings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Supervising and leading the Facility Management team (Rome and Naples offices), ensuring effective collaboration and continuous training (continuous improvement).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Developing and monitoring the operating budget, ensuring cost compliance. Planning ordinary and extraordinary maintenance interventions to ensure full usability of facilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Planning and managing renovation, refurbishment, and space management projects, monitoring timelines and costs to ensure completion within agreed parameters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Managing space planning, allocation, and efficient use of spaces, leveraging reference platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Selecting, negotiating, and monitoring, in collaboration with the Procurement department, the performance of external suppliers for maintenance, cleaning, security, and other building and people-related services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ensuring that all operations comply with laws, safety regulations, and corporate policies. Managing security audits and certification-related audits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Implementing sustainability practices in facility management, focusing on energy savings, efficiency, and waste management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Collaborating with other corporate departments to support their logistical and infrastructure needs, including IT, HR, and Operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Attributes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have at least 5-7 years of experience in facility management, with proven experience in a coordination role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You hold a degree in Engineering, Architecture, Facility Management, or equivalent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have in-depth knowledge of building management systems (e.g., HVAC, electrical systems, security, etc.), local and national regulations, and environmental sustainability principles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have experience in budget management, project planning, and supervising multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You possess excellent communication skills and the ability to collaborate effectively with various corporate functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You are proficient in facility management software (e.g., CAFM, CMMS, CAD) and the Microsoft Office Suite.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have a good command of the English language.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that fosters creativity and teamwork;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A hybrid work model to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to keep your skills up to date;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on psychological and physical well-being.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community commitment, and integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s values that create an environment open to exchanging ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to fully express their potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, level I. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills, relevant experience and fulfilment of the requirements of the position. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network has obtained ISO 30415 certification, attesting to compliance with the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125 certification, which certifies gender equality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In our Impact Plan - bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG - you’ll find a summary of all the concrete actions we are undertaking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join Us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Business Services S.r.l. guarantees equal opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Facility-Coordinator/1367155657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367155657</guid><g:id>1367155657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Facility Management</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Auditor - Categorie Protette Firenze (Firenze, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG is where Auditors become AI enthusiasts&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Nel rispetto dei valori di integrità e qualità, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offre un portafoglio di servizi integrato in costante evoluzione, con insight che consentono alle aziende di rispondere ai fabbisogni informativi del mercato e degli investitori.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt;, ti interfaccerai con clienti leader a livello nazionale e internazionale e potrai contribuire all’integrità e alla trasparenza dei mercati finanziari, garantendo l’indipendenza e la riservatezza fondamentale al loro corretto andamento. Grazie all’&lt;strong&gt;innovazione&lt;/strong&gt;, svolgerai un &lt;em&gt;audit&lt;/em&gt; conforme e attento ai &lt;strong&gt;temi ESG&lt;/strong&gt;, sempre più &lt;strong&gt;digitalizzato&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;integrato&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;automatizzato&lt;/strong&gt;, basato sull&apos;&lt;strong&gt;Intelligenza Artificiale &lt;/strong&gt;e sui &lt;strong&gt;Big Data&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Hlk172040557&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mappare i &lt;strong&gt;principali cicli aziendali &lt;/strong&gt;dei clienti attraverso colloqui con il personale amministrativo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verificare l’adeguatezza dei controlli interni delle imprese &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analizzare e verificare le diverse &lt;strong&gt;aree di bilancio&lt;/strong&gt; delle aziende clienti, predisposte in accordo ai principi contabili nazionali (OIC) o internazionali (IAS - IFRS) in base a quanto definito dai principi di revisione applicabili&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applicare la metodologia di revisione aziendale con il supporto di &lt;strong&gt;tecnologie di analisi dati avanzate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sarai coinvolto/a in progetti che ti permetteranno di esplorare &lt;strong&gt;diverse realtà aziendali&lt;/strong&gt; (industriali o finanziarie) a 360°, intessere relazioni con i &lt;strong&gt;referenti delle società clienti&lt;/strong&gt; ed entrare a far parte di &lt;strong&gt;team strutturati&lt;/strong&gt; che ti supporteranno nella tua &lt;strong&gt;crescita professionale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai o stai per conseguire una &lt;strong&gt;Laurea &lt;/strong&gt;in &lt;strong&gt;Economia/Finanza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai una buona conoscenza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai voglia di &lt;strong&gt;imparare&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;mettere in pratica&lt;/strong&gt; ciò che hai studiato&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sei un &lt;strong&gt;team player&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai voglia di &lt;strong&gt;migliorare &lt;/strong&gt;le tue&lt;strong&gt; capacità relazionali &lt;/strong&gt;e&lt;strong&gt; comunicative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sei iscritto/a alle liste Categorie Protette Art.1 lg. 68/99&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ci impegniamo a fornire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo e ad accogliere richieste specifiche di adattamento per soddisfare le esigenze individuali dei nostri dipendenti.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Troverai inoltre:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un percorso che ti aiuterà a &lt;strong&gt;riconoscere&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;sviluppare&lt;/strong&gt; le &lt;strong&gt;competenze&lt;/strong&gt; ed aree di miglioramento&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e programmi di sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL di ingresso compresa tra € 25.500 e € 28.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG is where Auditors become AI enthusiasts&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. In line with the values of integrity and quality, KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance offers an integrated and constantly evolving portfolio of services, providing insights that enable companies to meet the informational needs of the market and investors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join the &lt;strong&gt;Audit Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will collaborate with leading national and international clients and contribute to the integrity and transparency of financial markets, ensuring the confidentiality essential to their proper functioning. Thanks to &lt;strong&gt;innovation&lt;/strong&gt;, you will create an audit that is compliant and attentive to &lt;strong&gt;ESG issues&lt;/strong&gt;, increasingly &lt;strong&gt;digitalized&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;integrated&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;automated&lt;/strong&gt;, based on &lt;strong&gt;Artificial Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Big Data&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mapping of &lt;strong&gt;key business cycles&lt;/strong&gt; of clients through interviews with administrative staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assessing the adequacy of internal controls within companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzing and verifying various areas of &lt;strong&gt;client companies&apos; financial statements&lt;/strong&gt;, prepared in accordance with national accounting standards (OIC) or international standards (IAS - IFRS) as defined by applicable auditing principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing the audit methodology with the support of &lt;strong&gt;advanced data analysis technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be involved in projects that will allow you to explore &lt;strong&gt;various business environments&lt;/strong&gt; (industrial or financial) comprehensively, build relationships with &lt;strong&gt;client company representatives&lt;/strong&gt;, and become part of &lt;strong&gt;structured teams&lt;/strong&gt; that will support your &lt;strong&gt;professional growth&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have or are about to obtain a &lt;strong&gt;degree&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Economics/Finance&lt;/strong&gt; (priority will be given to Master&apos;s degree students or graduates)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;eager to learn and apply&lt;/strong&gt; what you have studied&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a &lt;strong&gt;team player&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;keen to improve&lt;/strong&gt; your &lt;strong&gt;interpersonal and communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Registration in the Protected Categories Lists Art.1 Law 68/99.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work environment is designed to be inclusive and accessible to everyone. We are proud to offer a &lt;strong&gt;barrier-free facility&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure that all individuals, regardless of their physical abilities, can work in a comfortable and safe environment. Our office features include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access ramps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accessible elevators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accessible restrooms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ergonomic workstations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to providing an inclusive work environment and accommodating specific adaptation requests to meet the individual needs of our employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also find:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A path that will help you &lt;strong&gt;identify &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;develop&lt;/strong&gt; your &lt;strong&gt;skills &lt;/strong&gt;and areas for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary ranging from €25,500 to €28,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Firenze-Junior-Auditor-Categorie-Protette-Firenze/1350615157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1350615157</guid><g:id>1350615157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Audit</g:job_function><g:location>Firenze, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Internship - Governance Risk &amp; Compliance | Roma (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Internship – Governance Risk &amp;amp; Compliance | Roma&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di &lt;strong&gt;Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt; di &lt;strong&gt;Roma &lt;/strong&gt;potrai aiutare le aziende a trasformare i &lt;strong&gt;rischi in opportunità&lt;/strong&gt; per migliorare la loro organizzazione e l’evoluzione dei loro sistemi di governance, ottenendo un vantaggio competitivo e offrendo soluzioni integrate e approcci innovativi per la gestione strategica del rischio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I progetti si concentreranno su:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;sviluppare e applicare modelli di valutazione del rischio di conformità;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;sviluppare e applicare modelli di valutazione del rischio di riciclaggio di denaro e finanziamento del terrorismo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;studiare la legislazione del settore bancario e le sue applicazioni e implicazioni sui processi e le procedure;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;sviluppare e applicare modelli di controllo remoto per il riconoscimento di potenziali condotte irregolari e frodi (interne ed esterne);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;audit interni;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;governance interna e sistemi di controllo interno (ad es. Solvency II/CRD IV);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;protezione dei clienti (ad es. IDD/Mifid 2);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;sostenibilità (ad es. Regolamento UE 2019/2088 e 2020/852).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su &lt;strong&gt;progetti nazionali &lt;/strong&gt;e&lt;strong&gt; internazionali&lt;/strong&gt; al fianco di professioniste e professionisti altamente qualificati e lavorerai a stretto contatto con i nostri clienti del settore dei &lt;strong&gt;Financial Services&lt;/strong&gt;, tra cui banche, assicurazioni e società di investimento.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• una laurea in economia e gestione aziendale;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• ottima conoscenza degli intermediari finanziari;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• interesse per la legislazione bancaria/assicurativa;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• interesse per la conformità e l’audit interno;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• ottima conoscenza dell’inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all’estero;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• ottima conoscenza di Microsoft Office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Opportunità di stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a title=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters -&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful?KPMG Advisory’s Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance team helps companies transform risks into opportunities for the improvement of their organisation and evolution of their governance systems to gain a competitive edge and offer integrated solutions and innovative approaches for strategic risk management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining our Risk &amp;amp; Compliance team in &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be involved in compliance projects in the Financial Services sector. Your experience will be put to full use, making you the point person for leading Italian and international clients. Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and applying compliance risk assessment models;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and applying money laundering and terrorism financing risk assessment models;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Studying banking sector legislation and its applications and implications on processes and procedures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and applying remote control models for the recognition of potential irregular conduct and fraud (internal and external);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting internal audits;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhancing internal governance and internal control systems (e.g., Solvency II/CRD IV);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring customer protection (e.g., IDD/MiFID II);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promoting sustainability (e.g., EU Reg 2019/2088 and 2020/852).&lt;br&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a degree in business and management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent knowledge of financial intermediaries;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are interested in banking/insurance legislation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are interested in compliance and internal audit;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a problem solver and never lose sight of your goals. You have strong interpersonal skills and are a team player. Your motivation and enthusiasm inspire confidence and empower change. You enjoy taking on challenges and are comfortable in fast-changing situations where your leadership abilities make the difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive and equitable work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced training and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International mindset and innovative projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Paid internship opportunity offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity. These are the KPMG values that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential. As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy. KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-FN3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Internship-Governance-Risk-&amp;-Compliance-Roma/1368215057/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368215057</guid><g:id>1368215057</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Governance &amp; Innovation Senior Consultant (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Innovation Senior Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;, you will join our&lt;strong&gt; Operations team&lt;/strong&gt; with the mission of leading complex digital transformation programs and ensuring effective governance on innovation-driven projects. You will support our clients in activities with a focus on innovation challenges, leveraging your &lt;strong&gt;management and technical skills&lt;/strong&gt;. Directly interacting with our customers, you will lead &lt;strong&gt;digital transformation&lt;/strong&gt; decisions with a strong eye on &lt;strong&gt;both business and technology&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will help our customers to drive the change with specific tasks:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Governance models to support &lt;strong&gt;innovation and digital initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; in line with leading practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Provide support for complex innovation initiatives across digital and application domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Deﬁne, establish, and evolve models for the governance of complex, multi-stakeholder project portfolios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Develop methodologies for monitoring, reporting, and controlling project performance, ensuring alignment with KPIs, milestones, and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Drive the deﬁnition and continuous &lt;strong&gt;improvement of digital processes&lt;/strong&gt;, translating business requirements into actionable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Coordinate multidisciplinary teams and engage with senior internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Contribute to the growth of the practice through knowledge sharing, mentoring, and thought leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or other STEM disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;At least 4-6 years of experience in &lt;strong&gt;Governance and Innovation&lt;/strong&gt; within corporate or consulting environments, with a particular interest in technological field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Effective knowledge of digital transformation projects with proven &lt;strong&gt;management and technical skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills in both Italian and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 36.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Solid knowledge of Governance methodologies (e.g. PMI, PRINCE2, Agile/SAFe, Scrum)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Understanding of frameworks and international standards (e.g. ITIL, COBIT, ISO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Technical certifications (TOGAF, Cloud, AI or Data related)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;regulated industries&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., energy, telco, financial services)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;advanced PMO tools&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Clarity PPM, MS Project Online, Jira/Confluence)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-MC2&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Governance-&amp;-Innovation-Senior-Consultant/1351435357/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1351435357</guid><g:id>1351435357</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant - SAP FI (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza per affiancare le organizzazioni nella trasformazione dei processi, nella digitalizzazione e nell’adozione di soluzioni SAP a supporto del cambiamento.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platforms&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai coinvolta/o in progetti di implementazione in ambito &lt;strong&gt;SAP FI&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;Financial Accounting&lt;/strong&gt;) per clienti del &lt;strong&gt;Settore Pubblico&lt;/strong&gt;, contribuendo all’analisi dei requisiti e alla&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;definizione della soluzione a supporto dei processi amministrativo-contabili e delle attività di chiusura.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Raccolta e analisi dei requisiti attraverso &lt;strong&gt;workshop&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;interviste&lt;/strong&gt; con le strutture Business e IT del cliente.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supporto al disegno del modello to-be e alla &lt;strong&gt;progettazione&lt;/strong&gt; della soluzione SAP più idonea, in coerenza con i processi e i vincoli del contesto pubblico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Configurazione (customizing) di &lt;strong&gt;SAP FI&lt;/strong&gt; e collaborazione con il team progettuale per garantire la coerenza della soluzione end-to-end, incluse eventuali integrazioni con altri moduli o sistemi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Redazione e aggiornamento della &lt;strong&gt;documentazione funzionale &lt;/strong&gt;e tecnico-funzionale, comprendente&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;processi, specifiche, tracciabilità requisiti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Esecuzione e supporto alle&lt;strong&gt; fasi di test &lt;/strong&gt;(SIT/UAT), supporto &lt;strong&gt;alle attività di&lt;/strong&gt; cutover, go-live e stabilizzazione post avvio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supporto, ove previsto, alle attività di &lt;strong&gt;preparazione&lt;/strong&gt; e m&lt;strong&gt;igrazione dei dati,&lt;/strong&gt; nonché alle &lt;strong&gt;riconciliazioni&lt;/strong&gt; contabili in ambito Finance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Lavorerai a stretto contatto con clienti del &lt;strong&gt;settore pubblico&lt;/strong&gt;, in contesti di Pubblica Amministrazione centrale e locale, enti regolatori, sanità, istruzione e società a partecipazione pubblica.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai maturato&lt;strong&gt; esperienza&lt;/strong&gt; su progetti &lt;strong&gt;implementativi in ambito&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;SAP&lt;/strong&gt; con focus su &lt;strong&gt;SAP FI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai maturato esperienza nelle attività&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;di analisi dei requisiti, supporto al disegno della soluzione, customizing, esecuzione dei test e supporto al go‑live in &lt;strong&gt;progetti di implementazione&lt;/strong&gt; o &lt;strong&gt;rollout&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona conoscenza dei principali ambiti di &lt;strong&gt;configurazione&lt;/strong&gt; FI (FI/GL, FI/AP, FI/AR, FI/AA); l’esposizione alle &lt;strong&gt;integrazioni&lt;/strong&gt; con CO, MM e SD rappresenta un plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Buona conoscenza della lingua &lt;strong&gt;inglese&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 36.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;equo &lt;/strong&gt;e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;stimolante &lt;/strong&gt;e &lt;strong&gt;dinamico &lt;/strong&gt;che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibrida&lt;/strong&gt;, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione &lt;/strong&gt;e &lt;strong&gt;sviluppo &lt;/strong&gt;avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale &lt;/strong&gt;e progettualità innovative.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 36.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager&lt;/span&gt; , determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want a job that is truly meaningful and impactful? At &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues tackle and solve today’s most pressing and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; provides consulting services to support organizations in process transformation, digitalization, and the adoption of SAP solutions that enable change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;In particular, by joining the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platforms Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be involved in &lt;strong&gt;SAP FI (Financial Accounting) &lt;/strong&gt;implementation projects for &lt;strong&gt;Public Sector clients&lt;/strong&gt;, contributing to requirements analysis and to defining solutions that support administrative and accounting processes and period-end closing activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be responsible for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gathering &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;analyzing requirements &lt;/strong&gt;through workshops and interviews with the client’s Business and IT teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supporting the design &lt;/strong&gt;of the target operating model (to-be) and the definition of the most suitable SAP solution, in line with processes and constraints typical of the public sector.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Configuring &lt;/strong&gt;(customizing) &lt;strong&gt;SAP FI&lt;/strong&gt; and collaborating with the project team to ensure end-to-end solution consistency, including any integrations with other modules or systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Producing &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;maintaining &lt;/strong&gt;functional and techno-functional documentation, including process documentation, specifications, and requirements traceability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executing &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;supporting testing phases&lt;/strong&gt; (SIT/UAT), as well as supporting cutover, go-live, and post go-live stabilization activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supporting, where required, &lt;strong&gt;data preparation&lt;/strong&gt; and migration activities, as well as Finance-related accounting reconciliations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You will work closely with &lt;strong&gt;Public Sector&lt;/strong&gt; clients in contexts such as central and local Public Administration, regulatory bodies, healthcare, education, and publicly owned companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is a great fit for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have experience on SAP implementation projects with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;SAP FI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have experience in requirements &lt;strong&gt;analysis&lt;/strong&gt;, solution &lt;strong&gt;design &lt;/strong&gt;support, &lt;strong&gt;customizing&lt;/strong&gt;, test execution, and &lt;strong&gt;go-live &lt;/strong&gt;support within implementation or rollout projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a solid knowledge of the main &lt;strong&gt;FI configuration areas&lt;/strong&gt; (FI/GL, FI/AP, FI/AR, FI/AA); exposure to integrations with CO, MM, and SD is a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good command of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive &lt;/strong&gt;and fair working environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;stimulating &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;dynamic &lt;/strong&gt;setting that fosters creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A&lt;strong&gt; hybrid working&lt;/strong&gt; model to promote a healthy work–life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;development &lt;/strong&gt;programs to keep your skills up to date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international mindset &lt;/strong&gt;and innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;psychological &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;physical wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate&apos;s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity: these are KPMG’s Values, which foster an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge and enable our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to creating an inclusive workplace, our Network complies with the ISO 30415 standards for Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Management Systems and the UNI PdR 125 standard relating to gender equality. Within our Impact Plan – Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) – you can find a summary of the concrete actions we are taking across environmental, social, and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – “GDPR”) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy notice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-Consultant-SAP-FI/1368288357/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368288357</guid><g:id>1368288357</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Tech Consultant | Supply Chain &amp; Industry 4.0 (Bologna, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain &amp;amp; Industry 4.0&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Bologna&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be engaged in projects for large Italian and international customers for the implementation of applications in Industry 4.0 - Smart Manufacturing - Supply Chain &amp;amp; Operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Developing Javascript solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; for FrontEnd using market SDKs (i.e: SapUI 5, AngularJS)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Implementing applications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; on Low Code or scripting systems, such as &lt;strong&gt;PTC Thingworx&lt;/strong&gt;, AWS Lambda or SAP DMC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Writing queries for data management on databases, using &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Allow applications to be more rapidly deployed, patched, or scaled, using &lt;strong&gt;Docker&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Developing &lt;strong&gt;IoT &lt;/strong&gt;architectures with machine and IoT communication management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Computer Engineering &lt;/strong&gt;or&lt;strong&gt; Computer Science&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Java concepts or object-oriented languages, JSON and XML.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge, even basic, of Javascript, CSS, and SQL.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge, even academic, of PLC operation or interfacing with OPC UA servers or other market&lt;strong&gt; standards, such as HTTP Api&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;MS Office&lt;/strong&gt; package&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 36.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-MC2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Bologna-Junior-Tech-Consultant-Supply-Chain-&amp;-Industry-4_0/1368640457/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368640457</guid><g:id>1368640457</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Bologna, IT</g:location></item><item><title>IT Business Analyst SAP - Financial Services (Intern) (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Enterprise Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai coinvolta/o nell&apos;implementazione della piattaforma &lt;strong&gt;SAP&lt;/strong&gt; presso i nostri clienti del settore dei &lt;strong&gt;Financial Services&lt;/strong&gt;: imparerai ad analizzare come funzionano i processi di banche, assicurazioni e società di investimento, e a tradurli in soluzioni digitali, affiancando colleghe e colleghi più esperti in ogni fase del progetto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Partecipare a incontri e interviste con le diverse aree aziendali del cliente (ad esempio credito, compliance, operations) per capire come lavorano e cosa serve loro (&lt;strong&gt;analisi dei requisiti di business&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribuire a disegnare la soluzione più adatta per il cliente, utilizzando &lt;strong&gt;funzionalità standard di SAP&lt;/strong&gt; studiate per il settore finanziario (ad esempio moduli per la gestione del rischio o dei processi bancari) oppure configurazioni su misura&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Aiutare a redigere la &lt;strong&gt;documentazione funzionale e tecnica&lt;/strong&gt; che descrive come funzionerà la soluzione end-to-end, dall&apos;inizio alla fine del processo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supportare i &lt;strong&gt;test&lt;/strong&gt; della soluzione, sia internamente sia insieme agli utenti che la useranno ogni giorno&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribuire alla &lt;strong&gt;formazione degli utenti finali&lt;/strong&gt;, spiegando loro come utilizzare la nuova soluzione&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Affiancare il team di progetto nella fase finale, quando la soluzione viene attivata presso il cliente (&lt;strong&gt;rilascio&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su progetti nazionali e internazionali al fianco di professioniste e professionisti altamente qualificati, lavorando a stretto contatto con i nostri clienti del settore dei Financial Services, tra cui banche, assicurazioni e società di investimento.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una &lt;strong&gt;laurea in Economia, Ingegneria Gestionale&lt;/strong&gt; o discipline simili&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai &lt;strong&gt;motivazione&lt;/strong&gt; a lavorare nell&apos;ambito dell&apos;Information Technology con clienti del settore dei servizi finanziari (banche e assicurazioni), anche senza esperienza pregressa in ambito SAP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai un&apos;&lt;strong&gt;ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, meglio se avvalorata da un&apos;esperienza di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai un&apos;&lt;strong&gt;ottima conoscenza di Excel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona padronanza della lingua inglese e attitudine al lavoro in team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a trasferte in Italia e all&apos;estero in base alle esigenze progettuali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibrida, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di formazione e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul benessere psicofisico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;L&apos;opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all&apos;impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l&apos;Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to businesses to support them in transforming their business models, improving and digitizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, and providing assistance in extraordinary financial operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;By joining the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platform Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be involved in the implementation of the &lt;strong&gt;SAP&lt;/strong&gt; platform at our clients in the &lt;strong&gt;Financial Services&lt;/strong&gt; sector: you will learn how the processes of banks, insurance companies and investment firms work, and how to translate them into digital solutions, working alongside more experienced colleagues at every stage of the project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Take part in meetings and interviews with the client&apos;s different business areas (for example credit, compliance, operations) to understand how they work and what they need (&lt;strong&gt;business requirements analysis&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribute to designing the most suitable solution for the client, using &lt;strong&gt;SAP&apos;s standard functionalities&lt;/strong&gt; designed for the financial sector (for example modules for risk management or banking processes) or tailored configurations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Help draft the &lt;strong&gt;functional and technical documentation&lt;/strong&gt; describing how the end-to-end solution will work, from start to finish of the process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Support &lt;strong&gt;testing&lt;/strong&gt; of the solution, both internally and together with the users who will use it every day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribute to &lt;strong&gt;training end users&lt;/strong&gt;, explaining how to use the new solution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Work alongside the project team in the final phase, when the solution goes live at the client (&lt;strong&gt;release&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You will be involved in national and international projects alongside highly qualified professionals and will work closely with our clients in the Financial Services sector, including banks, insurance companies, and investment firms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Attributes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is right for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a &lt;strong&gt;degree in Business, Management Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; or a similar field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have the &lt;strong&gt;motivation&lt;/strong&gt; to work in Information Technology with clients in the financial services sector (banks and insurance companies), even without prior experience in SAP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have an &lt;strong&gt;excellent command of English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally supported by study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;excellent knowledge of the Office suite&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good command of English and a team-oriented attitude&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are available for business travel in Italy and abroad based on project needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us – What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An inclusive and equitable work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that fosters creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A hybrid work model to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay up-to-date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate&apos;s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In compliance with applicable law, we do not collect or use information about salaries received in current or previous employment relationships. Our selection processes are also based on objective and gender neutral criteria.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s Values, which create an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to reach their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network complies with the standards of the ISO 30415 requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125, relating to gender equality. Our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) – summarizes all the concrete actions we are undertaking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The requested data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of European Regulation 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot; or &quot;Privacy Regulation&quot;) and its subsequent amendments and integrations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-IT-Business-Analyst-SAP-Financial-Services-%28Intern%29/1356973557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1356973557</guid><g:id>1356973557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Public Sector Consultant | Roma (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitization, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help digitalise the public administration (PA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;KPMG has always worked alongside central and local public bodies to assist them with &lt;strong&gt;change and innovation&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;processes &lt;/strong&gt;to generate a tangible impact on the lives of millions of people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of KPMG’s Government team, you will have the opportunity to &lt;strong&gt;make a difference&lt;/strong&gt; by personally contributing to the redesign of your country’s public service provision models while rapidly expanding your skills in a dynamic and highly professional environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will contend with strategic aspects of the public administration every day:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;devising and implementing the digital strategy;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;rethinking the citizen/user experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;designing service provision processes and the supporting information systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;designing performance management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you ready to help change and improve our country?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At KPMG you will be directly involved where change must happen, working closely with the officials and managers of the Italian PA to make public services increasingly user friendly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join a group of young colleagues and professionals dedicated to creating and generating the change every day. These colleagues will guide you as you grow and act as a touchstone, in addition to sharing ongoing training programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For our office in &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt;, we are recruiting professionals with drive and a sense of accountability to change the system. They must be goal-oriented, enthusiastic and highly motivated team players.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The successful candidate has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a degree in business and/or engineering management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;studies preferably focused on: business organization/administration, finance and control/organization of public administrations/digital transformation/public procurement;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study/work experience abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you&apos;ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages creativity and teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International mindset and innovative projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship with a monthly allowance of €1,000 or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better - Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individuality, continuous deepening, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s Values that give rise to an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, which allows our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.  Within our Impact Plan - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarized all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”) as amended. For more information, please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CA1&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Junior-Public-Sector-Consultant-Roma/1367943057/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367943057</guid><g:id>1367943057</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Meet&amp;Cheers Fides - Servizi di Accounting (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG &lt;/strong&gt;ti invita a partecipare a&lt;strong&gt; Meet&amp;amp;Cheers Fides&lt;/strong&gt;, un evento pensato per studenti e studentesse triennali, magistrali e neolaureati/e in ambito economico con una passione per il mondo Accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📅 &lt;strong&gt;Quando:&lt;/strong&gt; giovedì 24 settembre 2026 | 17.00 – 19.00&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍 &lt;strong&gt;Dove:&lt;/strong&gt; Ufficio KPMG Roma – Via Curtatone, 3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍽 &lt;strong&gt;Aperitivo di networking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;L’evento &lt;/strong&gt;Un’esperienza di networking informale insieme ai Professionisti di KPMG Fides. Potrai conoscere il loro percorso, confrontarti sulle sfide del ruolo e scoprire come supportiamo le aziende clienti nella gestione di &lt;strong&gt;processi amministrativi&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;contabili &lt;/strong&gt;e &lt;strong&gt;fiscali &lt;/strong&gt;in un contesto sempre più guidato dall&apos;innovazioe digitale e dall&apos;AI. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✨ &lt;strong&gt;Perché partecipare? &lt;/strong&gt;Ti confronterai con i nostri professionistiScoprirai da vicino le opportunità professionali di KPMG FidesApprofondirai i principali ambiti di attività del team AccountingVivrai un momento di networking e condivisione in un contesto informale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📌 &lt;strong&gt;Requisiti&lt;/strong&gt;: L’evento è dedicato a neolaureati/e e studenti e studentesse universitarie con background Economico.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Candidati ora! Posti limitati!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;KPMG, con oltre 276.000 professionisti in 138 paesi, è leader globale nei servizi di revisione, consulenza e amministrazione. In Italia, il team di oltre 7.000 professionisti in 25 sedi, si distingue per valori come trasparenza, inclusione e innovazione, promuovendo un ambiente che valorizza il potenziale di ciascuno. &lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG. KPMG Fides servizi di Amministrazione S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-EP1  &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Meet&amp;Cheers-Fides-Servizi-di-Accounting/1367362157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367362157</guid><g:id>1367362157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>FIDES</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant/Assistant Manager - Governance, Risk &amp; Compliance AML - Financial Services (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div id=&quot;tor__flistingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__flistingLayout_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultant/Assistant Manager – Governance, Risk and Compliance Financial Services&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In KPMG, you’ll feel closer to your full potential&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di &lt;strong&gt;Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt; di &lt;strong&gt;Milano&lt;/strong&gt; potrai aiutare le aziende a trasformare i &lt;strong&gt;rischi in opportunità&lt;/strong&gt; per migliorare la loro organizzazione e l’evoluzione dei loro sistemi di governance, ottenendo un vantaggio competitivo e offrendo soluzioni integrate e approcci innovativi per la gestione strategica del rischio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Definire nuovi modelli per il customer risk profiling, name screening e transaction monitoring in ambito anti-financial crime;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autovalutazione del rischio di riciclaggio;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Definizione dei business requirements legati a progetti innovativi (es. implementazione di prodotti e servizi ad alto contenuto tecnologico), per garantire il presidio dei rischi di riciclaggio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai &lt;strong&gt;almeno 3 anni&lt;/strong&gt; di esperienza in ambito anti-financial crime, AML;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai una laurea magistrale o un Master in Economia, Finanza o Giurisprudenza;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai interesse per i Financial Services (settore bancario e/o assicurativo) e una buona conoscenza del framework normativo del settore finanziario;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai un’ottima conoscenza dell’inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all’estero.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;----&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In KPMG, you’ll feel closer to your full potential&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join the Governance, Risk, Compliance and Sustainability Services team, you will help companies transform risks into opportunities for the improvement of their organisation and evolution of their governance systems to gain a competitive edge and offer integrated solutions and innovative approaches for strategic risk management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining our &lt;strong&gt;Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance team&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Milano&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be involved in projects to define governance, risk management and legislative compliance strategies in the&lt;strong&gt; Financial Services sector.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, you will be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining new models for customer risk profiling, name screening, and transaction monitoring in the anti-financial crime field;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-assessment of money laundering risk;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining business requirements related to innovative projects (e.g., implementation of high-tech products and services) to ensure the management of money laundering risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;at least 3 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in the anti-financial crime field;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a master&apos;s degree in Economics, Finance, or Law with excellent grades;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an interest in Financial Services (banking and/or insurance sector) and a good understanding of the regulatory framework of the financial sector;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent English skills, preferably supported by study and/or work experience abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a problem solver and never lose sight of your goals. You have strong interpersonal skills and are a team player. Your motivation and enthusiasm inspire confidence and empower change. You enjoy taking on challenges and are comfortable in fast-changing situations where your leadership abilities make the difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In today’s increasingly complex and interconnected world, clients need to transform and adapt ever more rapidly. At KPMG Advisory, we focus on the main drivers of change: strategies, corporate finance, organisational processes and models, technological platforms, risk management and organisational change. Our work is uniquely challenging given its scope, complexity and importance. You will experience disruptive technologies and set the new standards that impact their security. You will have access to global opportunities and the possibility of gaining skills and expertise that will help you reach your goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. +&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity. These are the KPMG values that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential. As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy. KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-AV1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-ConsultantAssistant-Manager-Governance%2C-Risk-&amp;-Compliance-AML-Financial-Services/1361396857/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1361396857</guid><g:id>1361396857</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Technical Specialist - System Administator | Azure (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Business Services&lt;/strong&gt; offre servizi interni all’organizzazione, supportando tutte le linee di servizio e coadiuvando i professionisti nella gestione delle attività quotidiane. In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di&lt;strong&gt; Infrastructure &amp;amp; cloud &lt;/strong&gt;del nostro dipartimento di IT interno di Milano, potrai occuparti di supportare la crescita e l’evoluzione verso un modello &lt;strong&gt;cloud‑first&lt;/strong&gt; mantenendo al contempo solide capacità &lt;strong&gt;on‑prem&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Engineering (focus Azure):&lt;/strong&gt; Progettare, implementare e gestire workload Azure principalmente PaaS con attenzione a: Compute, Storage, Virtual Networking, Load Balancing, App Services Identity &amp;amp; Access Management (Entra ID), RBAC e gestione privilegi Monitoraggio avanzato (Azure Monitor, Log Analytics, Alerts) Backup (Azure Backup) Cost governance e ottimizzazione dei consumi cloud &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Operations – Ambienti ibridi: &lt;/strong&gt;Gestire e ottimizzare infrastrutture on-prem: Windows/Linux Server, AD, VMware, storage SAN/NAS, backup, networking L2/L3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Zero Trust Applicare best practice di sicurezza su Azure e on-prem:&lt;/strong&gt; hardening, MFA, patching, gestione vulnerabilità logging/alerting centralizzati adozione dei principi Zero Trust in collaborazione con il team Security &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automazione &amp;amp; Standardizzazione:&lt;/strong&gt; Sviluppare e mantenere automazioni (Bicep/PowerShell/Bash). Standardizzare processi operativi e configurazioni. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Continuity &amp;amp; Performance: &lt;/strong&gt;Garantire disponibilità e continuità operativa: piani DR/BCP, test periodici, performance tuning. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IT Operations &lt;/strong&gt;Gestione incident/change/problem secondo ITIL. Supporto di 2°/3° livello e collaborazione con team cross-funzionali. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai 4–6 anni in ruoli di &lt;strong&gt;System/Cloud Administration su ambienti ibridi. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Solida esperienza su:&lt;strong&gt; Azure &lt;/strong&gt;(compute, storage, networking, identity, security) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Active Directory, DNS/DHCP/GPO &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;VMware, SAN/NAS, backup&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; Hai una conoscenza della lingua inglese almeno B2. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; Verranno considerati plus la conoscenza di: Kubernetes/containers, Linux &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio II° livello; la retribuzione sarà definita e commisurata in relazione a criteri oggettivi quali competenze, esperienza effettiva maturata e aderenza ai requisiti richiesti per la posizione. In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Business Services S.r.l. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to address and solve today’s most relevant and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Business Services&lt;/strong&gt; provides internal services to the organization, supporting all service lines and assisting professionals in managing their daily activities. In particular, by joining the &lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Cloud Team&lt;/strong&gt; within our &lt;strong&gt;Internal IT Department in Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will contribute to the growth and evolution towards a &lt;strong&gt;cloud-first model&lt;/strong&gt;, while maintaining strong on-premises capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be responsible for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Engineering (focus on Azure)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Designing, implementing, and managing Azure workloads, mainly PaaS services, with a focus on:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Compute, Storage, Virtual Networking, Load Balancing, and App Services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Identity &amp;amp; Access Management (Entra ID), RBAC, and privilege management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced monitoring using Azure Monitor, Log Analytics, and Alerts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Backup management (Azure Backup).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Cost governance and cloud consumption optimization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Operations – Hybrid Environment :&lt;/strong&gt;Managing and optimizing on-premise infrastructures including Windows/Linux Servers, Active Directory, VMware, SAN/NAS storage, backup systems, and L2/L3 networking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Zero Trust: &lt;/strong&gt;Applying security best practices across Azure and on-prem environments, including system hardening, MFA implementation, patch management, and vulnerability management. Managing centralized logging and alerting. Supporting the adoption of Zero Trust principles in collaboration with the Security team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Standardization: &lt;/strong&gt;Developing and maintaining automation scripts and infrastructure templates using Bicep, PowerShell, or Bash.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Standardizing operational processes and infrastructure configurations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Continuity &amp;amp; Performance: &lt;/strong&gt;Ensuring service availability and operational continuity through DR/BCP planning, periodic testing, and performance tuning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IT Operations: &lt;/strong&gt;Managing incidents, changes, and problems according to ITIL practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Providing Level 2/3 support and collaborating with cross-functional teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your skills and experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This opportunity is a great fit for you if you:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Have &lt;strong&gt;4–6 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in System Administration or Cloud Administration roles within hybrid environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Have solid experience with &lt;strong&gt;Azure (compute, storage, networking, identity, security)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Have experience with &lt;strong&gt;Active Directory, DNS, DHCP, and GPO&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Have experience with &lt;strong&gt;VMware, SAN/NAS storage, and backup solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Have &lt;strong&gt;English proficiency at B2 level or higher&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Nice to have:&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes or container technologies&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Linux systems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;dynamic and stimulating context&lt;/strong&gt; that fosters creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt;, promoting a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training and development programs&lt;/strong&gt; to continuously enhance your skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and exposure to innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;physical and psychological well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, level II. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills, relevant experience and fulfilment of the requirements of the position. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity: these are the &lt;strong&gt;Values of KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;, creating an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to fully express their potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; – &lt;em&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/em&gt; – you can find a summary of the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – GDPR) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please consult KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Business Services S.r.l. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-AM1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Technical-Specialist-System-Administator-Azure/1349064757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1349064757</guid><g:id>1349064757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Information Technology Services</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Deal Advisory Turnaround&amp;Restructuring Senior Consultant | Roma (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Restructuring&amp;amp;Turnaround Consultant | Roma&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi intraprendere una professione davvero significativa e di impatto? In &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare clienti, azienda e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione dei modelli di business, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e gestione dei rischi e nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Il team &lt;strong&gt;Restructuring&lt;/strong&gt; assiste i clienti nei processi di ristrutturazione del debito e di rilancio industriale, offrendo consulenza finanziaria e supporto nella predisposizione di business plan finalizzati alla stabilizzazione dell&apos;azienda e all&apos;avvio di un cambiamento sostenibile.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;I consulenti del team sono coinvolti in attività di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;ristrutturazione del debito;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;operazioni di fusione e acquisizione (M&amp;amp;A) su aziende in difficoltà (&lt;em&gt;distressed M&amp;amp;A&lt;/em&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;consulenza agli istituti finanziari (&lt;em&gt;lender advisory&lt;/em&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;rivolte a multinazionali, imprese familiari, fondi di private equity e istituzioni finanziarie.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte di un team riconosciuto per la qualità e la rilevanza dei progetti realizzati, avrai l&apos;opportunità di lavorare con importanti clienti italiani e internazionali. Nel 2022, per la terza volta in quattro anni, il team ha ricevuto il &lt;strong&gt;Finance Community Award&lt;/strong&gt; come &lt;strong&gt;&quot;Restructuring Team of the Year&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, a conferma dell&apos;eccellenza professionale e del valore dei progetti seguiti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Entrando nel team di &lt;strong&gt;Roma&lt;/strong&gt;, in un ambiente dinamico e stimolante, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;analizzare le performance finanziarie delle aziende target per valutarne l&apos;effettiva situazione economico-finanziaria;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;sviluppare modelli finanziari (&lt;em&gt;financial modelling&lt;/em&gt;) e business plan;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;effettuare revisioni indipendenti dei business plan (&lt;em&gt;Independent Business Review&lt;/em&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;svolgere attività di due diligence commerciale e operativa;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;partecipare alle negoziazioni con i principali stakeholder, in particolare istituti finanziari e investitori;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;supportare operazioni di acquisizione e fusione di aziende in crisi (&lt;em&gt;distressed M&amp;amp;A&lt;/em&gt;), insieme a partner industriali, fondi di investimento e altri operatori;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;supportare attività di gestione della liquidità (&lt;em&gt;cash management&lt;/em&gt;) e progetti di turnaround aziendale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;analizzare interventi di riduzione dei costi e miglioramento organizzativo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è ideale se possiedi:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2-4 anni di esperienza&lt;/strong&gt; in ambito restructuring, gestione delle crisi d&apos;impresa e/o corporate finance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;una &lt;strong&gt;laurea magistrale&lt;/strong&gt; in discipline economiche con specializzazione in finanza o amministrazione, finanza e controllo (AFC), oppure in ingegneria gestionale con indirizzo finanziario;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;un&apos;ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente accompagnata da esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;un&apos;ottima conoscenza del pacchetto &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo ed equo&lt;/strong&gt;, che rispetta, valorizza e promuove la diversità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;dinamico e stimolante&lt;/strong&gt;, che incoraggia creatività e lavoro di squadra.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt;, per favorire un sano equilibrio tra vita privata e professionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi avanzati di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt;, per mantenere competenze sempre aggiornate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente internazionale e la possibilità di lavorare su &lt;strong&gt;progetti innovativi&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere mentale e fisico&lt;/strong&gt; delle persone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità sono i valori di &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;. Questi principi contribuiscono a creare un ambiente che favorisce la condivisione di idee e conoscenze, permettendo ai professionisti di esprimere al meglio il proprio potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo &lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 &lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125 &lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Attraverso il proprio &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt;, KPMG riassume le azioni concrete intraprese sui temi ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati personali saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (GDPR) e delle successive modifiche. Per maggiori informazioni è possibile consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. promuove le pari opportunità ed è un datore di lavoro che valorizza l&apos;inclusione e la diversità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Restructuring services&lt;/strong&gt; team assists clients in debt and industrial restructuring with financial advisory and/or support services to help them prepare business plans that stabilise the business and usher in sustainable change. Our consultants are involved in debt restructuring, distressed M&amp;amp;As and lender advisory activities for multinationals, family-run enterprises, private equity funds and financial institutions. As a member of this team, known for the quality and scope of its projects, your talent will be put to full use, enabling you to work with leading Italian and international clients: in 2022, for the third time in four years, our team received the Finance Community Award for Italian “Restructuring Team of the Year” in recognition of its professional excellence and the type of projects implemented.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join our team in &lt;strong&gt;Rome, &lt;/strong&gt;a dynamic and stimulating environment where&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; you will be tasked with: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;analysing the financial performance of target companies to identify the actual financial situation of an enterprise;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;financial modelling and business planning;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;independent business reviews of business plans;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;commercial and operational due diligence;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;negotiation with the main stakeholders (mainly financial institutions and investors);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;distressed M&amp;amp;As (with industrial partners, investment funds, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;cash management and turnarounds;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;cost cutting analysis and organizational improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;2/4 years of experience in restructuring, company crisis and/or corporate finance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;specialist degree in business with a focus on finance/AFC and/or engineering management (for finance);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;equitable &lt;/strong&gt;work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;challenging and dynamic environment&lt;/strong&gt; that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a &lt;strong&gt;healthy work-life balance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internationa&lt;/strong&gt;l mindset and &lt;strong&gt;innovative &lt;/strong&gt;projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical &lt;strong&gt;well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a style=&quot;text-decoration:underline&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-AA2&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Deal-Advisory-Turnaround&amp;Restructuring-Senior-Consultant-Roma/1361643057/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1361643057</guid><g:id>1361643057</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Deal Advisory</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior SAP AI Consultant (Intern) (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché nel supporto alle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Enterprise Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai inserita/o in un percorso di crescita nell&apos;ambito &lt;strong&gt;SAP AI&lt;/strong&gt;, affiancando consulenti senior nella progettazione e nello sviluppo di soluzioni di Intelligenza Artificiale applicate ai processi aziendali ed ecosistemi ERP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supportare la &lt;strong&gt;progettazione e lo sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt; di soluzioni AI e Generative AI applicate a processi aziendali e sistemi ERP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Approfondire le principali &lt;strong&gt;piattaforme e framework AI&lt;/strong&gt;, affiancando i colleghi senior nell&apos;implementazione&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribuire allo sviluppo di &lt;strong&gt;AI Agent, Copilot aziendali, chatbot&lt;/strong&gt; e soluzioni basate su architetture RAG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supportare l&apos;&lt;strong&gt;integrazione di soluzioni AI&lt;/strong&gt; con sistemi ERP, CRM e applicazioni enterprise tramite API e servizi di integrazione&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Partecipare ad attività di &lt;strong&gt;analisi dei processi aziendali&lt;/strong&gt; e identificazione di opportunità di automazione intelligente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Collaborare alla &lt;strong&gt;raccolta di requisiti funzionali&lt;/strong&gt; e alla stesura della documentazione di progetto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei &lt;strong&gt;laureata/o o in procinto di laurearti&lt;/strong&gt; in Informatica, Ingegneria Informatica o discipline affini&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai acquisito &lt;strong&gt;conoscenze di base di Intelligenza Artificiale e Machine Learning&lt;/strong&gt; durante il percorso di studi, la tesi o progetti personali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Conosci almeno un &lt;strong&gt;linguaggio di programmazione&lt;/strong&gt;, preferibilmente Python&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei curiosa/o rispetto ai principi della &lt;strong&gt;Generative AI&lt;/strong&gt; (modelli linguistici, prompt engineering), anche solo a livello di studio o approfondimento personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai interesse verso i &lt;strong&gt;sistemi ERP&lt;/strong&gt;, preferibilmente SAP, senza necessità di conoscenza pregressa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai buone capacità di &lt;strong&gt;analisi logica e problem solving&lt;/strong&gt;, spirito di squadra e voglia di imparare&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona padronanza della lingua inglese e attitudine al lavoro in team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a trasferte in Italia e all&apos;estero in base alle esigenze progettuali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un plus: tesi, progetti universitari, hackathon o certificazioni base in ambito AI, Cloud o Data (Microsoft, Google, AWS o simili), anche conseguite in autonomia.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo ed equo, che rispetta e valorizza la diversità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che favorisce creatività e lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un modello di hybrid working che promuove un sano equilibrio vita-lavoro&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi avanzati di formazione e sviluppo per tenere sempre aggiornate le tue competenze&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Una mentalità internazionale e progetti innovativi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative dedicate al benessere fisico e mentale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;L&apos;opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG, che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e conoscenze, permettendo alle nostre professioniste e ai nostri professionisti di esprimere il proprio pieno potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Attraverso il nostro impegno per un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network rispetta i requisiti della norma ISO 30415 (Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Management System) e UNI PdR 125 (parità di genere). All&apos;interno del nostro Impact Plan troverai una sintesi di tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo intraprendendo sui temi ESG (Environmental, Social, Governance).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I dati personali saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto del Regolamento UE n. 679/2016 (GDPR) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, si rimanda all&apos;informativa privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that truly matters and makes an impact? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues face and solve today&apos;s most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory provides consulting services to businesses, supporting them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitalisation, risk analysis and management, as well as extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Joining the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platform Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be onboarded onto a growth path within &lt;strong&gt;SAP AI&lt;/strong&gt;, working alongside senior consultants on the design and development of Artificial Intelligence solutions applied to business processes and ERP ecosystems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Support the &lt;strong&gt;design and development&lt;/strong&gt; of AI and Generative AI solutions applied to business processes and ERP systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Deepen your knowledge of the main &lt;strong&gt;AI platforms and frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;, working alongside senior colleagues on implementation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribute to the development of &lt;strong&gt;AI Agents, enterprise Copilots, chatbots&lt;/strong&gt;, and solutions based on RAG architectures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Support the &lt;strong&gt;integration of AI solutions&lt;/strong&gt; with ERP, CRM, and enterprise applications through APIs and integration services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Take part in &lt;strong&gt;business process analysis&lt;/strong&gt; activities and identify opportunities for intelligent automation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Collaborate on &lt;strong&gt;gathering functional requirements&lt;/strong&gt; and drafting project documentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is right for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You hold or are completing a &lt;strong&gt;degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, or a related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have gained &lt;strong&gt;basic knowledge of Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning&lt;/strong&gt; through your studies, thesis, or personal projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You know at least one &lt;strong&gt;programming language&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably Python&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are curious about &lt;strong&gt;Generative AI&lt;/strong&gt; principles (language models, prompt engineering), even if only through independent study&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have an interest in &lt;strong&gt;ERP systems&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably SAP, with no prior experience required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have good &lt;strong&gt;logical analysis and problem-solving skills&lt;/strong&gt;, a team-oriented mindset, and a genuine willingness to learn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Good command of English, written and spoken&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are available for business travel in Italy and abroad based on project needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A plus: thesis work, university projects, hackathons, or entry-level certifications in AI, Cloud, or Data (Microsoft, Google, AWS, or similar), even self-obtained.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An inclusive and equitable work environment that respects and celebrates diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic setting that encourages creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A hybrid working model that promotes a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programmes to keep your skills sharp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative project portfolio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate&apos;s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In compliance with applicable law, we do not collect or use information about salaries received in current or previous employment relationships. Our selection processes are also based on objective and gender neutral criteria.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Our Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity: these are the Values of KPMG, which give life to an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to reach their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Through our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network complies with the ISO 30415 standard (Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Management System) and UNI PdR 125 (Gender Equality). Within our Impact Plan, you will find a full overview of the concrete actions we are taking on ESG (Environmental, Social, and Governance) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with EU Regulation No. 679/2016 (GDPR) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunities employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Junior-SAP-AI-Consultant-%28Intern%29/1368246857/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368246857</guid><g:id>1368246857</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Deal Strategy Senior Consultant | Firenze (Firenze, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:24.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Deal Strategy&amp;amp;Value Creation Senior Consultant | Florence&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Deal Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; team provides support in &lt;strong&gt;M&amp;amp;As&lt;/strong&gt;, from the pre-deal evaluation to the post-deal integration or separation with focus on the definition and quantification of all value creation levers. As a member of this team, you will work in close contact with lenders, shareholders and managers at all levels, helping to support clients in corporate finance transactions using digital tools and technology in your day-to-day work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Join our teams in &lt;strong&gt;Florence&lt;/strong&gt; where you will gain experience supporting shareholders and management of client companies in solving complex business challenges, from the definition of strategy to the execution of value creation initiatives, with focus on the Pre-Deal Business/Operational Due Diligence, Business Planning and Post-Deal Integration phases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;•    Business &amp;amp; Strategic Planning: You’ll work alongside C-level executives to assess the business in a short time framework and define/ quantify improvement actions to present to investors and stakeholders;&lt;br&gt;•    Business &amp;amp; Commercial Due Diligence: You’ll analyze business dynamics, market, and competition for potential targets, working with private equity funds and other buyers;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;•    Identification and review of synergies both in a pre and post deal phase. Support in the implementation of tracking models of the synergies identified in the &quot;execution&quot; phase;&lt;br&gt;•    Synergy assessment and execution: You will analyze all potential synergies both in a pre and post deal phase,  supporting end to end the client from the quantification phase to the implementation/ tracking of the identified synergies;&lt;br&gt;•    Integration &amp;amp; Separation Management Office: You will define and drive Day 1 Readiness plan, D100 Integration plan, definition of Target Operating Model, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;At least 2/3 years of experience from either a strategy consulting firm or the strategy or business development function of an industrial, consumer or retail company with activity focus on revenue growth initiatives definition and management;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;A master&apos;s degree in business subjects and, preferably, additional post-graduate courses in data science, business analytics and digital innovation;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;A keen interest in pre and post M&amp;amp;A deal activities;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;An analytical approach and ability to interpret data and KPIs;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in Italian &amp;amp; English;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of Excel and PowerPoint;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Knowledge of data and analytics tools (e.g., Power, BI and Qlik) is preferred;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Flexible to travel for work in Italy and abroad.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;equitable &lt;/strong&gt;work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;challenging and dynamic environment&lt;/strong&gt; that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a &lt;strong&gt;healthy work-life balance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;I&lt;strong&gt;nternational &lt;/strong&gt;mindset and &lt;strong&gt;innovative &lt;/strong&gt;projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical &lt;strong&gt;well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network has obtained ISO 30415 certification, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a style=&quot;color:black;text-decoration:underline;background-color:white&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;#LI-AV2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Firenze-Deal-Strategy-Senior-Consultant-Firenze/1367513057/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367513057</guid><g:id>1367513057</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Deal Advisory</g:job_function><g:location>Firenze, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Public Sector Consultant | Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters -&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle organizzazioni per supportarle nella trasformazione dei modelli di business, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e gestione dei rischi e nel supporto alle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribuisci alla digitalizzazione e alla trasformazione della Pubblica Amministrazione (PA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;KPMG è da sempre al fianco delle amministrazioni pubbliche centrali e locali per supportarle nei processi di cambiamento e innovazione, generando un impatto concreto sulla vita di milioni di persone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Government di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;, avrai l&apos;opportunità di fare la differenza contribuendo in prima persona alla riprogettazione dei modelli di erogazione dei servizi pubblici del tuo Paese, sviluppando rapidamente le tue competenze in un contesto dinamico e altamente professionale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ti confronterai ogni giorno con temi strategici della Pubblica Amministrazione:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;definizione e implementazione della strategia digitale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ripensamento dell&apos;esperienza del cittadino/utente;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;progettazione dei processi di erogazione dei servizi e dei relativi sistemi informativi di supporto;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;progettazione di sistemi di performance management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;supporto all&apos;analisi delle politiche pubbliche, dalla fase di progettazione fino all&apos;attuazione;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;applicazione di strumenti di valutazione e monitoraggio per misurare l&apos;impatto, l&apos;efficacia e l&apos;efficienza di programmi e investimenti pubblici (ad esempio valutazioni ex ante, in itinere ed ex post);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;supporto alla gestione e alla rendicontazione di programmi finanziati da fondi pubblici ed europei (ad esempio PNRR, fondi strutturali e di coesione), inclusa la definizione dei KPI e il monitoraggio dei risultati;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;coinvolgimento e coordinamento degli stakeholder rilevanti (funzionari pubblici, cittadini, attori istituzionali e privati) a supporto di iniziative di co-progettazione e change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sei pronto a contribuire al cambiamento e al miglioramento del nostro Paese?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In KPMG sarai coinvolto direttamente nei contesti in cui il cambiamento deve avvenire, lavorando a stretto contatto con dirigenti e funzionari della Pubblica Amministrazione italiana per rendere i servizi pubblici sempre più accessibili, efficaci e orientati ai bisogni degli utenti.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entrerai a far parte di un gruppo di giovani colleghi e professionisti impegnati ogni giorno nel generare cambiamento. Questi colleghi ti accompagneranno nel tuo percorso di crescita, rappresentando un punto di riferimento costante e supportandoti attraverso programmi di formazione continua.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Per il nostro ufficio di &lt;strong&gt;Milano&lt;/strong&gt;, siamo alla ricerca di professionisti intraprendenti e responsabili, motivati a contribuire al cambiamento del sistema. Cerchiamo persone orientate agli obiettivi, entusiaste e con una forte propensione al lavoro di squadra.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are- Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Il candidato ideale possiede:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;una laurea in Economia e/o Ingegneria Gestionale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;un percorso di studi preferibilmente orientato a: organizzazione e amministrazione aziendale, finanza e controllo, organizzazione delle pubbliche amministrazioni, trasformazione digitale, appalti pubblici;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;un&apos;ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente accompagnata da esperienze di studio o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;una buona conoscenza delle metodologie di valutazione delle politiche e dei programmi pubblici e dei relativi sistemi di monitoraggio (ad esempio progettazione di KPI e indicatori, quadro logico/teoria del cambiamento, analisi costi-benefici, valutazione d&apos;impatto);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;buone competenze quantitative e di analisi dei dati, con capacità di interpretare le informazioni a supporto dei processi decisionali (conoscenza di Excel richiesta; costituirà titolo preferenziale la familiarità con strumenti di data visualization o analisi statistica come Power BI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo ed equo, che rispetta, valorizza e promuove la diversità.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incoraggia creatività e lavoro di squadra.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibride per favorire un sano equilibrio tra vita privata e professionale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Percorsi avanzati di formazione e sviluppo professionale per mantenere competenze sempre aggiornate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto internazionale e progetti innovativi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative dedicate al benessere mentale e fisico delle persone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 1.000€ o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better - I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per l&apos;unicità di ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità: questi sono i valori di KPMG, che contribuiscono a creare un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e conoscenze, consentendo ai nostri professionisti di esprimere appieno il proprio potenziale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A conferma del nostro impegno nella promozione di un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il Network KPMG è conforme ai requisiti della norma ISO 30415 sul sistema di gestione della Diversità e Inclusione e alla UNI/PdR 125 in materia di parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro &lt;em&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/em&gt; sono inoltre raccolte tutte le iniziative concrete che stiamo realizzando sui temi ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (GDPR) e successive modifiche. Per maggiori informazioni, consulta l&apos;informativa privacy di KPMG.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce pari opportunità.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CA1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitization, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help digitalise and transform the public administration (PA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;KPMG has always worked alongside central and local public bodies to assist them with &lt;strong&gt;change and innovation&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;processes &lt;/strong&gt;to generate a tangible impact on the lives of millions of people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of KPMG’s Government team, you will have the opportunity to &lt;strong&gt;make a difference&lt;/strong&gt; by personally contributing to the redesign of your country’s public service provision models while rapidly expanding your skills in a dynamic and highly professional environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will contend with strategic aspects of the public administration every day:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;devising and implementing the digital strategy;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;rethinking the citizen/user experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;designing service provision processes and the supporting information systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;designing performance management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;supporting the analysis of public policies, from design through to implementation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;applying evaluation and monitoring tools to measure the impact, effectiveness and efficiency of public programmes and investments (e.g. ex-ante, in itinere and ex-post evaluation);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;supporting the management and reporting of publicly and EU-funded programmes (e.g. PNRR, structural and cohesion funds), including KPI definition and results monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;engaging and coordinating with the relevant stakeholders (public officials, citizens, institutional and private actors) to support co-design and change management initiatives;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you ready to help change and improve our country?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At KPMG you will be directly involved where change must happen, working closely with the officials and managers of the Italian PA to make public services increasingly user friendly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join a group of young colleagues and professionals dedicated to creating and generating the change every day. These colleagues will guide you as you grow and act as a touchstone, in addition to sharing ongoing training programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For our office in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, we are recruiting professionals with drive and a sense of accountability to change the system. They must be goal-oriented, enthusiastic and highly motivated team players.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The successful candidate has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a degree in business and/or engineering management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;studies preferably focused on: business organization/administration, finance and control/organization of public administrations/digital transformation/public procurement;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study/work experience abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;sound understanding of policy and program evaluation methodologies and monitoring frameworks (e.g. KPI/indicator design, logical framework/theory of change, cost-benefit analysis, impact assessment);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt; good quantitative and data analysis skills, with the ability to interpret data to support decision-making (knowledge of Excel required; familiarity with data visualization or statistical tools such as Power BI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you&apos;ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages creativity and teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International mindset and innovative projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship with a monthly allowance of €1,000 or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better - Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individuality, continuous deepening, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s Values that give rise to an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, which allows our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.  Within our Impact Plan - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarized all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”) as amended. For more information, please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CA1&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Public-Sector-Consultant-Milano/1365901757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365901757</guid><g:id>1365901757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Supply Chain &amp; Operations | Padua (Padova, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Padua&lt;/strong&gt;, you will have the opportunity to be part of the biggest revolution taking place by rethinking customer operating models from a digital perspective. You will work closely with market-leading companies on innovation topics and support our clients throughout their digital transformation journey.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Rethink the operating models of key business functions (with a specific focus on the Extended Supply Chain) by redesigning processes, revising the organizational structure and evaluating new technologies to support the Business;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Assess the impacts and expected benefits of initiatives identified through business cases and monitor pre- and post-transformation performance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Lead and coordinate complex Business and Digital Transformation programs with Program, Project &amp;amp; Change Management initiatives;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Target Operating Model Design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Management Engineering &lt;/strong&gt;or &lt;strong&gt;Management&lt;/strong&gt; (or similar);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Organizational and teamwork skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; with attention to detail, including the ability to prioritize and manage various complex tasks and activities; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;MS Office&lt;/strong&gt; package;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MC2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Padova-Junior-Consultant-Supply-Chain-&amp;-Operations-Padua/1366530657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366530657</guid><g:id>1366530657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Padova, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Software Engineer - Digital Assurance Team (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Senior Software Engineer - Digital Assurance Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Il Digital Assurance Team è un team all’avanguardia di KPMG in cui diverse competenze collaborano per dare forma alla digitalizzazione del futuro dei servizi di assurance e revisione contabile. I nostri servizi sono sviluppati da professionisti appassionati che vogliono offrire valore in un nuovo contesto in cui integrare la comprensione delle tematiche contabili e normative con le più recenti soluzioni tecnologiche.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Fondamenti di Programmazione: scriverai e analizzerai &lt;strong&gt;codici&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Manipolazione e Visualizzazione dei Dati: userai tool di &lt;strong&gt;data management e visualization&lt;/strong&gt; per pulire, trasformare e visualizzare i dati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Framework Web e Markup: creerai splendide interfacce utilizzando &lt;strong&gt;HTML, CSS&lt;/strong&gt; e framework &lt;strong&gt;JavaScript&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Database: gestirai grandi quantità di &lt;strong&gt;dati&lt;/strong&gt;, sia NoSQL che relazionali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai una laurea&lt;strong&gt; STEM&lt;/strong&gt; e ti riconosci in questa descrizione, potresti essere la risorsa che stiamo cercando! Get candidate (🎓=True, attitude=True)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai almeno 2 anni di esperienza pratica con &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; e&lt;strong&gt; React&lt;/strong&gt;, utilizzato per analisi dati, automazione e sviluppo di soluzioni reali &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza con tool di manipolazione dati come &lt;strong&gt;IDEA, KNIME, PBI&lt;/strong&gt; (Power Query, Power Pivot), Qlik e abilità nell&apos;utilizzo di strumenti di visualizzazione dei dati come &lt;strong&gt;PowerBI&lt;/strong&gt;, Qlik e &lt;strong&gt;Tableau&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza con i framework &lt;strong&gt;Javascript&lt;/strong&gt; come &lt;strong&gt;React o AngularJS&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;{console.log(&quot;Qua facciamo un salto quantico&quot;)}&lt;/strong&gt; e linguaggi di markup come &lt;strong&gt;HTML e CSS&lt;/strong&gt; non possono essere &lt;strong&gt;“404 Not Found” nel tuo repertorio; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Sai come fare fit, train e test sui modelli di &lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning&lt;/strong&gt; rimanendo lontano dall&apos;overfitting? Cerchiamo un candidato che, come un buon modello di Machine Learning, sia in grado di imparare dagli errori e di evolversi. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;while 1 &amp;lt; 2: learn(); exit()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 30.000 e € 40.500, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer - Digital Assurance Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Digital Assurance Team&lt;/strong&gt; is KPMG’s innovative team which brings together different skill sets to shape the digitalization of the future for assurance and audit services. KPMG’s cutting-edge Digital assurance team brings together different skill sets to shape the digitalisation of the future for assurance and audit services. Our services are developed by professionals who are passionate about what they do and who want to bring value to a new context where an understanding of accounting and regulatory issues dovetails with the most recent technological solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming&lt;/strong&gt; fundamentals: you will write and analyse &lt;strong&gt;code&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Data manipulation and visualisation: you will use &lt;strong&gt;data management&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;visualisation tools&lt;/strong&gt; to clean, transform and visualise data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Web framework and markup: you will develop outstanding interfaces using &lt;strong&gt;HTML, CSS&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;JavaScript&lt;/strong&gt; framework&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Databases: you will handle large amounts of data, both NoSQL and relational&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You have a &lt;strong&gt;STEM&lt;/strong&gt; degree and you see yourself in this description, you might be the candidate we are looking for! Get candidate (🎓=True, attitude=True)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You have at least 2 years of practical experience with &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt;, used for data analysis, automation and the development of real-world solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You have experience with data manipulation tools like &lt;strong&gt;IDEA&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;KNIME&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;PBI&lt;/strong&gt; (Power Query, Power Pivot), Qlik and skills in using data visualization tools like &lt;strong&gt;PowerBI&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;strong&gt; Qlik&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Tableau&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You have experience with &lt;strong&gt;JavaScript&lt;/strong&gt; frameworks like &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;AngularJS&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;{console.log(&quot;Here we make a quantum leap&quot;)} &lt;/strong&gt;and markup languages like &lt;strong&gt;HTML&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;CSS&lt;/strong&gt; cannot be &lt;strong&gt;“404 Not Found” in your repertoire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You know how to fit, train, and test &lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning&lt;/strong&gt; models while avoiding overfitting? We are looking for a candidate who, like a good Machine Learning model, can learn from mistakes and evolve. &lt;strong&gt;while 1 &amp;lt; 2: learn(); exit()&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive &lt;/strong&gt;and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages, and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training &lt;/strong&gt;and development programs to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International&lt;/strong&gt; mindset and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and &lt;strong&gt;mental well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from € 30.000 e € 40.500. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, integrity: these are the &lt;strong&gt;values of KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to &lt;strong&gt;express their full potential.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which attests to the compliance of our Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; certification, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance &lt;strong&gt;(ESG)&lt;/strong&gt; issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-TB1 &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-Software-Engineer-Digital-Assurance-Team/1359127757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1359127757</guid><g:id>1359127757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Audit</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Digital Finance &amp; AI Transformation (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory provides consulting services to support companies in business model transformation, process improvement, digitisation, risk analysis, and extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, when you join the Finance &amp;amp; Performance Management team across Italy, you will learn how finance projects are run end-to-end, from process analysis to reporting, and understand how AI can be applied to enhance processes and support decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct process assessments and gap analyses to evaluate the effectiveness of finance processes and controls, leveraging AI-enabled tools to accelerate digital finance transformation analysis, uncover recurring patterns, identify inefficiencies and gaps through best-practice benchmarking, and identify opportunities for automation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the Target Operating Model (TOM) using AI-assisted insights to optimize workflows, reduce manual tasks, and improve decision support;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Redefine performance management strategies, supporting CFOs in planning, budgeting, forecasting, and reporting, utilizing AI to enhance requirement analysis, drive innovative solution design, and enable predictive and scenario-based analytics;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support reporting and data visualization, creating dashboards and insights using AI to identify anomalies, uncover trends and key insights, and build intelligent, action-oriented dashboards that support decision-making;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with clients to implement and integrate EPM systems using AI-enabled modules to enhance planning, forecasting, and reporting, while assessing automation impacts and benefits through business cases and feasibility studies;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the organizational structure, competencies, resources, training plans, operating logic, and timelines for finance digital transformation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your skills and characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A master’s degree in Artificial Intelligence, Business Analytics or similar AI-oriented programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of English, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset and curiosity about the application of AI in finance processes and decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in learning how finance transformation projects are executed and how AI can generate actionable insights in real business contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to bridge business understanding and technology, using AI as a tool to deliver insights that support planning, forecasting, and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive and equitable work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages creativity and teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced training and development programmes to stay current, including AI and data-driven finance topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International mindset and innovative projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity. These are the KPMG values that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential. As part of our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network complies with ISO 30415 standards for Diversity and Inclusion Management and UNI PdR 125 on gender equality. Within our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MS2&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Consultant-Digital-Finance-&amp;-AI-Transformation/1359756857/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1359756857</guid><g:id>1359756857</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Consultant - Cyber Security | Padova (Padova, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella &lt;strong&gt;digitalizzazione&lt;/strong&gt; dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk&lt;/strong&gt;, linea di servizi di KPMG che ha anticipato e seguito nel tempo le richieste del mercato relative alle tematiche di Information Risk Management e Sicurezza Informatica, sviluppando costantemente le competenze e capacità di analisi a protezione del patrimonio informativo aziendale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Comprendere il contesto tecnologico e di business dei clienti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Analizzare e proteggere il patrimonio informativo aziendale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Garantire la sicurezza delle informazioni e delle strategie di business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Integrare tecnologie innovative nelle infrastrutture esistenti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I professionisti appartenenti al team IRM di KPMG supportano le organizzazioni in tutte le fasi necessarie a garantire la sicurezza delle loro informazioni e delle loro strategie di business. Possiamo affiancare i nostri clienti per migliorare la crescita e creare valore. Possiamo aiutarli a fare i giusti investimenti nel momento giusto, a considerare le implicazioni più ampie della digital disruption, ad integrare tecnologie innovative nelle infrastrutture esistenti.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei un laureando/neolaureato magistrale in Cybersecurity, Informatica, Ingegneria informatica, Crime&amp;amp;Security Analysis, Cybersecurity Risk Strategy and Governance ecc;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai passione per le nuove tecnologie e la loro declinazione nei contesti aziendali;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai capacità di analisi dei dati e di sintesi nella presentazione dei risultati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Conosci i principali standard o practice di riferimento (ISO 27001, COBIT ecc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai interesse per l&apos;ambito dei Sistemi Informativi aziendali, intesi quale strumento abilitante per l&apos;efficace erogazione dei processi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai predisposizioni per la risoluzione di problemi complessi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei proattivo, flessibile e capace di adattarti a contesti eterogenei e sfidanti;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una buona padronanza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a viaggiare sul territorio nazionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ / L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso compresa tra € 28.000 e € 31.500, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and &lt;strong&gt;digitalisation&lt;/strong&gt;, risk analysis and management, and support in corporate finance transactions.  The &lt;strong&gt;Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk &lt;/strong&gt;team handles the KPMG line of services that pre-empted and continues to meet market demand for information risk management and cybersecurity services, continually developing the analytical skills and expertise to protect company information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;understanding clients’ technological and business context;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;analysing and protecting their information assets;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ensuring information and business strategies are secure;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;integrating innovative technologies into existing infrastructures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The members of KPMG’s CTR team support organisations across all phases of the process to ensure the security of their information and business strategies. We help our clients drive growth and generate value.  We can help them make the right investments at the right time, consider the broader implications of the digital disruption and build breakthrough innovations into their legacy infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;or will soon have a master’s degree in cybersecurity, computer science or computer engineering, Crime&amp;amp;Security Analysis, Cybersecurity Risk Strategy and Governance etc;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a passion for new technologies and their application in corporate settings;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an ability to analyse and summarise data when reporting findings;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;knowledge of the main applicable standards or practices (ISO 27001, COBIT, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an interest in corporate IT systems as enablers for the effective performance of processes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an aptitude for complex problem solving;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a proactive, flexible approach and the ability to adapt to varied, challenging situations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of English, preferably with study/work experience abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;availability to travel within Italy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay up-to-date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship with a monthly allowance of €800 / This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary  ranging from €28,000 to €31,500. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Padova-Consultant-Cyber-Security-Padova/1361016557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1361016557</guid><g:id>1361016557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Padova, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Consultant - Cyber Security | Roma (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella &lt;strong&gt;digitalizzazione&lt;/strong&gt; dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk&lt;/strong&gt;, linea di servizi di KPMG che ha anticipato e seguito nel tempo le richieste del mercato relative alle tematiche di Information Risk Management e Sicurezza Informatica, sviluppando costantemente le competenze e capacità di analisi a protezione del patrimonio informativo aziendale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Comprendere il contesto tecnologico e di business dei clienti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Analizzare e proteggere il patrimonio informativo aziendale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Garantire la sicurezza delle informazioni e delle strategie di business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Integrare tecnologie innovative nelle infrastrutture esistenti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I professionisti appartenenti al team IRM di KPMG supportano le organizzazioni in tutte le fasi necessarie a garantire la sicurezza delle loro informazioni e delle loro strategie di business. Possiamo affiancare i nostri clienti per migliorare la crescita e creare valore. Possiamo aiutarli a fare i giusti investimenti nel momento giusto, a considerare le implicazioni più ampie della digital disruption, ad integrare tecnologie innovative nelle infrastrutture esistenti.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei un laureando/neolaureato magistrale in Cybersecurity, Informatica, Ingegneria informatica, Crime&amp;amp;Security Analysis, Cybersecurity Risk Strategy and Governance ecc;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai passione per le nuove tecnologie e la loro declinazione nei contesti aziendali;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai capacità di analisi dei dati e di sintesi nella presentazione dei risultati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Conosci i principali standard o practice di riferimento (ISO 27001, COBIT ecc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai interesse per l&apos;ambito dei Sistemi Informativi aziendali, intesi quale strumento abilitante per l&apos;efficace erogazione dei processi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai predisposizioni per la risoluzione di problemi complessi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei proattivo, flessibile e capace di adattarti a contesti eterogenei e sfidanti;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una buona padronanza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a viaggiare sul territorio nazionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ / L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso compresa tra € 28.000 e € 31.500, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and &lt;strong&gt;digitalisation&lt;/strong&gt;, risk analysis and management, and support in corporate finance transactions.  The &lt;strong&gt;Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk &lt;/strong&gt;team handles the KPMG line of services that pre-empted and continues to meet market demand for information risk management and cybersecurity services, continually developing the analytical skills and expertise to protect company information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;understanding clients’ technological and business context;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;analysing and protecting their information assets;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ensuring information and business strategies are secure;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;integrating innovative technologies into existing infrastructures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The members of KPMG’s CTR team support organisations across all phases of the process to ensure the security of their information and business strategies. We help our clients drive growth and generate value.  We can help them make the right investments at the right time, consider the broader implications of the digital disruption and build breakthrough innovations into their legacy infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;or will soon have a master’s degree in cybersecurity, computer science or computer engineering, Crime&amp;amp;Security Analysis, Cybersecurity Risk Strategy and Governance etc;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a passion for new technologies and their application in corporate settings;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an ability to analyse and summarise data when reporting findings;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;knowledge of the main applicable standards or practices (ISO 27001, COBIT, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an interest in corporate IT systems as enablers for the effective performance of processes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an aptitude for complex problem solving;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a proactive, flexible approach and the ability to adapt to varied, challenging situations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of English, preferably with study/work experience abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;availability to travel within Italy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay up-to-date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship with a monthly allowance of €800 / This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary  ranging from €28,000 to €31,500. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Consultant-Cyber-Security-Roma/1361657957/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1361657957</guid><g:id>1361657957</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant - ServiceNow (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che abbia un impatto concreto sulle organizzazioni? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di affiancare aziende di diversi settori nei loro percorsi di trasformazione digitale, contribuendo alla progettazione e implementazione di soluzioni che migliorano il funzionamento dei processi aziendali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory supporta le imprese nell’evoluzione dei propri modelli operativi attraverso l’ottimizzazione dei processi, l’adozione di piattaforme digitali e l’introduzione di soluzioni tecnologiche in grado di rendere le attività più efficienti, integrate e tracciabili.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte dell&apos;area Enterprise Platform nel team&lt;strong&gt; ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt;, contribuirai alla progettazione e realizzazione di soluzioni basate sulla piattaforma ServiceNow, utilizzata dalle organizzazioni per gestire e digitalizzare processi operativi e di servizio, come IT Service Management, gestione delle richieste interne e workflow tra diverse funzioni aziendali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Analizzare i &lt;strong&gt;processi&lt;/strong&gt; e i&lt;strong&gt; requisiti di business&lt;/strong&gt; del cliente, collaborando con stakeholder di diverse funzioni aziendali per identificare opportunità di &lt;strong&gt;digitalizzazione&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;miglioramento dei flussi operativi&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Supportare la &lt;strong&gt;progettazione della soluzione applicativa&lt;/strong&gt; su piattaforma ServiceNow, contribuendo alla definizione del design funzionale e alla configurazione dei moduli più adatti alle esigenze del cliente.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Configurare&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;personalizzare&lt;/strong&gt; i moduli ServiceNow (in particolare ambiti ITSM, ITOM e/o CSM), traducendo i requisiti di business in workflow e funzionalità implementate sulla piattaforma.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Contribuire alla definizione e alla produzione della &lt;strong&gt;documentazione progettuale&lt;/strong&gt; (analisi funzionali, specifiche di configurazione, documentazione di processo).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Partecipare alle &lt;strong&gt;attività di testing &lt;/strong&gt;della soluzione (SIT e UAT), collaborando con gli utenti del cliente per verificare la corretta implementazione dei requisiti e garantire la qualità delle soluzioni rilasciate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Supportare le fasi di rilascio e &lt;strong&gt;go-live&lt;/strong&gt; della soluzione, affiancando il cliente durante il periodo di hypercare e contribuendo alla risoluzione delle eventuali &lt;strong&gt;criticità operative&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Nel corso delle attività potrai essere coinvolta/o in progetti &lt;strong&gt;nazionali&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;internazionali&lt;/strong&gt;, lavorando con team multidisciplinari e clienti appartenenti a diversi settori industriali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai maturato&lt;strong&gt; esperienza su progetti di implementazione ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt;, idealmente su moduli come &lt;strong&gt;ITSM, ITOM o CSM&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza nella &lt;strong&gt;raccolta e analisi dei requisiti funzionali&lt;/strong&gt; e nella configurazione di soluzioni applicative su piattaforma ServiceNow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai familiarità con la progettazione e gestione di &lt;strong&gt;workflow digitali e processi di service management&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai partecipato a progetti di implementazione o evoluzione di piattaforme enterprise in contesti consulenziali o IT.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona conoscenza della lingua inglese, necessaria per lavorare in contesti progettuali internazionali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a trasferte nazionali e internazionali, in linea con le esigenze dei progetti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a style=&quot;text-decoration:underline&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory provides consulting services to businesses, assisting them in transforming their business models, improving and digitizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, and supporting extraordinary financial operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;By joining the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platform Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be involved in managing organizational change processes. Together with experienced colleagues, you will analyze strategic requirements to implement the best digital solutions available on the market for integrated process management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analyzing business requirements, collaborating with various corporate areas to identify needs in ITSM, ITOM, and other ServiceNow applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Designing optimal solutions using the ServiceNow platform, configuring and customizing it to meet the specific needs of the client.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Drafting detailed documentation, including functional and technical analyses, for end-to-end processes related to business and IT workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Configuring ServiceNow modules, ensuring that the solution is tailored to the client’s needs and objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conducting internal tests and collaborating with end users to ensure that the solutions meet KPMG’s and the client’s quality standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Delivering training sessions for business users, supporting them in correctly adopting the implemented solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Providing support to clients during the go-live phase and Hypercare period, ensuring a smooth transition and consolidation of new functionalities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will work on both national and international projects, collaborating with highly qualified professionals and working closely with clients from various industries, delivering tailored solutions to meet their specific business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;experience implementing ServiceNow solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, with a specific focus on modules such as ITSM, ITOM, and/or CSM.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have solid experience in managing &lt;strong&gt;complex business processes&lt;/strong&gt;, focusing on their optimization and digitization through workflow automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have a &lt;strong&gt;good command of the English language&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably with study and/or work experiences abroad.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You are available to &lt;strong&gt;travel nationally and internationally&lt;/strong&gt; to support clients at all project stages.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, fair work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic setting that fosters creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A hybrid working model to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to keep your skills up-to-date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate&apos;s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better - Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity: these are the values of KPMG that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to fully express their potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; outlines the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) topics. Learn more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;br&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. ensures equal opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Senior-Consultant-ServiceNow/1368280057/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368280057</guid><g:id>1368280057</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Legal Public Sector | Roma (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Legal Public Sector Consultant | Roma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. I professionisti dello &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato &lt;/strong&gt;di KPMG intervengono in tutte le principali aree della fiscalità e del diritto societario offrendo servizi integrati e innovativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Siamo alla ricerca di una figura professionale da inserire nel team &lt;strong&gt;Legal Public Sector&lt;/strong&gt; per lo svolgimento di attività in ambito di diritto dei contratti pubblici, della normativa in materia di anticorruzione e trasparenza, nonché dei processi di digitalizzazione della pubblica amministrazione (Codice dell’Amministrazione Digitale).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In particolare, le attività saranno svolte con la pubblica amministrazione e organismi similari nei seguenti ambiti:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;contratti pubblici di lavori, servizi e forniture (D.lgs. n. 36/2023), anche con riferimento a operazioni di partenariato pubblico-privato;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;pubblica amministrazione digitale, e-procurement, sanità digitale e, in generale, digitalizzazione dei procedimenti amministrativi e gestione della relativa documentazione (D.lgs. n. 82/2005);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;obblighi previsti dalla normativa anticorruzione e trasparenza (Legge n. 190/2012 e D.lgs. n. 33/2013);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;disciplina delle società a partecipazione pubblica (D.lgs. n. 175/2016).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se possiedi:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;laurea magistrale in Giurisprudenza con votazione finale pari ad almeno 105/110;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;esperienzaminima di&lt;strong&gt; 4 anni&lt;/strong&gt; maturata presso primari studi legali, società a partecipazione pubblica o enti pubblici in uno o più degli ambiti sopra indicati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;abilitazione alla professione forense o pratica forense completata;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;buona conoscenza di Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;eccellenti capacità relazionali e di lavoro in team;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;ottime capacità organizzative, spirito d’iniziativa e problem solving;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;forte motivazione alla crescita professionale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;approccio flessibile e dinamico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working With Us Also Means&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Formazione continua&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Percorsi di crescita professionale definiti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Legal Public Sector Consultant | Rome&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;–&lt;em&gt; Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you’ll have the opportunity to help your firm, clients and colleagues address and resolve some of today’s most topical and complex issues. Our &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Tax &amp;amp; Legal&lt;/strong&gt; professionals work at the forefront of tax and corporate law, delivering integrated and innovative services across all key areas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;We are recruiting for a new member of our &lt;strong&gt;Legal Public Sector &lt;/strong&gt;team. The successful candidate will work in the areas of public procurement law, anti-corruption and transparency requirements, the processing of personal data in the public sector (GDPR), and the digitalization of the public administration (Digital Administration Code). In particular, the new team member will support public-sector bodies and similar organizations in the following areas:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;public contracts for works, services and supplies (Legislative Decree no. 36/2023);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;processing of personal data in the public sector (EU Regulation 679/2016 – GDPR, Legislative Decree no. 196/2003);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;digital public administration, e-procurement, digital healthcare and, in general, the digitalization of administrative procedures and the management of related documentation (Legislative Decree no. 82/2005);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;anti-corruption and transparency obligations (Law no. 190/2012 and Legislative Decree no. 33/2013);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;the regulation of publicly owned companies (Legislative Decree no. 179/2016).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Qualifications, Skills and Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a master’s degree in law, with a final mark of at least 105/110;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;at least &lt;strong&gt;four years&lt;/strong&gt;’ experience at a leading law firm, publicly owned company or public entity, working in one or more of the areas listed above;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;qualified as a lawyer or completed your qualifying work experience;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;strong organizational skills, initiative, and problem-solving abilities;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;strong motivation to grow professionally;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a flexible and dynamic approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Working With Us Also Means&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ongoing professional development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A clearly defined career path.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that fosters &lt;strong&gt;creativity &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;teamworking&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to support continuous learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international outlook&lt;/strong&gt; and a focus on &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individual, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values &lt;/strong&gt;that foster an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge. KPMG supports all its people in reaching their full potential, whatever their identity or background. Fully committed to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, we are &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 compliant &lt;/strong&gt;(ISO 30415:2021 – Human Resources Management – Diversity and Inclusion). KPMG in Italy is also &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125 &lt;/strong&gt;compliant (UNI/PdR 125:2022 – measures to ensure gender equality in audit and assurance services).  You can find a summary of all our &lt;strong&gt;concrete&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;ESG &lt;/strong&gt;(environmental, social, and governance) &lt;strong&gt;actions&lt;/strong&gt; in our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG in Italy is an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – “GDPR”) as subsequently amended. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy notice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-CN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Senior-Legal-Public-Sector-Roma/1367494357/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367494357</guid><g:id>1367494357</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Legal</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Manager Cybersecurity - Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di Cyber &amp;amp; Tech Risk a Milano, lavorerai con i nostri esperti di ICT security per aiutare i clienti a identificare, gestire e mitigare i rischi informatici che minacciano il loro business, collaborando su progetti rilevanti per le aziende leader di mercato. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sarai responsabile della &lt;strong&gt;gestione, pianificazione ed esecuzione di progetti tecnologici e tecnologici complessi&lt;/strong&gt;, con particolare focus su iniziative di &lt;strong&gt;trasformazione digitale&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;implementazione di soluzioni tecnologiche&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;coordinamento di team multidisciplinari&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:square;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestione end-to-end dei progetti tecnologici&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;, dalla fase di analisi e definizione dei requisiti fino al rilascio e alla messa in esercizio. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 36.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:square;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Coordinamento di team interni ed esterni&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;, inclusi potenzialmente anche fornitori e partner tecnologici. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:square;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analisi delle esigenze di business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; e traduzione in soluzioni tecnologiche scalabili e innovative. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:square;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Monitoraggio e controllo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; di tempi, costi, rischi e qualità dei deliverable. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:square;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Change management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; e supporto alle funzioni aziendali nell’adozione delle nuove tecnologie, nelle attività day-by-day e nella mitigazione degli impatti operativi. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:square;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; verso gli stakeholder, con aggiornamenti sullo stato di avanzamento dei progetti, monitoraggio dei KPI, mitigazione dei rischi, gestione di eventuali criticità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Alcune tra le potenziali iniziative progettuali gestite includeranno il disegno dell’offerta progettuale e, ove richiesto dal cliente, l’implementazione di tool a presidio del rischio cyber nei seguenti ambiti:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:square;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;security testing &amp;amp; monitoring &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;(es.: Microsoft Sentinel/Defender, Splunk, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;identity governance &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;(es.: SailPoint, CyberArk, Okta, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;data protection &amp;amp; data loss prevention &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;(es.: Microsoft Purview, Informatica, Varonis, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;IT/OT convergence &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;(es.: Nozomi, Claroty, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolto in progetti sia nazionali che internazionali, collaborando con professionisti altamente qualificati e lavorando a stretto contatto con i nostri clienti principali, che operano in settori eterogenei, ricoprendo un ruolo che richiede una solida competenza tecnica e capacità di leadership per garantire il successo dei progetti in termini di tempi, costi e qualità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Per essere il candidato ideale non ti possono mancare:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Esperienza consolidata&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; (6+ anni) nella gestione di progetti tecnologici complessi o programmi di trasformazione digitale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Laurea in discipline tecnico-scientifiche (Ingegneria, Informatica o equivalenti)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza dei &lt;strong&gt;principali standard&lt;/strong&gt; di riferimento (NIST, ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza dei &lt;strong&gt;principali ambiti tecnologici&lt;/strong&gt; aziendali, e soluzioni di sicurezza correlate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza dei &lt;strong&gt;principali ambiti normativi&lt;/strong&gt; e regolatori, in materia di cybersecurity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Competenze tecniche&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; su architetture IT, infrastrutture, applicazioni e/o soluzioni cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza metodologie di Project Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; (es. PMI, PRINCE2), preferibilmente con relative &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Capacità di leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;, problem solving e gestione di stakeholder a diversi livelli&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ottime doti comunicative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;, orientamento al risultato&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ottima conoscenza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, parlata e scritta, meglio se avvalorata da un’esperienza all’estero e da una specifica certificazione&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Forte attitudine ed interesse verso tematiche tecnologiche innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; internazionale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 50.000 e € 59.000 determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto delle individualità, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità: questi sono i valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e alla crescita personale e professionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie al nostro impegno per un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, abbiamo ottenuto le certificazioni ISO 30415 (Gestione della Diversità e Inclusione) e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; (Parità di genere). Scopri tutte le nostre azioni concrete nel nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com), che descrive le nostre iniziative su temi ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your role and responsibilities &lt;/strong&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society and colleagues address and solve today’s most pressing and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory provides consulting services to support organisations in transforming their business models, improving and digitising processes, analysing and managing risks, and delivering extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining the Cyber &amp;amp; Tech Risk team in Milan, you will work with our cybersecurity experts to help clients identify, manage and mitigate the cyber risks that threaten their businesses, collaborating on high‑profile projects for market‑leading companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for the management, planning and execution of complex technology projects and programmes, with a particular focus on digital transformation initiatives, the implementation of technology solutions and the coordination of multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End‑to‑end management of technology projects, from requirements analysis and definition through to release and go‑live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordination of internal and external teams, including suppliers and technology partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysis of business needs and translation into scalable, innovative technology solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring and control of timelines, costs, risks and quality of deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change management and support to business functions in adopting new technologies, day‑to‑day activities and mitigating operational impacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting to stakeholders, including project status updates, KPI tracking, risk mitigation and issue management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Selected project initiatives may include the design of the engagement approach and, where requested by the client, implementation of cyber risk tools in areas such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security testing &amp;amp; monitoring (e.g., Microsoft Sentinel/Defender, Splunk)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identity governance (e.g., SailPoint, CyberArk, Okta)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data protection &amp;amp; data loss prevention (e.g., Microsoft Purview, Informatica, Varonis)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IT/OT convergence (e.g., Nozomi, Claroty)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be involved in both national and international engagements, working with highly qualified professionals and closely with our key clients across diverse sectors. The role requires strong technical acumen and leadership to ensure project success in terms of time, cost and quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your skills and attributes To be the ideal candidate, you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in a technical/scientific discipline (Engineering, Computer Science or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years’ experience managing complex technology projects or digital transformation programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of leading standards and frameworks (NIST, ISO/IEC 27001, COBIT, ITIL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of key enterprise technology domains and related security solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of the main regulatory and compliance landscape in cybersecurity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical skills across IT architectures, infrastructure, applications and/or cloud solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of project management methodologies (e.g., PMI, PRINCE2); related certifications preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership, problem‑solving and stakeholder management skills at multiple levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a results‑oriented mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent command of written and spoken English; international experience and/or certification is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong interest in and aptitude for innovative technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive, equitable workplace that respects, encourages and values diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A stimulating, dynamic environment that fosters creativity and teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hybrid working model to support a healthy work‑life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced training and development programmes to keep your skills current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An international mindset and innovative engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental wellbeing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary ranging from €50,000 to €59,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better &lt;/strong&gt;– Our values and our commitment Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community impact and integrity: these are KPMG values that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and to personal and professional growth. Thanks to our commitment to an inclusive workplace, we have achieved ISO 30415 (Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Management) and UNI PdR 125 (Gender Equality) certifications. Discover our concrete actions in our Impact Plan – Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com), which outlines our initiatives on environmental, social and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data protection notice Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – “GDPR”) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy notice. KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-AA1 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Manager-Cybersecurity-Milano/1349057857/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1349057857</guid><g:id>1349057857</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant | Financial Services Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot; class=&quot;joqReqEditorReadOnlyDiv richTextContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_content&quot; style=&quot;padding:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Financial Services Team&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will work closely with &lt;strong&gt;Banking &amp;amp; Insurance&lt;/strong&gt; sector on topics such as: business process reengineering to increase the economic-financial and physical-operational performance and digital transformation. This specialization offers the opportunity to work on nationally and internationally significant projects within the Financial Sector industry, participating in key initiatives of change and improvement in the realm of business processes efficiency and digitization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Definition of &lt;strong&gt;strategic development and growth opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; in the insurance sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development of &lt;strong&gt;industrial and business plans&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feasibility studies&lt;/strong&gt; for the start-up of new businesses and innovative products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management of complex &lt;strong&gt;strategic reorganization transactions&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;business integration deals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Definition and implementation of &lt;strong&gt;business strategy&lt;/strong&gt; of major financial institutions (e.g., reorganization of distribution networks, marketing plans, pricing models, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market, benchmarking and expected evolution analysis&lt;/strong&gt; of major sectors/business segments in the financial market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Definition of &lt;strong&gt;operating models&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;performance improvement programs&lt;/strong&gt; including the use of &lt;strong&gt;innovative technological solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Management Engineering, Finance, Management &lt;/strong&gt;or related field, with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;financial services&lt;/strong&gt; industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2 years of experience in a similar role, preferably with a consulting company or a multinational&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational and teamwork skills&lt;/strong&gt; with attention to detail, including the ability to prioritize and manage various complex tasks and activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;MS Office&lt;/strong&gt; package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-LZ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding:0.0px;text-indent:-0.5pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#ffffff&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding:0.0px;text-indent:-0.5pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;72&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;72full&amp;#39;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#ffffff&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-Consultant-Financial-Services-Milano/1367485857/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367485857</guid><g:id>1367485857</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Transportation (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Transportation Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt;, you will &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;focus on business reorganization in procurement and supply chain, innovation and reengineering, strategy and transformation: the goal is to improve the performance of production processes by adapting them to the changing needs of markets and customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;You will have the opportunity to work together with leading &lt;strong&gt;Transportation clients&lt;/strong&gt; on high-value strategic projects that have a crucial impact on their business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Defining &lt;strong&gt;business strategies&lt;/strong&gt; in the transportation industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Preparation of &lt;strong&gt;business plans&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Feasibility studies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;economic-financial analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Analysis of &lt;strong&gt;investment sustainability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Reorganization and reengineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt; of industrial processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Hlk188551403&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Management &lt;/strong&gt;or related field &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Organizational and teamwork skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt; with attention to detail, including the ability to prioritize and manage various complex tasks and activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;MS Office&lt;/strong&gt; package&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 17.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.8px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.8px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.8px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.8px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.8px&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.8px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 21.3pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MC2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Junior-Consultant-Transportation/1368643557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368643557</guid><g:id>1368643557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant IAM - Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk a Milano, lavorerai con i nostri esperti di ICT security per aiutare i clienti ad affrontare i rischi informatici che minacciano il loro business. Collaborerai su progetti rilevanti per le aziende leader di mercato.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Progettare e implementare soluzioni tecnologiche best-of-breed e leader di mercato in ambito Identity and Access Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestire, analizzare e pianificare l&apos;evoluzione delle soluzioni IAM in un contesto medio/grande&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Progettare e implementare architetture di Identity &amp;amp; Access Management e dei seguenti argomenti: Single Sign On, Multi-Factor Authentication, Federation (SAML, OAuth2, OIDC), One-Time-Password, Identity Governance, provisioning e riconciliazione degli account su più target, gestione delle password (modifica, ripristino, self-service, sincronizzazione, ecc.), controllo degli accessi basato sui ruoli (RBAC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Progettare, implementare e gestire le soluzioni per la governance degli account privilegiati (PAM);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Progettare, implementare e gestione delle soluzioni di Identity Governance, comprensivo di definizione ed implementazione di Workflow Custom per gestire il ciclo di vita dell&apos;utente, Provisioning/Deprovisioning di account, l&apos;integrazione di applicazioni e la creazione di flussi di lavoro.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; Sarai coinvolto in progetti sia nazionali che internazionali, collaborando con professionisti altamente qualificati, e lavorerai a stretto contatto con i nostri clienti del settore Financial Services, tra cui banche, assicurazioni e società di investimento, contribuendo alla gestione di rischi IT, governance, audit, privacy e sicurezza informatica.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi oltre 2 anni di esperienza, preferibilmente in società di consulenza, in ambito IAM, IAG, PAM;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona conoscenza di almeno una delle seguenti tecnologie:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Okta&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Forgerock&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Cyberark&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Delinea&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sailpoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;OneIdentity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Saviynt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai conseguito conseguito almeno una certificazione in merito alle tecnologie sopramenzionate;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi conoscenza di LDAP (es. MS Active Directory, ecc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi una conoscenza base dei sistemi operativi (*nx, Microsoft).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi conoscenza base delle tecnologie Database (MSSQL, Oracle, Mysql).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi una forte comprensione delle best practice IAM, dei requisiti di sicurezza e di conformità ed esperienza con altre tecnologie IAM quali active directory, single sign-on, PAM e autenticazione a più fattori (MFA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi una Laurea in Informatica o Scienze Informatiche e dell’Informazione, Ingegneria Informatica, Sicurezza Informatica;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona conoscenza della lingua inglese, meglio se avvalorata da un’esperienza di studio e/o lavoro all’estero.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 38.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 48.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto delle individualità, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità: questi sono i valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e alla crescita personale e professionale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie al nostro impegno per un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, abbiamo ottenuto le certificazioni ISO 30415 (Gestione della Diversità e Inclusione) e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; (Parità di genere). Scopri tutte le nostre azioni concrete nel nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com), che descrive le nostre iniziative su temi ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do meaningful and impactful work? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues face and solve today’s most complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; offers consulting services to companies to support them in transforming their business models, improving and digitizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, and conducting extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;By joining the Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk Team, you will work with our information governance experts, who focus on innovation and adopt a risk-based approach, with functional experience in specific business sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will join the Milan team and be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Designing and implementing best-of-breed and market-leading technological solutions in Identity and Access Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Managing, analyzing, and planning the evolution of IAM solutions in a medium/large context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; Designing and implementing Identity &amp;amp; Access Management architectures and the following topics: Single Sign-On, Multi-Factor Authentication, Federation (SAML, OAuth2, OIDC), One-Time-Password, Identity Governance, account provisioning and reconciliation across multiple targets, password management (reset, recovery, self-service, synchronization, etc.), and role-based access control (RBAC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Designing, implementing, and managing solutions for privileged account governance (PAM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Designing, implementing, and managing Identity Governance solutions, including defining and implementing custom workflows to manage the user lifecycle, account provisioning/deprovisioning, application integration, and workflow creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will be involved in both national and international projects, collaborating with highly qualified professionals, and working closely with our clients in the Financial Services sector, including banks, insurance companies, and investment firms, contributing to IT risk management, governance, audits, privacy, and cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have 2-4 years of experience, preferably in consulting firms, in IAM, IAG, PAM;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; You have a good knowledge of at least one of the following technologies:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; Okta&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Forgerock&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;CyberArk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Delinea&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;SailPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;OneIdentity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Saviynt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have obtained at least one certification related to the aforementioned technologies;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; You have knowledge of LDAP (e.g., MS Active Directory, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have basic knowledge of operating systems (*nx, Microsoft);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have basic knowledge of database technologies (MSSQL, Oracle, MySQL);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; You have a strong understanding of IAM best practices, security and compliance requirements, and experience with other IAM technologies such as Active Directory, Single Sign-On, PAM, and Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You hold a degree in Computer Science, Information Sciences, Computer Engineering, or Cybersecurity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; You have a good command of the English language, preferably supported by study and/or work experience abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A dynamic and stimulating context that promotes creativity and teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A hybrid working model, promoting a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay up-to-date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €38,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €48,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are KPMG’s values that foster an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to realize their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; Thanks to our commitment to promoting an inclusive work environment, our network has obtained ISO 30415 certification, which attests to the compliance of our Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125 certification, which certifies gender equality. Our concrete actions on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues are summarized in our Impact Plan - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-Consultant-IAM-Milano/1333129157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1333129157</guid><g:id>1333129157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Manager - S/4Hana Conversion (Torino, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare clienti, organizzazioni e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere sfide complesse e attuali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory supporta le imprese nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, oltre che nell&apos;analisi e gestione dei rischi e nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del Team Enterprise Platform sarai coinvolta/o nelle progettualità di conversione a SAP S/4HANA, con focus sugli approcci brownfield e bluefield.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Definizione dell&apos;&lt;strong&gt;approccio di conversione&lt;/strong&gt; più adatto al contesto, tra system conversion (brownfield) e selective data transition (bluefield)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Definizione della &lt;strong&gt;governance&lt;/strong&gt; end-to-end dei progetti di conversione S/4HANA, strutturando fasi, ruoli e modello di controllo su &lt;strong&gt;tempi, costi, rischi e qualità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Coordinamento dell&apos;&lt;strong&gt;execution operativa&lt;/strong&gt; dei progetti, garantendo l&apos;allineamento continuo tra i team tecnici e funzionali coinvolti e il rispetto dei piani concordati con il cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Coordinamento di &lt;strong&gt;team multidisciplinari&lt;/strong&gt;, assicurando qualità e coerenza dei deliverable lungo tutto il ciclo di vita del progetto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Gestione della relazione con gli &lt;strong&gt;sponsor di progetto&lt;/strong&gt; e le &lt;strong&gt;direzioni apicali&lt;/strong&gt; del cliente, come punto di riferimento su avanzamento, criticità e decisioni chiave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contributo allo sviluppo dell&apos;&lt;strong&gt;offering commerciale&lt;/strong&gt; dedicato alle progettualità di conversione, supportando la costruzione di proposte e l&apos;individuazione di nuove &lt;strong&gt;opportunità di business&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Conosci in profondità gli &lt;strong&gt;approcci di conversione a S/4HANA&lt;/strong&gt; (brownfield, bluefield/selective data transition) e i principali &lt;strong&gt;strumenti a supporto&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai maturato &lt;strong&gt;piena autonomia&lt;/strong&gt; nella gestione di progetti di trasformazione SAP complessi e &lt;strong&gt;multi-stakeholder&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza nella gestione della &lt;strong&gt;governance di progetto&lt;/strong&gt; secondo metodologie strutturate (es. SAP Activate, PMI, Prince2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi capacità di &lt;strong&gt;stakeholder management&lt;/strong&gt; verso interlocutori senior e sponsor di progetto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai attitudine al &lt;strong&gt;business development&lt;/strong&gt; e alla costruzione di proposte commerciali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona padronanza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt; e attitudine al lavoro in &lt;strong&gt;team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a &lt;strong&gt;trasferte&lt;/strong&gt; in Italia e all&apos;estero in base alle esigenze progettuali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt; e orientato alla valorizzazione delle &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto dinamico che incentiva &lt;strong&gt;collaborazione&lt;/strong&gt; e lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt; per favorire l&apos;equilibrio vita-lavoro&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo strutturati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere&lt;/strong&gt; psicofisico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 52.000 e € 65.000 per la qualifica di Manager e tra € 65.240 e € 84.000 per la qualifica di Senior Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all&apos;esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto dell&apos;individualità, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità sono i Valori di KPMG, alla base di un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e conoscenza.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie al nostro impegno per un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il Network è conforme agli standard ISO 30415 e UNI PdR 125. Nel nostro Impact Plan sono raccolte azioni concrete sui temi ambientali, sociali e di governance ESG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 GDPR e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that truly matters and makes an impact? At KPMG you&apos;ll have the opportunity to help clients, organizations and colleagues tackle and solve complex, current challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory supports businesses in transforming their business models, improving and digitalizing processes, as well as in risk analysis and management and extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Joining the Enterprise Platform Team, you will be involved in SAP S/4HANA conversion projects, with a focus on brownfield and bluefield approaches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be responsible for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Defining the &lt;strong&gt;conversion approach&lt;/strong&gt; best suited to the context, between &lt;strong&gt;system conversion (brownfield)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;selective data transition (bluefield)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Defining the end-to-end &lt;strong&gt;governance&lt;/strong&gt; of S/4HANA conversion projects, structuring phases, roles and the control model for &lt;strong&gt;timelines, costs, risks and quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Coordinating the &lt;strong&gt;operational execution&lt;/strong&gt; of projects, ensuring ongoing alignment across the technical and functional teams involved and adherence to the plans agreed with the client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Coordinating &lt;strong&gt;multidisciplinary teams&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring quality and consistency of deliverables throughout the project lifecycle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Managing the relationship with &lt;strong&gt;project sponsors&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;senior client leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, acting as the key point of reference on progress, issues and critical decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contributing to the development of the &lt;strong&gt;commercial offering&lt;/strong&gt; dedicated to conversion projects, supporting proposal building and the identification of new &lt;strong&gt;business opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Qualities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is a great fit for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have in-depth knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;S/4HANA conversion approaches&lt;/strong&gt; (brownfield, bluefield/selective data transition) and the main &lt;strong&gt;supporting tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have gained &lt;strong&gt;full autonomy&lt;/strong&gt; in managing complex, &lt;strong&gt;multi-stakeholder&lt;/strong&gt; SAP transformation projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have experience managing &lt;strong&gt;project governance&lt;/strong&gt; using structured methodologies (e.g. SAP Activate, PMI, Prince2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have strong &lt;strong&gt;stakeholder management&lt;/strong&gt; skills with senior contacts and project sponsors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have an aptitude for &lt;strong&gt;business development&lt;/strong&gt; and building commercial proposals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good command of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; and a strong aptitude for &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are available for &lt;strong&gt;travel&lt;/strong&gt; in Italy and abroad, based on project needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You&apos;ll Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A dynamic environment that fosters &lt;strong&gt;collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; way of working to support work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Structured &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives dedicated to &lt;strong&gt;wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with an indicative starting gross annual salary ranging from €52,000 to €65,000 for the Manager position and from €65,240 to €84,000 for the Senior Manager position, determined on the basis of objective criteria with specific reference to the candidate&apos;s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are also based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for the individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity are KPMG&apos;s Values, underpinning an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to an inclusive workplace, the Network complies with ISO 30415 and UNI PdR 125 standards. Our Impact Plan gathers concrete actions on environmental, social and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 GDPR and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#&lt;/strong&gt;LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Torino-Senior-Manager-S4Hana-Conversion/1371057057/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1371057057</guid><g:id>1371057057</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Torino, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Deal Advisory - Restructuring&amp;Turnaround Senior Consultant | Padova (Padova, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Deal Advisory - Restructuring&amp;amp;Turnaround Senior Consultant | Padua&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Restructuring&amp;amp;Turnaround &lt;/strong&gt;team assists clients in debt and industrial restructuring with financial advisory and/or support services to help them prepare business plans that stabilise the business and usher in sustainable change. Our consultants are involved in debt restructuring, distressed M&amp;amp;As and lender advisory activities for multinationals, family-run enterprises, private equity funds and financial institutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;As a member of this team, known for the quality and scope of its projects, your talent will be put to full use, enabling you to work with leading Italian and international clients: in 2022, for the third time in four years, our team received the Finance Community Award for Italian “Restructuring Team of the Year” in recognition of its professional excellence and the type of projects implemented.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will join our &lt;strong&gt;Padua &lt;/strong&gt;team and be tasked with: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;analysing the financial performance of target companies to identify the actual financial situation of an enterprise;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;assisting in the identification of strategic business recovery guidelines;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;financial modelling and business planning;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;negotiation with the main stakeholders (mainly financial institutions and investors);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;distressed M&amp;amp;As (with industrial partners, investment funds, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;independent business reviews of business plans;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;cash management and turnarounds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;As a member of this dynamic and highly motivated team, you will be part of the deal from day one, playing an active role in various projects and liaising with the key executives involved.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;3/4 years experience in debt restructuring, company crisis and/or corporate finance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;a Specialist Degree in Business with a focus on Finance/AFC and/or Engineering Management (for Finance);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;problem solving skills and you never lose sight of your goals; you have strong interpersonal skills and are a team player; your motivation and enthusiasm inspire confidence and empower change; you enjoy taking on challenges and are comfortable in fast-changing situations where your leadership abilities make the difference.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;equitable&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity and teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;. As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join us!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;#LI-AV2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Padova-Deal-Advisory-Restructuring&amp;Turnaround-Senior-Consultant-Padova/785524602/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">785524602</guid><g:id>785524602</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Deal Advisory</g:job_function><g:location>Padova, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Manager AI Cyber Risk| Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di Cyber &amp;amp; Tech Risk a Milano, lavorerai con i nostri esperti di ICT security per aiutare i clienti ad affrontare i rischi informatici che minacciano il loro business. Collaborerai su progetti rilevanti per le aziende leader di mercato.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; AI Cyber tooling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scouting e valutazione di soluzioni AI per la cybersecurity&lt;/strong&gt; (es. threat intelligence analytics, anomaly detection, vulnerability management, code/security scanning).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Due diligence tecnica e di rischio&lt;/strong&gt;: architetture, sicurezza dei modelli, privacy e compliance (EU AI Act, NIS2, DORA, GDPR), vendor risk e supply chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Definizione di &lt;strong&gt;framework di valutazione, criteri di scoring, KPI/KRI e metriche di efficacia &lt;/strong&gt;(precision/recall, falsi positivi), TCO/ROI e business case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestione di &lt;strong&gt;PoC/pilot con clienti&lt;/strong&gt;: success criteria, misurazione risultati, integrazione con SIEM/EDR/IAM, design di playbook per il SOC e runbook operativi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sviluppo di &lt;strong&gt;alleanze e partnership con vendor e startup in ambito AI&lt;/strong&gt;: co-creation, go-to-market congiunti, supporto a contratti e partnership, abilitazione commerciale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;AI Risk &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;AI Risk Assessment: &lt;strong&gt;identificazione e gestione delle minacce&lt;/strong&gt; specifiche (prompt injection, jailbreak e data exfiltration, model poisoning/evasion, supply chain e dipendenze, privacy leakage, bias e impatti etici).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;AI Governance: &lt;strong&gt;definizione di policy, processi e controlli; ruoli e responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;; registrazione dei sistemi di AI; guardrails e content filtering; red teaming e secure-by-design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implementazione di framework di riferimento&lt;/strong&gt;: NIST AI Risk Management Framework, ISO/IEC 23894 (AI risk management), ISO/IEC 42001 (AI management system), EU AI Act (gap analysis, readiness e roadmap), integrazione con NIST CSF/COBIT/ISO 27001.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolto in progetti sia nazionali che internazionali, collaborando con professionisti altamente qualificati, e lavorerai a stretto contatto con i nostri clienti del settore Financial Services, tra cui banche, assicurazioni e società di investimento, contribuendo alla gestione di rischi IT, governance, audit, privacy e sicurezza informatica.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Per essere il candidato ideale non ti possono mancare:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Dai 5 agli 8 anni di esperienza in società di consulenza in ambito Cyber security, con comprovata esposizione a progetti su AI Security, AI Governance o AI for Cyber;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza dei principali standard: ISO/IEC 27001, NIST CSF, COBIT, ITIL; e dei framework AI: NIST AI RMF, ISO/IEC 23894, ISO/IEC 42001, EU AI Act; normativa di settore (NIS2, DORA, GDPR);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Buona conoscenza dei principali ambiti tecnologiche e/o di specifiche soluzioni correlate agli ambiti evidenziati in precedenza;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Laurea in Ingegneria Informatica, delle Telecomunicazioni o in Scienze Informatiche e dell’Informazione;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese, meglio se avvalorata da un’esperienza di studio e/o lavoro all’estero;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Forte attitudine verso tematiche tecnologiche innovative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 50.000 e € 59.000 determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto delle individualità, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità: questi sono i valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e alla crescita personale e professionale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie al nostro impegno per un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, abbiamo ottenuto le certificazioni ISO 30415 (Gestione della Diversità e Inclusione) e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; (Parità di genere). Scopri tutte le nostre azioni concrete nel nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com), che descrive le nostre iniziative su temi ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Century Gothic&amp;#39;, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-AA1 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Manager-AI-Cyber-Risk-Milano/1349117257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1349117257</guid><g:id>1349117257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Deal Strategy&amp;Value Creation Senior Consultant | Bologna (Bologna, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:24.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Deal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:24.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strategy&amp;amp;Value Creation Senior Consultant | Bologna&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Deal Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; team provides support in &lt;strong&gt;M&amp;amp;As&lt;/strong&gt;, from the pre-deal evaluation to the post-deal integration or separation with focus on the definition and quantification of all value creation levers. As a member of this team, you will work in close contact with lenders, shareholders and managers at all levels, helping to support clients in corporate finance transactions using digital tools and technology in your day-to-day work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join our teams in &lt;strong&gt;Bologna&lt;/strong&gt; where you will gain experience supporting shareholders and management of client companies in solving complex business challenges, from the definition of strategy to the execution of value creation initiatives, with focus on the Pre-Deal Business/Operational Due Diligence, Business Planning and Post-Deal Integration phases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;•    Business &amp;amp; Strategic Planning: You’ll work alongside C-level executives to assess the business in a short time framework and define/ quantify improvement actions to present to investors and stakeholders;&lt;br&gt;•    Business &amp;amp; Commercial Due Diligence: You’ll analyze business dynamics, market, and competition for potential targets, working with private equity funds and other buyers;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;•    Identification and review of synergies both in a pre and post deal phase. Support in the implementation of tracking models of the synergies identified in the &quot;execution&quot; phase;&lt;br&gt;•    Synergy assessment and execution: You will analyze all potential synergies both in a pre and post deal phase,  supporting end to end the client from the quantification phase to the implementation/ tracking of the identified synergies;&lt;br&gt;•    Integration &amp;amp; Separation Management Office: You will define and drive Day 1 Readiness plan, D100 Integration plan, definition of Target Operating Model, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;At least 2/3 years of experience from either a strategy consulting firm or the strategy or business development function of an industrial, consumer or retail company with activity focus on revenue growth initiatives definition and management;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A master&apos;s degree in business subjects and, preferably, additional post-graduate courses in data science, business analytics and digital innovation;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A keen interest in pre and post M&amp;amp;A deal activities;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An analytical approach and ability to interpret data and KPIs;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in Italian &amp;amp; English;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of Excel and PowerPoint;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of data and analytics tools (e.g., Power, BI and Qlik) is preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Flexible to travel for work in Italy and abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;equitable &lt;/strong&gt;work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;challenging and dynamic environment&lt;/strong&gt; that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a &lt;strong&gt;healthy work-life balance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I&lt;strong&gt;nternational &lt;/strong&gt;mindset and &lt;strong&gt;innovative &lt;/strong&gt;projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical &lt;strong&gt;well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network has obtained ISO 30415 certification, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a style=&quot;text-decoration:underline&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-AV2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Bologna-Deal-Strategy&amp;Value-Creation-Senior-Consultant-Bologna/1363479757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1363479757</guid><g:id>1363479757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Deal Advisory</g:job_function><g:location>Bologna, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Governance &amp; Innovation Consultant (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Innovation Senior Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;, you will join our&lt;strong&gt; Operations team&lt;/strong&gt; with the mission of leading complex digital transformation programs and ensuring effective governance on innovation-driven projects. You will support our clients in activities with a focus on innovation challenges, leveraging your &lt;strong&gt;management and technical skills&lt;/strong&gt;. Directly interacting with our customers, you will lead &lt;strong&gt;digital transformation&lt;/strong&gt; decisions with a strong eye on &lt;strong&gt;both business and technology&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will help our customers to drive the change with specific tasks:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Governance models to support &lt;strong&gt;innovation and digital initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; in line with leading practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Provide support for complex innovation initiatives across digital and application domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Deﬁne, establish, and evolve models for the governance of complex, multi-stakeholder project portfolios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Develop methodologies for monitoring, reporting, and controlling project performance, ensuring alignment with KPIs, milestones, and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Drive the deﬁnition and continuous &lt;strong&gt;improvement of digital processes&lt;/strong&gt;, translating business requirements into actionable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Coordinate multidisciplinary teams and engage with senior internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Contribute to the growth of the practice through knowledge sharing, mentoring, and thought leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or other STEM disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;At least 1-2 years of experience in &lt;strong&gt;Governance and Innovation&lt;/strong&gt; within corporate or consulting environments, with a particular interest in technological field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Effective knowledge of digital transformation projects with proven &lt;strong&gt;management and technical skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills in both Italian and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 36.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Solid knowledge of Governance methodologies (e.g. PMI, PRINCE2, Agile/SAFe, Scrum)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Understanding of frameworks and international standards (e.g. ITIL, COBIT, ISO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Technical certifications (TOGAF, Cloud, AI or Data related)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;regulated industries&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., energy, telco, financial services)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;advanced PMO tools&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Clarity PPM, MS Project Online, Jira/Confluence)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €29,000 to €33,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-MC2&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Governance-&amp;-Innovation-Consultant/1328228457/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1328228457</guid><g:id>1328228457</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Legal Compliance Consultant | Firenze (Firenze, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;–&lt;em&gt; Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you’ll have the opportunity to help your firm, clients and colleagues address and resolve some of today’s most topical and complex issues. Our &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Tax &amp;amp; Legal&lt;/strong&gt; professionals work at the forefront of tax and corporate law, delivering integrated and innovative services across all key areas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;As part of the &lt;strong&gt;Legal &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt; team, you’ll help clients navigate corporate law. You’ll be working in a constantly evolving environment, where national and international regulations intersect with market expectations as well as public opinion on crucial topics such as ethics, transparency and corporate governance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Providing regulatory compliance assistance in the development and implementation of models to ensure adherence to regulations in the areas of anti-money laundering; listed companies; antitrust matters; anti-corruption; occupational health and safety; the environment, legality rating; ESG; corporate liability (Legislative Decree no. 231/2001).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Assisting in monitoring regulatory updates, with particular reference to regulations in the areas of anti-money laundering; listed companies; corporate liability (Legislative Decree no. 231/2001); anti-corruption and transparency; antitrust matters; ESG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Helping to draft governance regulations and policies, as well as global policies for international groups.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Conducting audits and reviews of processes, procedures and controls in accordance with Legislative Decree no. 231/2001.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Assisting in audits and reviews of compliance programs (privacy, anti-corruption, anti-money laundering, antitrust, whistleblowing and data governance).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Assisting in defining the components of the corporate control system in regulatory compliance models, such as the: risk assessment; gap analysis; control protocols; operating procedures and corporate policies; disciplinary system; reporting system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Assisting in regulatory compliance training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You’ll be involved in &lt;strong&gt;national and international projects&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;working alongside highly qualified professionals and acquiring top-level skills through interaction with the brightest minds in the field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Qualifications, Skills and Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;some brief experience at a leading national or international practice and/or advisory firm;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a master’s degree in law or business economics – preferably with a dissertation on a topic related to civil or corporate law or regulatory compliance – with a final mark of 100/110 or higher;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a knowledge of Microsoft Office (in particular, Word, Excel and PowerPoint);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a knowledge of written and spoken English (study or work experience abroad would be a plus);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a flexible and dynamic approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that fosters &lt;strong&gt;creativity &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;teamworking&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to support continuous learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international outlook&lt;/strong&gt; and a focus on &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individual, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values &lt;/strong&gt;that foster an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG supports all its people in reaching their full potential, whatever their identity or background. Fully committed to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, we are &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 compliant &lt;/strong&gt;(ISO 30415:2021 – Human Resources Management – Diversity and Inclusion).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG in Italy is also &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125 &lt;/strong&gt;compliant (UNI/PdR 125:2022 – measures to ensure gender equality in audit and assurance services). You can find a summary of all our &lt;strong&gt;concrete&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;ESG &lt;/strong&gt;(environmental, social, and governance) &lt;strong&gt;actions&lt;/strong&gt; in our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG in Italy is an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – “GDPR”) as subsequently amended. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy notice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. I professionisti dello &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato &lt;/strong&gt;di KPMG intervengono in tutte le principali aree della fiscalità e del diritto societario offrendo servizi integrati e innovativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team&lt;strong&gt; Legal &amp;amp; Compliance &lt;/strong&gt;di &lt;strong&gt;Firenze&lt;/strong&gt;, contribuirai a supportare i clienti nell&apos;affrontare le sfide legate alle principali aree del diritto societario. Opererai in uno scenario in continua evoluzione, dove normative nazionali e internazionali si intrecciano con le aspettative del mercato e dell’opinione pubblica su temi cruciali come l’etica, la trasparenza e la corporate governance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Assistenza in materia di compliance normativa per la redazione ed implementazione di Modelli di compliance normativa Antiriciclaggio, Diritto delle Società Quotate, Antitrust, Anticorruzione, D.lgs. n. 231/2001, Sicurezza sul lavoro, Ambientale, Rating di legalità e ESG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Assistenza nel monitoraggio degli aggiornamenti normativi con particolare riferimento alle normative: Antiriciclaggio; Diritto delle Società Quotate, Responsabilità amministrativa degli enti ex d.lgs. n. 231/2001, Anticorruzione e Trasparenza; Antitrust, ed ESG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Assistenza nella redazione di Regolamenti e Policy di Governance e di Global Policy nell’ambito di Gruppi Internazionali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Conduzione di Audit e Verifiche su processi, procedure e protocolli di controllo in ambito D.lgs. n. 231/2001.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Assistenza nello svolgimento di compliance audit e verifiche su compliance programs (Privacy, Anticorruzione, Antiriciclaggio, Antitrust, Whistleblowing e Data Governance).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Assistenza nella definizione dei contenuti del sistema di controllo aziendale nell’ambito dei modelli di compliance normativa, quali: risk assessment; gap analisi; protocolli di controllo; procedure operative e policy aziendali; sistema disciplinare; sistema di flussi informativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Assistenza nello svolgimento di attività formative in ambito di compliance normativa.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su &lt;strong&gt;progetti nazionali &lt;/strong&gt;e&lt;strong&gt; internazionali, &lt;/strong&gt;lavorando al fianco di professioniste e professionisti altamente qualificati e acquisendo competenze di primo livello attraverso il confronto con le menti più brillanti del settore.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Esperienza minima presso primari studi nazionali o internazionali e/o società di consulenza; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Laurea magistrale a ciclo unico in Giurisprudenza, preferibilmente con laurea su tematica attinente al diritto civile, societario ovvero alla compliance normativa, con votazione di laurea pari o superiore a 100/110;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Abilitazione all&apos;esercizio della professione forense;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Conoscenza del pacchetto Office (in particolare, degli applicativi Word, Excel e Powerpoint);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Conoscenza della lingua inglese, scritta e parlata. Un’esperienza di studio o lavoro all’estero sarà titolo di preferenza nella valutazione del CV;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Ottime capacità relazionali e di team working;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Flessibilità e dinamicità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-CN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Firenze-Junior-Legal-Compliance-Consultant-Firenze/1368714257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368714257</guid><g:id>1368714257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Legal</g:job_function><g:location>Firenze, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Tax Consultant | Perugia (Perugia, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Tax Consultant | Perugia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;With its highly qualified tax and legal experts, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; provides assistance in all the key tax and corporate law areas, offering innovative, integrated services. Its work teams specialise in both professional field and client sector. With over &lt;strong&gt;600 professionals &lt;/strong&gt;at &lt;strong&gt;12 offices &lt;/strong&gt;in Italy&apos;s largest cities, the KPMG network&apos;s Tax and legal unit is one of the top professional partnerships in the country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;We are recruiting a consultant to join our &lt;strong&gt;Tax Team &lt;/strong&gt;team in &lt;strong&gt;Perugia&lt;/strong&gt;, who will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analysing issues concerning domestic direct and indirect taxation and offering ongoing advice to companies;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Expressing opinions on Italian and international tax matters (CFCs, blacklists, permanent establishments, withholding tax, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analysing the taxation of extraordinary transactions (mergers, demergers, contributions, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Tax due diligence;      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Aptos&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Tax compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience operating at Junior or Senior tax specialist level within a Big 4 or top-tier advisory firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in business or law;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Intention of going into professional practice as a chartered accountant and/or lawyer;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of English;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Strong organisational skills, an ability to take initiative and problem solving abilities;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Flexible and dynamic approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Candidates with the following will have an advantage:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in Tax Law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;•    An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive &lt;/strong&gt;and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;•    A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;•    Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training &lt;/strong&gt;and development programmes to stay current.&lt;br&gt;•    &lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and&lt;strong&gt; innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;•    Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work &lt;/strong&gt;environment, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a style=&quot;color:#467886;text-decoration:underline&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-CN1&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Perugia-Senior-Tax-Consultant-Perugia/1365618557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365618557</guid><g:id>1365618557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Perugia, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant/ Assistant Manager IT Audit/ IT Risk - Bologna/Firenze (Bologna, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance &lt;/strong&gt;offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di Cyber &amp;amp; Tech Risk a Firenze, Bologna o Parma, lavorerai con i nostri esperti di ICT security per aiutare i clienti ad affrontare i rischi informatici che minacciano il loro business. Collaborerai su progetti rilevanti per le aziende leader di mercato.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analizzare i rischi e i controlli (rischio IT);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Comprendere le metodologie interne e le normative adottate dai clienti;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Valutare degli impatti delle caratteristiche specifiche del business del cliente sui sistemi IT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analizzare la parametrizzazione, configurazione e processi SAP (per i processi contabili e logistici);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Approfondire la sicurezza negli ambienti SAP ECC / SAP HANA;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Utilizzare le funzionalità di accesso ai dati (tabelle e report) e relative analisi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Apprendere gli strumenti di elaborazione dei dati come QlikView, IDEA e MS Access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolto su progetti sia nazionali che internazionali, collaborando con professionisti altamente qualificati, e lavorerai a stretto contatto con i nostri clienti, contribuendo alla gestione di rischi IT, governance, audit, privacy e sicurezza informatica.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai maturato oltre 2 anni di esperienza in società di consulenza operanti in ambito cybersecurity, audit IT e compliance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai una laurea in ingegneria informatica, ingegneria gestionale o in informatica e tecnologie dell&apos;informazione;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai un&apos;ottima padronanza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conosci i principali standard applicabili (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, ecc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza nella strategia e nella valutazione del rischio informatico;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai conoscenza della governance dei sistemi IT e di business continuity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile per effettuare trasferte a livello nazionale e internazionale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 38.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 48.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto delle individualità, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità: questi sono &lt;strong&gt;i valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;. Favoriamo un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e alla crescita personale e professionale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità. I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (GDPR).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offers consulting services to businesses, supporting them in transforming their business models, improving and digitizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, and executing extraordinary financial operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;By joining the Cyber &amp;amp; Tech Risk Team in Florence, you will work with our ICT security experts to help clients face cyber risks that threaten their business. You will collaborate on key projects for market-leading companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be involved in:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyzing risks&lt;/strong&gt; and controls (IT risk);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Understanding the &lt;strong&gt;internal methodologies&lt;/strong&gt; and regulations adopted by clients;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Assessing the &lt;strong&gt;impact of clients&apos; specific business&lt;/strong&gt; characteristics on IT systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyzing the configuration&lt;/strong&gt;, setup, and processes of SAP (for accounting and logistics processes);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Deepening your &lt;strong&gt;knowledge of security&lt;/strong&gt; in SAP ECC / SAP HANA environments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Utilizing &lt;strong&gt;data access functionalities&lt;/strong&gt; (tables and reports) and conducting related analyses;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Learning to &lt;strong&gt;use data processing&lt;/strong&gt; tools such as QlikView, IDEA, and MS Access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will be involved in both national and international projects, working alongside highly qualified professionals, and collaborating closely with our clients to contribute to IT risk management, governance, audit, privacy, and cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Qualities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have 2+ &lt;strong&gt; years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in consulting firms operating in cybersecurity, IT audit, and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You hold a degree in Computer Engineering, Management Engineering, or Computer Science and Information Technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have an excellent command of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You are familiar with the &lt;strong&gt;main applicable standards&lt;/strong&gt; (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have experience in &lt;strong&gt;cybersecurity strategy&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;risk assessment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have knowledge of IT systems governance and &lt;strong&gt;business continuity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You are available for national and international travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, &lt;strong&gt;equitable work&lt;/strong&gt; environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and &lt;strong&gt;dynamic context&lt;/strong&gt; that fosters creativity and teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;hybrid working&lt;/strong&gt; model to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to stay up-to-date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and innovative projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and &lt;strong&gt;mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €38,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €48,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity: these are KPMG’s values. We promote an environment open to the exchange of ideas and personal and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities. Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (GDPR).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0px&quot;&gt;#LI-AA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Bologna-Senior-Consultant-Assistant-Manager-IT-Audit-IT-Risk-BolognaFirenze/792957502/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">792957502</guid><g:id>792957502</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Bologna, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Manager - Digital Transformation (Piattaforme HR) (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare clienti, società e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, oltre che nell&apos;analisi e gestione dei rischi e nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del Team Enterprise Platform, ricoprirai un ruolo di leadership nella trasformazione digitale dei processi HR, con un presidio tecnico-strategico sull&apos;offering e sulla delivery delle piattaforme, in particolare SAP SuccessFactors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Guidare l&apos;&lt;strong&gt;offering e la strategia di delivery&lt;/strong&gt; sulle piattaforme HR, in particolare &lt;strong&gt;SAP SuccessFactors&lt;/strong&gt;, garantendo un presidio tecnico solido sui programmi di trasformazione digitale HR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Definire la &lt;strong&gt;governance a livello di programma&lt;/strong&gt;: pianificazione, milestone, budget e gestione della commessa su iniziative complesse e multi-progetto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Gestire la relazione con &lt;strong&gt;CHRO e stakeholder C-level&lt;/strong&gt;, posizionandoti come punto di riferimento strategico sul percorso di trasformazione HR del cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Guidare la &lt;strong&gt;costruzione di proposte e gare&lt;/strong&gt;, con responsabilità diretta sul relativo esito commerciale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Coordinare e fare da &lt;strong&gt;mentor a Manager e team di progetto&lt;/strong&gt;, supportandone la crescita e lo sviluppo professionale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Presidiare la &lt;strong&gt;qualità e la readiness al rilascio&lt;/strong&gt; a livello di programma, fino a cutover e go-live&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribuire allo &lt;strong&gt;sviluppo dell&apos;offering e della practice&lt;/strong&gt; HR Transformation, anche attraverso iniziative di thought leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su progetti nazionali e internazionali, con un focus preferenziale su clienti del settore pubblico, in particolare in contesti di &lt;strong&gt;Pubblica Amministrazione centrale e locale&lt;/strong&gt;, enti regolatori, sanità, istruzione e società a partecipazione pubblica.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai maturato &lt;strong&gt;esperienza consolidata in ruoli di leadership&lt;/strong&gt; su programmi di trasformazione digitale HR, con solida competenza tecnica su piattaforme enterprise, idealmente &lt;strong&gt;SAP SuccessFactors&lt;/strong&gt; (altre piattaforme HR sono considerate un valore aggiunto)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una &lt;strong&gt;conoscenza approfondita dell&apos;implementazione e configurazione&lt;/strong&gt; reale delle piattaforme, oltre alla capacità di guidarne l&apos;evoluzione strategica&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sai gestire la &lt;strong&gt;relazione con interlocutori senior/C-level&lt;/strong&gt; e guidare la costruzione di &lt;strong&gt;proposte e gare&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza nella &lt;strong&gt;governance di programmi complessi&lt;/strong&gt;, con dimestichezza in metodologie Agile, Waterfall o ibride e strumenti di pianificazione (es. Jira/Confluence, MS Project o equivalenti)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai capacità consolidate di &lt;strong&gt;leadership, negoziazione e gestione di team&lt;/strong&gt;, anche a supporto della crescita di profili Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi un&apos;ottima padronanza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt; e attitudine al lavoro in &lt;strong&gt;team&lt;/strong&gt; anche internazionali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a &lt;strong&gt;trasferte&lt;/strong&gt; in Italia e all&apos;estero, in base alle esigenze progettuali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Costituisce un plus:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Conoscenza delle &lt;strong&gt;peculiarità del settore pubblico&lt;/strong&gt; (normativa, procedure di gara, stakeholder istituzionali)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt; e orientato alla valorizzazione delle &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt; per favorire l&apos;equilibrio vita-lavoro&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere&lt;/strong&gt; psicofisico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 52.000 e € 65.000 per la qualifica di Manager e tra € 65.240 e € 84.000 per la qualifica di Senior Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all&apos;esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto dell&apos;individualità, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità sono i Valori di KPMG, alla base di un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e conoscenza.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie al nostro impegno per un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il Network è conforme agli standard ISO 30415 e UNI PdR 125. Nel nostro Impact Plan sono raccolte le azioni concrete sui temi ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (GDPR) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, society and colleagues tackle and solve today&apos;s most pressing and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to businesses, supporting them in transforming their business model, improving and digitalizing processes, as well as in risk analysis and management and extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Joining the Enterprise Platform Team, you will hold a leadership role in the digital transformation of HR processes, with technical and strategic oversight of the offering and delivery of HR platforms, in particular SAP SuccessFactors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be responsible for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leading the &lt;strong&gt;offering and delivery strategy&lt;/strong&gt; for HR platforms, in particular &lt;strong&gt;SAP SuccessFactors&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring solid technical oversight of HR digital transformation programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Defining &lt;strong&gt;program-level governance&lt;/strong&gt;: planning, milestones, budget and engagement management across complex, multi-project initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Managing the relationship with &lt;strong&gt;CHROs and C-level stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;, acting as a strategic point of reference on the client&apos;s HR transformation journey&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leading the &lt;strong&gt;development of proposals and tenders&lt;/strong&gt;, with direct responsibility for the related commercial outcome&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Coordinating and &lt;strong&gt;mentoring Managers and project teams&lt;/strong&gt;, supporting their growth and professional development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Overseeing &lt;strong&gt;quality and release readiness&lt;/strong&gt; at program level, through cutover and go-live&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contributing to the &lt;strong&gt;development of the offering and practice&lt;/strong&gt; for HR Transformation, including through thought leadership initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You will be involved in national and international projects, with a preferential focus on Public Sector clients, particularly Central and Local Public Administration, regulatory bodies, healthcare, education, and publicly owned companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Qualities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is a great fit for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;consolidated experience in leadership roles&lt;/strong&gt; on HR digital transformation programs, with solid technical expertise in enterprise platforms, ideally &lt;strong&gt;SAP SuccessFactors&lt;/strong&gt; (experience with other HR platforms is considered an asset)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have an &lt;strong&gt;in-depth understanding of platform implementation and configuration&lt;/strong&gt;, as well as the ability to guide their strategic evolution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You know how to manage relationships with &lt;strong&gt;senior/C-level stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt; and lead the development of &lt;strong&gt;proposals and tenders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have experience in the &lt;strong&gt;governance of complex programs&lt;/strong&gt;, with familiarity in Agile, Waterfall or hybrid methodologies and planning tools (e.g. Jira/Confluence, MS Project or equivalent)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have strong &lt;strong&gt;leadership, negotiation and team management&lt;/strong&gt; skills, including supporting the growth of Manager-level profiles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have an excellent command of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; and an aptitude for working in international &lt;strong&gt;teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are available for &lt;strong&gt;travel&lt;/strong&gt; in Italy and abroad, based on project needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;The following is considered a plus:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;specific features of the Public Sector&lt;/strong&gt; (regulations, tender procedures, institutional stakeholders)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You&apos;ll Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A stimulating, dynamic environment that fosters &lt;strong&gt;creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; way of working to support work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives dedicated to &lt;strong&gt;wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with an indicative starting gross annual salary ranging from €52,000 to €65,000 for the Manager position and from €65,240 to €84,000 for the Senior Manager position, determined on the basis of objective criteria with specific reference to the candidate&apos;s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are also based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for the individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity are KPMG&apos;s Values, underpinning an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to an inclusive workplace, the Network complies with ISO 30415 and UNI PdR 125 standards. Our Impact Plan gathers concrete actions on environmental, social and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (GDPR) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Senior-Manager-Digital-Transformation-%28Piattaforme-HR%29/1333364257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1333364257</guid><g:id>1333364257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Healthcare Consultant | Triveneto (Padova, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;h3&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribuisci alla digitalizzazione del Servizio Sanitario Nazionale (SSN)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Healthcare di KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;, avrai l’opportunità di contribuire all’&lt;strong&gt;innovazione dei servizi&lt;/strong&gt; sanitari in Italia. Nei prossimi anni saremo impegnati nell’estensione dell’utilizzo degli strumenti digitali e delle trasformazioni che essi possono generare nelle strutture sanitarie e nella vita di oltre 60 milioni di persone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particolare, supporterai gli enti del SSN nelle attività di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;definizione delle strategie e valutazione dei relativi impatti sanitari, economici, finanziari e organizzativi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;elaborazione delle strategie di trasformazione digitale e progettazione della relativa esperienza utente e paziente;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;valorizzazione delle tecnologie digitali per ripensare in modo innovativo servizi, processi e modelli operativi delle amministrazioni pubbliche e delle organizzazioni sanitarie;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;monitoraggio dello stato di avanzamento e dell’evoluzione dei servizi, dei sistemi e delle attività operative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sei pronto a contribuire al cambiamento del nostro Paese?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La pandemia ha evidenziato ancora di più il ruolo strategico della sanità, un settore fondamentale non solo per la tutela della salute e della sicurezza dei cittadini, ma anche per la crescita e la resilienza economica del Paese.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di vivere il cambiamento in prima persona, lavorando a stretto contatto con professionisti del settore sanitario, dirigenti e manager del Servizio Sanitario Nazionale. Entrerai a far parte di un team giovane e dinamico, composto da professionisti che ogni giorno promuovono il cambiamento e l’innovazione, supportandoti nella tua crescita professionale attraverso formazione continua e affiancamento costante.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Siamo alla ricerca di professionisti per le nostre sedi di &lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Padova&lt;/span&gt; e Verona, motivati a contribuire allo sviluppo del Paese. Cerchiamo persone empatiche, orientate al lavoro di squadra, al raggiungimento degli obiettivi e dotate di solide capacità di problem solving, entusiasmo e forte motivazione professionale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il candidato ideale possiede:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;una laurea magistrale, conseguita con ottimi risultati, in discipline ingegneristiche (Ingegneria Biomedica, Ingegneria Gestionale) o economiche (Economia Aziendale, Economia Sanitaria);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;attitudine all’analisi quantitativa e padronanza degli strumenti di analisi dei dati (utilizzo avanzato di Excel, gestione di database, ecc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente maturata anche attraverso esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all’estero e/o anche della lingua tedesca;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Microsoft Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo ed equo, che rispetta, valorizza e promuove la diversità.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto dinamico e sfidante, che incoraggia creatività, innovazione e lavoro di squadra.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibride a supporto dell’equilibrio tra vita professionale e personale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Percorsi strutturati di formazione e sviluppo per una crescita continua.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un mindset internazionale e la possibilità di lavorare su progetti innovativi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative dedicate al benessere psicofisico delle persone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 1.000€ o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better –  I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan&lt;/a&gt; (kpmg.com) - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitization, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help digitalise the national health system (NHS)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working with KPMG’s Healthcare Team, you will have the opportunity to contribute to the innovation of healthcare services in Italy. &lt;strong&gt;Over the next few years, we will be working to expand the use of digital tools and the changes&lt;/strong&gt; they can bring to healthcare facilities and the lives of more than 60 million people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our team, you will assist NHS bodies: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;outline the strategy and related healthcare, economic, financial and organisational impacts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;prepare the digital strategy and related user and patient experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;leverage digital technologies to rethink, in an innovative way, service provided, processes and operating models of public and healthcare institutions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;monitor the status and evolution of services, operating management and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you ready to change the future of our country?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The pandemic shed additional light on the strategic importance of healthcare as a crucial sector not only for the health and safety of all citizens but for the country’s economic security as well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With KPMG, you will see first hand where change happens, &lt;strong&gt;working closely with healthcare professionals and NHS officials and managers.&lt;/strong&gt; You will join a &lt;strong&gt;team of young colleagues and professionals &lt;/strong&gt;who work tirelessly day in and day out to promote and champion change, colleagues who will help you to grow and act as a point of reference and help plan your ongoing training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are recruiting professionals for our office in&lt;strong&gt; Padova and Verona &lt;/strong&gt;who want to be part of setting the path for our country. Candidates must be empathetic and team players. They must be highly goal-oriented and have strong problem-solving abilities and they must be enthusiastic and strongly career-oriented.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate has:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a master’s degree in engineering subjects (biomedical/engineering management), business (business/healthcare economics);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an aptitude for quantitative approaches and a mastery of data analysis tools (advanced use of Excel, database management, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you&apos;ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages creativity and teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International mindset and innovative projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €1,000 or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better - Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individuality, continuous deepening, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s Values that give rise to an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, which allows our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network has obtained ISO 30415 certification, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125, which certifies gender equality. Within our Impact Plan - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;  - you will find summarized all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”) as amended. For more information, please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CA1&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Padova-Junior-Healthcare-Consultant-Triveneto/1357623357/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1357623357</guid><g:id>1357623357</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Padova, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Consultant - Tech Risk | Roma (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Nel rispetto dei valori di integrità e qualità,&lt;strong&gt; KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance &lt;/strong&gt;offre un portafoglio di servizi integrato in costante evoluzione, con insight che consentono alle aziende di rispondere ai fabbisogni informativi del mercato e degli investitori. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk&lt;/strong&gt;, linea di servizi di KPMG che ha anticipato e seguito nel tempo le richieste del mercato relative alle tematiche di Information Risk Management e Sicurezza Informatica, sviluppando costantemente le competenze e capacità di analisi a protezione del patrimonio informativo aziendale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;color:black&quot;&gt;Comprendere il contesto tecnologico e di business dei clienti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;color:black&quot;&gt;Mappare i processi business ed IT, identificandone i rischi e definendo il giusto approccio per mitigarli &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;color:black&quot;&gt;Analizzare le nuove tecnologie e capirne i rischi specifici&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;color:black&quot;&gt;Identificare i dati chiave e definire i controlli per renderli affidabili e sicuri&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;color:black&quot;&gt;I professionisti appartenenti al team CTR di KPMG supportano le organizzazioni in tutte le fasi necessarie a garantire la sicurezza delle loro informazioni e delle loro strategie di business. Possiamo affiancare i nostri clienti per migliorare la crescita e creare valore. Possiamo aiutarli a fare i giusti investimenti nel momento giusto, a considerare le implicazioni più ampie della digital disruption, ad integrare tecnologie innovative nelle infrastrutture esistenti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a style=&quot;color:black&quot; name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei un laureando/neolaureato magistrale in Ingegneria Gestionale, Management dell’innovazione, Management ecc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Passione per le nuove tecnologie e la loro declinazione nei contesti aziendali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Competenze nella comprensione e analisi dei processi aziendali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Capacità di analisi dei dati e di sintesi nella presentazione dei risultati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Interesse per l&apos;ambito dei Sistemi Informativi aziendali, intesi quale strumento abilitante per l&apos;efficace erogazione dei processi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Predisposizione per la risoluzione di problemi complessi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Proattività, flessibilità e capacità di adattamento a contesti eterogenei e sfidanti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una buona padronanza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a viaggiare sul territorio nazionale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color:black&quot; name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; internazionale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ / L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso compresa tra € 28.000 e € 31.500, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color:black&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. In keeping with the values of integrity and quality&lt;strong&gt;, KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offers an integrated and constantly evolving portfolio of services, with insights that allow companies to respond to the informational/reporting needs of the market and investors. The &lt;strong&gt;Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk&lt;/strong&gt; team handles the KPMG line of services that pre-empted and continues to meet market demand for information risk management and cybersecurity services, continually developing the analytical skills and expertise to protect company information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;color:black&quot;&gt;understanding clients’ technological and business context;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;color:black&quot;&gt;mapping business and IT processes, identifying their risks and developing the right approach to mitigate them; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;color:black&quot;&gt;analysing new technologies and understanding their specific risks;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;color:black&quot;&gt;identifying key data and defining controls to guarantee they are reliable and secure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;color:black&quot;&gt;The members of KPMG’s CTR team support organisations across all phases of the process to ensure the security of their information and business strategies. We help our clients drive growth and generate value.  We can help them make the right investments at the right time, consider the broader implications of the digital disruption and build breakthrough innovations into their legacy infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;or will soon have a master’s degree in management engineering, innovation management, management, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;a passion for new technologies and their application in corporate settings;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;expertise in understanding and analysing company processes;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;an ability to analyse and summarise data when reporting findings;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;an interest in corporate IT systems as enablers for the effective performance of processes; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;an aptitude for complex problem solving;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;proactiveness, flexibility and an ability to adapt to different challenging situations;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of English, preferably with study/work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;availability to travel within Italy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;A challenging and &lt;strong&gt;dynamic environment&lt;/strong&gt; that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay up-to-date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; and innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship with a monthly allowance of €800 / This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary  ranging from €28,000 to €31,500. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the KPMG values that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality Within our Impact Plan - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color:black&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Consultant-Tech-Risk-Roma/1366116957/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366116957</guid><g:id>1366116957</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>IT Application and Integration Architect (Verona, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Gli esperti di Nolan Norton, società di IT Strategy del Network KPMG, aiutano le organizzazioni ad affrontare le sfide di trasformazione digitale e ad implementare architetture IT. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del Team CIO Advisory di Verona, esperto di architetture e soluzioni di data management che supporta i CIO nell&apos;evoluzione digitale, dalla strategia all&apos;esecuzione e dalla visione al valore reale. Entrerai a far parte di un ambiente dinamico e stimolante, per clienti di alto livello nei mercati dei servizi finanziari, dell&apos;energia, del settore pubblico, sanitario e dei consumatori e industriali.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di tecnologie innovative e progetti sfidanti ed entusiasmanti, supportando i nostri clienti principalmente sulle seguenti tematiche:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· ICT Strategy: aiutiamo i nostri clienti a sviluppare strategie tecnologiche e modelli operativi tecnologici innovativi;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· ICT Architecture: consentiamo ai clienti di utilizzare soluzioni all&apos;avanguardia per applicazioni, infrastrutture e TLC;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Data Management: aiutiamo i nostri clienti nell’identificazione delle migliori soluzioni di gestione del dato e progettazione di architetture di Data Management;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting: assistiamo i nostri clienti a identificare, definire le priorità, progettare e indirizzare meglio gli investimenti tecnologici;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Strategic Sourcing: gestiamo la governance e svolgiamo attività di supporto tecnico durante la selezione delle varie opzioni e dei fornitori nell&apos;intero ciclo dei servizi ICT;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· ICT Governance and Organization: ci occupiamo della corretta struttura e dimensionamento delle risorse ICT;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· ICT Cost right-sizing: valutiamo e suggeriamo opzioni per indirizzare meglio la spesa e le risorse ICT.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;È prevista inoltre la possibilità di svolgere attività di IT project management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Laurea Magistrale in Informatica, Ingegneria Informatica, Ingegneria Elettronica, Ingegneria delle Telecomunicazioni, Fisica, Matematica o hai maturato esperienze equivalenti;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Almeno 5 anni di esperienza:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o in attività di Enterprise Architecture;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o nella modellazione e nella progettazione di architetture applicative, di integrazione e dati;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o nell’identificazione e disegni di scenari di trasformazione architetturale AS-IS vs TO-BE.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Ottima conoscenza o certificazione del framework TOGAF;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Ottima conoscenza del framework ArchiMate e ABACUS come tool di architettura aziendale per la descrizione di architetture complesse&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Conoscenza delle principali Architetture applicative (es. monolitiche, 3-tier, SOA e a microservizi) e containerizzate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Conoscenza delle architetture Cloud e AI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Conoscenza della lingua inglese, idealmente approfondita attraverso un&apos;esperienza formativa/lavorativa all&apos;estero.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rappresentano un plus:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Ulteriori certificazioni in ambito dati e cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Esperienza nel disegno dei processi IT sulla base delle best practice di mercato&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Conoscenza di architetture infrastrutturali (es. sistemi iperconvergenti)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Esperienza nell’analisi dei costi IT&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Modalità di lavoro ibrida, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Programmi di formazione e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Mindset internazionale e progettualità innovative&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Iniziative incentrate sul benessere psicofisico&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant  Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le certificazioni ISO 30415, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nolan Norton Spa garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com?utm_source=chatgpt.com&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot;&gt;KPMG&lt;/a&gt;, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues tackle and solve today’s most pressing and complex challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The experts at Nolan Norton, the IT Strategy company within the KPMG Network, support organizations in addressing digital transformation challenges and implementing IT architectures. In particular, you will join the CIO Advisory Team in Verona, specializing in architectures and data management solutions that support CIOs in their digital evolution journey — from strategy to execution and from vision to tangible value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will become part of a dynamic and stimulating environment, working with top-tier clients across the financial services, energy, public sector, healthcare, consumer, and industrial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will work on innovative technologies and exciting, challenging projects, supporting our clients mainly in the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; helping clients develop innovative technology strategies and operating models;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; enabling clients to adopt cutting-edge solutions for applications, infrastructure, and telecommunications;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management:&lt;/strong&gt; supporting clients in identifying the best data management solutions and designing Data Management architectures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting:&lt;/strong&gt; assisting clients in identifying, prioritizing, designing, and better directing technology investments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing:&lt;/strong&gt; managing governance and providing technical support throughout the selection of ICT service options and vendors;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance and Organization:&lt;/strong&gt; ensuring the proper structure and sizing of ICT resources;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost Right-Sizing:&lt;/strong&gt; evaluating and recommending options to better optimize ICT spending and resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;There will also be opportunities to work on IT project management activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Master’s degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Electronic Engineering, Telecommunications Engineering, Physics, Mathematics, or equivalent experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;At least 5 years of experience:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;circle&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;in Enterprise Architecture activities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;in the modeling and design of application, integration, and data architectures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;in identifying and designing architectural transformation scenarios from AS-IS to TO-BE;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of, or certification in, the TOGAF framework;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of the ArchiMate framework and ABACUS as enterprise architecture tools for describing complex architectures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of major application architectures (e.g., monolithic, 3-tier, SOA, and microservices-based architectures) and containerized environments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of Cloud and AI architectures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Proficiency in English, ideally strengthened through educational or professional experience abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The following will be considered a plus:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Additional certifications in data and cloud technologies;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Experience in designing IT processes based on market best practices;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of infrastructure architectures (e.g., hyperconverged systems);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Experience in IT cost analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive and fair work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic setting that fosters creativity and teamwork;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid working arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay continuously up to date;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity: these are KPMG’s values, which create an open environment for exchanging ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to fully express their potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Thanks to its commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, the Network has obtained ISO 30415 certification for Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Management Systems compliance and UNI/PdR 125 certification for gender equality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Within the Impact Plan – Our Impact Plan, you can find a summary of all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – “GDPR”) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please consult KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nolan Norton S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-DM1&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Verona-IT-Application-and-Integration-Architect/1360671057/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1360671057</guid><g:id>1360671057</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Verona, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant/ Assistant Manager Cyber - Firenze/Bologna (Bologna, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk a Firenze e Bologna lavorerai con i nostri esperti di ICT security per aiutare i clienti ad affrontare i rischi informatici che minacciano il loro business. Collaborerai su progetti rilevanti per le aziende leader di mercato.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analizzare &lt;strong&gt;la sicurezza delle informazioni&lt;/strong&gt; (politiche, modelli organizzativi, ecc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestire &lt;strong&gt;la continuità operativa&lt;/strong&gt; e disaster recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestire gli accessi (IAM e IAG)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestire la privacy &lt;strong&gt;IT Compliance&lt;/strong&gt; (ad es., protezione dei dati, decreto legislativo n. 231, crimine informatico e regolamenti della Banca d&apos;Italia)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analizzare dei &lt;strong&gt;dati di sicurezza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Re-ingegnerizzare&lt;/strong&gt; i processi aziendali&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Applicare i &lt;strong&gt;principali standard&lt;/strong&gt; (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, ecc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Utilizzare strategie di sicurezza e valutazione dei rischi&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestione del rischio e controllo nel campo IT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Valutazione della cybersecurity e delle &lt;strong&gt;vulnerabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ethical hacking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolto in progetti sia nazionali che internazionali, collaborando con professionisti altamente qualificati, e lavorerai a stretto contatto con i nostri clienti del settore Financial Services, tra cui banche, assicurazioni e società di investimento, contribuendo alla gestione di rischi IT, governance, audit, privacy e sicurezza informatica.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai maturato oltre 2 anni di esperienza in società di consulenza operanti in ambito cybersecurity, audit IT e compliance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai una laurea in ingegneria informatica, ingegneria gestionale o in informatica e tecnologie dell&apos;informazione;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai una consolidata esperienza nel modulo SAP FI maturata lavorando su progetti;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai un&apos;ottima padronanza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conosci i principali standard applicabili (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, ecc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 38.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 48.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto delle individualità, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità: questi sono i valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e alla crescita personale e professionale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere. Scopri tutte le nostre azioni concrete nel nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com), che descrive le nostre iniziative su temi ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity to build a better future is right in front of you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to businesses to support them in transforming their business models, improving and digitizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, as well as assisting in extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, by joining the Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk Team in Firenze e Bologna, you will work alongside our ICT security experts to help clients address the cybersecurity risks threatening their business. You will collaborate on significant projects for leading market companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In particular, you will be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analyzing information security governance (policies, organizational models, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Managing business continuity and disaster recovery;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Managing identity access (IAM and IAG);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ensuring IT compliance in privacy matters (e.g., data protection, Legislative Decree No. 231, cybercrime, and Bank of Italy regulations);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analyzing security data;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Re-engineering business processes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Applying the main standards (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Utilizing security strategies and conducting risk assessments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Managing risk and control in the IT field;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conducting cybersecurity and vulnerability assessments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Practicing ethical hacking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will be involved in both national and international projects, collaborating with highly qualified professionals and working closely with our clients in the financial services sector, including banks, insurance companies, and investment firms, contributing to the management of IT risks, governance, audit, privacy, and cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have 2+ of experience in consulting firms operating in the fields of cybersecurity, IT audit, and compliance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You hold a degree in computer engineering, management engineering, or information technology;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You possess solid experience in the SAP FI module gained through project work;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have excellent proficiency in English, preferably supported by study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You are familiar with the main applicable standards (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that fosters creativity and teamwork;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid working modes to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay up-to-date;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €38,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €48,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s values that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and personal and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.” Discover all our concrete actions in our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com), which outlines our initiatives on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:6.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-AA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Bologna-Senior-Consultant-Assistant-Manager-Cyber-FirenzeBologna/1371049157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1371049157</guid><g:id>1371049157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Bologna, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior SAP BTP Developer (Napoli, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters | Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare clienti, società, colleghe e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Open Platform è il nostro nuovo Hub innovativo con sede a Napoli, creato per sviluppare modelli di servizio e soluzioni ad alto contenuto tecnologico. Le aree di intervento includono Cyber Security, Program Management su grandi cantieri di trasformazione, Application Maintenance e Managed Services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del Team SAP Tech avrai la possibilità di crescere su una delle piattaforme cloud più rilevanti del mercato enterprise, lavorando a stretto contatto con colleghi senior e consulenti funzionali allo sviluppo e alla personalizzazione di soluzioni su SAP Business Technology Platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Affiancare il team nella &lt;strong&gt;gestione e modellazione dei dati&lt;/strong&gt; su SAP HANA Cloud, contribuendo alla progettazione delle strutture dati a supporto delle soluzioni.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supportare lo &lt;strong&gt;sviluppo di servizi e applicazioni&lt;/strong&gt; su SAP BTP, con graduale approfondimento di tecnologie come CAP (Cloud Application Programming Model), Node.js e SAPUI5.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribuire alle attività di &lt;strong&gt;integrazione tra sistemi&lt;/strong&gt; tramite API REST, con supporto alle funzionalità di SAP Integration Suite.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Avvicinarti agli &lt;strong&gt;scenari di Intelligenza Artificiale&lt;/strong&gt; e ai servizi AI disponibili su BTP, seguendo l&apos;evoluzione della piattaforma in un ambito in rapida crescita.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Partecipare alle attività di &lt;strong&gt;manutenzione evolutiva&lt;/strong&gt; delle soluzioni esistenti, garantendo continuità e qualità del servizio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are | Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai conseguito una &lt;strong&gt;laurea triennale o magistrale&lt;/strong&gt; in Ingegneria (Informatica, Gestionale, Automazione), Informatica, Matematica, Fisica o discipline affini, oppure un diploma tecnico-informatico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una buona conoscenza di almeno un &lt;strong&gt;linguaggio di programmazione&lt;/strong&gt; (ad esempio Python, Java, C++ o JavaScript) e dei principi dello sviluppo software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai buone basi di &lt;strong&gt;analisi e modellazione dei dati&lt;/strong&gt; e interesse per la loro applicazione ai processi aziendali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai familiarità con i &lt;strong&gt;principi dell&apos;integrazione tra sistemi&lt;/strong&gt; (architetture a microservizi, API REST) e con strumenti di &lt;strong&gt;versionamento del codice&lt;/strong&gt; come Git, oppure sei motivata/o ad acquisirli.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei motivata/o ad &lt;strong&gt;apprendere le tecnologie SAP&lt;/strong&gt; in un contesto strutturato e sfidante.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona padronanza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt; e attitudine al &lt;strong&gt;lavoro in team&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a &lt;strong&gt;trasferte&lt;/strong&gt; in Italia e all&apos;estero in base alle esigenze progettuali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us | Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, equo e che valorizza le diversità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva creatività e lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibrida, per un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi avanzati di formazione e sviluppo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul benessere psicofisico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;L&apos;opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 500€ per stage curriculare o 700€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio RAL di ingresso compresa tra € 23.500 e € 24.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better | I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e conoscenza.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all&apos;impegno nel favorire un ambiente inclusivo, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le certificazioni ISO 30415 (Diversità e Inclusione) e UNI PdR 125 (Parità di Genere). All&apos;interno del nostro Impact Plan trovi tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ESG (ambientali, sociali e di governance).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel rispetto del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (GDPR).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Open Platform S.r.l. SB garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters | Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Looking for work that truly matters and makes a difference? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, organisations and colleagues tackle and solve today&apos;s most complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Open Platform is our new innovation Hub based in Naples, created to develop service models and technology-intensive solutions. Our areas of focus include Cyber Security, Program Management on large-scale transformation programmes, Application Maintenance and Managed Services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;As part of the SAP Tech Team you will grow on one of the most relevant cloud platforms in the enterprise market, working side by side with senior colleagues and functional consultants on the development and customisation of solutions built on SAP Business Technology Platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;More specifically, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Support the team in &lt;strong&gt;data management and modelling&lt;/strong&gt; on SAP HANA Cloud, contributing to the design of the data structures behind our solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Support the &lt;strong&gt;development of services and applications&lt;/strong&gt; on SAP BTP, gradually building expertise in technologies such as CAP (Cloud Application Programming Model), Node.js and SAPUI5.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribute to &lt;strong&gt;system integration&lt;/strong&gt; activities through REST APIs, supporting the use of SAP Integration Suite.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Get closer to &lt;strong&gt;Artificial Intelligence scenarios&lt;/strong&gt; and AI services available on BTP, following the evolution of the platform in a fast-growing area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Take part in the &lt;strong&gt;continuous improvement and maintenance&lt;/strong&gt; of existing solutions, ensuring service continuity and quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are | Your skills and qualities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You hold a &lt;strong&gt;Bachelor&apos;s or Master&apos;s degree&lt;/strong&gt; in Engineering (Computer, Management, Automation), Computer Science, Mathematics, Physics or related fields, or a technical diploma in IT.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good command of at least one &lt;strong&gt;programming language&lt;/strong&gt; (for example Python, Java, C++ or JavaScript) and of software development principles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have solid foundations in &lt;strong&gt;data analysis and modelling&lt;/strong&gt; and an interest in applying them to business processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are familiar with &lt;strong&gt;system integration principles&lt;/strong&gt; (microservices architectures, REST) and with &lt;strong&gt;code versioning tools&lt;/strong&gt; such as Git, or you are motivated to learn them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are motivated to &lt;strong&gt;learn SAP technologies&lt;/strong&gt; in a structured and challenging environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good command of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; and a strong aptitude for &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are available to &lt;strong&gt;travel&lt;/strong&gt; in Italy and abroad according to project needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us | What you will find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An inclusive and equitable working environment that values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A stimulating, dynamic context that encourages creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid working arrangements, for a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programmes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives dedicated to physical and mental wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €500 for curricular internships and €700 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary between € 23,500 and € 24,000, determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate&apos;s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;In compliance with current regulations, we do not collect or use information on salaries received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective criteria and are gender-neutral.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better | Our values and our commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity: these are the KPMG Values that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network has obtained the ISO 30415 (Diversity and Inclusion) and UNI PdR 125 (Gender Equality) certifications. Our Impact Plan sets out all the concrete actions we are taking on ESG (environmental, social and governance) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (GDPR).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Open Platform S.r.l. SB is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Napoli-Junior-SAP-BTP-Developer/1361129157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1361129157</guid><g:id>1361129157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Napoli, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant Oracle EPM planning (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare clienti, società, colleghe e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory affianca le imprese nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, supportando i clienti nell&apos;analisi e gestione dei rischi e nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del Team &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platforms&lt;/strong&gt;, lavorerai su progetti di implementazione, manutenzione ed evoluzione di soluzioni &lt;strong&gt;Oracle EPM Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; ed &lt;strong&gt;Oracle ERP Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;, contribuendo alla digitalizzazione dei processi di &lt;strong&gt;pianificazione&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;forecasting&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;tax&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;financial close&lt;/strong&gt; per clienti privati di primario standing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Partecipare alle sessioni di analisi dei requisiti con gli stakeholder (Finance, Program Management, Controllo di Gestione), contribuendo a tradurre le esigenze di business in soluzioni funzionali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supportare il disegno dei processi to-be in ambito &lt;strong&gt;pianificazione&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;budgeting&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;tax reporting&lt;/strong&gt;, in coerenza con le best practice &lt;strong&gt;Oracle EPM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Curare la &lt;strong&gt;configurazione funzionale&lt;/strong&gt; di &lt;strong&gt;Oracle EPM Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;Planning/PBCS&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Tax Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;) e, ove richiesto, di moduli &lt;strong&gt;Oracle ERP Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;GL&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;AP&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Gestire attività di &lt;strong&gt;manutenzione evolutiva e correttiva&lt;/strong&gt; su applicazioni EPM già a regime, incluse le richieste di service e gli interventi di configurazione&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Fungere da interfaccia funzionale con i team tecnici e con le altre piattaforme IT del cliente (&lt;strong&gt;SAP&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Jira&lt;/strong&gt;) nelle attività di &lt;strong&gt;integrazione dei dati&lt;/strong&gt; e nella gestione dei &lt;strong&gt;ticket di supporto&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Presidiare la &lt;strong&gt;documentazione funzionale&lt;/strong&gt; di progetto, garantendone qualità e aggiornamento nelle diverse fasi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supportare i cicli di &lt;strong&gt;test SIT/UAT&lt;/strong&gt; e la gestione della risoluzione delle anomalie&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Fornire supporto alle attività di &lt;strong&gt;go-live&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;hypercare&lt;/strong&gt;, assicurando continuità operativa e gestione tempestiva delle criticità applicative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Interfacciarsi con i &lt;strong&gt;key user&lt;/strong&gt; del cliente, garantendo supporto continuativo e &lt;strong&gt;knowledge transfer&lt;/strong&gt; sull&apos;utilizzo degli strumenti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su progetti in ambito &lt;strong&gt;privato&lt;/strong&gt;, lavorando a stretto contatto con clienti di settori quali largo consumo, farmaceutico, retail e servizi, con esposizione anche ad ambienti &lt;strong&gt;multi-vendor&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;multi-piattaforma&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai circa &lt;strong&gt;3 anni di esperienza&lt;/strong&gt; su progetti &lt;strong&gt;Oracle&lt;/strong&gt;, con competenza applicativa su &lt;strong&gt;Oracle EPM Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;Planning&lt;/strong&gt;) e familiarità con moduli &lt;strong&gt;Tax Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai maturato esperienza anche su &lt;strong&gt;Oracle ERP Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; (moduli &lt;strong&gt;GL&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;AP&lt;/strong&gt;) e, idealmente, su ambienti &lt;strong&gt;Oracle EBS R12&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una buona conoscenza dei processi di &lt;strong&gt;pianificazione&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;budgeting&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;financial close&lt;/strong&gt;, con capacità di supportare la traduzione dei requisiti di business in soluzioni &lt;strong&gt;EPM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza in attività di &lt;strong&gt;manutenzione applicativa&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;gestione ticket&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;supporto L2/L3&lt;/strong&gt;, oltre che in progetti implementativi end-to-end (requisiti, configurazione, test, go live)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai familiarità con la gestione di &lt;strong&gt;integrazioni&lt;/strong&gt; tra &lt;strong&gt;Oracle&lt;/strong&gt; e altre piattaforme aziendali (&lt;strong&gt;SAP&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Jira&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei a tuo agio nell&apos;interfacciarti con i &lt;strong&gt;key user&lt;/strong&gt; e con fornitori esterni, garantendo qualità e continuità del supporto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai buona padronanza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt; (scritta e parlata) e sei disponibile a trasferte nazionali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Costituisce un plus:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Esperienza su progetti di reportistica &lt;strong&gt;Oracle Fusion Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;AR&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;AP&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Project Management&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;T&amp;amp;L&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Conoscenza di strumenti di scripting/coding (&lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Groovy&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Essbase&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certificazioni Oracle EPM Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; rilevanti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt;, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di formazione e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul benessere psicofisico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager , determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all&apos;impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; (Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l&apos;Inclusione) e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; (parità di genere). All&apos;interno del nostro Impact Plan trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (GDPR) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, organisations, colleagues and peers tackle and solve today&apos;s most complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory supports companies in business model transformation, process improvement and digitalisation, helping clients with risk analysis and management as well as extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;By joining the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platforms&lt;/strong&gt; team, you will work on implementation, maintenance and evolution projects for &lt;strong&gt;Oracle EPM Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Oracle ERP Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; solutions, contributing to the digitalisation of &lt;strong&gt;planning&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;forecasting&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;tax&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;financial close&lt;/strong&gt; processes for leading private sector clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be responsible for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supporting requirements analysis sessions with stakeholders (Finance, Program Management, Management Control)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contributing to the design of to-be processes in the &lt;strong&gt;planning&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;budgeting&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;tax reporting&lt;/strong&gt; space&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supporting &lt;strong&gt;functional configuration&lt;/strong&gt; activities for &lt;strong&gt;Oracle EPM Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;Planning/PBCS&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Tax Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;) and, where required, &lt;strong&gt;Oracle ERP Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; modules (&lt;strong&gt;GL&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;AP&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Managing &lt;strong&gt;evolutive and corrective maintenance&lt;/strong&gt; activities on live EPM applications, including service requests and configuration interventions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Acting as functional interface with technical teams and other client IT platforms (&lt;strong&gt;SAP&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Jira&lt;/strong&gt;) on &lt;strong&gt;data integration&lt;/strong&gt; activities and &lt;strong&gt;support ticket&lt;/strong&gt; management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Maintaining &lt;strong&gt;functional documentation&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring quality and updates across project phases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supporting &lt;strong&gt;SIT/UAT testing&lt;/strong&gt; cycles and defect resolution management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Providing support during &lt;strong&gt;go-live&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;hypercare&lt;/strong&gt; phases, ensuring operational continuity and timely resolution of application issues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Interfacing with client &lt;strong&gt;key users&lt;/strong&gt;, providing ongoing support and &lt;strong&gt;knowledge transfer&lt;/strong&gt; on tool usage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You will be involved in &lt;strong&gt;private sector&lt;/strong&gt; projects, working closely with clients in industries such as consumer goods, pharmaceutical, retail and services, with exposure to &lt;strong&gt;multi-vendor&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;multi-platform&lt;/strong&gt; environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is a great fit for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have around &lt;strong&gt;3 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; on &lt;strong&gt;Oracle&lt;/strong&gt; projects, with hands-on expertise on &lt;strong&gt;Oracle EPM Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;Planning&lt;/strong&gt;) and familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Tax Reporting&lt;/strong&gt; modules&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have also gained experience on &lt;strong&gt;Oracle ERP Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;GL&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;AP&lt;/strong&gt; modules) and, ideally, on &lt;strong&gt;Oracle EBS R12&lt;/strong&gt; environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good understanding of &lt;strong&gt;planning&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;budgeting&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;financial close&lt;/strong&gt; processes, with the ability to support the translation of business requirements into &lt;strong&gt;EPM&lt;/strong&gt; solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have experience in &lt;strong&gt;application maintenance&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;ticket management&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;L2/L3 support&lt;/strong&gt;, as well as in end-to-end implementation projects (requirements, configuration, testing, go-live)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are familiar with managing &lt;strong&gt;integrations&lt;/strong&gt; between &lt;strong&gt;Oracle&lt;/strong&gt; and other enterprise platforms (&lt;strong&gt;SAP&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Jira&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are comfortable interfacing with &lt;strong&gt;key users&lt;/strong&gt; and external vendors, ensuring quality and continuity of support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good command of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; (written and spoken) and are available to travel within Italy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Experience on &lt;strong&gt;Oracle Fusion Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; reporting projects (&lt;strong&gt;AR&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;AP&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Project Management&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;T&amp;amp;L&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Knowledge of scripting/coding tools (&lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Groovy&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Essbase&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Relevant &lt;strong&gt;Oracle EPM Cloud certifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An inclusive and equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic setting that fosters creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; working model to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programmes to keep you continuously up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An international mindset and exposure to innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate&apos;s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement and integrity: these are the KPMG Values that give life to an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to reach their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Through our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network is compliant with the requirements of &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; (Diversity and Inclusion Management System) and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; (gender equality). Within our Impact Plan you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of EU Regulation no. 679/2016 (GDPR) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-Consultant-Oracle-EPM-planning/1368443157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368443157</guid><g:id>1368443157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Manager Ufficio Gare - Roma (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Senior Manager | Ufficio Gare&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Business Services &lt;/strong&gt;offre servizi interni all’organizzazione, supportando tutte le linee di servizio e coadiuvando i professionisti nella gestione delle attività quotidiane.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team&lt;strong&gt; Ufficio gare &lt;/strong&gt;come&lt;strong&gt; Senior Manager &lt;/strong&gt;presso la sede di &lt;strong&gt;Roma&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai responsabile di fornire i più alti standard di assistenza diretta e di supporto alla Leadership e ai componenti del Management Group, gestendo un team complesso con riferimento alle gare sia nazionali sia internazionali.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Coordinare e supervisionare l&apos;Ufficio Gare, curando lo sviluppo del team e garantendo un&apos;efficace pianificazione delle attività, la corretta assegnazione dei carichi di lavoro e il rispetto delle scadenze;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Definire procedure, standard operativi e best practice per la gestione delle gare nazionali e internazionali, assicurando uniformità e qualità dei processi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Presidiare l&apos;intero ciclo di vita delle procedure di gara per il Network, dalla fase di analisi della documentazione fino alla stipula del contratto e all&apos;avvio dell&apos;esecuzione;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Garantire la conformità della documentazione amministrativa alle disposizioni normative e ai requisiti previsti da bandi, disciplinari e capitolati di gara;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Coordinare la partecipazione a procedure di gara complesse e di elevato valore economico, inclusi raggruppamenti temporanei di imprese (RTI), consorzi, avvalimenti e partenariati strategici;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Supervisionare la predisposizione delle offerte amministrative e il processo di verifica dei requisiti economico-finanziari e tecnico-professionali richiesti dalle stazioni appaltanti;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestire le relazioni con enti pubblici, clienti privati, partner, consulenti e organismi di controllo relativamente agli aspetti amministrativi e procedurali delle gare;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Assicurare il monitoraggio delle aggiudicazioni, delle verifiche post-gara e delle attività propedeutiche alla contrattualizzazione;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Coordinare la gestione delle richieste di chiarimento, degli accessi agli atti, delle contestazioni e delle eventuali procedure di verifica dell&apos;anomalia dell&apos;offerta;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Supervisionare la richiesta e la gestione di cauzioni, fideiussioni, garanzie e coperture assicurative richieste nell&apos;ambito delle procedure di affidamento;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Garantire la corretta gestione degli adempimenti amministrativi nella fase esecutiva degli appalti, inclusi subappalti, varianti, proroghe, rinnovi e modifiche contrattuali;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Monitorare costantemente le opportunità di business attraverso i principali portali di e-procurement e le piattaforme telematiche di acquisto pubbliche e private;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Coordinare il processo di qualificazione aziendale e la gestione degli albi fornitori, assicurando il mantenimento dei requisiti e il puntuale aggiornamento delle informazioni societarie;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Presidiare l&apos;aggiornamento e la validità della documentazione societaria, delle certificazioni aziendali e della documentazione amministrativa necessaria alla partecipazione alle gare;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Supportare la Partnership nella definizione delle strategie di partecipazione alle gare e nell&apos;analisi della redditività e sostenibilità delle opportunità commerciali;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Garantire la corretta gestione delle procedure telematiche attraverso le principali piattaforme di e-procurement (MEPA, Sintel, STELLA, Net4Market, Ariba e altre);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Monitorare l&apos;evoluzione della normativa in materia di contratti pubblici e procurement, promuovendo l&apos;adeguamento delle procedure interne;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Supportare la gestione degli ACQ nella gestione delle terze parti coinvolte e nella rendicontazione dei contratti, presidiando i rapporti con i RTI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As you Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai conseguito una Laurea magistrale in Giurisprudenza, Economia o discipline affini;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai maturato una conoscenza approfondita del Codice dei Contratti Pubblici (Codice degli Appalti) e della normativa di settore;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza di almeno 10 anni in ruolo analogo presso realtà strutturate di medie/grandi dimensioni, preferibilmente settore servizi e ICT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Hai maturato esperienza nella gestione delle procedure di affidamento dal lato stazione appaltante, con particolare riferimento a: scelta della procedura di gara; definizione delle modalità di affidamento; individuazione e selezione degli operatori economici; predisposizione degli atti amministrativi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Possiedi esperienza nella gestione di procedure di gara complesse e grandi convenzioni/Accordi Quadro;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Hai una buona conoscenza della lingua inglese.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività &lt;/strong&gt;e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida, &lt;/strong&gt;per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione &lt;/strong&gt;e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;mindset internazionale &lt;/strong&gt;e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio Dirigente; la retribuzione sarà definita e commisurata in relazione a criteri oggettivi quali competenze, esperienza effettiva maturata e aderenza ai requisiti richiesti per la posizione. In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Business services S.r.l. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Senior Manager | Tenders Office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Business Services &lt;/strong&gt;provides internal services to our organisation, supporting all lines of service and assisting professionals in managing their daily tasks.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;senior manager&lt;/strong&gt; in the KPMG &lt;strong&gt;Tenders Office&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be responsible for meeting the highest standards of excellence in the provision of direct assistance and support to leadership and members of the management group, whilst managing a cross-functional team involved in both national and international tender processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;coordinating and supervising the Tenders Office, overseeing the development of the team and ensuring the effective planning of activities, the suitable allocation of workloads and adherence to deadlines;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;defining procedures, operational standards and best practices for managing national and international tenders to ensure consistency and quality in the processes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;overseeing the entire lifecycle of the Network’s tender procedures, from the analysis of the documentation to signing the contract and commencing procedures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ensuring that administrative documentation complies with regulatory provisions and the requirements set out in calls for tenders, tender guidelines and tender specifications;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;coordinating participation in complex, high-value tenders, including joint ventures and consortia, reliance arrangements and strategic partnerships;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;overseeing the preparation of tender administrative documentation and ensuring compliance with the financial, technical and professional requirements set by contracting authorities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;managing relationships with public bodies, private clients, partners, consultants and regulatory bodies, ensuring compliance with the administrative and procedural requirements of tender processes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ensuring the monitoring of contract awards, post-award verifications and all activities leading to the formal execution of contracts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;coordinating the management of clarification requests, document access requests, appeals and procedures related to the verification of tender irregularities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;overseeing the application for and management of bid bonds, sureties, guarantees and insurance coverage required for tender procedures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ensuring the proper management of administrative obligations throughout the contract implementation phase, including subcontracting, contract variations, extensions, renewals and amendments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;monitoring constantly business opportunities through major e-procurement portals and public and private online procurement platforms;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;coordinating the company’s qualification processes and the management of supplier registers, ensuring compliance with qualification requirements and the updating of company information;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ensuring that corporate records, company certifications and tender-related administrative documentation remain valid and up to date;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;supporting the Partnership in defining tender participation strategies and analysing the profitability and sustainability of business opportunities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ensuring the effective management of electronic tender procedures through major e-procurement platforms (including MEPA, Sintel, STELLA, Net4Market, Ariba, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;monitoring developments in public procurement and contract legislation, and ensuring that internal procedures remain aligned with regulatory changes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;supporting ACQs in the management of third party stakeholders and contract reporting activities, while overseeing relationships with joint ventures and consortia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a master’s degree in law, economics or in a related field;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an in-depth knowledge of the Public Procurement Code (&lt;em&gt;Codice degli Appalti&lt;/em&gt;) and sector-specific legislation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;at least 10 years’ experience in a similar role within well-established medium-sized or large organisations, preferably in the services and ICT sectors;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;experience in managing procurement procedures from the perspective of the contracting authority, with particular reference to: the choice of tender procedure; the definition of the award criteria; the identification and selection of bidders, and the preparation of administrative documents;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;experience in managing complex tender procedures and large-scale contracts and framework agreements;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a challenging and dynamic environment that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay up-to-date;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;international mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Executive employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills, relevant experience and fulfilment of the requirements of the position. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network complies with &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 &lt;/strong&gt;(Diversity and Inclusion Management System) and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; (gender equality). Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Business Services S.r.l. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-RR1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Senior-Manager-Ufficio-Gare-Roma/1368400757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368400757</guid><g:id>1368400757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Ufficio Gare</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Cyber Security - Torino (Torino, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team di Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk a Torino lavorerai con i nostri esperti di ICT security per aiutare i clienti ad affrontare i rischi informatici che minacciano il loro business. Collaborerai su progetti rilevanti per le aziende leader di mercato.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analizzare &lt;strong&gt;la sicurezza delle informazioni&lt;/strong&gt; (politiche, modelli organizzativi, ecc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestire &lt;strong&gt;la continuità operativa&lt;/strong&gt; e disaster recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestire gli accessi (IAM e IAG)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestire la privacy &lt;strong&gt;IT Compliance&lt;/strong&gt; (ad es., protezione dei dati, decreto legislativo n. 231, crimine informatico e regolamenti della Banca d&apos;Italia)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analizzare dei &lt;strong&gt;dati di sicurezza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Re-ingegnerizzare&lt;/strong&gt; i processi aziendali&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Applicare i &lt;strong&gt;principali standard&lt;/strong&gt; (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, ecc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Utilizzare strategie di sicurezza e valutazione dei rischi&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestione del rischio e controllo nel campo IT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Valutazione della cybersecurity e delle &lt;strong&gt;vulnerabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ethical hacking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolto in progetti sia nazionali che internazionali, collaborando con professionisti altamente qualificati, e lavorerai a stretto contatto con i nostri clienti del settore Financial Services, tra cui banche, assicurazioni e società di investimento, contribuendo alla gestione di rischi IT, governance, audit, privacy e sicurezza informatica.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai maturato oltre 2 anni di esperienza in società di consulenza operanti in ambito cybersecurity, audit IT e compliance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai una laurea in ingegneria informatica, ingegneria gestionale o in informatica e tecnologie dell&apos;informazione;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai una consolidata esperienza nel modulo SAP FI maturata lavorando su progetti;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai un&apos;ottima padronanza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conosci i principali standard applicabili (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, ecc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 38.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 48.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto delle individualità, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità: questi sono i valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e alla crescita personale e professionale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere. Scopri tutte le nostre azioni concrete nel nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com), che descrive le nostre iniziative su temi ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity to build a better future is right in front of you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to businesses to support them in transforming their business models, improving and digitizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, as well as assisting in extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, by joining the Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk Team in Firenze e Bologna, you will work alongside our ICT security experts to help clients address the cybersecurity risks threatening their business. You will collaborate on significant projects for leading market companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In particular, you will be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analyzing information security governance (policies, organizational models, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Managing business continuity and disaster recovery;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Managing identity access (IAM and IAG);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ensuring IT compliance in privacy matters (e.g., data protection, Legislative Decree No. 231, cybercrime, and Bank of Italy regulations);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analyzing security data;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Re-engineering business processes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Applying the main standards (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Utilizing security strategies and conducting risk assessments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Managing risk and control in the IT field;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conducting cybersecurity and vulnerability assessments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Practicing ethical hacking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will be involved in both national and international projects, collaborating with highly qualified professionals and working closely with our clients in the financial services sector, including banks, insurance companies, and investment firms, contributing to the management of IT risks, governance, audit, privacy, and cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have 2+ of experience in consulting firms operating in the fields of cybersecurity, IT audit, and compliance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You hold a degree in computer engineering, management engineering, or information technology;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You possess solid experience in the SAP FI module gained through project work;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have excellent proficiency in English, preferably supported by study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You are familiar with the main applicable standards (ISO27001, COBIT, ITIL, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that fosters creativity and teamwork;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid working modes to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay up-to-date;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €38,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €48,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s values that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and personal and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.” Discover all our concrete actions in our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com), which outlines our initiatives on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:6.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-AA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Visit www.kpmg.it to learn more&lt;/p&gt;
]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Torino-Senior-Cyber-Security-Torino/797573202/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">797573202</guid><g:id>797573202</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Torino, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant | Financial Services Roma (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot; class=&quot;joqReqEditorReadOnlyDiv richTextContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_content&quot; style=&quot;padding:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Financial Services Team&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt;, you will work closely with &lt;strong&gt;Banking &amp;amp; Insurance&lt;/strong&gt; sector on topics such as: business process reengineering to increase the economic-financial and physical-operational performance and digital transformation. This specialization offers the opportunity to work on nationally and internationally significant projects within the Financial Sector industry, participating in key initiatives of change and improvement in the realm of business processes efficiency and digitization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Definition of &lt;strong&gt;strategic development and growth opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; in the insurance sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development of &lt;strong&gt;industrial and business plans&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feasibility studies&lt;/strong&gt; for the start-up of new businesses and innovative products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management of complex &lt;strong&gt;strategic reorganization transactions&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;business integration deals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Definition and implementation of &lt;strong&gt;business strategy&lt;/strong&gt; of major financial institutions (e.g., reorganization of distribution networks, marketing plans, pricing models, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market, benchmarking and expected evolution analysis&lt;/strong&gt; of major sectors/business segments in the financial market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Definition of &lt;strong&gt;operating models&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;performance improvement programs&lt;/strong&gt; including the use of &lt;strong&gt;innovative technological solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Management Engineering, Finance, Management &lt;/strong&gt;or related field, with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;financial services&lt;/strong&gt; industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2 years of experience in a similar role, preferably with a consulting company or a multinational&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational and teamwork skills&lt;/strong&gt; with attention to detail, including the ability to prioritize and manage various complex tasks and activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;MS Office&lt;/strong&gt; package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-LZ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding:0.0px;text-indent:-0.5pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#ffffff&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding:0.0px;text-indent:-0.5pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;72&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;72full&amp;#39;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#ffffff&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Senior-Consultant-Financial-Services-Roma/1355450057/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1355450057</guid><g:id>1355450057</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Tax Consultant | Padova (Padova, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Junior Tax Consultant | Padova&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;With its highly qualified tax and legal experts, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; provides assistance in all the key tax and corporate law areas, offering innovative, integrated services. Its work teams specialise in both professional field and client sector. With over &lt;strong&gt;500 professionals &lt;/strong&gt;at &lt;strong&gt;12 offices &lt;/strong&gt;in Italy&apos;s largest cities, the KPMG network&apos;s Tax and legal unit is one of the top professional partnerships in the country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;We are recruiting a consultant to join our &lt;strong&gt;Tax Team &lt;/strong&gt;team in &lt;strong&gt;Padova&lt;/strong&gt;, who will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analysing issues concerning domestic direct and indirect taxation and offering ongoing advice to companies;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Expressing opinions on Italian and international tax matters (CFCs, blacklists, permanent establishments, withholding tax, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analysing the taxation of extraordinary transactions (mergers, demergers, contributions, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Tax due diligence;      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Aptos&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Tax compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in business or law;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Intention of going into professional practice as a chartered accountant and/or lawyer;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of English;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Strong organisational skills, an ability to take initiative and problem solving abilities;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Flexible and dynamic approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Candidates with the following will have an advantage:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in Tax Law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;•    An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive &lt;/strong&gt;and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;•    A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;•    &lt;strong&gt;Hybrid &lt;/strong&gt;work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;br&gt;•    Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training &lt;/strong&gt;and development programmes to stay current.&lt;br&gt;•    &lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and&lt;strong&gt; innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;•    Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work environmen&lt;/strong&gt;t, our Network complies with the standards of the&lt;strong&gt; ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a style=&quot;color:#467886;text-decoration:underline&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi intraprendere una professione davvero significativa e d’impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare clienti, l’azienda e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie ai suoi esperti altamente qualificati in ambito fiscale e legale, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; fornisce assistenza in tutte le principali aree del diritto tributario e societario, offrendo servizi innovativi e integrati. I team di lavoro sono specializzati sia per ambito professionale che per settore di clientela. Con oltre &lt;strong&gt;500 professionisti&lt;/strong&gt; distribuiti in &lt;strong&gt;12 sedi&lt;/strong&gt; nelle principali città italiane, l’unità fiscale e legale del network KPMG è una delle principali realtà professionali nel Paese.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Stiamo cercando un consulente da inserire nel nostro &lt;strong&gt;Tax Team&lt;/strong&gt; presso la sede di &lt;strong&gt;Padova&lt;/strong&gt;, che si occuperà di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analizzare problematiche relative alla fiscalità diretta e indiretta nazionale e fornire consulenza continuativa alle aziende;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Redigere pareri in materia fiscale italiana e internazionale (CFC, black list, stabili organizzazioni, ritenute, ecc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analizzare la fiscalità delle operazioni straordinarie (fusioni, scissioni, conferimenti, ecc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Effettuare attività di &lt;strong&gt;tax due diligence&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gestire attività di &lt;strong&gt;tax compliance&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa è l’opportunità perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Laurea magistrale in discipline economiche o giuridiche;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Intenzione di intraprendere la pratica professionale come dottore commercialista e/o avvocato;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ottime capacità relazionali e attitudine al lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Spiccate capacità organizzative, spirito d’iniziativa e problem solving;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Approccio flessibile e dinamico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Costituirà titolo preferenziale:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Laurea magistrale in Diritto Tributario.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Il tuo futuro con noi – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt; ed &lt;strong&gt;equo&lt;/strong&gt;, che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza la &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;sfidante e dinamico&lt;/strong&gt; che favorisce la creatività e il lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere l’equilibrio tra vita professionale e privata;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt; avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un mindset internazionale e &lt;strong&gt;progetti innovativi&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere mentale e fisico&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insieme per un futuro migliore – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità. Questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che creano un ambiente in cui è possibile condividere idee e conoscenze affinché i nostri professionisti possano &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro&lt;/strong&gt; inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; – [Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)] – sono sintetizzate tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti in materia ambientale, sociale e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), come modificato. Per ulteriori informazioni, consulta l’informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato è un datore di lavoro che offre pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-LB1&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Padova-Junior-Tax-Consultant-Padova/1365689157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365689157</guid><g:id>1365689157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Padova, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Consultant - Cyber Security | Firenze/Bologna/Parma (Bologna, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella &lt;strong&gt;digitalizzazione&lt;/strong&gt; dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk&lt;/strong&gt;, linea di servizi di KPMG che ha anticipato e seguito nel tempo le richieste del mercato relative alle tematiche di Information Risk Management e Sicurezza Informatica, sviluppando costantemente le competenze e capacità di analisi a protezione del patrimonio informativo aziendale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Comprendere il contesto tecnologico e di business dei clienti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Analizzare e proteggere il patrimonio informativo aziendale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Garantire la sicurezza delle informazioni e delle strategie di business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Integrare tecnologie innovative nelle infrastrutture esistenti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I professionisti appartenenti al team IRM di KPMG supportano le organizzazioni in tutte le fasi necessarie a garantire la sicurezza delle loro informazioni e delle loro strategie di business. Possiamo affiancare i nostri clienti per migliorare la crescita e creare valore. Possiamo aiutarli a fare i giusti investimenti nel momento giusto, a considerare le implicazioni più ampie della digital disruption, ad integrare tecnologie innovative nelle infrastrutture esistenti.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei un laureando/neolaureato magistrale in Cybersecurity, Informatica, Ingegneria informatica, Crime&amp;amp;Security Analysis, Cybersecurity Risk Strategy and Governance ecc;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai passione per le nuove tecnologie e la loro declinazione nei contesti aziendali;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai capacità di analisi dei dati e di sintesi nella presentazione dei risultati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Conosci i principali standard o practice di riferimento (ISO 27001, COBIT ecc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai interesse per l&apos;ambito dei Sistemi Informativi aziendali, intesi quale strumento abilitante per l&apos;efficace erogazione dei processi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai predisposizioni per la risoluzione di problemi complessi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei proattivo, flessibile e capace di adattarti a contesti eterogenei e sfidanti;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una buona padronanza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a viaggiare sul territorio nazionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ / L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso compresa tra € 28.000 e € 31.500, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and &lt;strong&gt;digitalisation&lt;/strong&gt;, risk analysis and management, and support in corporate finance transactions.  The &lt;strong&gt;Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk &lt;/strong&gt;team handles the KPMG line of services that pre-empted and continues to meet market demand for information risk management and cybersecurity services, continually developing the analytical skills and expertise to protect company information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;understanding clients’ technological and business context;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;analysing and protecting their information assets;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ensuring information and business strategies are secure;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;integrating innovative technologies into existing infrastructures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The members of KPMG’s CTR team support organisations across all phases of the process to ensure the security of their information and business strategies. We help our clients drive growth and generate value.  We can help them make the right investments at the right time, consider the broader implications of the digital disruption and build breakthrough innovations into their legacy infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;or will soon have a master’s degree in cybersecurity, computer science or computer engineering, Crime&amp;amp;Security Analysis, Cybersecurity Risk Strategy and Governance etc;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a passion for new technologies and their application in corporate settings;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an ability to analyse and summarise data when reporting findings;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;knowledge of the main applicable standards or practices (ISO 27001, COBIT, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an interest in corporate IT systems as enablers for the effective performance of processes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an aptitude for complex problem solving;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a proactive, flexible approach and the ability to adapt to varied, challenging situations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of English, preferably with study/work experience abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;availability to travel within Italy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay up-to-date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:150%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship with a monthly allowance of €800 / This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary  ranging from €28,000 to €31,500. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:150%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Bologna-Consultant-Cyber-Security-FirenzeBolognaParma/1366117157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366117157</guid><g:id>1366117157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Bologna, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Deal Advisory - Turnaround&amp;Restructuring Assistant Manager-Manager | Roma (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Restructuring&amp;amp;Turnaround Manager | Rome&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Restructuring services&lt;/strong&gt; team assists clients in debt and industrial restructuring with financial advisory and/or support services to help them prepare business plans that stabilise the business and usher in sustainable change. Our consultants are involved in debt restructuring, distressed M&amp;amp;As and lender advisory activities for multinationals, family-run enterprises, private equity funds and financial institutions. As a member of this team, known for the quality and scope of its projects, your talent will be put to full use, enabling you to work with leading Italian and international clients: in 2022, for the third time in four years, our team received the Finance Community Award for Italian “Restructuring Team of the Year” in recognition of its professional excellence and the type of projects implemented.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Join our team in &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;a dynamic and stimulating environment where you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;analysing the financial performance of target companies to identify the actual financial situation of an enterprise;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;financial modelling and business planning;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;independent business reviews of business plans;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;commercial and operational due diligence;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;negotiation with the main stakeholders (mainly financial institutions and investors);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;distressed M&amp;amp;As (with industrial partners, investment funds, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;cash management and turnarounds;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;cost cutting analysis and organizational improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;5/7 years of experience in restructuring, company crisis and/or corporate finance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;specialist degree in business with a focus on finance/AFC and/or engineering management (for finance);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;equitable &lt;/strong&gt;work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;challenging and dynamic environment&lt;/strong&gt; that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a &lt;strong&gt;healthy work-life balance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internationa&lt;/strong&gt;l mindset and &lt;strong&gt;innovative &lt;/strong&gt;projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical &lt;strong&gt;well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position and from €52,000 to €65,000 for the Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:115%;background-color:white&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential. As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a style=&quot;color:black&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-MP2&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Deal-Advisory-Turnaround&amp;Restructuring-Assistant-Manager-Manager-Roma/1325929757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1325929757</guid><g:id>1325929757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Deal Advisory</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Transfer Pricing Consultant | Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transfer Pricing Consultant | Milano&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. I professionisti dello &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; di KPMG intervengono in tutte le principali aree della fiscalità e del diritto societario offrendo servizi integrati e innovativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Transfer Pricing &lt;/strong&gt;di &lt;strong&gt;Milano&lt;/strong&gt;, contribuirai a supportare i clienti nell&apos;affrontare le sfide legate alle principali aree della fiscalità. Opererai in uno scenario in continua evoluzione, dove normative nazionali e internazionali si intrecciano con le aspettative del mercato e dell’opinione pubblica su temi cruciali come l’etica, la trasparenza e la corporate governance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Strutturare ed eseguire analisi di conformità alla normativa fiscale italiana e alle linee guida OCSE;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Analizzare la catena del valore dei gruppi attraverso interviste al management;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Analizzare bilanci e contratti infragruppo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Eseguire analisi economiche e di benchmarking;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Redigere la documentazione sul transfer pricing;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Sviluppare competenze in materia di fiscalità internazionale e dei gruppi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa è l’opportunità perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Conseguito la laurea magistrale in Economia (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;LM-56 or LM-77&lt;/span&gt;) con votazione minima di 100/110;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;La volontà di conseguire l&apos;abilitazione come Dottore Commercialista;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ottime capacità relazionali e attitudine al lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Spiccate capacità organizzative, spirito d’iniziativa e problem solving;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Approccio flessibile e dinamico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; Sarà considerato un plus un Master di II livello in Diritto Tributario.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Il tuo futuro con noi – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt; ed &lt;strong&gt;equo&lt;/strong&gt;, che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza la &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;sfidante e dinamico&lt;/strong&gt; che favorisce la creatività e il lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt; avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un mindset internazionale e &lt;strong&gt;progetti innovativi&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere mentale e fisico&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Insieme per un futuro migliore – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità. Questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che creano un ambiente in cui è possibile condividere idee e conoscenze affinché i nostri professionisti possano &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; – [Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)] – sono sintetizzate tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti in materia ambientale, sociale e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), come modificato. Per ulteriori informazioni, consulta l’informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato è un datore di lavoro che offre pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;With its highly qualified tax and legal experts, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; provides assistance in all the key tax and corporate law areas, offering innovative, integrated services. Its work teams specialise in both professional field and client sector. With over &lt;strong&gt;600 professionals &lt;/strong&gt;at &lt;strong&gt;12 offices &lt;/strong&gt;in Italy&apos;s largest cities, the KPMG network&apos;s Tax and legal unit is one of the top professional partnerships in the country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;We are recruiting a professional to join our &lt;strong&gt;Transfer Pricing&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, who will perform international tax analyses to establish the transfer prices of goods, services and financial transactions between companies in the same industrial or financial group, in order to determine the proper tax base in each tax jurisdiction in which the group operates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; Specifically, the successful candidate will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Structuring and performing compliance analyses with Italian tax legislation and the OECD guidelines, under the supervision of more senior consultants; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Analysing the value chain of groups by interviewing management;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Developing their theoretical knowledge of the international tax matters that could be the subject of specific research and subsequently collaborating in the writing of articles if requested;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Analysing financial statements and intragroup contracts;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Performance of economic and benchmarking analysis;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Drafting of transfer pricing documentation;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Developing skills in international tax matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Master’s degree in business (LM-56 or LM-77);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Qualification to practice as a chartered accountant, or willingness to obtain such qualification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of English;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office, especially Excel;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Strong organizational skills, initiative and problem solving;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Flexible and dynamic approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; A post-graduate specialisation in Tax Law would be a definite plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive &lt;/strong&gt;and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training &lt;/strong&gt;and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and&lt;strong&gt; innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a style=&quot;color:black&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-CN1&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Transfer-Pricing-Consultant-Milano/1368804757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368804757</guid><g:id>1368804757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant F&amp;PM | Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join our &lt;strong&gt;Financial and Performance Management&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will have the opportunity to work on finance transformation projects, redesigning the control, planning and reporting models of leading companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You will join our rapidly-expanding team of young talents, which stands out for the quality and scope of its innovative projects, at our offices. You will work with colleagues that provide functional advice on corporate performance management systems, assisting clients in the analysis, review of designs and processes supporting the CFO and the subsequent development of technological platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;analysing and defining &lt;strong&gt;budgeting, forecasting, long-term planning, sales and operational planning and product costing&lt;/strong&gt; processes;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;defining &lt;strong&gt;profitability analysis models&lt;/strong&gt;: analysis and definition of the income statement, the logic behind reclassification/consolidation, the identification of variable direct costs and cost allocation rules for overheads;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;assisting in the &lt;strong&gt;analysis of the closing process for the management accounts and redefining them for fast closes&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;analysing and defining the set of operating/strategic KPIs &lt;/strong&gt;for accurate and punctual performance monitoring;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;preparing and analysing periodic directors’ reports and analysing the changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;have a master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Economics&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;have &lt;strong&gt;2+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in similar roles at a consulting company or firm;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;are familiar with the following: &lt;strong&gt;control models, budgeting and forecasting, consolidated and statutory financial statements and management accounts, financial planning&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;have an &lt;strong&gt;excellent knowledge of English&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably with study/work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;are a problem solver, never lose sight of your goals, have strong interpersonal skills at work and as part of a team;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;have a desire to take on challenges and are comfortable in tough situations where leadership abilities can make the difference.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a title=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-LZ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-Consultant-F&amp;PM-Milano/826438302/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">826438302</guid><g:id>826438302</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>IT Strategy Senior Consultant | Financial Services | CIO Advisory (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Gli esperti di &lt;strong&gt;Nolan Norton&lt;/strong&gt;, società di IT Strategy del Network KPMG, aiutano le organizzazioni ad affrontare le sfide di trasformazione digitale e ad implementare architetture IT. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del Team CIO Advisory di Roma, esperto di architetture e soluzioni di data management che supporta i CIO nell&apos;evoluzione digitale del loro percorso, nel loro journey verso il cloud, dalla strategia all&apos;esecuzione e dalla visione al valore reale. Entrerai a far parte di un ambiente dinamico e stimolante, per clienti di alto livello altamente visibili nei mercati dei servizi finanziari, dell&apos;energia, del settore pubblico e dei consumatori e industriali.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di su tecnologie innovative su progetti sfidanti ed entusiasmanti, supportando i nostri clienti principalmente sulle seguenti tematiche:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: aiutiamo i nostri clienti a sviluppare strategie tecnologiche e modelli operativi tecnologici innovativi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: consentiamo ai clienti di utilizzare soluzioni all&apos;avanguardia per applicazioni, infrastrutture e TLC;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management&lt;/strong&gt;: aiutiamo i nostri clienti nell’identificazione delle migliori soluzioni di gestione del dato e progettazione di architetture di Data Management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;: assistiamo i nostri clienti a identificare, definire le priorità, progettare e indirizzare meglio gli investimenti tecnologici;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: gestiamo la governance e svolgiamo attività di supporto tecnico durante la selezione delle varie opzioni e dei fornitori nell&apos;intero ciclo dei servizi ICT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance and Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: ci occupiamo della corretta struttura e dimensionamento delle risorse ICT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost right-sizing&lt;/strong&gt;: valutiamo e suggeriamo opzioni per indirizzare meglio la spesa e le risorse ICT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Laurea in discipline tecnico-scientifiche;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;almeno 3/4 anni di esperienza in società di consulenza o grandi aziende internazionali del settore ICT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Buona padronanza della lingua inglese, scritta e parlata (Livello minimo B2);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ottime capacità comunicative (scritte e orali)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Rappresentano un plus:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Esperienza nel disegno dei processi IT sulla base delle best practice di mercato&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza dei principali tool utilizzati in ambito IT Governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Eventuali certificazioni (Prince, ITIL v4, Togaf v9, Scrum o certificazioni AWS/Ms Azure/Google/Professional Cloud Service Manager) &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;strong&gt;  &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;All’interno del nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nolan Norton Spa garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. The experts at &lt;strong&gt;Nolan Norton&lt;/strong&gt;, an IT Strategy firm in the KPMG Network, help organizations address digital transformation challenges and implement IT architectures. Specifically, you will join the Rome-based CIO Advisory Team, experts in data management architectures and solutions who support CIOs in their digital evolution on their journey to the cloud, from strategy to execution and from vision to real value. You will join a dynamic and challenging environment for highly visible high-level clients in the financial services, energy, public sector, and consumer and industrial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will work on innovative technologies on challenging and exciting projects, supporting our clients primarily on the following topics:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: we help our clients develop innovative technology strategies and technology operating models;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: we enable clients to use state-of-the-art solutions for applications, infrastructure and TLC;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management&lt;/strong&gt;: we assist our clients in identifying the best data management solutions and designing Data Management architectures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;: we assist our clients in identifying, prioritizing, planning and better targeting technology investments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: we manage governance and perform technical support activities during the selection of various options and suppliers throughout the ICT services cycle;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance and Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: we address the proper structure and sizing of ICT resources;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost right-sizing&lt;/strong&gt;: we evaluate and suggest options to better target ICT spending and resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bachelor&apos;s degree in technical/scientific disciplines;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;At least 1/2 years of experience in consulting firms or large international ICT companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Good command of the English language, written and spoken (Minimum level B2);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills (written and oral).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Represent a plus:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Experience in IT process design based on market best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of the main tools used in IT Governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Any certifications (Prince, ITIL v4, Togaf v9, Scrum or AWS/Ms Azure/Google/Professional Cloud Service Manager certifications)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Represent a plus:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Experience in IT process design based on market best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of the main tools used in IT Governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Any certifications (Prince, ITIL v4, Togaf v9, Scrum or AWS/Ms Azure/Google/Professional Cloud Service Manager certifications)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you&apos;ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt;, equitable &lt;strong&gt;work&lt;/strong&gt; environment that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to stay current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better - Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individuality, continuous deepening, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are the &lt;strong&gt;Values of KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; that give rise to an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, which allows our professionals to &lt;strong&gt;express their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.” &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Within our &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Impact&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarized all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”) as amended.&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;For more information, please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nolan Norton Spa guarantees equal opportunities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-DM1&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-IT-Strategy-Senior-Consultant-Financial-Services-CIO-Advisory/820295402/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">820295402</guid><g:id>820295402</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Legal Labour Consultant - Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. I professionisti dello &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; di KPMG intervengono in tutte le principali aree della fiscalità e del diritto societario offrendo servizi integrati e innovativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team &lt;strong&gt;Diritto del Lavoro&lt;/strong&gt; di &lt;strong&gt;Milano,&lt;/strong&gt; contribuirai a supportare i clienti nell&apos;affrontare le sfide legate alle principali aree del diritto societario. Opererai in uno scenario in continua evoluzione, dove normative nazionali e internazionali si intrecciano con le aspettative del mercato e dell’opinione pubblica su temi cruciali come l’etica, la trasparenza e la corporate governance. Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Gestione dei rapporti di lavoro e dei relativi contratti;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Gestione di licenziamenti individuali e collettivi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Trasferimenti d’azienda e cessioni di rami d’azienda;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Riorganizzazioni aziendali;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Redazione di contratti di agenzia;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Attività di due diligence in materia di diritto del lavoro;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Redazione di contratti di somministrazione e consulenza;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Gestione di accordi di conciliazione sindacale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Implementazione di piani di incentivazione e stock option;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Implementazione di piani di welfare aziendale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Contenzioso in materia di diritto del lavoro&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su &lt;strong&gt;progetti nazionali e internazionali&lt;/strong&gt;, lavorando al fianco di professioniste e professionisti altamente qualificati e acquisendo competenze di primo livello attraverso il confronto con le menti più brillanti del settore.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza professionale di almeno 1 anno presso primari studi nazionali o internazionali e/o società di consulenza;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai una laurea magistrale in &lt;strong&gt;Giurisprudenza &lt;/strong&gt;(LMG-01) con votazione almeno pari a 100/110;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai l’abilitazione alla professione di &lt;strong&gt;Avvocato &lt;/strong&gt;o la volontà di intraprendere la &lt;strong&gt;pratica professionale&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai una buona padronanza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Buona conoscenza di Office, in particolare Excel e Power Point;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ottime capacità relazionali e di team working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di&lt;strong&gt; lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività &lt;/strong&gt;e il&lt;strong&gt; lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione &lt;/strong&gt;e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale &lt;/strong&gt;e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;benessere psicof&lt;/span&gt;isico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di&lt;strong&gt; esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro&lt;strong&gt; Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the firm and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. The tax and legal experts at &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; provide assistance in all the key tax and corporate law areas, offering innovative, integrated services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;As part of the &lt;strong&gt;Labor Law&lt;/strong&gt; team, you’ll help clients navigate labor issues. You’ll be working in a constantly evolving environment, where national and international regulations intersect with market expectations as well as public opinion on crucial topics such as ethics, transparency and corporate governance.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Drafting employment contracts;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Individual and collective dismissals;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Business transfers and transfers of business units;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Corporate restructurings and reorganizations;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Drafting of agency contracts;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Due diligence activities in labour law;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Drafting staff leasing and consultancy contracts;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Management of union settlement agreements;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Implementation of incentive plans and stock options;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Implementation of corporate welfare plans;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Labour law litigation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Profile&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You have at least 1 year of professional experience in leading national or international firms and/or consulting companies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You hold a Master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Law &lt;/strong&gt;(LMG-01) with a final grade of at least 100/110&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You are either a certified &lt;strong&gt;Lawyer &lt;/strong&gt;or intend to begin the &lt;strong&gt;professional training&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You have a&lt;strong&gt; good command of English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally supported by study and/or work experiences abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You have a good working knowledge of Office tools, especially Excel and PowerPoint&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You possess strong interpersonal and teamworking skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A dynamic and stimulating setting that fosters &lt;strong&gt;creativity and collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced&lt;strong&gt; training and development programs &lt;/strong&gt;to keep your skills up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;– Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-CN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Legal-Labour-Consultant-Milano/1365690457/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365690457</guid><g:id>1365690457</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Legal</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Auditor (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG is where Auditors become AI enthusiasts &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Nel rispetto dei valori di integrità e qualità, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offre un portafoglio di servizi integrato in costante evoluzione, con insight che consentono alle aziende di rispondere ai fabbisogni informativi del mercato e degli investitori. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; ti interfaccerai con clienti leader a livello nazionale e internazionale e potrai contribuire all’integrità e alla trasparenza dei mercati finanziari, garantendo l’indipendenza e la riservatezza fondamentale al loro corretto andamento. Grazie all’&lt;strong&gt;innovazione&lt;/strong&gt;, svolgerai un &lt;em&gt;audit&lt;/em&gt; conforme e attento ai &lt;strong&gt;temi ESG&lt;/strong&gt;, sempre più &lt;strong&gt;digitalizzato&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;integrato&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;automatizzato&lt;/strong&gt;, basato sull&apos;&lt;strong&gt;Intelligenza Artificiale &lt;/strong&gt;e sui &lt;strong&gt;Big Data&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Starting date: Ottobre 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Tipologia di inserimento: Apprendistato &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Mappare i &lt;strong&gt;principali cicli aziendali &lt;/strong&gt;dei clienti attraverso colloqui con il personale amministrativo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Verificare l’adeguatezza dei controlli interni delle imprese &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Analizzare e verificare le diverse &lt;strong&gt;aree di bilancio&lt;/strong&gt; delle aziende clienti, predisposte in accordo ai principi contabili nazionali (OIC) o internazionali (IAS - IFRS) in base a quanto definito dai principi di revisione applicabili&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Applicare la metodologia di revisione aziendale con il supporto di &lt;strong&gt;tecnologie di analisi dati avanzate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolto/a in progetti che ti permetteranno di esplorare &lt;strong&gt;diverse realtà aziendali&lt;/strong&gt; (industriali o finanziarie) a 360°, intessere relazioni con i &lt;strong&gt;referenti delle società clienti&lt;/strong&gt; ed entrare a far parte di &lt;strong&gt;team strutturati&lt;/strong&gt; che ti supporteranno nella tua &lt;strong&gt;crescita professionale&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai o stai per conseguire una &lt;strong&gt;Laurea &lt;/strong&gt;in &lt;strong&gt;Economia/Finanza &lt;/strong&gt;(verrà data precedenza ai laureandi/e o laureati/e Magistrali)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai una buona conoscenza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai voglia di &lt;strong&gt;imparare&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;mettere in pratica&lt;/strong&gt; ciò che hai studiato&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Sei un &lt;strong&gt;team player&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai voglia di &lt;strong&gt;migliorare &lt;/strong&gt;le tue&lt;strong&gt; capacità relazionali &lt;/strong&gt;e&lt;strong&gt; comunicative.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;percorso che ti aiuterà a &lt;strong&gt;riconoscere&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;sviluppare&lt;/strong&gt; le &lt;strong&gt;competenze&lt;/strong&gt; ed aree di miglioramento&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e programmi di sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL di ingresso compresa tra € 25.500 e € 28.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni &lt;/strong&gt;che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG is where Auditors become AI enthusiasts &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In line with the values of integrity and quality, KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance offers an integrated and constantly evolving portfolio of services, providing insights that enable companies to meet the informational needs of the market and investors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;When you join the &lt;strong&gt;Audit Team&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;you will collaborate with leading national and international clients and contribute to the integrity and transparency of financial markets, ensuring the confidentiality essential to their proper functioning. Thanks to &lt;strong&gt;innovation&lt;/strong&gt;, you will create an audit that is compliant and attentive to &lt;strong&gt;ESG issues&lt;/strong&gt;, increasingly &lt;strong&gt;digitalized&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;integrated&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;automated&lt;/strong&gt;, based on &lt;strong&gt;Artificial Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Big Data&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Starting date: October 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Type of contract: Apprenticeship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Mapping of &lt;strong&gt;key business cycles&lt;/strong&gt; of clients through interviews with administrative staff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Assessing the adequacy of internal controls within companies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Analyzing and verifying various areas of &lt;strong&gt;client companies&apos; financial statements&lt;/strong&gt;, prepared in accordance with national accounting standards (OIC) or international standards (IAS - IFRS) as defined by applicable auditing principles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Implementing the audit methodology with the support of &lt;strong&gt;advanced data analysis technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You will be involved in projects that will allow you to explore &lt;strong&gt;various business environments&lt;/strong&gt; (industrial or financial) comprehensively, build relationships with &lt;strong&gt;client company representatives&lt;/strong&gt;, and become part of &lt;strong&gt;structured teams&lt;/strong&gt; that will support your &lt;strong&gt;professional growth&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You have or are about to obtain a &lt;strong&gt;degree&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Economics/Finance&lt;/strong&gt; (priority will be given to Master&apos;s degree students or graduates)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You are proficient in&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;eager to learn and apply&lt;/strong&gt; what you have studied&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You are a &lt;strong&gt;team player&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;keen to improve&lt;/strong&gt; your &lt;strong&gt;interpersonal and communication skills.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A path that will help you &lt;strong&gt;identify &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;develop&lt;/strong&gt; your &lt;strong&gt;skills &lt;/strong&gt;and areas for improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary ranging from €25,500 to €28,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification &lt;/strong&gt;requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;,relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;text-decoration:underline&quot; href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-TB1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Auditor/1329250057/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1329250057</guid><g:id>1329250057</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Audit</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Restructuring&amp;Turnaround Intern - Padova (Padova, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Restructuring&amp;amp;Turnaround Intern | Padua&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Restructuring services&lt;/strong&gt; team assists clients in debt and industrial restructuring with financial advisory and/or support services to help them prepare business plans that stabilise the business and usher in sustainable change. Our consultants are involved in debt restructuring, distressed M&amp;amp;As and lender advisory activities for multinationals, family-run enterprises, private equity funds and financial institutions. As a member of this team, known for the quality and scope of its projects, your talent will be put to full use, enabling you to work with leading Italian and international clients: in 2022, for the third time in four years, our team received the Finance Community Award for Italian “Restructuring Team of the Year” in recognition of its professional excellence and the type of projects implemented.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;We are recruiting recent and near graduates for our &lt;strong&gt;Padua &lt;/strong&gt;office who are ready to challenge themselves in a demanding and stimulating environment. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;analysing the financial performance of target companies to identify the actual financial situation of an enterprise;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;financial modelling and business planning;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;independent business reviews of business plans;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;commercial and operational Due Diligence;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;cost cutting analysis and organizational improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:11.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;specialist degree in business with a focus on finance/AFC and/or engineering management (for finance);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Paid internship opportunity offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;. As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-AV2&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Padova-Restructuring&amp;Turnaround-Intern-Padova/1356776157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1356776157</guid><g:id>1356776157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Deal Advisory</g:job_function><g:location>Padova, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant - Workday HCM (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare clienti, organizzazioni e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere sfide complesse e attuali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory supporta le imprese nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, oltre che nell’analisi e gestione dei rischi e nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del Team &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platform&lt;/strong&gt; sarai coinvolta/o in progetti di implementazione &lt;strong&gt;Workday HCM&lt;/strong&gt;. Insieme a colleghe e colleghi esperti contribuirai all’analisi dei requisiti e alla configurazione di soluzioni digitali a supporto dei processi HR.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Partecipare e fornire supporto in tutte le principali fasi progettuali quali &lt;strong&gt;analisi, configurazione&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;test&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;go-live&lt;/strong&gt; su progetti Workday HCM, con affiancamento dei referenti senior.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Partecipare a workshop con stakeholder &lt;strong&gt;HR/IT&lt;/strong&gt; e contribuire alla raccolta requisiti e alla creazione della &lt;strong&gt;documentazione funzionale &lt;/strong&gt;e, più in generale, dei principali deliverables di progetto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Interpretare i requisiti di processo raccolti nella fase di analisi e curare la relativa configurazione di Workday &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Collaborare con i team che si occupano dei temi più tenici quali, ad esempio, sviluppo di integrazioni verso sistemi terzi e attività di Data Migration, essendo in grado di capire i principali punti di contatto con i corrispettivi stream funzionali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Supportare le attività di &lt;strong&gt;SIT/UAT&lt;/strong&gt;, dalla predisposizione dei test case alla raccolta evidenze e gestione difetti, e contribuire a &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;knowledge transfer&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;hypercare&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su progetti nazionali e internazionali, lavorando a stretto contatto con clienti e team multidisciplinari, in particolare in contesti &lt;strong&gt;Consumer &amp;amp; Industrial&lt;/strong&gt;, ad esempio Retail, Food &amp;amp; Drink, Consumer Products, Industrial &amp;amp; Manufacturing e Automotive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai maturato esperienza su progetti di implementazione &lt;strong&gt;Workday HCM&lt;/strong&gt; in ruolo funzionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Conosci almeno &lt;strong&gt;1 modulo&lt;/strong&gt; tra &lt;strong&gt;Core HCM,&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Recruiting&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Talent &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/strong&gt;, Advanced &lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Learning, Adattive Planning&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Absence/Time Tracking&lt;/strong&gt;. Essere in possesso di una o più &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni Workday&lt;/strong&gt; è considerato un plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza nella raccolta dei requisiti di processo HR, &lt;strong&gt;configurazione&lt;/strong&gt;, creazione di &lt;strong&gt;documentazione&lt;/strong&gt; e supporto a &lt;strong&gt;SIT/UAT&lt;/strong&gt; con gestione difetti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai lavorato con stakeholder &lt;strong&gt;HR/IT&lt;/strong&gt; in contesti strutturati e sai organizzare attività e tracciamenti in modo ordinato.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona padronanza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt; e attitudine al lavoro in team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a trasferte in Italia e all’estero in base alle esigenze progettuali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;equo &lt;/strong&gt;e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;stimolante &lt;/strong&gt;e &lt;strong&gt;dinamico &lt;/strong&gt;che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt;, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;e &lt;strong&gt;sviluppo &lt;/strong&gt;avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Mindset &lt;strong&gt;internazionale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;e progettualità &lt;strong&gt;innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto dell’individualità, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità sono i Valori di KPMG, alla base di un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e conoscenza.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie al nostro impegno per un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il Network è conforme agli standard &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;. Nel nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; sono raccolte azioni concrete sui temi ambientali, sociali e di governance &lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 &lt;strong&gt;GDPR&lt;/strong&gt; e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l’informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, organizations, and colleagues tackle and solve complex, current challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory supports companies in transforming their business models, improving and digitalizing processes, as well as analyzing and managing risks and extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;By joining the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platform Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be involved in &lt;strong&gt;Workday HCM implementation projects&lt;/strong&gt;. Working alongside experienced colleagues, you will contribute to &lt;strong&gt;requirements analysis&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;configuration of digital solutions&lt;/strong&gt; supporting HR processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be responsible for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Participating in and supporting all key project phases, including &lt;strong&gt;analysis, configuration, testing, and go-live activities&lt;/strong&gt; on Workday HCM projects, under the guidance of senior team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Taking part in workshops with &lt;strong&gt;HR and IT stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;, contributing to &lt;strong&gt;requirements gathering&lt;/strong&gt; and the preparation of &lt;strong&gt;functional documentation&lt;/strong&gt; and key project deliverables.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Interpreting process requirements collected during the analysis phase and managing the related &lt;strong&gt;Workday configuration&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Collaborating with teams focused on more technical topics such as &lt;strong&gt;third-party system integrations&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Data Migration activities&lt;/strong&gt;, understanding the main touchpoints with the corresponding functional streams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Supporting &lt;strong&gt;SIT/UAT activities&lt;/strong&gt;, from test case preparation to evidence collection and defect management, while also contributing to &lt;strong&gt;training, knowledge transfer, and hypercare activities&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You will work on both &lt;strong&gt;national and international projects&lt;/strong&gt;, collaborating closely with clients and multidisciplinary teams, particularly within &lt;strong&gt;Consumer &amp;amp; Industrial sectors&lt;/strong&gt;, including &lt;strong&gt;Retail, Food &amp;amp; Beverage, Consumer Products, Industrial &amp;amp; Manufacturing, and Automotive&lt;/strong&gt; industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your skills and qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if you:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Have &lt;strong&gt;experience&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Workday HCM implementation projects&lt;/strong&gt; in a functional role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Have knowledge of at least one module among &lt;strong&gt;Core HCM, Recruiting, Talent &amp;amp; Performance, Advanced Compensation, Learning, Adaptive Planning, Absence/Time Tracking&lt;/strong&gt;. One or more &lt;strong&gt;Workday certifications&lt;/strong&gt; will be considered a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Have experience in &lt;strong&gt;HR process requirements gathering, configuration, documentation creation, and SIT/UAT support with defect management&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Have worked with &lt;strong&gt;HR and IT stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt; in structured environments and can organize activities and tracking efficiently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Possess a good command of the &lt;strong&gt;English language&lt;/strong&gt; and a strong &lt;strong&gt;teamwork attitude&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Are available for &lt;strong&gt;business travel in Italy and abroad&lt;/strong&gt;, depending on project needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What you will find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work environment&lt;/strong&gt; focused on valuing diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;dynamic environment&lt;/strong&gt; that encourages collaboration and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt; to support work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Structured &lt;strong&gt;training and development programs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and exposure to innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives dedicated to &lt;strong&gt;physical and mental wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate&apos;s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity are the core values of KPMG, fostering an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to an inclusive workplace, the Network complies with &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; standards. Our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; includes concrete actions focused on &lt;strong&gt;environmental, social, and ESG governance topics&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of &lt;strong&gt;EU Regulation No. 679/2016 (GDPR)&lt;/strong&gt; and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to the KPMG Privacy Policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-Consultant-Workday-HCM/1361403257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1361403257</guid><g:id>1361403257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Auditor Intern (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;h2&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG is where Auditors become AI enthusiasts&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Nel rispetto dei valori di integrità e qualità, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offre un portafoglio di servizi integrato in costante evoluzione, con insight che consentono alle aziende di rispondere ai fabbisogni informativi del mercato e degli investitori.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Audit&lt;/strong&gt;, collaborerai con clienti leader a livello nazionale e internazionale e potrai contribuire all’integrità e alla trasparenza dei mercati finanziari, garantendo la riservatezza fondamentale al loro corretto andamento. Grazie all’&lt;strong&gt;innovazione&lt;/strong&gt;, creerai un &lt;em&gt;audit&lt;/em&gt; conforme e attento ai &lt;strong&gt;temi ESG&lt;/strong&gt;, sempre più &lt;strong&gt;digitalizzato&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;integrato&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;automatizzato&lt;/strong&gt;, basato sull&apos;&lt;strong&gt;Intelligenza Artificiale &lt;/strong&gt;e sui &lt;strong&gt;Big Dati&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Starting date: Ottobre 2026&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Durata: 3-6 mesi&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello specifico, supporterai i colleghi del team in attività di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mappatura dei &lt;strong&gt;principali cicli&lt;/strong&gt; aziendali dei clienti attraverso colloqui con il personale amministrativo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verifica dell’adeguatezza dei &lt;strong&gt;controlli interni&lt;/strong&gt; delle imprese &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analisi e verifica delle diverse &lt;strong&gt;aree di bilancio&lt;/strong&gt; delle aziende clienti, predisposte in accordo ai principi contabili nazionali (OIC) o internazionali (IAS - IFRS) in base a quanto definito dai principi di revisione applicabili&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applicazione della metodologia di revisione aziendale con il supporto di &lt;strong&gt;tecnologie di analisi dati&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;avanzate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sarai coinvolto/a in progetti che ti permetteranno di esplorare &lt;strong&gt;diverse realtà aziendali&lt;/strong&gt; (industriali o finanziarie) a 360°, intessere relazioni con i &lt;strong&gt;referenti delle società clienti&lt;/strong&gt; ed entrare a far parte di &lt;strong&gt;team strutturati&lt;/strong&gt; che ti supporteranno nella tua &lt;strong&gt;crescita professionale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sei uno/a studente/studentessa universitario/a in &lt;strong&gt;Economia &lt;/strong&gt;(verrà data la precedenza agli studenti di Laurea Magistrale)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai una buona conoscenza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai voglia di &lt;strong&gt;imparare&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;mettere in pratica&lt;/strong&gt; ciò che hai studiato&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sei un &lt;strong&gt;team player&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai voglia di &lt;strong&gt;migliorare &lt;/strong&gt;le tue&lt;strong&gt; capacità relazionali e comunicative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un percorso che ti aiuterà a &lt;strong&gt;riconoscere&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;sviluppare&lt;/strong&gt; le &lt;strong&gt;competenze&lt;/strong&gt; ed aree di miglioramento&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e programmi di sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Una &lt;strong&gt;corsia preferenziale&lt;/strong&gt; per essere assunto in KPMG al termine dello stage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Opportunità di stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-GF1 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG is where Auditors become AI enthusiasts&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. In line with the values of integrity and quality, KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance offers an integrated and constantly evolving portfolio of services, providing insights that enable companies to meet the informational needs of the market and investors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join the &lt;strong&gt;Audit Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will collaborate with leading national and international clients and contribute to the integrity and transparency of financial markets, ensuring the confidentiality essential to their proper functioning. Thanks to &lt;strong&gt;innovation&lt;/strong&gt;, you will create an audit that is compliant and attentive to &lt;strong&gt;ESG issues&lt;/strong&gt;, increasingly &lt;strong&gt;digitalized&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;integrated&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;automated&lt;/strong&gt;, based on &lt;strong&gt;Artificial Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Big Data&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Starting date: October 2026&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Duration: 3-6 months&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mapping of &lt;strong&gt;key business cycles&lt;/strong&gt; of clients through interviews with administrative staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assessing the adequacy of internal controls within companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzing and verifying various areas of &lt;strong&gt;client companies&apos; financial statements&lt;/strong&gt;, prepared in accordance with national accounting standards (OIC) or international standards (IAS - IFRS) as defined by applicable auditing principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing the audit methodology with the support of &lt;strong&gt;advanced data analysis technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be involved in projects that will allow you to explore &lt;strong&gt;various business environments&lt;/strong&gt; (industrial or financial) comprehensively, build relationships with &lt;strong&gt;client company representatives&lt;/strong&gt;, and become part of &lt;strong&gt;structured teams&lt;/strong&gt; that will support your &lt;strong&gt;professional growth&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a University student in &lt;strong&gt;Economics&lt;/strong&gt; (priority will be given to Master&apos;s degree students)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;eager to learn and apply&lt;/strong&gt; what you have studied&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a &lt;strong&gt;team player&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;keen to improve&lt;/strong&gt; your &lt;strong&gt;interpersonal and communication skills.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A path that will help you &lt;strong&gt;identify &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;develop&lt;/strong&gt; your &lt;strong&gt;skills &lt;/strong&gt;and areas for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;fast track&lt;/strong&gt; to being hired by KPMG at the end of the internship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Paid internship opportunity offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-GF1&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Auditor-Intern/1329249557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1329249557</guid><g:id>1329249557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Audit</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant | Organizational &amp; Process Improvement (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Operations Team&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt;, you will also be part of the biggest revolution underway, rethinking the customer operating models. You will work on projects that combine &lt;strong&gt;organizational design&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;process optimization&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;digital transformation&lt;/strong&gt;, supporting leading companies in redefining their operating models and governance structures. Your role will be key in enabling clients to achieve efficiency, resilience, and innovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Mapping and re-engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; business processes, ensuring alignment with best practices and digital solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Organizational analysis and design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;, supporting the definition of structures, sizing, roles, and responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Project and Change Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;, assisting in planning, monitoring, and managing transformation programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Target Operating Model design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;, contributing to the development of future-state models that integrate processes, organization, and technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;master’s degree in Management Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, Economics, or related fields&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;analytical and organizational skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with attention to detail and the ability to prioritize multiple tasks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;MS Office&lt;/strong&gt; package&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of&lt;strong&gt; English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MC2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Junior-Consultant-Organizational-&amp;-Process-Improvement/1368643957/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368643957</guid><g:id>1368643957</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior - Digital and Computer Forensic (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Senior - Digital and Computer Forensic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;L&apos;opportunità di costruire un futuro migliore è proprio davanti a te&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Desideri svolgere un lavoro davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare clienti, società e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione del modello di business, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, entrando a far parte del Forensic Technology Team di Milano, aiuterai le aziende a prevenire, individuare e minimizzare i rischi economici, reputazionali e informatici derivanti da frodi, irregolarità, controversie commerciali e finanziarie e violazioni contrattuali. Acquisirai un vantaggio competitivo e contribuirai a offrire soluzioni integrate e approcci innovativi per la gestione strategica del rischio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Responsabilità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Guidare progetti complessi di e-discovery e indagini di digital forensics, inclusa la pianificazione, l&apos;esecuzione e la revisione qualitativa delle attività;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Utilizzare tecnologie digitali all&apos;avanguardia e le più rigorose metodologie forensi per analizzare dati e sviluppare soluzioni innovative;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Gestire la raccolta, la conservazione e l&apos;analisi delle prove digitali, garantendo la conformità agli standard forensi e ai requisiti normativi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Promuovere l&apos;utilizzo di analisi avanzate e tecnologie innovative per estrarre informazioni significative e supportare le strategie investigative;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Garantire l&apos;eccellenza nell&apos;erogazione dei servizi, il rispetto delle tempistiche e la qualità dei risultati su più incarichi contemporaneamente;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Collaborare con un team di professionisti altamente qualificati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Crescere professionalmente attraverso formazione continua e sviluppo di nuove competenze.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se possiedi:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Laurea in Informatica, Ingegneria Informatica o discipline affini;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Almeno 3-5 anni di esperienza nell&apos;ambito della digital forensics, e-discovery o forensic data analytics presso società di consulenza o contesti altamente specializzati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Solida conoscenza di strumenti, metodologie e best practice forensi per la gestione delle prove digitali;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente supportata da esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Eccellente padronanza del pacchetto Microsoft Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;• &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo ed equo, che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza la diversità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che favorisce creatività e lavoro di squadra.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Modalità di lavoro ibrida per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita professionale e privata.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Programmi avanzati di formazione e sviluppo professionale per mantenere competenze sempre aggiornate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Mentalità internazionale e partecipazione a progetti innovativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Iniziative dedicate al benessere fisico e mentale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG, che contribuiscono a creare un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e conoscenze, consentendo ai nostri professionisti di esprimere appieno il proprio potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A conferma del nostro impegno nella promozione di un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network è conforme ai requisiti della norma ISO 30415 sul Sistema di Gestione della Diversità e Inclusione e alla UNI/PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (Regolamento Generale sulla Protezione dei Dati – “GDPR”) e successive modifiche. Per maggiori informazioni, ti invitiamo a consultare l&apos;informativa privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. è un datore di lavoro che garantisce pari opportunità a tutti i candidati.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Senior - Digital and Computer Forensic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; offers consulting services to companies to support them in transforming their business model, improving and digitizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, and providing support in extraordinary finance operations.&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:yellow&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, by joining the Forensic Technology Team in Milan, you will help companies prevent, identify, and minimize economic, reputational, and IT risks deriving from fraud, irregularities, trade and financial disputes, and breach of contract. You will gain a competitive edge and offer integrated solutions and innovative approaches for strategic risk management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Responsibilities  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;working on complex e-discovery cases, digital evidence recovery, and forensic data analytics;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;using state-of-the-art digital technologies and the most rigorous forensic methodologies to analyze data and develop innovative solutions;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;working with a team of highly qualified professionals;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;growing professionally through continuous training and the development of new skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or related fields;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a solid understanding of digital technologies and forensic investigation processes, as well as the importance of forensic methodologies to ensure proper data handling and the validity of evidence;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;excellent command of the English language, preferably supported by study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;excellent proficiency in Microsoft Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive, fair work&lt;/strong&gt; environment that respects, encourages, and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity and teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Hybrid work mode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to stay up-to-date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; and innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;br&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are the &lt;strong&gt;Values of KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to &lt;strong&gt;express their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;. As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-FN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-Digital-and-Computer-Forensic/1363366757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1363366757</guid><g:id>1363366757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>IT Cloud Architect &amp; AI | Information Technology Services (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p class=&quot;MsoTitle&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Business Services &lt;/strong&gt;offre servizi interni all’organizzazione, supportando tutte le linee di servizio e coadiuvando i professionisti nella gestione delle attività quotidiane.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team IT Interno come&lt;strong&gt; Cloud &amp;amp; AI Architect &lt;/strong&gt;di Milano sarai responsabile di fornire i più alti standard di assistenza diretta e di supporto alla Leadership e ai componenti del Management Group. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Supportare il disegno e la revisione di architetture cloud e AI su Azure (inclusi casi generativi e RAG) sicure, scalabili e sostenibili, collaborando con team di sviluppo e architetti senior. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Collaborare al disegno e alla revisione di architetture cloud su Azure e soluzioni AI, contribuendo alle specifiche tecniche e funzionali insieme a figure senior.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Supportare la definizione di ambienti Azure in coordinamento con i team di security e infrastruttura.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Valutare tecnologie AI, sia infrastrutturali che destinate ad utenti finali (es. Azure OpenAI, Azure ML, Azure AI Search, Azure AI Studio, Copilot M365) evidenziando principali trade‑off e rischi e preparando semplici demo o reference pattern.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribuire alla progettazione di pattern AI/GenAI (RAG di base, prompt engineering, guardrail, content safety) e integrazione di LLM via API.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Guidare l’adozione di AI per lo sviluppo software (es. GitHub Copilot, Azure AI Studio/Prompt Flow) tramite linee guida, esempi e coaching ai team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Partecipare a PoC e assessment architetturali; contribuire a decision log/ADR, roadmap e piani di migrazione/modernizzazione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Collaborare con team cross‑funzionali e comunicare chiaramente a stakeholder tecnici e business; facilitare workshop e allineamenti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Documentare e presentare soluzioni e supportare il passaggio a operation e il post‑go‑live.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Apprendere e applicare best practice Azure Well‑Architected/CAF, favorendo standardizzazione di blueprint e reference architecture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai buone competenze di programmazione per leggere/valutare codice, partecipare a revisioni tecniche e prototipare in piccolo- non è richiesta l’implementazione di feature in produzione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una laurea in Informatica/Ingegneria o equivalente.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai un’esperienza di 1–3 anni complessivi in ambito IT (o progetti pratici/tirocini significativi) con esposizione a sistemi cloud ed AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai solida base di programmazione (C#, Java, Python o JavaScript/TypeScript) per leggere/valutare codice, partecipare a code review e prototipare; non è richiesto lo sviluppo di feature in produzione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai passione per l’AI e le sue applicazioni nel software; utilizzo pratico di strumenti AI per lo sviluppo (es. GitHub Copilot).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai conoscenza di base di Azure: principi dei principali servizi (compute PaaS/serverless, storage, database), identity &amp;amp; access management e networking (VNet, Private Endpoints).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una buona conoscenza della lingua inglese. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio III° livello; la retribuzione sarà definita e commisurata in relazione a criteri oggettivi quali competenze, esperienza effettiva maturata e aderenza ai requisiti richiesti per la posizione. In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:8.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Business services srl garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues address and solve today’s most relevant and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Business Services provides internal services to the organization, supporting all service lines and assisting professionals in managing their daily activities. In particular, by joining the Cloud &amp;amp; AI Architect Team in Milan, you will be responsible for delivering the highest standards of direct assistance and support to Leadership and members of the Management Group.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Support the design and review of secure, scalable, and sustainable cloud and AI architectures on Azure (including generative use cases and RAG), collaborating with development teams and senior architects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribute to the design and review of Azure cloud architectures and AI solutions, supporting technical and functional specifications alongside senior professionals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Support the definition of Azure environments in coordination with security and infrastructure teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Evaluate AI technologies, both infrastructure-based and end-user oriented (e.g., Azure OpenAI, Azure ML, Azure AI Search, Azure AI Studio, Copilot M365), highlighting key trade-offs and risks, and preparing simple demos or reference patterns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribute to the design of AI/GenAI patterns (basic RAG, prompt engineering, guardrails, content safety) and integration of LLMs via API.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Drive AI adoption in software development (e.g., GitHub Copilot, Azure AI Studio/Prompt Flow) through guidelines, examples, and team coaching.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Participate in PoCs and architectural assessments; contribute to decision logs/ADRs, roadmaps, and migration/modernization plans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams and communicate clearly with both technical and business stakeholders; facilitate workshops and alignment meetings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Document and present solutions and support the transition to operations and post go-live phases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Learn and apply Azure Well-Architected Framework/CAF best practices, promoting the standardization of blueprints and reference architectures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;You have solid programming skills to read/evaluate code, participate in technical reviews, and build small prototypes – implementation of production features is not required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;You hold a degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or an equivalent field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;You have 1–3 years of overall experience in IT (or significant hands-on projects/internships) with exposure to cloud systems and AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a strong programming foundation (C#, Java, Python, or JavaScript/TypeScript) to read/evaluate code, participate in code reviews, and prototype; production feature development is not required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a passion for AI and its applications in software development, with practical use of AI development tools (e.g., GitHub Copilot).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a basic knowledge of Azure, including principles of key services (PaaS/serverless compute, storage, databases), identity &amp;amp; access management, and networking (VNet, Private Endpoints).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good command of the English language.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;An inclusive and fair workplace that respects, encourages, and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that fosters creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid working arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay up to date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, level III°. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills, relevant experience and fulfilment of the requirements of the position. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity: these are KPMG’s Values, creating an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to fully express their potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. &lt;/span&gt;Within our Impact Plan (bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG), you can find a summary of all the concrete actions we are carrying out on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18.0pt&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – “GDPR”) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please consult KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Business Services S.r.l. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-AM1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-IT-Cloud-Architect-&amp;-AI-Information-Technology-Services/1355599457/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1355599457</guid><g:id>1355599457</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Information Technology Services</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Microsoft F&amp;O Developer (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div id=&quot;tor__flistingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__flistingLayout_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Enterprise Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, all&apos;interno della practice Microsoft sarai coinvolta/o in progetti di Digital Transformation per clienti enterprise, occupandoti dello sviluppo e dell&apos;implementazione della piattaforma &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Dynamics 365 Finance &amp;amp; Operations (F&amp;amp;O)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supportare lo sviluppo di &lt;strong&gt;customizzazioni&lt;/strong&gt; su Dynamics 365 F&amp;amp;O tramite il linguaggio &lt;strong&gt;X++&lt;/strong&gt; e Visual Studio, apprendendo le logiche dell&apos;&lt;strong&gt;Extension Framework&lt;/strong&gt;, lo strumento che permette di estendere le funzionalità standard senza modificarne il codice sorgente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribuire alla realizzazione di &lt;strong&gt;integrazioni con sistemi esterni&lt;/strong&gt; attraverso REST API, OData e Data Entities, i meccanismi con cui Dynamics 365 F&amp;amp;O scambia dati con altri applicativi aziendali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Partecipare allo sviluppo di componenti applicativi come &lt;strong&gt;report SSRS&lt;/strong&gt; , &lt;strong&gt;batch job &lt;/strong&gt;e &lt;strong&gt;workflow&lt;/strong&gt; di approvazione, imparando a tradurre requisiti funzionali in soluzioni tecniche&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Affiancare il team nelle attività di &lt;strong&gt;debugging, testing e code review&lt;/strong&gt;, contribuendo a individuare e risolvere anomalie nel codice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Acquisire familiarità con gli &lt;strong&gt;strumenti DevOps e di deployment&lt;/strong&gt; specifici dell&apos;ecosistema Microsoft, tra cui Azure DevOps e Lifecycle Services (LCS), la piattaforma con cui si gestiscono gli ambienti e i rilasci di Dynamics 365&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Collaborare con consulenti funzionali e stakeholder di business nelle fasi progettuali, incluse le fasi di &lt;strong&gt;go-live&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;hypercare&lt;/strong&gt; (supporto intensivo nel periodo immediatamente successivo)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei un/a neolaureato/a o laureando/a in Informatica, Ingegneria Informatica, Ingegneria del Software o discipline affini&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una &lt;strong&gt;buona conoscenza di linguaggi orientati agli oggetti&lt;/strong&gt; (come C#, Java o simili) e ti senti a tuo agio con la logica di sviluppo enterprise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai &lt;strong&gt;curiosità per i sistemi ERP&lt;/strong&gt; e per la digitalizzazione dei processi aziendali: non è richiesta esperienza pregressa su Dynamics 365 F&amp;amp;O, che potrai apprendere on the job con il supporto del team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai buone capacità comunicative e una conoscenza dell&apos;inglese adeguata a lavorare in contesti internazionali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona padronanza della lingua inglese e attitudine al lavoro in team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a trasferte in Italia e all&apos;estero in base alle esigenze progettuali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibrida, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di formazione e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul benessere psicofisico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;L&apos;opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all&apos;impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l&apos;Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro Impact Plan trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (GDPR) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues face and solve some of the most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to businesses, supporting them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitalisation, risk analysis and management, as well as extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;By joining the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platform Team&lt;/strong&gt;, within the Microsoft practice you will be involved in Digital Transformation projects for enterprise clients, working on the development and implementation of the &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Dynamics 365 Finance &amp;amp; Operations (F&amp;amp;O)&lt;/strong&gt; platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Support the development of &lt;strong&gt;customisations&lt;/strong&gt; on Dynamics 365 F&amp;amp;O using the &lt;strong&gt;X++&lt;/strong&gt; language (the platform&apos;s proprietary programming language) and Visual Studio, learning the logic of the &lt;strong&gt;Extension Framework&lt;/strong&gt;, the tool that allows standard functionality to be extended without modifying the source code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribute to the implementation of &lt;strong&gt;integrations with external systems&lt;/strong&gt; via REST API, OData and Data Entities, the mechanisms through which Dynamics 365 F&amp;amp;O exchanges data with other business applications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Take part in the development of application components such as &lt;strong&gt;SSRS reports&lt;/strong&gt; (Dynamics&apos; built-in reporting tool), &lt;strong&gt;batch jobs&lt;/strong&gt; (scheduled automated processes) and approval &lt;strong&gt;workflows&lt;/strong&gt;, learning to translate functional requirements into technical solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Support the team in &lt;strong&gt;debugging, testing and code review&lt;/strong&gt; activities, helping to identify and resolve anomalies in the code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Gain familiarity with the &lt;strong&gt;DevOps and deployment tools&lt;/strong&gt; specific to the Microsoft ecosystem, including Azure DevOps and Lifecycle Services (LCS), the platform used to manage Dynamics 365 environments and releases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Collaborate with functional consultants and business stakeholders during project phases, including &lt;strong&gt;go-live&lt;/strong&gt; (activation of the solution) and &lt;strong&gt;hypercare&lt;/strong&gt; (intensive support in the period immediately following go-live)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You hold or are completing a degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Software Engineering or related disciplines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a &lt;strong&gt;good knowledge of object-oriented programming languages&lt;/strong&gt; (such as C#, Java or similar) and feel comfortable with enterprise development logic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;curious about ERP systems&lt;/strong&gt; and the digitalisation of business processes: no prior experience with Dynamics 365 F&amp;amp;O is required, as you will learn on the job with the support of the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have strong communication skills and a working knowledge of English suitable for international work environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good command of English and a team-oriented attitude&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are available for business travel in Italy and abroad based on project needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us – What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An inclusive, fair working environment that respects, encourages and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that fosters creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid working arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programmes to keep your skills up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate&apos;s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In compliance with applicable law, we do not collect or use information about salaries received in current or previous employment relationships. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Our Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, community commitment, integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s Values, which create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Through our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network is compliant with the ISO 30415 standard on Diversity and Inclusion Management Systems, and UNI PdR 125 on gender equality. Within our Impact Plan you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of EU Regulation No. 679/2016 (GDPR) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Microsoft-F&amp;O-Developer/1365974057/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365974057</guid><g:id>1365974057</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Experience &amp; Strategy Design Senior Consultant - Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UX/UI Senior Consultant – Milano&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All&apos;interno del gruppo &lt;strong&gt;Experience Strategy &amp;amp; Design&lt;/strong&gt; parteciperai a progetti relativi alla progettazione e sviluppo di &lt;strong&gt;Customer Experiences&lt;/strong&gt; innovative, con realizzazione di nuovi servizi ed ecosistemi. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nell’ambito di tali progetti, sarai coinvolto nelle seguenti attività: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;User Research: sviluppo di benchmark, test di usabilità, analisi euristiche e interviste agli utenti, analisi behaviourals;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Analisi e comprensione dei requisiti ed obiettivi di business per guidare la definizione degli user requirement, user stories; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Progettazione architettura informativa, user flow, wireframe e prototipi interattivi; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Organizzazione di workshop a supporto delle attività di co-design con gli utenti finali;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Definizione UI KIT, Design System e aspetti Visual dell’esperienza digitale.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Per essere il candidato ideale non ti possono mancare: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Background accademico in human-computer interaction, experience design o campi analoghi; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Almeno 3 anni di esperienza come UX Designer&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;e Interaction Designer in contesti strutturati, quali società di consulenza, agenzie e/o clienti finali; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Solida esperienza nei processi e metodologie User Centered Design; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Esperienza in progettazione su diverse piattaforme e app mobile &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Solide competenze di user research, content strategy, information architecture UX, ID, prototipazione, UX copy, responsive design, user testing, &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;analisi funzionale&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ottima conoscenza di strumenti di wireframing e prototipazione &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;(es. Figma) e tool di visual collaboration (es, Mural...);  &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Conoscenza ed esperienza in metodologie di lavoro Agile; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Buona&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; conoscenza della lingua inglese&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Office, con particolare riferimento a Word, Excel e Powerpoint; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Gradita la conoscenza delle linee guida di design per l’accessibilità; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Gradita la condivisione del portfolio. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Completano il profilo spiccate abilità di lavorare per obiettivi e forte attitudine al problem solving, ottime doti comunicative e relazionali, focus sul cliente, entusiasmo ed elevata motivazione alla crescita professionale, naturale propensione al lavoro in team e disponibilità a frequenti viaggi e trasferte. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I dati richiesti verranno trattati nell’assoluto rispetto delle disposizioni contenute nel Regolamento Europeo 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR” o “Normativa Privacy”) e sue successive modificazioni ed integrazioni. Per maggiori informazioni fare riferimento alla Privacy Policy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Seni&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;or UX/UI Consultant – Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As part of the &lt;strong&gt;Experience Strategy &amp;amp; Design&lt;/strong&gt; team, you will contribute to projects focused on the design and development of innovative &lt;strong&gt;Customer Experiences&lt;/strong&gt;, creating new services and digital ecosystems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Within these projects, you will be involved in the following activities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conducting &lt;strong&gt;User Research&lt;/strong&gt;, including benchmarking, usability testing, heuristic evaluations, user interviews, and behavioral analysis;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analyzing and understanding business requirements and objectives to support the definition of user requirements and user stories;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Designing information architecture, user flows, wireframes, and interactive prototypes;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Planning and facilitating workshops to support co-design activities with end users;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Defining UI Kits, Design Systems, and the visual aspects of digital experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;What We&apos;re Looking For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;To be successful in this role, you should have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An academic background in &lt;strong&gt;Human-Computer Interaction (HCI), Experience Design&lt;/strong&gt;, or a related field;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;At least &lt;strong&gt;3 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; as a UX Designer and Interaction Designer in structured environments such as consulting firms, agencies, and/or end-client organizations;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;User-Centered Design (UCD)&lt;/strong&gt; processes and methodologies;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Experience designing for multiple platforms, including mobile applications;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Solid expertise in user research, content strategy, information architecture, UX and interaction design, prototyping, UX writing, responsive design, user testing, and functional analysis;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of wireframing and prototyping tools (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;Figma&lt;/strong&gt;) and visual collaboration platforms (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;Mural&lt;/strong&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Experience working within &lt;strong&gt;Agile&lt;/strong&gt; methodologies and frameworks;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Good command of the &lt;strong&gt;English language&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency in Microsoft Office, particularly &lt;strong&gt;Word, Excel, and PowerPoint&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of accessibility design guidelines is considered a plus;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Portfolio submission is highly appreciated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Personal Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate demonstrates:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A strong results-oriented mindset and problem-solving attitude;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A customer-centric approach;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Enthusiasm and a strong motivation for professional growth;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A natural inclination toward teamwork and collaboration;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel frequently for business purposes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a  gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. Please see KPMG’s privacy policy for further information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-SD1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Experience-&amp;-Strategy-Design-Senior-Consultant-Milano/1365994257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365994257</guid><g:id>1365994257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Internship - Credit Risk | Milan (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Internship – Credit Risk | Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;When you join &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;the Financial Risk team in Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;, &lt;/em&gt;you are going to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;work on &lt;strong&gt;Credit Risk &lt;/strong&gt;projects, for top-tier clients in the Financial Services sector. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;analysis of national and international practice and know-how of the KPMG framework on Risk Management issues, specifically: Risk Strategy, Risk Governance, Model Risk Management, Credit Processes and Risk monitoring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;analysis and interpretation of relevant regulations (prudential supervisory provisions, European Banking Authority guidelines, European Central Bank, Basel Commettee, etc.) with reference to aspects relevant to credit risk management and the impact of climate and environmental risk issues on this profile&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;design and formalization of the Target Operating Model, framework, policies, processes, methodologies related to the Risk Management area&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;support in activities dedicated to monitoring and control processes (e.g., Level II controls, reporting, performance monitoring of risk metrics, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 17.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;a specialist degree (graduate or nearing completion) in finance or any other business faculty;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;have excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;have an excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;knowledge of programming software and languages (Python, SAS, R, Matlab and Stata).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Paid internship opportunity offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:windowtext&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-FN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Internship-Credit-Risk-Milan/1366577457/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366577457</guid><g:id>1366577457</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>SAP Security &amp; GRC Senior Consultant (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del Team Cyber &amp;amp; Tech Risk lavorerai con i nostri esperti di governance delle informazioni, che hanno un focus sull’innovazione e un approccio basato sul rischio, con un’esperienza funzionale in specifici settori aziendali.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti unirai al team di Milano e ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analizzare e identificare i rischi SoD a livello su Ruoli e Utenti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Svolgere attività di remediation riguardante le violazioni SoD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Definire e rivedere le matrici SoD secondo le necessità del cliente&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Svolgere attività di troubleshooting e bug fixing relativamente ad autorizzazioni, ruoli e profili SAP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Configurare modulo EAM (Emergency Access Management): FireFighter concept&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; Sarai coinvolto in progetti sia nazionali che internazionali, collaborando con professionisti altamente qualificati, e lavorerai a stretto contatto con i nostri clienti del settore Financial Services, tra cui banche, assicurazioni e società di investimento, contribuendo alla gestione di rischi IT, governance, audit, privacy e sicurezza informatica.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;  Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi almeno 3&lt;strong&gt;-6 anni&lt;/strong&gt; di esperienza nella gestione di autorizzazioni, profili, ruoli e utenze SAP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi un’esperienza progettuale in &lt;strong&gt;SAP Security&lt;/strong&gt;: raccolta dei requisiti, disegno, realizzazione tecnica ed implementazione del modello autorizzativo all’interno di un’organizzazione secondo i principi di &lt;strong&gt;Segregation Of Duty&lt;/strong&gt; (SoD)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi una laurea in discipline tecnico-scientifiche.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi una conoscenza delle regole e dei principi di Segregation of Duties (SoD)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai ottima conoscenza di &lt;strong&gt;SAP GRC Access Control&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ha maturato un’esperienza nella gestione delle autorizzazioni su SAP S/4HANA e SAP Fiori&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hai maturato un’esperienza su General IT controls (GITC) e su controlli applicativi (ITAC) in ambiente SAP maturata in attività di audit IT su sistemi SAP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi una conoscenza dei principali strumenti informatici e del pacchetto Office (MS Excel, MS PowerPoint, MS Word)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi una conoscenza fluente della lingua inglese&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Possiedi esperienza nell’implementazione della suite SAP GRC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 38.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 48.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conferme agli standard dei requisiti&lt;strong&gt; ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Are you looking for a job that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory provides consulting services to companies to support them in transforming their business models, improving and digitalizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, as well as assisting with extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;By joining the Cyber &amp;amp; Tech Risk Team, you will work alongside our information governance experts, who focus on innovation and adopt a risk-based approach, with functional experience in specific business sectors.&lt;br&gt;Specifically, you will join the team in Milan and your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analyzing and identifying SoD (Segregation of Duties) risks at Role and User levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Carrying out remediation activities regarding SoD violations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Defining and reviewing SoD matrices based on client needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conducting troubleshooting and bug fixing related to SAP authorizations, roles, and profiles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Configuring the EAM (Emergency Access Management) module: FireFighter concept&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will be involved in both national and international projects, collaborating with highly qualified professionals, and working closely with our clients in the Financial Services sector, including banks, insurance companies, and investment firms, contributing to the management of IT risks, governance, audit, privacy, and cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Qualifications&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have at least 3-6 years of experience managing SAP authorizations, profiles, roles, and users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have project experience in SAP Security: requirements gathering, design, technical implementation, and deployment of authorization models within an organization according to Segregation of Duties (SoD) principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You hold a degree in technical-scientific disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have a solid understanding of Segregation of Duties (SoD) rules and principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You possess excellent knowledge of SAP GRC Access Control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have experience managing authorizations in SAP S/4HANA and SAP Fiori&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have experience in General IT controls (GITC) and IT Application Controls (ITAC) in SAP environments, gained through IT audit activities on SAP systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have proficiency in key IT tools and MS Office (MS Excel, MS PowerPoint, MS Word)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have fluent English language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have experience implementing the SAP GRC suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us – What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic setting that fosters creativity and teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A hybrid working model to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to keep you up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a  gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €38,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €48,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s values that create an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to realize their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thanks to our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our network complies with the standards of the ISO 30415 certification, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125 certification, relating to gender equality. Our concrete actions on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues are summarized in our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. ensures equal opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0px&quot;&gt;#LI-AA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-SAP-Security-&amp;-GRC-Senior-Consultant/777593102/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">777593102</guid><g:id>777593102</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Financial Energy - Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Junior – Financial Energy| Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;When you join &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;the Financial Energy team in Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;, &lt;/em&gt;you are going to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;work on &lt;strong&gt;Financial Energy projects &lt;/strong&gt;for top-tier clients in the energy &amp;amp; utilities sector. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;drafting of market and regulatory analysis of energy markets;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;supporting clients in defining business strategy: identification of industry macro-trends at both market and technology levels, analysis of the company&apos;s strengths and weaknesses, and defining strategic directions;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;business Planning: preparation of financial and cash flow statements, Sensitivity analysis and risk assessment, review of market scenarios within Business Plans;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;assistance to clients in decarbonization projects: from strategy definition to implementation (e.g., technology scouting, definition of Energy Procurement strategy, consulting within the framework of Corporate PPA underwriting).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;master&apos;s degree (obtained or in the process of being obtained) in Economics and Finance or Energy or Management Engineering during which you have had the opportunity to study Risk Management and energy world issues in depth;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of the English language, preferably backed up by study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of the Office package;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;knowledge of software and programming languages is considered a plus for candidates interested in more quantitative opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#4472c4&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:windowtext&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-FN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Financial-Energy-Milano/1365965257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365965257</guid><g:id>1365965257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Consultant - Tech Risk | Torino (Torino, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Nel rispetto dei valori di integrità e qualità,&lt;strong&gt; KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance &lt;/strong&gt;offre un portafoglio di servizi integrato in costante evoluzione, con insight che consentono alle aziende di rispondere ai fabbisogni informativi del mercato e degli investitori. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk&lt;/strong&gt;, linea di servizi di KPMG che ha anticipato e seguito nel tempo le richieste del mercato relative alle tematiche di Information Risk Management e Sicurezza Informatica, sviluppando costantemente le competenze e capacità di analisi a protezione del patrimonio informativo aziendale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Comprendere il contesto tecnologico e di business dei clienti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Mappare i processi business ed IT, identificandone i rischi e definendo il giusto approccio per mitigarli &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Analizzare le nuove tecnologie e capirne i rischi specifici&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Identificare i dati chiave e definire i controlli per renderli affidabili e sicuri&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;I professionisti appartenenti al team CTR di KPMG supportano le organizzazioni in tutte le fasi necessarie a garantire la sicurezza delle loro informazioni e delle loro strategie di business. Possiamo affiancare i nostri clienti per migliorare la crescita e creare valore. Possiamo aiutarli a fare i giusti investimenti nel momento giusto, a considerare le implicazioni più ampie della digital disruption, ad integrare tecnologie innovative nelle infrastrutture esistenti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei un laureando/neolaureato magistrale in Ingegneria Gestionale, Management dell’innovazione, Management ecc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Passione per le nuove tecnologie e la loro declinazione nei contesti aziendali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Competenze nella comprensione e analisi dei processi aziendali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Capacità di analisi dei dati e di sintesi nella presentazione dei risultati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Interesse per l&apos;ambito dei Sistemi Informativi aziendali, intesi quale strumento abilitante per l&apos;efficace erogazione dei processi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Predisposizione per la risoluzione di problemi complessi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Proattività, flessibilità e capacità di adattamento a contesti eterogenei e sfidanti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una buona padronanza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a viaggiare sul territorio nazionale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; internazionale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ / L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso compresa tra € 28.000 e € 31.500, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:windowtext&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. In keeping with the values of integrity and quality&lt;strong&gt;, KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offers an integrated and constantly evolving portfolio of services, with insights that allow companies to respond to the informational/reporting needs of the market and investors. The &lt;strong&gt;Cyber&amp;amp;Tech Risk&lt;/strong&gt; team handles the KPMG line of services that pre-empted and continues to meet market demand for information risk management and cybersecurity services, continually developing the analytical skills and expertise to protect company information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;understanding clients’ technological and business context;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;mapping business and IT processes, identifying their risks and developing the right approach to mitigate them; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;analysing new technologies and understanding their specific risks;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;identifying key data and defining controls to guarantee they are reliable and secure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;The members of KPMG’s CTR team support organisations across all phases of the process to ensure the security of their information and business strategies. We help our clients drive growth and generate value.  We can help them make the right investments at the right time, consider the broader implications of the digital disruption and build breakthrough innovations into their legacy infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;or will soon have a master’s degree in management engineering, innovation management, management, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;a passion for new technologies and their application in corporate settings;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;expertise in understanding and analysing company processes;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;an ability to analyse and summarise data when reporting findings;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;an interest in corporate IT systems as enablers for the effective performance of processes; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;an aptitude for complex problem solving;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;proactiveness, flexibility and an ability to adapt to different challenging situations;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of English, preferably with study/work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;background-color:white;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;text-indent:4.7333px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;availability to travel within Italy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;A challenging and &lt;strong&gt;dynamic environment&lt;/strong&gt; that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay up-to-date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; and innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:150%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship with a monthly allowance of €800 / This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary  ranging from €28,000 to €31,500. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the KPMG values that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can achieve their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality Within our Impact Plan - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;color:windowtext&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Torino-Consultant-Tech-Risk-Torino/1366117957/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366117957</guid><g:id>1366117957</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Torino, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Office Assistant | Torino (Torino, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div id=&quot;tor__flistingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__flistingLayout_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nel rispetto dei valori di integrità e qualità, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offre un portafoglio di servizi integrato in costante evoluzione, con insight che consentono alle aziende di rispondere ai fabbisogni informativi del mercato e degli investitori. In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team &lt;strong&gt;Office assistant &lt;/strong&gt;di Torino&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;sarai responsabile di fornire i più alti standard di assistenza diretta e di supporto alla Leadership e ai componenti del Management Group. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Corrispondenza telefonica e via mail;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Gestione agenda e interfaccia costante con tutti i livelli organizzativi;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Gestione rapporti istituzionali esterni;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Redazione di documenti, presentazioni, reportistica con archiviazione dei documenti interni;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Attività amministrative e di compliance legate alla contrattualistica;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Organizzazione e programmazione di meeting con clienti e interni;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Organizzazione viaggi;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Gestione del processo di controllo qualità, in conformità con le linee guida stabilite da KPMG;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o sui servizi interni all’organizzazione, supportando tutte le linee di servizio e coadiuvando i professionisti nella gestione delleattività quotidiane.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As Are - &lt;strong&gt;Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hai un&apos;ottima conoscenza del&lt;strong&gt; pacchetto Office&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hai Ottime doti comunicative (scritte e orali) ed una buona padronanza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - &lt;strong&gt;Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio IV° livello; la retribuzione sarà definita e commisurata in relazione a criteri oggettivi quali competenze, esperienza effettiva maturata e aderenza ai requisiti richiesti per la posizione. In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – &lt;strong&gt;I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;KPMG SpA garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to do truly meaningful and impactful work? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In line with the values of integrity and quality, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offers an integrated and constantly evolving portfolio of services, providing insights that enable companies to meet the informational needs of the market and investors. Specifically, by joining the Office Assistant Team in Torino, you will be responsible for providing the highest standards of direct assistance and support to the Leadership and Management Group members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More specifically, you will be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Telephone and email correspondence;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Agenda management and constant interaction with all organizational levels;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Managing external institutional relationships;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Drafting documents, presentations, reports, and archiving internal documents;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Administrative and compliance activities related to contracts;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Organizing and scheduling meetings with clients and internal staff;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Organizing travel arrangements;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Managing the quality control process in accordance with KPMG’s established guidelines.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be involved in the organization’s internal services, supporting all service lines and assisting professionals in managing daily activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You have excellent knowledge of the Office suite;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You have excellent communication skills (both written and verbal) and a good command of the English language, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad (B2/C1).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Future With Us – What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An inclusive, fair working environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that promotes creativity and teamwork;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A hybrid working model to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced training and development programs to keep you up to date;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, level IV. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills, relevant experience and fulfilment of the requirements of the position. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community commitment, and integrity: these are the Values of KPMG that foster an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks to our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network has obtained ISO 30415 certifications, which confirm the compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125, which certifies gender equality. In our Impact Plan – &lt;a href=&quot;https://performancemanager5.successfactors.eu/bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&quot;&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/a&gt; – you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – &quot;GDPR&quot;) and its amendments. For more information, please consult KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;KPMG SpA guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AM1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;height:36.0px&quot;&gt; &lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Torino-Office-Assistant-Torino/1359366257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1359366257</guid><g:id>1359366257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Infrastructure</g:job_function><g:location>Torino, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant People &amp; Change | Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join the &lt;strong&gt;People &amp;amp; Change&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will also join our rapidly-growing team of young talent, who stand out for the quality and impact of their innovative projects on people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will be involved in key transformation projects for large Italian and international clients, liaising directly with senior management of companies at the top of their sector.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;designing solutions and models to improve the &lt;strong&gt;employee experience&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;organisational redesign of operating models for the &lt;strong&gt;HR function&lt;/strong&gt;, with the aim of improving HR services and employee satisfaction;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;redefining &lt;strong&gt;talent management, performance management and learning and development&lt;/strong&gt; models;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;leading &lt;strong&gt;organisational re-design and process re-engineering&lt;/strong&gt; projects through change management initiatives, providing tools for implementing changes so that they become an integral part of the transformation (organisational assessments, skills mapping, impact analysis, mitigation actions, definition and implementation of internal and external communication strategies);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;assessing the impacts and expected benefits of the implemented initiatives, monitoring pre- and post-transformation performances and implementing plans to fill in any gaps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a master’s degree in management and production engineering or business administration;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2 to 4 years of experience in People &amp;amp; Change projects&lt;/strong&gt;, preferable while working in a consulting firm;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;leadership abilities in coordinating teams and in client management;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;an excellent knowledge of English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with study and/or work experience abroad.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.  Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-LZ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-Consultant-People-&amp;-Change-Milano/822450202/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">822450202</guid><g:id>822450202</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant IT Strategy | CIO Advisory 1 (Torino, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Gli esperti di &lt;strong&gt;Nolan Norton&lt;/strong&gt;, società di IT Strategy del Network KPMG, aiutano le organizzazioni ad affrontare le sfide di trasformazione digitale e ad implementare architetture IT. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del Team CIO Advisory di Torino, esperto di architetture e soluzioni di data management che supporta i CIO nell&apos;evoluzione digitale del loro percorso, nel loro journey verso il cloud, dalla strategia all&apos;esecuzione e dalla visione al valore reale. Entrerai a far parte di un ambiente dinamico e stimolante, per clienti di alto livello altamente visibili nei mercati dei servizi finanziari, dell&apos;energia, del settore pubblico e dei consumatori e industriali.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di su tecnologie innovative su progetti sfidanti ed entusiasmanti, supportando i nostri clienti principalmente sulle seguenti tematiche:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: aiutiamo i nostri clienti a sviluppare strategie tecnologiche e modelli operativi tecnologici innovativi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: consentiamo ai clienti di utilizzare soluzioni all&apos;avanguardia per applicazioni, infrastrutture e TLC;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management&lt;/strong&gt;: aiutiamo i nostri clienti nell’identificazione delle migliori soluzioni di gestione del dato e progettazione di architetture di Data Management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;: assistiamo i nostri clienti a identificare, definire le priorità, progettare e indirizzare meglio gli investimenti tecnologici;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: gestiamo la governance e svolgiamo attività di supporto tecnico durante la selezione delle varie opzioni e dei fornitori nell&apos;intero ciclo dei servizi ICT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance and Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: ci occupiamo della corretta struttura e dimensionamento delle risorse ICT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost right-sizing&lt;/strong&gt;: valutiamo e suggeriamo opzioni per indirizzare meglio la spesa e le risorse ICT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Laurea Magistrale in Ingegneria Gestionale,Informatica, Elettronica, delle Telecomunicazioni, Fisica, Matematica;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza della lingua inglese, idealmente approfondita attraverso un&apos;esperienza formativa/lavorativa all&apos;estero.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Opportunità di stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1000€ per stage extracurriculare &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nolan Norton Spa garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. Experts from Nolan Norton, an IT Strategy company within the KPMG Network, help organizations face digital transformation challenges and implement IT architectures. Specifically, you will join the CIO Advisory Team, experts in data management architectures and solutions that support CIOs in their digital evolution journey, from strategy to execution and from vision to real value. You will be part of a dynamic and stimulating environment, working with high-level clients highly visible in the financial services, energy, public sector, and consumer and industrial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will work on innovative technologies on challenging and exciting projects, supporting our clients mainly on the following topics:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: We help our clients develop innovative technology strategies and operating models;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: We enable clients to use cutting-edge solutions for applications, infrastructure, and TLC;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management&lt;/strong&gt;: We help our clients identify the best data management solutions and design data management architectures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;: We assist our clients in identifying, prioritizing, designing, and better directing technology investments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: We manage governance and provide technical support during the selection of various options and suppliers throughout the ICT services cycle;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance and Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: We take care of the proper structure and sizing of ICT resources;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost Right-Sizing&lt;/strong&gt;: We evaluate and suggest options to better direct ICT spending and resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in Management Engineering, Computer Engineering, Electronic Engineering, Telecommunications Engineering, Physics, Mathematics;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of the English language, ideally deepened through educational/work experience abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, fair work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that encourages creativity and teamwork;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid work mode to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay always updated;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset and innovative projects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Paid internship opportunity offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are the Values of KPMG that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Within our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan - you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are carrying out on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues. Join us! Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to the KPMG privacy policy. Nolan Norton Spa guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-SD1&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Torino-Junior-Consultant-IT-Strategy-CIO-Advisory-1/1366147557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366147557</guid><g:id>1366147557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Torino, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Internship Liquidity &amp; Risk Governance | Milan (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Internship Liquidity &amp;amp; Risk Governance | Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;When you join &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;the Liquidity &amp;amp; Risk Governance team in Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;, &lt;/em&gt;you are going to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;work on projects in the field of Risk Management, with a focus both on regulatory and organizational aspects of competence and on the development and validation of modeling for top-tier clients in the Financial Services sector. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Liquidity and Interest Rate Risk;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Risk Governance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 17.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;have a specialist degree (graduate or nearing completion) in finance, economics or related field;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;have excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;have an excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.0px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;knowledge of programming software and languages (Python, SAS, R, Matlab and Stata).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Paid internship opportunity offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either an internship or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:107%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-FN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Internship-Liquidity-&amp;-Risk-Governance-Milan/1366576857/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366576857</guid><g:id>1366576857</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant - ServiceNow (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Enterprise Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai inserita/o in un percorso di crescita nell&apos;ambito &lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt;: ti occuperai di progettare, sviluppare e implementare soluzioni personalizzate su questa piattaforma per i nostri clienti, affiancando colleghe e colleghi più esperti in ogni fase del progetto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Partecipare, insieme al team funzionale, alla &lt;strong&gt;raccolta dei requisiti&lt;/strong&gt; del cliente e alla loro traduzione in &lt;strong&gt;workflow e regole di automazione&lt;/strong&gt; da costruire sulla piattaforma&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Configurare e personalizzare i &lt;strong&gt;moduli ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt;, definendo campi, form e regole di business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Costruire &lt;strong&gt;flussi automatizzati&lt;/strong&gt; con Flow Designer, lo strumento visuale di ServiceNow per collegare tra loro le diverse fasi di un processo senza scrivere codice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Effettuare i &lt;strong&gt;test interni&lt;/strong&gt; delle configurazioni sviluppate, verificando che i flussi funzionino correttamente prima di consegnarli al cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribuire alla &lt;strong&gt;migrazione dei dati&lt;/strong&gt; dai vecchi sistemi del cliente all&apos;interno di ServiceNow &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Supportare il cliente nella fase di &lt;strong&gt;rilascio&lt;/strong&gt; della soluzione e nel periodo immediatamente successivo (&lt;strong&gt;Hypercare&lt;/strong&gt;), monitorando che tutto funzioni e risolvendo eventuali criticità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai una &lt;strong&gt;formazione accademica&lt;/strong&gt; in Ingegneria Informatica o Informatica&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai &lt;strong&gt;motivazione&lt;/strong&gt; a svolgere attività di consulenza sui processi aziendali e sui sistemi informativi, anche senza esperienza pregressa su ServiceNow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai un&apos;&lt;strong&gt;ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, preferibilmente supportata da esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai un&apos;&lt;strong&gt;ottima conoscenza di JavaScript e Excel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona padronanza della lingua inglese e attitudine al lavoro in team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a trasferte in Italia e all&apos;estero in base alle esigenze progettuali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibrida, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di formazione e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul benessere psicofisico&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;L&apos;opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all&apos;impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l&apos;Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I dati richiesti verranno trattati nell&apos;assoluto rispetto delle disposizioni contenute nel Regolamento Europeo 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot; o &quot;Normativa Privacy&quot;) e sue successive modificazioni ed integrazioni.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to do a job that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues face and solve the most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to businesses to assist them in transforming their business models, improving and digitalizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, as well as supporting extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;By joining the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platform Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be onboarded onto a growth path within &lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow&lt;/strong&gt;: you will design, develop and implement customised solutions on this platform for our clients, working alongside more experienced colleagues at every stage of the project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Take part, together with the functional team, in &lt;strong&gt;gathering the client&apos;s requirements&lt;/strong&gt; and translating them into &lt;strong&gt;workflows and automation rules&lt;/strong&gt; to be built on the platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Configure and customise &lt;strong&gt;ServiceNow modules&lt;/strong&gt; (for example Incident, Problem and Change Management, or custom applications), defining fields, forms and business rules&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Write simple &lt;strong&gt;JavaScript scripts&lt;/strong&gt; (ServiceNow&apos;s native scripting language, called GlideScript) to automate steps that would otherwise require manual work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Build &lt;strong&gt;automated flows&lt;/strong&gt; using Flow Designer, ServiceNow&apos;s visual tool for connecting the different steps of a process without writing code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Carry out &lt;strong&gt;internal testing&lt;/strong&gt; of the configurations developed, checking that flows work correctly before handing them over to the client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Contribute to &lt;strong&gt;data migration&lt;/strong&gt; from the client&apos;s old systems into ServiceNow (for example populating the CMDB, the repository that maps all of a company&apos;s IT assets)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Support the client during the &lt;strong&gt;release&lt;/strong&gt; phase and in the period immediately following it (&lt;strong&gt;Hypercare&lt;/strong&gt;), monitoring that everything works and resolving any issues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is right for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have an &lt;strong&gt;academic background&lt;/strong&gt; in Computer Engineering or Computer Science&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have the &lt;strong&gt;motivation&lt;/strong&gt; to engage in consulting activities related to business processes and information systems, even without prior experience in ServiceNow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have an &lt;strong&gt;excellent command of English&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably supported by study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;excellent knowledge of the Office suite&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have a good command of English and a team-oriented attitude&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are available for business travel in Italy and abroad based on project needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us – What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that promotes creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid working options to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate&apos;s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In compliance with applicable law, we do not collect or use information about salaries received in current or previous employment relationships. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, community commitment, and integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s values, which create an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network complies with the standards of the ISO 30415 requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125, relating to gender equality. In our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) you can find all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The requested data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of the European Regulation 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – &quot;GDPR&quot; or &quot;Privacy Regulation&quot;) and its subsequent amendments and integrations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Junior-Consultant-ServiceNow/1366391457/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366391457</guid><g:id>1366391457</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Deal Advisory Transaction Services Senior Consultant | Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div id=&quot;tor__flistingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__flistingLayout_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Advisory Transaction Services Senior Consultant | Milano&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi intraprendere una professione davvero significativa e di impatto? In &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare clienti, azienda e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nel rispetto dei valori di integrità e qualità, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offre un portafoglio integrato e in continua evoluzione di servizi, fornendo analisi e approfondimenti che consentono alle aziende di rispondere alle esigenze informative e di rendicontazione del mercato e degli investitori. Il team &lt;strong&gt;Transaction Services&lt;/strong&gt; fa parte della divisione &lt;strong&gt;Deal Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; e supporta i clienti in tutte le fasi delle operazioni di fusione e acquisizione (M&amp;amp;A), dalla valutazione preliminare dell&apos;operazione fino all&apos;integrazione o alla separazione successiva alla chiusura del deal. I professionisti del team assistono fondi di &lt;strong&gt;private equity&lt;/strong&gt; e clienti corporate nell&apos;identificazione dei rischi e delle opportunità legati ad acquisizioni, cessioni e joint venture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del team, lavorerai a stretto contatto con investitori, azionisti e manager di ogni livello. Supporterai i clienti nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria, utilizzando strumenti di &lt;strong&gt;data analytics&lt;/strong&gt;, tecnologie innovative e soluzioni di &lt;strong&gt;intelligenza artificiale&lt;/strong&gt; nelle attività quotidiane.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Entrando nel team di &lt;strong&gt;Milano&lt;/strong&gt;, diventerai un elemento chiave nella creazione di valore nelle operazioni di M&amp;amp;A. In un ambiente dinamico e stimolante, contribuirai a progetti di &lt;strong&gt;financial due diligence&lt;/strong&gt;, supportando fondi di private equity e aziende italiane e internazionali nelle loro decisioni di investimento.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è ideale se possiedi:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;una &lt;strong&gt;laurea magistrale&lt;/strong&gt; in discipline economiche, con specializzazione in contabilità, controllo di gestione e finanza;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2-3 anni di esperienza&lt;/strong&gt; in Transaction Services, Corporate Finance, Revisione Contabile (Audit) o ambiti affini;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;solide competenze contabili e conoscenza dei principi di bilancio &lt;strong&gt;Italian GAAP&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;IFRS&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;capacità di analizzare i bilanci d&apos;esercizio e una solida preparazione in ambito matematico, finanziario e contabile;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ottime capacità di problem solving e un forte approccio analitico;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;una buona conoscenza della lingua inglese.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo ed equo&lt;/strong&gt;, che rispetta, valorizza e promuove la diversità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;dinamico e stimolante&lt;/strong&gt;, che incoraggia la creatività e il lavoro di squadra.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt;, per favorire un sano equilibrio tra vita privata e professionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi avanzati di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo professionale&lt;/strong&gt;, per mantenere competenze sempre aggiornate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente internazionale e la possibilità di lavorare su &lt;strong&gt;progetti innovativi&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere mentale e fisico&lt;/strong&gt; delle persone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 30.000 e € 43.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità sono i valori di &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;. Questi principi creano un ambiente che favorisce la condivisione di idee e conoscenze, consentendo ai professionisti di esprimere appieno il proprio potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A conferma dell&apos;impegno per un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il Network KPMG ha ottenuto la certificazione &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione della Diversità e Inclusione, e la certificazione &lt;strong&gt;UNI/PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Attraverso il proprio &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt;, KPMG presenta le azioni concrete intraprese sui temi ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati personali saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto del &lt;strong&gt;Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (GDPR)&lt;/strong&gt; e delle successive modifiche. Per maggiori informazioni è possibile consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. promuove le pari opportunità ed è un datore di lavoro che garantisce pari opportunità di accesso e crescita professionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. In keeping with the values of integrity and quality, KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance offers an integrated and constantly evolving portfolio of services, with insights that allow companies to respond to the informational/reporting needs of the market and investors.The &lt;strong&gt;Transaction Services&lt;/strong&gt; team is part of &lt;strong&gt;Deal Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;, providing support in M&amp;amp;As, from the pre-deal evaluation to the post-deal integration or separation.Our Transaction Services professionals assist private equity and corporate clients in identifying the risks and opportunities of their acquisitions, divestments and joint ventures.When you join our team, you will be working closely with financial backers, shareholders and managers at all levels. You will assist clients in corporate finance transactions, availing of data analytics tools and using technology and AI in your day-to-day activities.Join our team in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt; and become a key player in delivering value on M&amp;amp;A transactions. In a dynamic and stimulating environment, you will contribute to &lt;strong&gt;financial due diligence&lt;/strong&gt; projects, supporting Italian and International private equity and corporates in their investment decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a master’s degree in business subjects (with a focus on accounting, management control and finance);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;2-3 years of experience in transaction services, corporate finance, audit or similar;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;accounting skills and knowledge of the financial reporting standards (Italian GAAP and IFRS);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an ability to analyse financial statements and solid mathematical, financial and accounting expertise;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;problem solving and an analytical mindset;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of English;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt;, equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;gross annual salary ranging from €30,000 to €43,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network has obtained &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 certification&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, which certifies gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; -  &lt;em&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/em&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-AA2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Deal-Advisory-Transaction-Services-Senior-Consultant-Milano/1365770157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365770157</guid><g:id>1365770157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Deal advisory</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior - Forensic Accounting | MI (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Senior - Investigation and Disputes Advisory Services | Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; offers consulting services to companies to support them in transforming their business model, improving and digitizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, and providing support in extraordinary finance operations. Specifically, by joining the &lt;strong&gt;Forensic Team &lt;/strong&gt;in&lt;strong&gt; Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will help companies prevent, identify, and minimize economic, reputational, and IT risks deriving from fraud, irregularities, trade and financial disputes, and breach of contract. You will gain a competitive edge and offer integrated solutions and innovative approaches for strategic risk management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Internal investigation (fraud &amp;amp; misconduct, bribery &amp;amp; corruption, other regulatory issues) through, for example, interviews, documental review, review of digital evidence using f-tech tools;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Fraud risk management &amp;amp; corporate compliance (regulatory enforcement compliance, fraud risk management);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Preventing, identifying, and responding to violations (legislative and/or procedural violations), complaints, or irregularities;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Expert witness in civil, criminal (231) and arbitration proceedings;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will be involved in &lt;strong&gt;national and international projects&lt;/strong&gt; alongside highly qualified professionals and will work closely with our clients in the &lt;strong&gt;Consumer and Industrial Markets&lt;/strong&gt; sector.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have 3 / 4 years of experience in Forensic Accounting;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have a master&apos;s degree in &lt;strong&gt;business and/or accounting (e.g., business administration, AFC, &lt;/strong&gt;, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;accounting, compliance (e.g., Legislative decree no. 231, anti-money laundering, etc.), corporate governance and risk management&lt;/strong&gt;,;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have an excellent knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably supported by study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have an excellent knowledge of Microsoft &lt;strong&gt;Office&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive, fair work&lt;/strong&gt; environment that respects, encourages, and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity and teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Hybrid work mode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to stay up-to-date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; and innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are the &lt;strong&gt;Values of KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to &lt;strong&gt;express their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;. As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-FN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-Forensic-Accounting-MI/1366017857/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366017857</guid><g:id>1366017857</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Candidatura Spontanea (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG è un Network formato da oltre 207 mila professionisti in 153 paesi, che attraverso servizi di revisione e organizzazione contabile, di consulenza manageriale e in ambito fiscale, legale e amministrativo, forniscono expertise e competenza a migliaia di organizzazioni, generando risultati concreti.&lt;br&gt;
Il team in Italia è composto da oltre 4.200 professionisti che operano in 26 sedi e rendono KPMG il più importante player del settore.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In un contesto in rapida trasformazione, rispondiamo alle esigenze dei nostri clienti garantendo sempre l’alta qualità dei nostri servizi: fare la differenza oggi ci permette di gettare le basi del cambiamento di domani.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Coltiviamo e investiamo nel talento promuovendo una cultura inclusiva e sollecitando alte prestazioni, formando i nostri professionisti per l’utilizzo di nuovi strumenti e soluzioni digitali.&lt;br&gt;
Il nostro patrimonio di conoscenza attinge da un expertise condivisa a livello globale, accresciuta dall’apprendimento continuo e dallo sviluppo di nuove competenze.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;                                                                                                                                             &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Culture of Trust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Siamo una società solida e riconosciuta sul mercato. La nostra cultura è basata su reciproca lealtà, professionalità e competenza, che ci rendono consapevoli dell’impatto del nostro lavoro.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Challenge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Da noi ogni giorno è diverso dall’altro e il ruolo rivestito cresce e si arricchisce nel quotidiano.&lt;br&gt;
Portiamo avanti progetti stimolanti con un approccio innovativo, all’interno di un contesto sfidante.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Dynamic Inclusion&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;
L’ambiente giovane e collaborativo facilità l’ascolto e lo scambio a tutti i livelli, favorendo il senso di appartenenza e la valorizzazione dell’individuo e della sua unicità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; People Empowerment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;L’apprendimento continuo e i feedback costanti permettono uno sviluppo di carriera chiaro e definito.&lt;br&gt;
Tutti possono proporre le proprie idee ed essere leader.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Future Ready&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Formiamo i nostri professionisti su skills e tecnologie emergenti, per l’utilizzo di nuovi strumenti e soluzioni digitali. Valorizziamo la creatività perseguendo l’innovazione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I nostri servizi e le nostre competenze in continua evoluzione coprono tutti i settori di business:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;AUDIT &amp;amp; ASSURANCE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ti occuperai dell’integrità e trasparenza dei mercati finanziari, garantendo la riservatezza fondamentale al loro corretto andamento. Potrai vedere concretamente il valore del tuo lavoro ed entrare in contatto con le più grandi organizzazioni a livello mondiale e con le aziende che rappresentano il cuore del nostro tessuto produttivo. Sostenendole nella crescita, nella trasparenza e nella competitività, acquisirai un’esperienza unica e di ampio respiro.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ADVISORY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nel mondo di oggi, così complesso e interconnesso, i clienti hanno bisogno di trasformarsi e adattarsi ad una velocità sempre crescente. Ci concentriamo sui principali vettori del cambiamento: strategie, finanza straordinaria, processi e modelli organizzativi, piattaforme tecnologiche, gestione dei rischi e del cambiamento organizzativo. Il nostro lavoro è una sfida unica. Potrai sperimentare le tecnologie disruptive e definire i nuovi standard che impattano sulla loro sicurezza.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;TAX &amp;amp; LEGAL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;La rapida globalizzazione e la crescente competitività gettano il mondo della fiscalità in un contesto rapido e mutevole: i clienti si affidano ai nostri team di fiscalisti e legali per raggiungere un reale vantaggio competitivo. I nostri professionisti crescono acquisendo le competenze per affrontare questa sfida: formazione di primo livello, esposizione a progetti internazionali e collaborazioni con le principali organizzazioni e le più brillanti menti del settore.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sei una persona curiosa di natura, attenta ai dettagli? Ti piace favorire la collaborazione e motivare i tuoi compagni di team per raggiungere risultati?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;#JoinTheChange&lt;/b&gt; Invia la tua candidatura ed entra nel team KPMG. Scoprirai una realtà giovane e innovativa, dove poter sviluppare il tuo talento. Ti aspettiamo!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;list-style-type:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Community&quot;&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Candidatura-Spontanea/522176602/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">522176602</guid><g:id>522176602</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant - SAP Concur 1 (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza per affiancare le organizzazioni nella trasformazione dei processi, nella digitalizzazione e nell’adozione di soluzioni SAP a supporto del cambiamento.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del Team &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platforms&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai coinvolta/o in progetti di implementazione e ottimizzazione di &lt;strong&gt;SAP Concur&lt;/strong&gt;, con focus sui processi di &lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Expense Management&lt;/strong&gt; e sulla digitalizzazione delle note spese e delle trasferte aziendali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Condurre workshop con &lt;strong&gt;stakeholder Business e IT &lt;/strong&gt;per tradurre le esigenze di Travel &amp;amp; Expense Management in requisiti funzionali concreti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Contribuire al &lt;strong&gt;disegno della soluzione to-be&lt;/strong&gt; su SAP Concur, occupandoti di attività di configurazione e customizing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Garantire, in collaborazione con team funzionali e tecnici, la corretta integrazione tra &lt;strong&gt;Concur&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;SAP ERP/S4HANA&lt;/strong&gt; e le altre piattaforme aziendali coinvolte.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Curare la &lt;strong&gt;documentazione funzionale&lt;/strong&gt; e seguire le fasi di &lt;strong&gt;test&lt;/strong&gt;, go-live e hypercare, garantendo continuità anche nel post rilascio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Affiancare gli utenti finali nelle fasi di &lt;strong&gt;adozione della soluzione.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su progetti nazionali e internazionali, lavorando a stretto contatto con clienti e team multidisciplinari operanti in ambito &lt;strong&gt;Consumer &amp;amp; Industrial&lt;/strong&gt;, con settori quali Retail, Food &amp;amp; Drink, Consumer Products, Industrial &amp;amp; Manufacturing e Automotive. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai maturato esperienza su &lt;strong&gt;progetti SAP Concur &lt;/strong&gt;e sei a tuo agio nel gestire in autonomia le fasi di analisi, configurazione e rilascio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza in attività di&lt;strong&gt; analisi requisiti&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;configurazione&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;testing&lt;/strong&gt; e supporto al go-live.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona conoscenza dei processi&lt;strong&gt; Travel &amp;amp; Expense.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai familiarità con integrazioni verso sistemi SAP ERP o &lt;strong&gt;SAP S/4HANA.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Possiedi una buona padronanza della lingua &lt;strong&gt;inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a &lt;strong&gt;viaggiare &lt;/strong&gt;sia a livello nazionale che internazionale per supportare i clienti nelle varie fasi progettuali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 36.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;equo &lt;/strong&gt;e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;stimolante &lt;/strong&gt;e &lt;strong&gt;dinamico &lt;/strong&gt;che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibrida&lt;/strong&gt;, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione &lt;/strong&gt;e &lt;strong&gt;sviluppo &lt;/strong&gt;avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale &lt;/strong&gt;e progettualità innovative.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 31.000 e € 41.000 per la qualifica di Senior Consultant e tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 36.0pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti ISO 30415, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e UNI PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly &lt;strong&gt;meaningful&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;impactful&lt;/strong&gt;? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, communities, colleagues, and organizations address and solve today’s most complex challenges. KPMG Advisory provides consulting services to support organizations in &lt;strong&gt;process transformation&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;digitalization&lt;/strong&gt;, and the adoption of &lt;strong&gt;SAP solutions&lt;/strong&gt; to drive change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;By joining the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Platforms&lt;/strong&gt; team, you will be involved in &lt;strong&gt;SAP Concur&lt;/strong&gt; implementation and optimization projects, with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Expense Management&lt;/strong&gt; processes and the digitalization of expense reports and business travel management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be responsible for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Gathering and analyzing business requirements through workshops and collaboration with Business and IT stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Supporting the design of the &lt;strong&gt;to-be solution&lt;/strong&gt; and performing &lt;strong&gt;SAP Concur configuration/customization&lt;/strong&gt; activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Collaborating with functional and technical teams to ensure proper &lt;strong&gt;integration&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;SAP ERP/S/4HANA&lt;/strong&gt; systems and other enterprise platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Preparing &lt;strong&gt;functional documentation&lt;/strong&gt; and supporting &lt;strong&gt;testing&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;go-live&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;hypercare&lt;/strong&gt; activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Supporting end users during project delivery and release phases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You will work closely with &lt;strong&gt;Public Sector&lt;/strong&gt; clients, contributing to innovative projects within central and local government, healthcare, education, and publicly owned organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your skills and characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;experience&lt;/strong&gt; working on &lt;strong&gt;SAP Concur&lt;/strong&gt; projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You have experience in &lt;strong&gt;requirements gathering&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;configuration&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;testing&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;go-live support&lt;/strong&gt; activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You have a solid understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Expense&lt;/strong&gt; processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You are familiar with integrations involving &lt;strong&gt;SAP ERP&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;SAP S/4HANA&lt;/strong&gt; systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You possess strong interpersonal skills and a good command of the &lt;strong&gt;English language&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What you will find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and collaborative work environment that values diversity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A dynamic and stimulating context that encourages creativity and teamwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt; designed to support work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training and development&lt;/strong&gt; programs to help you continuously grow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An international mindset and involvement in innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on employees’ physical and mental well-being.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000 for the Senior Consultant position and from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate&apos;s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, and integrity: these are KPMG’s Values, shaping an environment that promotes the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to fully express their potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network complies with ISO 30415 standards for Diversity and Inclusion Management Systems and UNI PdR 125 standards relating to gender equality. Within our Impact Plan, you can find an overview of all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social, and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – “GDPR”) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#&lt;/strong&gt;LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-Consultant-SAP-Concur-1/1365983957/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365983957</guid><g:id>1365983957</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Internship - Forensic Accounting | Milan (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Internship – Forensic Accounting | Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; offers consulting services to companies to support them in transforming their business model, improving and digitizing processes, analyzing and managing risks, and providing support in extraordinary finance operations. Specifically, by joining the &lt;strong&gt;Forensic Team &lt;/strong&gt;in&lt;strong&gt; Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will help companies prevent, identify, and minimize economic, reputational, and IT risks deriving from fraud, irregularities, trade and financial disputes, and breach of contract. You will gain a competitive edge and offer integrated solutions and innovative approaches for strategic risk management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Responsibilities  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conduct forensic investigations related to fraud, misconduct, bribery &amp;amp; corruption, cybercrime, and other regulatory or financial irregularities, including evidence collection, analysis, and reporting;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Support fraud risk management and corporate compliance activities, including the design, assessment, and enhancement of anti-fraud frameworks;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Assist clients in preventing, identifying, and responding to legislative, regulatory, and procedural violations, whistleblowing reports, complaints, and other allegations of misconduct;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Perform data-driven analyses (such as transaction testing, pattern analysis, red-flag identification) to detect anomalies, suspicious behaviors, and control weaknesses;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Contribute to the resolution of disputes and contentious matters, including support to external advisors;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conduct business intelligence and background checks on natural persons and legal entities using public-domain information and open-source intelligence (OSINT).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will be involved in &lt;strong&gt;national and international projects&lt;/strong&gt; alongside highly qualified professionals and will work closely with our clients in the &lt;strong&gt;Consumer and Industrial Markets&lt;/strong&gt; sector.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have a master&apos;s degree in &lt;strong&gt;business and/or accounting (e.g., business administration, AFC, market economics and the economics of financial intermediaries&lt;/strong&gt;, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;accounting, compliance (e.g., Legislative decree no. 231, anti-money laundering, etc.), corporate governance and risk management&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably through university courses and/or master&apos;s programmes in these fields;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have an excellent knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably supported by study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You have an excellent knowledge of Microsoft &lt;strong&gt;Office&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive, fair work&lt;/strong&gt; environment that respects, encourages, and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity and teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid work mode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to stay up-to-date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and innovative projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Paid internship opportunity offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are the &lt;strong&gt;Values of KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to &lt;strong&gt;express their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;. As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-FN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Internship-Forensic-Accounting-Milan/1366018557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366018557</guid><g:id>1366018557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Tax Incentives | Verona (Verona, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Junior Tax Consultant | Verona&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. I professionisti dello &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato &lt;/strong&gt;di KPMG intervengono in tutte le principali aree della fiscalità e del diritto societario offrendo servizi integrati e innovativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;team Tax Incentives&lt;/strong&gt; di Verona, contribuirai a supportare i clienti nell&apos;affrontare le sfide legate alle principali aree della fiscalità. Opererai in uno scenario in continua evoluzione, dove normative nazionali e internazionali si intrecciano con le aspettative del mercato e dell’opinione pubblica su temi cruciali come l’etica, la trasparenza e la corporate governance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di supportare le aziende nell&apos;identificazione e nell&apos;ottenimento dei &lt;strong&gt;Crediti d&apos;Imposta&lt;/strong&gt; previsti dalla normativa quali, ad esempio:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;i crediti d’imposta per investimenti in ricerca, sviluppo e innovazione, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;transizione 4.0, transizione 5.0,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;nuovo regime Patent Box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa è l’opportunità perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laurea magistrale in discipline economiche o giuridiche;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intenzione di intraprendere la pratica professionale come dottore commercialista e/o avvocato;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Microsoft Office;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ottime capacità relazionali e attitudine al lavoro di squadra;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spiccate capacità organizzative, spirito d’iniziativa e problem solving;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approccio flessibile e dinamico.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Costituirà titolo preferenziale:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laurea magistrale in Diritto Tributario.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Il tuo futuro con noi – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt; ed &lt;strong&gt;equo&lt;/strong&gt;, che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza la &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;sfidante e dinamico&lt;/strong&gt; che favorisce la creatività e il lavoro di squadra;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere l’equilibrio tra vita professionale e privata;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt; avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un mindset internazionale e &lt;strong&gt;progetti innovativi&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere mentale e fisico&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insieme per un futuro migliore – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità. Questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che creano un ambiente in cui è possibile condividere idee e conoscenze affinché i nostri professionisti possano &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; – [Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)] – sono sintetizzate tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti in materia ambientale, sociale e di governance (ESG).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), come modificato. Per ulteriori informazioni, consulta l’informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato è un datore di lavoro che offre pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;–&lt;em&gt; Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you’ll have the opportunity to help your firm, clients and colleagues address and resolve some of today’s most topical and complex issues. Our &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Tax &amp;amp; Legal&lt;/strong&gt; professionals work at the forefront of tax and corporate law, delivering integrated and innovative services across all key areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As part of our &lt;strong&gt;Tax Specialties &lt;/strong&gt;team in Verona,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;you’ll help clients navigate the tax system. You’ll be working in a constantly evolving environment, where national and international regulations intersect with market expectations as well as public opinion on crucial topics such as ethics, transparency and corporate governance. Specifically, you’ll assist businesses in identifying and obtaining &lt;strong&gt;tax relief&lt;/strong&gt; such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:8.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;tax credits for investments in research, development and innovation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;the transition 4.0 and transition 5.0 tax credits;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;the new Patent Box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Qualifications, Skills and Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:8.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;at least one year’s&lt;/strong&gt; experience at a leading national or international practice and/or advisory firm; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;a master&apos;s degree in &lt;strong&gt;economics&lt;/strong&gt; (LM-77 or LM-56) or &lt;strong&gt;law&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;with a final mark of at least 100/110;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;qualified as an &lt;strong&gt;accountant&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;lawyer&lt;/strong&gt; or wish to begin your &lt;strong&gt;qualifying work experience&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;a good command of &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably with experience studying and/or working abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of Microsoft Office, especially Excel and PowerPoint;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:8.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that fosters &lt;strong&gt;creativity &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;teamworking&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to support continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international outlook&lt;/strong&gt; and a focus on &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm 6.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individual, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values &lt;/strong&gt;that foster an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge, so that our people can &lt;strong&gt;express their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;. KPMG supports all its people in reaching their full potential, whatever their identity or background. Fully committed to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, we are &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 compliant &lt;/strong&gt;(ISO 30415:2021 &lt;em&gt;–&lt;/em&gt; Human Resources Management &lt;em&gt;–&lt;/em&gt; Diversity and Inclusion). KPMG in Italy is also &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125 &lt;/strong&gt;compliant (UNI/PdR 125:2022 – measures to ensure gender equality in audit and assurance services). You can find a summary of all our &lt;strong&gt;concrete&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;ESG &lt;/strong&gt;(environmental, social, and governance) &lt;strong&gt;actions&lt;/strong&gt; in our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG in Italy is an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:6.0pt 0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – “GDPR”) as subsequently amended. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy notice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0px&quot;&gt;#LI-LA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Verona-Junior-Tax-Incentives-Verona/1365688857/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365688857</guid><g:id>1365688857</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Verona, IT</g:location></item><item><title>IT Service Desk Specialist - Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We don’t imagine a better future. We’re building it&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Business Services &lt;/strong&gt;offre servizi interni all’organizzazione, supportando tutte le linee di servizio e coadiuvando i professionisti nella gestione delle attività quotidiane.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team&lt;strong&gt; Service Desk&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai responsabile di fornire i più alti standard di assistenza diretta e di supporto alla Leadership e ai componenti del Management Group. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Fornire supporto tecnico agli utenti tramite telefono o chat;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Gestire e risolvere le richieste di assistenza secondo le priorità definite;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Diagnostica e risoluzione di problematiche hardware e software;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Gestione degli incident di sicurezza e compliance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Gestione delle richieste attraverso il sistema di ticketing;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Collaborare con il team IT per migliorare i processi e risolvere problematiche più complesse. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As you Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
